�脢id�d7bd72ca3a58�body���股票代表投资者对一家公司的部分所有权，买入股票即成为股东，可分享利润并承担风险。股票市场为企业提供融资、为投资者提供流动性与价格发现，是资本配置的重要场所。��A stock represents partial ownership of a company; buying one makes you a shareholder who shares in profits and risks. Stock markets let firms raise capital, give investors liquidity and price discovery, and help allocate capital.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d9eb3144a2ff�body���迁徙自由指公民在国内或国际间合法移动、选择居住地而不受不当限制的权利。许多国家宪法保障国内迁徙自由，但跨国流动仍受边境管控。它是个人发展机会的重要前提。�Freedom of movement is the right to move and choose residence, domestically or internationally, without undue restriction. Many constitutions guarantee internal movement, but cross-border mobility remains controlled by borders. It is an important precondition for individual opportunity.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�db6af1f06446�body��
人权观念可追溯至古代关于自然法的思想，并在启蒙运动中被系统化为普遍、不可剥夺的权利。20世纪两次世界大战后，《世界人权宣言》使其成为全球共识。它强调不论身份，每个人都享有基本尊严。�NThe idea of human rights traces to ancient notions of natural law and was systematized as universal, inalienable rights during the Enlightenment. After the world wars of the 20th century, the Universal Declaration of Human Rights made it a global consensus. It stresses that everyone is entitled to basic dignity regardless of status.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�de7fd09b33ea�body�ٙ双职工家庭托育成本高、托育供给不足，祖辈协助既省钱又基于亲情。但也可能引发代际育儿观念冲突与老人负担。ٳDual-income families face high childcare cost and short supply, so grandparents help cheaply and out of kinship. But it can spark intergenerational clashes and burden the elderly.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�df491b71ca22�body��x河流提供灌溉、饮水和便利的航运，使农业丰收、人口聚集，从而孕育出早期城市与国家。َRivers gave irrigation, water, and easy transport, letting agriculture flourish and populations concentrate, birthing early cities and states.�ans��src��:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937�:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937��id�e291d68a26a3�body���这被称为“价值悖论”。水的用途大但供给充足，边际效用低；钻石用途小却稀缺，边际效用高。价格由边际效用和稀缺性决定，而非总效用。所以稀缺的钻石反而更贵。�This is called the “paradox of value.” Water is highly useful but abundant, so its marginal utility is low; diamonds are less useful but scarce, so their marginal utility is high. Price is set by marginal utility and scarcity, not total utility—so scarce diamonds cost more.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e2e4940b6618�body���“法制”指有系统的法律制度存在，而“法治”更强调法律至上、权力受约束与保障权利。一个社会可以有完备的法制却未必实现法治。法治的核心在于政府自身也要服从法律。�@A legal system ('rule by law' in a loose sense) means there are systematic laws, while the rule of law emphasizes the supremacy of law, constraint on power, and protection of rights. A society can have a full legal system yet lack the rule of law. The core of the rule of law is that government itself is subject to law.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e3fbfa389939�body���社会规范是一个群体中被广泛接受和期望的行为准则，包括习俗、礼仪和禁忌等。它们通过教育、榜样和舆论维持，帮助社会有序运转。违反规范通常会招致批评或排斥，但不一定违法。�/Social norms are widely accepted and expected rules of behavior within a group, including customs, etiquette, and taboos. They are maintained through education, example, and public opinion, helping society function orderly. Violating them may bring criticism or exclusion but is not necessarily illegal.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e6d3a3fca488�body�ه终身学习指人离开学校后仍然持续学习新知识和技能，以适应变化的社会和工作，像一直给大脑充电。ٛLifelong learning means continuing to gain knowledge and skills after school to adapt to a changing society and work, like constantly recharging the brain.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�eacca2011b69�body�ٖ社区是一群生活在同一地方或拥有共同兴趣、身份的人，他们互相帮助、分享资源，比如小区、学校或同好圈子。٢A community is a group of people sharing a place or common interest and identity who help and share with one another, like a neighborhood, school, or hobby group.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�eb90e8022ca5�body��民主制度是一种由人民通过选举、参与和制衡等方式共同决定公共事务的政治体制。它通常强调保护少数群体权利、言论自由和定期选举。不同国家的民主在形式上存在差异，如代议制与直接民主。�@A democratic system is a form of government in which the public participates in decisions through elections, engagement, and checks and balances. It typically emphasizes protection of minority rights, freedom of expression, and regular elections. Democracies vary in form, such as representative versus direct democracy.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ec04bf58bbb7�body��环境保护政策是政府为防治污染、保护生态和应对气候变化而制定的规则与措施，如排放标准、保护区和碳交易。它往往针对环境这一公共物品的外部性。平衡发展与保护是政策设计的核心难题。�REnvironmental protection policy comprises rules and measures governments adopt to prevent pollution, protect ecosystems, and address climate change, such as emission standards, reserves, and carbon trading. It often targets the externalities of the environment as a public good. Balancing development and protection is the core challenge.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ee83528ece14�body�ٮ雅斯贝尔斯称公元前800–200年欧亚多地（中国、印度、希腊、中东）几乎同时出现哲学与宗教突破，奠定后世主要文明的精神基础。٩Jaspers’ Axial Age (800–200 BCE) saw near-simultaneous philosophical and religious breakthroughs across Eurasia, founding the spiritual bases of later civilizations.�ans��src��ubellah,《what is axial about the axial age?》, European Journal of Sociology, 2005 (DOI: 10.1017/s0003975605000032)�qbellah, 'what is axial about the axial age?', European Journal of Sociology, 2005, DOI: 10.1017/s0003975605000032��id�f02b1c4fc6da�body�ِ城市扩张常超出住房、交通、供水和垃圾处理等设施的承载能力，导致拥挤、贫民窟、污染与公共服务紧张。ٓRapid urban growth often outpaces housing, transport, water, and waste systems, causing congestion, slums, pollution, and strained public services.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f0ed6a72067d�body���中国圆形方孔铜钱自秦代起沿用两千多年，外圆象征天、内方象征地，也便于用绳子串起来携带和计数。方孔还能在打磨时用方棍固定硬币，提高加工效率。这种设计是技术与文化结合的产物。�]China's round coins with a square hole were used for over two thousand years from the Qin dynasty; the circle symbolized heaven and the square earth, and the hole let coins be strung on cords for carrying and counting. The square hole also let workers fix coins on a rod while filing them, improving efficiency. The design blended craft and culture.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�f0fca68fadc9�body�ٱ这是“冲动购买区”策略：顾客结账排队时容易顺手拿低价小商品。收银台是停留时间短但注意力集中的区域，能提升非计划性消费。��This is an “impulse-buy zone” tactic: shoppers waiting in line are likely to grab low-price small items. The checkout is a spot with short dwell time but focused attention, lifting unplanned purchases.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f6bf9e13ec1a�body���世界上第一条地铁是1863年通车的伦敦大都会铁路，用蒸汽机车在地下运行以缓解地面拥堵。它开创了以轨道交通疏解城市交通的先河。如今地铁成为许多大都市的骨干公交。�The world's first metro was London's Metropolitan Railway, opened in 1863 with steam locomotives running underground to ease surface congestion. It pioneered using rail transit to relieve city traffic. Today the metro is the backbone of public transport in many metropolises.�ans��src��7Vuchic，《城市轨道与公交系统》（第2版）�=Vuchic, V.R., 'Urban Public Transportation Systems' (2nd ed.)��id�f730f4788ea2�body�ٓ国际条约是国家之间书面约定的协议，一旦批准就对当事国产生法律义务，涵盖贸易、人权、环境等广泛领域。٢An international treaty is a written agreement between states that, once ratified, creates legal obligations, covering trade, human rights, environment, and more.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�f7f779c20bcc�body���社交媒体是让用户生成、分享与互动内容的网络平台，如微博、短视频应用。它降低了发布门槛，使传播从“少数对多数”变为“多对多”。它重塑了信息与舆论生态。�
Social media are online platforms where users create, share, and interact with content, such as microblogs and short-video apps. They lower publishing barriers, shifting communication from one-to-many to many-to-many. They reshape information and opinion ecosystems.�ans��src��IBail,《Breaking the Social Media Prism»,Princeton University Press,2021�MC. A. Bail, Breaking the Social Media Prism, Princeton University Press, 2021��id�fa2e3815f754�body���改革开放是1978年前后开始的一系列政策：对内改革计划经济、允许市场与民营，对外打开国门、引进技术与贸易。它让经济快速增长、数亿人脱贫。��Reform and opening up refers to policies since around 1978: reforming the planned economy to allow markets and private business, and opening borders to trade and technology. It drove rapid growth and lifted hundreds of millions out of poverty.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�fa3bf030160a�body�ٟ据记载，郑和七下西洋的船队常有百余艘船、约两万七千人，宝船长达数十丈，是当时世界上规模最大的远洋船队之一。��Records say Zheng He's seven expeditions often fielded over a hundred ships and about 27,000 people, with treasure ships tens of meters long—among the largest oceangoing fleets of their time.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�fa6478a6554e�body���沉没成本是指已经发生且无法收回的支出，比如已买的电影票。理性决策只应考虑未来的成本和收益，而不该被沉没成本绑架。所谓“及时止损”就是忽略沉没成本。�A sunk cost is an expense that has already been incurred and cannot be recovered, such as a movie ticket already bought. Rational decisions should weigh only future costs and benefits, not be held hostage by sunk costs. “Cutting losses in time” means ignoring sunk costs.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fdfebaff8336�body��]公民权利是保障个人免受歧视、享有人身自由与平等保护的法律权利。�wCivil rights are legal guarantees protecting individuals from discrimination and ensuring liberty and equal protection.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ff5c5686e6e3�body�ٮ高考是大规模、相对公平的选拔通道，成绩直接影响升学与早期职业机会。它承载阶层流动期待，也被批评“一考定终身”压力大。��The gaokao is a large-scale, relatively fair selection channel whose scores directly shape college and early career chances. It carries hopes of mobility but is criticized for high “one exam decides all” pressure.�ans��src�١Xiang,Wang,《China: Gaokao (College Entrance Exam) Current Reform and Future Development》,International Higher Education,2024 (DOI: 10.6017/895b9e0d.7220a924)٠Xiang, Wang, 'China: Gaokao (College Entrance Exam) Current Reform and Future Development', International Higher Education, 2024, DOI: 10.6017/895b9e0d.7220a924��id�soc_24_010�body���韦伯把科层制(bureaucracy)定义为现代组织的理性化形态:明确的职权等级、成文规则、按专业资格录用晋升、档案化记录。对比传统型(听命于君主个人)与魅力型(追随领袖感召)权威,法理型权威的优势是可预期与可复制——大公司能在全球开设分部并保持标准一致,靠的正是这套非人格化机器。科层也自带病理:目标置换(守规矩忘了办事)、彼得原理(胜任者被提拔到不胜任层)、繁文缛节。组织社会学百年研究都在回答同一问题:如何在保留科层效率的同时注入弹性与创新——矩阵制、扁平化都是这场拉锯的当代回合。�	Weber defined bureaucracy as modern organizations rationalized form: explicit hierarchy, written rules, hiring and promotion by credentials, filed records. Against traditional authority (loyalty to persons) and charismatic authority (devotion to leaders), legal-rational authority wins on predictability and replicability — multinationals open branches worldwide with consistent standards precisely via this impersonal machine. Bureaucracy carries its own pathologies: goal displacement (rules over results), the Peter principle (promoted to incompetence), red tape. A century of organizational sociology asks one question: how to keep bureaucratic efficiency while injecting flexibility and innovation — matrix structures and flat organizations are just its latest rounds.�ans��src��BWeber,《Economy and Society»,University of California Press,1978�CM. Weber, Economy and Society, University of California Press, 1978��id�soc_24_011�body��A函件实验法让歧视第一次变得可测量:研究者虚构完全相同的简历,只改变暗示种族或性别的名字,成对投递给数千个真实岗位。芝加哥与波士顿的经典研究显示,白人名字简历的回复率比同等条件的非裔名字高约五成;后续多国复制普遍发现类似差距,有的行业甚至更大。它把看不见的态度转译为看得见的回调差,成为反就业歧视诉讼与政策评估的标准工具;也提醒求职者:结构性的门槛无法靠个人努力单独跨越,这正是立法与匿名初筛的依据。��Correspondence experiments made discrimination measurable: researchers fabricate identical resume pairs differing only in names signaling race or gender and submit them to thousands of real openings. The classic Chicago-Boston study found white-sounding names drew roughly fifty percent more callbacks than equally strong Black-sounding names, with replications worldwide showing gaps as wide or wider in some sectors. The method translates invisible attitudes into visible callback differences, powering anti-discrimination litigation and policy evaluation — and reminding job seekers that structural gates cannot be jumped by effort alone, which is exactly why anonymous screening laws exist.�ans��src�ـBertrand 与 Mullainathan,《Are Emily and Greg More Employable than Lakisha and Jamal?»,American Economic Review 第94卷,2004�~M. Bertrand and S. Mullainathan, Are Emily and Greg More Employable than Lakisha and Jamal?, American Economic Review 94, 2004��id�soc_24_013�body��a经验证据比直觉复杂。一方面,选择暴露确实存在:人们偏好立场一致的信源,社交网络的好友同质性放大了这一点。另一方面,大规模研究发现普通用户的线上新闻饮食其实比自我感觉更多元,纯粹的回音室集中在少数重度党派用户;算法的责任常被高估——人际传递与主动搜索的贡献不小于排序模型。真正确定的机制是情绪经济学:愤怒与道德谴责内容获得更高互动,激励创作者生产对立标签化内容。所以解药不在打破气泡,而在平台激励机制与媒介素养双管齐下。�mEvidence is messier than intuition. Selective exposure is real: people prefer congenial sources and homogeneous friend networks amplify it. Yet large-scale audits find ordinary users encounter more diverse news online than they believe, pure echo chambers concentrate among small highly partisan minorities, and algorithms take blame that human sharing and active search share equally. The solid mechanism is emotional economics: outrage and moral condemnation earn engagement, rewarding creators who produce adversarial labels. So the cure is not bursting bubbles but fixing platform incentives alongside media literacy.�ans��src��IBail,《Breaking the Social Media Prism»,Princeton University Press,2021�MC. A. Bail, Breaking the Social Media Prism, Princeton University Press, 2021��id�soc_24_020�body���帕特南注意到一个悖论:保龄球人数创新高,联赛参与却腰斩——人们依旧活动,却不再结社。他汇总数十年数据指出美国的社群参与(教会、工会、家长会、俱乐部)自1960年代起全面下滑,并检验郊区化、时间压力与电视等替代解释(电视与代际更替影响最大);社会资本因此分薄:连接型资本(弱关系网络带来机会)与粘合型资本(强关系提供支持)双双萎缩,后果是信任下降、公民参与减少与孤独流行病。数字社交是否补位仍是争论焦点——线上联结能否产生线下义务,决定着这是媒介变迁还是社区危机。��Putnam spotted a paradox: bowling hit record highs while leagues halved — people still played but stopped associating. Aggregating decades of data, he documented sweeping declines in US communal participation (churches, unions, PTAs, clubs) since the 1960s, weighing rival explanations such as sprawl, time pressure and television — TV and generational change weigh heaviest. Social capital thinned on both faces: bridging ties (weak links carrying opportunity) and bonding ties (strong links giving support), feeding falling trust, weaker civic life and a loneliness epidemic. Whether digital connection refills the tank remains contested — can online bonds generate offline obligations? That decides whether this is media change or community crisis.�ans��src��0Putnam,《Bowling Alone》,Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�soc_26_005�body��因为性别观念的变化赶不上就业结构的变化，霍克希尔德把这称为停滞的革命。机理：女性大量进入职场之后，家务分工背后的文化剧本依然陈旧，男主外女主内的默认继续运转；不少妻子为照顾丈夫的自我感受而主动放低标准，丈夫则以帮忙的身份做选择性的投入。追踪若干双职工家庭后她估算，职业母亲每年相当于多做约一个月的全天家务——这就是第二轮班，其代价是长期的疲惫与积怨。�`Gender beliefs lag behind employment structures—what Arlie Hochschild called a stalled revolution. Women entered paid work en masse, but the cultural script governing housework stayed old, and the default of men outside, women inside kept running. Many wives lowered their own standards to spare their husband's feelings, while husbands chipped in selectively as helpers rather than partners. Following dual-earner couples over time, she reckoned that employed mothers did roughly an extra month of round-the-clock housework a year—the second shift—paid for in chronic fatigue and simmering resentment.�ans��src��|阿莉·罗素·霍克希尔德：《第二轮班：上班族父母与家庭的革命》，Viking Penguin出版社1989年版�lArlie Russell Hochschild, The Second Shift: Working Parents and the Revolution at Home, Viking Penguin, 1989��id�soc_26_006�body���顾客买的其实不是使用价值，而是昂贵本身所传递的财力与地位信号。机理：凡勃伦在《有闲阶级论》里指出，财产占有成为荣誉的标尺，人们借助浪费性消费与炫耀性休闲证明自己无须劳动、余财充裕；价格越高，公开展示财力的资格越显赫，在财富攀比中赢得的优越感越强，降价反而会吓跑主顾，于是出现需求曲线局部上斜的凡勃伦商品。�Buyers are paying less for usefulness than for the status signal that expense itself sends. In The Theory of the Leisure Class, Veblen argued that property holding had become the yardstick of honor: wasteful consumption and conspicuous leisure proved a person need not labor and had money to spare. The higher the price, the grander the license to display wealth openly and the stronger the superiority won in pecuniary rivalry—so a price cut drives customers away, yielding Veblen goods whose demand curves locally slope upward.�ans��src��N托尔斯坦·凡勃伦：《有闲阶级论》，Macmillan出版社1899年版�BThorstein Veblen, The Theory of the Leisure Class, Macmillan, 1899��id�soc_26_012�body���命名为第二轮班，指职业女性下班后在家中继续从事的无偿家务与照料劳动。机理：丈夫下班走向休闲，妻子却开始当天的第二份工作，根源在于性别观念落后于就业结构——夫妻带着深浅不一的性别意识形态谈判家务，分工被当成衡量爱与感激的账本；职场又默认家里总有人值守，便利安排多为男性动用，缺口最终由女性的闲暇填补。�;She named it the second shift: the unpaid housework and caregiving women performed at home after their paid day ended. Husbands headed for leisure while wives began the day's second job, because gender ideology lagged behind employment structure—spouses bargained over chores armed with deeply held beliefs about proper roles, turning the division of labor into a ledger measuring love and gratitude. Workplaces meanwhile presumed someone was always home, so family-friendly arrangements were mostly claimed by men, and the shortfall was covered out of women's leisure.�ans��src��t阿莉·罗素·霍克希尔德：《第二轮班：上班族父母与家庭的变革》，Viking出版社1989年版�dArlie Russell Hochschild, The Second Shift: Working Parents and the Revolution at Home, Viking, 1989��id�soc_26_017�body���称为婚姻的去制度化。机理：婚姻曾是规定夫妻角色与人生轨道的一整套明确规范——何时结婚、婚后各自承担什么都有章可循；随着同居普及、离婚常态化与非婚生育增多，婚姻从人人必经的制度安排变成个体可选、可自行定义的关系项目，旧的共同行为脚本随之失灵。人们依旧结婚甚至更舍得办婚礼，但婚姻承载的意义已从经济合伙与社会成人礼转向情感陪伴与自我实现。�XHe named it the deinstitutionalization of marriage. Marriage once carried a clear rulebook for spouses' roles and life courses—when to wed, who owes what afterward. As cohabitation spread, divorce grew routine, and childbearing outside wedlock became common, marriage turned from a near-obligatory institution into an optional relationship project couples define for themselves, and the old shared script lost its force. Americans still marry and even splurge on weddings, yet what marriage signifies has shifted from economic partnership and adult status toward companionship and self-fulfillment.�ans��src��i安德鲁·切林：《美国婚姻的去制度化》，《婚姻与家庭杂志》2004年第66卷第4期�uAndrew J. Cherlin, The Deinstitutionalization of American Marriage, Journal of Marriage and Family, 2004, vol.66 no.4��id�6bb7e9baf4e4�body�ٺ仪式把个人成长、群体归属和文化记忆连在一起；现代生活节奏快，人们反而更想借仪式获得安定与认同，所以传统被刻意保留并定期举行。��Rituals tie personal growth, group belonging and cultural memory together; in fast modern life people seek stability and identity through them, so traditions are deliberately kept and repeated.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�06daed1c5678�body���库利在 1902 年提出，人的自我像照镜子：我们先想象自己在别人眼中的样子，再揣测别人的评价，最后据此形成自尊与认同。它说明「自我」不是天生孤立的，而是在社会互动里慢慢长出来的。��Cooley proposed in 1902 that the self is like a mirror: we imagine how we appear to others, guess their judgment, and then build our self-esteem and identity from that. It shows the self is not innate and isolated but grows out of social interaction.�ans��src��*Cooley，《人性与社会秩序》(1902)�2Cooley, 'Human Nature and the Social Order' (1902)��id�386b67c6aa9d�body���科举是中国古代通过统一考试选拔官员的制度，约从隋唐延续到清末（1300多年）。它让普通人（理论上）可以靠读书考试进入官场，是早期以考试选才的制度。�'The imperial examination was a system in imperial China that selected officials through standardized exams, lasting from the Sui-Tang era to the late Qing (over 1,300 years). In theory it let ordinary people enter government by studying and passing exams—an early merit-based selection system.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�58f6a4a8c8ab�body��「准无产者」指从事临时工、零工、短约等「不稳定、低收入、缺保障」工作的群体，既不像传统工人有长期雇佣，也难指望福利与晋升。社会学家斯坦丁在 2011 年用这个词刻画全球化与零工经济下的新脆弱阶层。�*The 'precariat' are people in temporary, gig, or short-contract work that is unstable, low-paid, and unprotected—neither the secure long-term employee nor the beneficiary of steady welfare. Sociologist Standing used the term in 2011 for the new fragile class of globalization and the gig economy.�ans��src��#Standing，《准无产者》(2011)� Standing, 'The Precariat' (2011)��id�79f488052e2a�body���「遵循先例」要求法院在类似案件里沿用上级或本院此前作出的判决，保证「同样情形同样对待」。它让法律可预期、减少任意裁量，却也允许在旧判例明显错误时「推翻」先例。�'Stare decisis' requires courts to follow earlier decisions by higher or same courts in similar cases, ensuring 'like cases are treated alike.' It makes law predictable and curbs arbitrary discretion, while still allowing precedent to be overruled when clearly wrong.�ans��src��$《牛津美国最高法院手册》�/'The Oxford Handbook of the U.S. Supreme Court'��id�c74f5b27cb43�body��「人才外流」指受过高等教育或掌握技能的年轻人移居到收入更高的国家，导致原籍国损失医生、工程师等人才。世界银行指出，这对依赖「海外汇款」的国家既有损失，也常伴随资金与技能的回流。�'Brain drain' means highly educated or skilled people move to countries with higher pay, leaving their home country short of doctors, engineers, and the like. The World Bank notes that while it is a loss, such countries often also receive remittances and later skills flowing back.�ans��src��9世界银行《移民与发展简报》；Bhagwati (1976)�>World Bank, 'Migration and Development Brief'; Bhagwati (1976)��id�faf7ae549fe2�body�٫考试以文章而非出身取人，使寒门子弟也能入仕，稀释了世家大族的政治特权，官僚来源变得更分散，中央对地方的控制也更强。��Exams selected by writing, not birth, letting commoners enter office and diluting great clans' political privilege. The bureaucracy became more diverse, strengthening central control over localities.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�fe421341087a�body�ٽ热带生鲜易腐、小农多，集市便于当天卖鲜货、灵活议价；温带冷链与规模化零售更发达，超市效率高。气候、农业规模共同塑造了购买习惯。��In the tropics produce spoils fast and small farms abound, so markets suit same-day fresh sales and bargaining; temperate zones have more cold chains and scale retail, making supermarkets efficient. Climate and farm size shape habits.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�soc_24_018�body��R默顿1968年观察到一个复利现象:荣誉倾向于流向已有声望者。同样的贡献,署名在诺奖得主名下会被高估,无名者则被忽视;资源分配随之倾斜——基金、实验室与学生都涌向头部,优势滚雪球。他用马太福音的一句经文命名:凡有的,还要加给他。这一机制不否认个体差异,而是揭示制度性放大器的存在;后续计量研究证实了早期优势对科学生涯的持续影响。对策也在演化:双盲评审、青年基金专项、对团队贡献的显性署名规范,都是在给马太效应装减速器。�`Merton observed compounding in 1968: recognition flows toward the already renowned. Identical contributions get overcredited under Nobel laureates names and ignored under unknown ones; funding, labs and students pile onto heads, snowballing advantage. He borrowed Matthews verse: to those who have, more shall be given. The mechanism does not deny individual differences — it exposes institutional amplifiers; scientometric work confirms early boosts echo through careers. Remedies evolve: double-blind review, young-investigator grants, explicit team-authorship norms — all brakes on the Matthew engine.�ans��src��ZMerton,《The Matthew Effect in Science》,Science,1968 (DOI: 10.1126/science.159.3810.56)�XMerton, 'The Matthew Effect in Science', Science, 1968, DOI: 10.1126/science.159.3810.56��id�0934b2999309�body�ٙ生产要用的原料、运费和工资上升时，商品的成本也跟着上去。如果想买的人多、能供应的量少，价格也会被推高。��When raw materials, transport, and wages become more expensive, the cost of making goods rises with them. Prices also get pushed up when many people want something and only a small amount is available.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�15a4e1579207�body���「犯意」指实施犯罪时的「明知或故意」等主观心理状态，「犯罪行为」指客观发生的不法举动或疏忽。多数犯罪须两者同时具备——既有坏心思、又做了坏事，才构成完整罪行。��'Mens rea' is the guilty mind—the intentional or knowing mental state when committing a crime—while 'actus reus' is the guilty act, the outward unlawful conduct or omission. Most crimes require both: a wrongful mind joined to a wrongful act.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�2c70559c34ad�body�٥很多岗位不公开招募，靠熟人推荐更快匹配信任。介绍人用自身名声作担保，招聘方省去筛选成本，求职者也更容易被相信。ٮMany jobs aren't publicly posted; referrals match trust faster. The referrer stakes their reputation, the employer saves screening cost, and the candidate is easier to trust.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�3789a85888fe�body�ٽ不同科目训练不同的本领，数学练推理，语文练表达，体育练身体和合作。多学几样，你才知道自己真正喜欢什么，也更容易看懂复杂的世界。��Different subjects train different abilities, with maths building reasoning, language building expression, and sport building the body and teamwork. Trying several helps you discover what you truly enjoy and makes a complicated world easier to understand.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4025c7d26d51�body���在文字不普及的年代，故事和歌谣是把经验、历史和道理传给下一代的可靠办法。有节奏、有情节的内容更容易记住，也让听的人愿意一起参与。��In times when writing was not widespread, stories and songs were a reliable way to pass experience, history, and lessons to the next generation. Rhythm and plot make content easier to remember and invite listeners to join in.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�47d59c13c00b�body�٥银行把很多人暂时不用的存款借给需要用钱的人和企业，收取一部分费用。银行再把其中一部分分给存款的人，这就是利息。پA bank lends the deposits people are not using right now to those who need money, and charges a fee for it. The bank then shares part of that fee with depositors, and that share is interest.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4a4429479bb2�body�٢记账是把每一笔收入和支出写下来，看清钱到底去了哪里。预算是提前安排好各项要花多少，这样钱就不会在月中就用光。��Keeping accounts means writing down every bit of money coming in and going out, so you can see where it actually went. A budget plans in advance how much goes to each need, so the money does not run out halfway through the month.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4b6a60d664af�body�٥未成年人心智还没完全成熟，判断力和自我保护能力较弱，所以法律在惩罚、合同和福利上给予特别照顾，重在教育和保护。ٸMinors are not yet fully mature and have weaker judgment and self-protection, so the law gives special care in punishment, contracts, and welfare, focusing on education and protection.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4bdff6b18669�body���图书馆把书籍、报刊和网络免费开放给所有人，无论收入高低都能查找信息、学新东西。它还是安静的学习空间和社区活动场所，作用远超过借书。��Libraries open books, newspapers, and the internet to everyone free of charge, so people can look things up and learn regardless of income. They also serve as quiet study spaces and community gathering places, doing far more than lending books.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5ab9b84b1038�body���1966 年美国最高法院在「米兰达诉亚利桑那州」案中裁定，警察拘押讯问前必须告知嫌疑人「保持沉默、请律师」等权利。它把宪法第五、六修正案的保护落到日常执法，防止逼供。�In Miranda v. Arizona (1966) the U.S. Supreme Court ruled that police must warn a suspect in custody of the right to remain silent and to an attorney before questioning. It turned the Fifth and Sixth Amendment protections into everyday police procedure and curbed coerced confessions.�ans��src��'Miranda v. Arizona, 384 U.S. 436 (1966)�'Miranda v. Arizona, 384 U.S. 436 (1966)��id�62142ac0d2b2�body���「一事不再理」原则规定，一个人对同一项指控被「正式宣判后」，不得再因同一罪行受审或处罚，源自美国宪法第五修正案。它保护个人免遭国家「反复追责」的消耗与恐吓。�The double jeopardy clause bars a person from being tried or punished again for the same offense after a final acquittal or conviction, rooted in the U.S. Constitution's Fifth Amendment. It shields individuals from the state's repeated, harassing pursuit over one act.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6c08e08bf045�body�ٺ用过的东西可能有磨损，也不再是最新款，能用的时间通常比全新的短。买家愿意付的钱因此更少，卖家也乐意让它继续被使用而不是丢掉。��Used items may show wear, are no longer the newest model, and usually have a shorter life left than new ones. Buyers are therefore willing to pay less, and sellers are glad to see the item used again instead of thrown away.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�85b3154e14b1�body�٨了解别人的习惯和想法，可以少一些误会，多一些合作的机会。你还会发现看待同一件事有很多角度，自己的思路也跟着变宽。��Learning about other people's customs and ideas removes misunderstandings and opens up chances to work together. You also discover many angles on the same thing, which widens your own thinking.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�89fe6db00a82�body�ٽ山川阻隔和交通不便让各地的人长期少来往，说话的腔调和用词就各自变化。这些方言保留着当地的历史和生活味道，和通用语可以同时使用。��Mountains, rivers, and poor transport kept people in different areas apart for a long time, so their accents and word choices drifted in their own directions. These dialects hold local history and flavour, and can be used alongside a common language.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a24fd09154ca�body�ٴ这些节日按月亮的圆缺来算日子，也就是农历或类似的历法。月相周期和太阳年的长度不一样，换算到常用日历上，日期自然每年移动。��Those festivals are counted by the phases of the moon, using a lunar calendar or something similar. A cycle of moon phases does not match the length of a solar year, so the date shifts when converted to the everyday calendar.�ans��src��-中国科学院紫金山天文台历书编算�PAlmanac calculations of Purple Mountain Observatory, Chinese Academy of Sciences��id�aaf716a56664�body�ٽ各国的资源和擅长的技术不同，有的地方盛产咖啡，有的地方善于造机器。把自己多的换成自己缺的，双方都能用更低的代价得到需要的东西。��Countries have different resources and different strengths, so one may grow plenty of coffee while another is good at building machines. Trading what you have plenty of for what you lack lets both sides get what they need at a lower cost.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�acca707bada4�body���公民是指具有某国国籍、依法享有权利并承担义务的个人。公民通常拥有投票、受教育、受保护等基本权利。相应地，公民也需遵守法律、纳税和服兵役（在适用国家）等义务。�,A citizen is a person who holds the nationality of a state and legally enjoys rights and bears duties. Citizens typically have basic rights such as voting and education, and protection under the law. In return, they are expected to obey laws, pay taxes, and where applicable perform military service.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ae8b3cfb5c1d�body�ٴ旧物件是过去生活留下的实证，能告诉我们祖先怎么耕作、穿衣和交流。把它们妥善保存下来，后人才能亲眼看到历史，而不只是听说。��Old objects are physical evidence of past lives, showing how ancestors farmed, dressed, and communicated. Preserving them properly lets later generations see history with their own eyes rather than only hear about it.�ans��src�ٵPierre Nora主编，《Les Lieux de Mémoire》（记忆之场），巴黎：Gallimard，1984–1992；英译Realms of Memory，纽约：哥伦比亚大学出版社，1996–1998。ٚNora, P. (ed.) (1984–1992). Les Lieux de Mémoire. Paris: Gallimard; English trans.: Realms of Memory. New York: Columbia University Press, 1996–1998.��id�bac5f2af47f5�body�ٖ河流和海港提供饮水、灌溉，还让船只能把货物运进运出。运输方便的地方生意兴旺，人口就慢慢聚集成大城市。ٽRivers and harbours supply drinking water and irrigation, and they let boats carry goods in and out. Where transport is easy, business thrives and people gradually gather into large cities.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�bdaee3e663a0�body�ٙ投票让每个同学的意见都算上一份，选出的人更能代表大多数人的想法。这样当选的人做事时，同学也更愿意配合。��Voting lets every classmate's opinion count once, so the person chosen better represents what most people think. Because of that, classmates are more willing to cooperate with whoever is chosen.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c6061c8598cf�body�ٟ地球是球形的，把球面摊平必然要拉伸或挤压某些地方。因此每种画法都有取舍，有的保住形状，有的保住面积或方向。��Earth is a sphere, and flattening a curved surface always means stretching or squeezing some parts. So every mapping method trades something off, keeping shapes accurate while giving up area, or the other way round.�ans��src�ٍKerkovits,《A Low-Distortion Oblique Map Projection of the World’s Landmasses》,Cartographic Perspectives,2024 (DOI: 10.14714/cp103.1833)ًKerkovits, 'A Low-Distortion Oblique Map Projection of the World’s Landmasses', Cartographic Perspectives, 2024, DOI: 10.14714/cp103.1833��id�c6358a51c161�body���人身保护令要求政府把被拘押的人带到大法官面前，说明「凭什么」关押，否则必须放人。它源自 1215 年《大宪章》并写入 1679 年《人身保护法案》，是防止「任意关押」的古老法治屏障。�␀Habeas corpus compels the government to bring a detained person before a court and justify the detention, or release them. Rooted in Magna Carta (1215) and enacted in the Habeas Corpus Act of 1679, it is an ancient safeguard against arbitrary imprisonment.�ans��src��4《大宪章》(1215)；《人身保护法案》1679�*Magna Carta (1215); Habeas Corpus Act 1679��id�d11ff2a08b8a�body�ٺ志愿者做事图的不是报酬，而是想让身边的人和环境变好，也从中获得成就感和友谊。灾害救援、社区图书角这类事常常靠志愿者补上人手。��Volunteers are not after payment; they want to make the people and places around them better, and they gain a sense of achievement and friendship. Disaster relief and community reading corners often rely on volunteers to fill the gap in helping hands.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d9f08787152e�body�٢首都是一个国家安排主要政府机构办公的城市，重要的会议和对外接待常在这里进行。它不一定是全国最大或最富的城市。��A capital is the city where a country places its main government offices, and important meetings and official visits usually happen there. It is not necessarily the largest or richest city in the country.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�dcbbe5e6fad7�body�٨这类设施一旦建好，多一个人使用几乎不增加成本，也很难挡住谁不许用。于是由政府统一建设和维护，让所有居民都能享受。ٹOnce such facilities are built, one more user adds almost no cost, and it is hard to keep anyone out. So governments build and maintain them together for everyone living there to enjoy.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�df8f7759f5d1�body���天上有一批导航卫星不停发出带时间的信号，手机接收到几颗卫星的信号后，比较它们到达的时间差。用这些差值算出距离，就能定出自己的位置。��A set of navigation satellites in space constantly broadcasts time-stamped signals, and a phone compares the arrival times of signals from several of them. Turning those tiny time differences into distances lets it work out where you are.�ans��src��e国务院新闻办公室《2021中国的航天》白皮书：北斗卫星导航定位原理（2022）�`SCIO white paper 'China's Space Program: A 2021 Perspective': BeiDou positioning principle, 2022��id�e270615f58a8�body�٨这些线织成一张网，让地球上任何一点都能用两个数字准确表示。船长、飞行员和导航软件靠这套坐标，就能说清自己在哪里。��These lines weave a grid so that any point on Earth can be described exactly with two numbers. Ship captains, pilots, and navigation apps use those coordinates to say precisely where they are.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�f099d48ad3bb�body�ٙ很多人各交一小笔钱，凑成一个共同的资金池。谁不幸遇到生病、火灾这类意外，就从池子里拿钱来帮他渡过难关。ٸMany people each pay a small amount into one shared pool of money. If someone is unlucky and faces an accident such as illness or a fire, money from the pool helps them get through it.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�soc_25_014�body��v无罪推定是现代法治基石:任何人在法院判决有罪前都推定为无罪,控方必须拿出确凿证据,被告无需自证清白。理由是一个不对称账本:错放一个坏人,损失的是一案;错判一个好人,摧毁的是他的人生加公众对法律的信任。程序正义或许偶尔放慢惩罚,却守护着每个人免受权力滥用的底线。�~Presumption of innocence anchors modern justice: everyone counts innocent until courts convict, prosecutors must prove guilt solidly, defendants never prove innocence. The logic is an asymmetric ledger: freeing one guilty person loses one case; convicting one innocent destroys a life plus public trust. Procedure sometimes slows punishment but shields everyone from abuse of power.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�0273f6c60744�body���人口密度指单位土地面积上居住的人口数量，通常用“人/平方公里”表示。它帮助人们比较不同地区人类分布的疏密程度，是地理学和城市规划的基本指标。��Population density is the number of people living per unit of land area, usually expressed as persons per square kilometer. It helps compare how densely people are distributed across regions and is a basic indicator in geography and urban planning.�ans��src��F联合国人口司（UN Population Division）《世界人口展望》�8UN Population Division, “World Population Prospects”��id�03050a58ab57�body���研究发现，暑假等长假后，学生的阅读与数学测验分数往往会下滑，低收入家庭孩子掉得更多，这叫「暑期学习损失」。它说明学习需要持续练习，停太久不使用，知识就会慢慢变模糊。�Studies find that after long breaks like summer vacation, students' reading and math scores tend to drop—and more so for low-income children—a pattern called 'summer learning loss.' It shows learning needs steady practice; without use, knowledge slowly fades.�ans��src��=Cooper 等，《暑假对学业测验分数的影响》(1996)�QCooper et al., 'The Effects of Summer Vacation on Achievement Test Scores' (1996)��id�03461fc7afe4�body��i主要有直接民主（公民直接表决）和代议民主（选举代表代为决策）两种形式。�yThe two main forms are direct democracy (citizens vote directly) and representative democracy (elected officials decide).�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�06a6a85843f3�body��o利息是借用资金的成本，或让渡资金使用权的回报，通常按本金的一定百分比计算。�yInterest is the cost of borrowing money or the return for lending it, usually expressed as a percentage of the principal.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�192eef65e18b�body�٨各平台选题、立场与算法不同，会放大不同侧面；加之自媒体二次加工，信息出现偏差。多看几个信源有助于拼出更全的图景。��Different platforms choose angles, stances, and algorithms differently, amplifying distinct facets; self-media rework content, causing skew. Checking several sources helps piece together a fuller picture.�ans��src��gRobert Entman,《Framing: Toward Clarification of a Fractured Paradigm》,Journal of Communication,1993�8R. M. Entman, Framing, Journal of Communication 43, 1993��id�1c3ae07127f2�body�ٍ法治指法律至上，政府和个人都要守法，法律公平对待所有人、保护基本权利，而不是由掌权者随意决定。ٰThe rule of law means law is supreme: both government and citizens obey it, it treats everyone fairly and protects basic rights, rather than leaving decisions to rulers' whims.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�21471630653b�body�٨学校把很多有用的知识和方法集中教给孩子，让每个人都有机会学会读写和计算。学到的本领会帮你以后选择自己喜欢的生活。��School gathers useful knowledge and methods and teaches them to children, so everyone has a chance to learn reading, writing, and counting. Those skills help you choose the life you want later on.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�282a10a86998�body�٥问候是长期形成的习惯，有的地方握手，有的地方鞠躬，有的地方双手合十。方式虽然不同，想表达的心意都是尊重和欢迎。ٰGreetings are habits built up over a long time, so some places shake hands, some bow, and some press palms together. The gestures differ, but they all mean respect and welcome.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2a50b0501623�body�ِ打招呼让彼此熟悉起来，见了面就不再陌生。熟悉的邻居更容易互相照应，比如帮忙收快递或注意小孩安全。ٻGreeting each other helps neighbours become familiar instead of strangers. Familiar neighbours look out for one another more easily, like taking in a parcel or keeping an eye on children.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�328739cc9f7f�body�ٍ投票是公民选择谁来制定规则与分配资源的方式。每个人的票都微小，但汇总起来决定社区和国家的方向。ىVoting lets citizens choose who makes rules and allocates resources. Each vote is small, but together they steer a community and country.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�35a724f4def3�body�٨有些事需要专门的训练和装备才能做好，比如治病和灭火。社会让一部分人专心学这些本领，遇到紧急情况就有人能立刻帮忙。��Some tasks, such as treating illness or putting out fires, need special training and equipment. Communities let some people focus on those skills, so help is ready the moment an emergency happens.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3b0d8b1c01b9�body�ِ手机付款时，钱以数字的形式从你的账户转到了商家的账户。虽然看不到纸币，但银行里的记录已经改变了。٤When you pay with a phone, money moves as numbers from your account into the shop's account. You see no banknotes, but the records at the bank have already changed.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�423d4c96caeb�body�ٓ城镇化、人口流动与个人主义兴起使年轻人独立居住，三代同堂减少。核心家庭更灵活但也弱化家族互助网络。ٽUrbanization, mobility, and individualism lead young people to live independently, reducing three-generation households. Nuclear families are flexible but weaken family mutual-aid networks.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�456145188c79�body��Z国际贸易是国家间买卖商品与服务，使各国专注于相对高效的生产。�`It is the cross-border exchange of goods and services, letting countries specialize efficiently.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�45708f2f6988�body��f老年人口比重上升的现象，主要因生育下降与寿命延长，影响养老与劳动力。�jIt is the rising share of older people from lower fertility and longer life, stressing pensions and labor.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�4c282a662d9c�body�٥每个地方的气候和土地能长出的作物不同，人们就用手边的食材做饭。海边多吃鱼，草原多吃奶和肉，慢慢形成了不同口味。��Each place has a climate and soil that grow different crops, so people cook with whatever is at hand. Coastal areas eat more fish and grasslands more milk and meat, and different tastes grew from that.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5439791a4e84�body�ٟ马上花掉能立刻得到一点快乐，钱也就没有了。存起来虽然要等，却能换到更贵、更想要的东西，遇到急事时也有准备。��Spending right away brings a small pleasure at once, and then the money is gone. Saving means waiting, but it can buy something bigger that you really want and leaves you ready for emergencies.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5a43620abc30�body�ٓ国家是一片有边界的地方，住在里面的人有共同的政府和规则。地图上不同颜色的区域，常常就是不同的国家。٠A country is an area with borders where the people share a government and a set of rules. The differently coloured areas on a map are often different countries.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5bc893c15b44�body���全球化指商品、资本、信息、技术和人员在世界各地日益频繁跨境流动，使各国经济与社会相互依存加深的过程。它既带来效率与文化交流，也引发不平等与文化冲突等争议。�,Globalization is the process by which goods, capital, information, technology, and people flow across borders ever more frequently, deepening economic and social interdependence among countries. It brings efficiency and cultural exchange but also sparks debates over inequality and cultural conflict.�ans��src��f国际货币基金组织（IMF）《世界经济展望》；联合国贸易和发展会议（UNCTAD）�)IMF, “World Economic Outlook”; UNCTAD��id�5ddba1eb4337�body��Z文化是一个群体共享的信仰、习俗、语言与艺术等生活方式的总和。�^Culture is the shared beliefs, customs, language, and arts that make up a group's way of life.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�62dda12ad004�body�ٟ地址像一层层的抽屉，从国家、城市写到街道和门牌号，一步步把范围缩小。写得越清楚，信件和快递就越不容易送错。��An address works like nested drawers, moving from country and city down to street and house number, narrowing the area step by step. The clearer it is, the less likely letters and parcels go to the wrong place.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6464b99a8f56�body�ٜ未经同意公开他人肖像可能侵犯肖像权与隐私权，尤其涉及孩童或私密场景。征得同意是基本的数字礼仪与法律常识。��Posting someone’s portrait without consent may violate portrait and privacy rights, especially for children or private scenes. Asking first is basic digital etiquette and legal common sense.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�69a24fdad84f�body�ٖ每个人都会遇到自己搞不定的时候，互相帮忙就能一起把事情做成。你帮过别人，别人也更愿意在你需要时伸手。ٸEveryone runs into moments they cannot handle alone, and helping each other gets things done together. When you have helped others, they are more willing to reach out when you need it.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6c49c3b03488�body��f城市规划是对土地使用、交通与公共设施的统筹安排，以改善宜居性与效率。�iUrban planning organizes land use, transport, and public facilities to improve livability and efficiency.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6d5bd2ee99cb�body��`迁徙指人跨越一定距离改变常住地的移动，可分为国内迁徙与国际迁徙。�lMigration is the movement of people changing residence across a distance, either within or across countries.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�79de8e0d11bb�body�ي信息不对称指交易双方掌握的信息不一样多，比如卖家比买家更清楚商品质量，可能造成不公平或低效。ٻInformation asymmetry means the two sides of a deal hold unequal information—e.g., a seller knows a product's quality better than the buyer—which can cause unfairness or inefficiency.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�85cf65838cc4�body�ٟ这是绘图的人长期形成的约定，让大家用同一种方式读地图。指北针指着北方，上方是北就容易把地图和真实方向对齐。��It is a long-standing agreement among mapmakers so that everyone reads maps the same way. A compass needle points north, so north at the top makes it easy to line the map up with real directions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�871a948e68b3�body�٨通用语、大众媒体与人口流动让年轻人更少使用方言，许多方言使用人数下降、面临消失；语言保护努力试图记录与传承它们。��A common language, mass media, and migration lead younger people to use dialects less, so many are declining and at risk of disappearing; preservation efforts try to document and sustain them.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�9128cafb0eab�body���房子要先对付当地的天气，多雨的地方屋顶很斜，好让雨水流走；很热的地方墙厚窗小，屋里才凉快。人们还会就近取材，用石头、木头或泥土来建。��A house must first cope with the local weather, so rainy places have steep roofs that let water run off, while very hot places have thick walls and small windows to stay cool. People also build with what is nearby, such as stone, wood, or earth.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�960813451634�body��Z义务教育是国家依法要求适龄儿童必须接受的基础教育，通常免费。�fCompulsory education is the state-mandated, usually free basic schooling for children of certain ages.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9b3c165dd922�body���从 16 到 19 世纪，横跨大西洋的奴隶贸易把约「1200 万」非洲人强制运到美洲种植园做工，造成无数家庭破碎。联合国教科文组织将其列为人类共同记忆，提醒人们铭记这段历史。��From the 1500s to the 1800s, the transatlantic slave trade forcibly carried roughly 12 million Africans to work on American plantations, shattering countless families. UNESCO lists it as shared human memory, urging the world to remember.�ans��src��KEltis & Richardson，《跨大西洋奴隶贸易地图集》(2010)；UNESCO�KEltis & Richardson, 'Atlas of the Transatlantic Slave Trade' (2010); UNESCO��id�9c34425b8919�body��~社会流动指人在社会地位、收入或职业层级上的上升或下降，比如从工人家庭的孩子成为医生。�zSocial mobility is movement up or down in social status, income, or occupation—e.g., a worker's child becoming a doctor.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�a3a8c47182ed�body�ٖ以前人们走得不远，各地的人常年只和身边的人说话，说法就慢慢变得不一样。时间久了，就形成了各自的语言。ٱIn the past people did not travel far, so each group mostly talked with those nearby and their way of speaking slowly drifted apart. Over a long time, separate languages formed.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a7023a12f75f�body��o人口普查是定期对所有人口进行逐人登记的调查，为政策与资源分配提供基础数据。�iA census is a periodic count of every person, providing baseline data for policy and resource allocation.�ans��src��b联合国经济和社会事务部《人口和住房普查的原则和建议》第三修订版,2017�}United Nations, Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses, Revision 3, UN Statistics Division, 2017.��id�aaa5fc59b13e�body�٨图书馆是大家共同拥有的，一本书轮流借给很多人看，比每人各买一本省钱得多。这样不论家里条件如何，孩子都能读到好书。��A library belongs to the whole community, and lending one book to many readers in turn costs far less than everyone buying a copy. That way children can reach good books no matter what their family can afford.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aae5dae40575�body�ٙ满减让人在“省到优惠”的心理下多买本不需要的东西，实际支出反而增加。这是一种门槛促销利用了贪便宜心理。٘Threshold discounts push people to buy unneeded items to “unlock” the saving, so actual spending often rises. It exploits a bargain-seeking mindset.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aea19401fb6b�body�ٓ邮政编码用几个数字代表一小片区域，机器一读就知道信该送往哪里。这比读长长的地址快得多，也更少出错。ټA postal code uses a few digits to stand for a small area, so a machine can tell at once where a letter should go. That is much faster than reading a long address and makes fewer mistakes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�aec9a1aab091�body���恩格尔定律由恩斯特·恩格尔于 1857 年发现：家庭收入越高，花在食物上的钱占全部开销的比例就越低。也就是说，富裕家庭虽然吃得更好，但「吃饭」在总支出里的比重反而更小。��Discovered by Ernst Engel in 1857, Engel's law states that as a household's income rises, the fraction of spending devoted to food falls. Wealthier families eat better yet spend a smaller share of their total budget on meals.�ans��src��)Engel，《生产与消费关系》(1857)�>Engel, 'Die Productions- und Consumptionsverhältnisse' (1857)��id�b3d377a6ba58�body�ٜ工作是给别人提供有用的东西或帮助，比如种粮食、修房子、教孩子读书。别人得到了需要的东西，就付钱作为回报。ٺWorking means providing something useful or helpful for others, such as growing food, repairing houses, or teaching children. Because others get what they need, they pay money in return.�ans��src��@Richard Scarry,《What Do People Do All Day》,Random House,1968�8R. Scarry, What Do People Do All Day, Random House, 1968��id�b550b9f97a34�body�ٟ每个国家通常自己发行货币，这样更方便管理自己的经济。去别的国家时，可以按当时的比例把手里的钱换成当地货币。ٶEach country usually issues its own currency, which makes managing its own economy easier. When you travel abroad, you can swap your money for the local currency at the current rate.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�bc378e18f10b�body�ٙ家庭背景、教育机会、所在地区和运气都会影响一个人的收入和财富。社会通过税收和公共服务来缩小过大的差距。َFamily background, education, region, and luck all affect income and wealth. Societies use taxes and public services to narrow excessive gaps.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�c2c6883d48e1�body�٥节日常常来自值得记住的事，比如丰收、季节变换或重要的历史故事。固定的日子让一代代人都记得这件事，也有机会团聚。��Festivals often come from something worth remembering, such as a harvest, a change of season, or an important story from history. A fixed date helps each generation remember it and gives people a chance to gather.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c5424d3389de�body�٥每家商店的房租、运费和人工花费都不一样，卖同一件玩具付出的成本就不同。有的店还会故意把价钱定低一点来吸引顾客。ٳEvery shop pays different rent, shipping, and staff costs, so selling the same toy costs them different amounts. Some shops also set a lower price on purpose to attract customers.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c686fe657848�body�ِ分类便于回收可利用物、减少填埋焚烧污染，并降低处理成本。它能延长垃圾场寿命、保护环境和资源循环。ٮSorting eases recycling, cuts landfill and incineration pollution, and lowers processing cost. It extends landfill life and protects the environment through resource cycling.�ans��src��,世界银行《城市固体废物简报》(What a Waste 2.0);国家发展改革委、住建部生活垃圾分类制度实施方案 ; 另见: World Bank, What a Waste 2.0: A Global Snapshot of Solid Waste Management to 2050; NDRC & MOHURD, Implementation Plan on Household Waste Sorting System (China)�.World Bank, What a Waste 2.0: A Global Snapshot of Solid Waste Management to 2050; NDRC & MOHURD, Implementation Plan on Household Waste Sorting System (China) ; see also: 世界银行《城市固体废物简报》(What a Waste 2.0);国家发展改革委、住建部生活垃圾分类制度实施方案��id�ca7a68ccda85�body���马斯洛在 1943 年提出需求从低到高分为生理、安全、归属与爱、尊重、自我实现五层，认为低层满足后才会追求高层。它被广泛用于理解动机，以及教育与管理工作。��In 1943 Maslow arranged needs from low to high as physiological, safety, love/belonging, esteem, and self-actualization, arguing higher needs emerge once lower ones are met. It is widely used to understand motivation in education and management.�ans��src��O亚伯拉罕·马斯洛《人类动机理论》（1943, Psychological Review）�9Abraham Maslow, “A Theory of Human Motivation” (1943)��id�cfb2b6c55aa0�body�ل比例尺告诉你地图上的一小段代表现实中多长的距离。量一量纸上的长度，就能算出真的要走多远。ٗA scale tells you how much real distance a short length on the map stands for. By measuring on paper, you can work out how far you would really travel.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d8b061bced7f�body�ِ出生多、去世少的地方人口会增加；相反，生育少又寿命长的地方可能变少。迁移也会让一些地方人数变化。ـWhere births exceed deaths, population grows; where births are few and lives long, it may shrink. Migration also shifts numbers.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�dd68bf016f54�body�ٖ会议占用专注时间、打断工作流，若缺乏明确议题与结论就变成低效消耗。好的会议应有目标、纪要和后续行动。٢Meetings steal focus time and break flow; without clear agenda and conclusions they become low-efficiency drains. Good meetings have goals, notes, and follow-ups.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�de395162535b�body�ه先储蓄再消费能建立应急缓冲，应对失业或意外开支，减少陷入债务。它是个人财务稳健的基础习惯。ٔSaving before spending builds an emergency buffer for job loss or surprises and reduces debt risk. It is a basic habit of personal financial health.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e1bbbac91d2e�body��]活字印刷使书籍廉价普及，加速了知识传播、识字率提升与宗教改革。�gMovable type made books cheap and widespread, boosting literacy, knowledge spread, and the Reformation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�eb9ca7117be7�body�٨钱之所以管用，是因为大家相信它数量有限、由国家统一发行。如果谁都能印，钱就会多到没人愿意收，东西的价格也会乱掉。��Money works because everyone trusts that its amount is limited and that a country issues it in one official way. If anyone could print it, there would be so much that nobody would accept it, and prices would fall into chaos.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f956f226f98d�body�ٙ规则事先说清楚什么可以做、什么不可以做，大家就不用每次都争论。有了规则，上课能安静，游戏也能玩得公平。ٔRules say in advance what is allowed and what is not, so people do not argue about it every time. With rules, lessons stay calm and games stay fair.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fbdf75a8d739�body��r阶层是社会按财富、职业、教育等把人分成的不同等级，影响收入、生活方式和机会。�vClass is society's ranking of people by wealth, occupation, and education, shaping income, lifestyle, and opportunity.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�fcfba242b47a�body���文化相对论主张以某一文化自身的标准而非外部标准来理解和评价其习俗与价值观，由博厄斯在 20 世纪初系统提出。它提醒人们避免用本族中心主义武断评判其他社会。�Cultural relativism holds that a culture’s customs and values should be understood and judged by its own standards rather than external ones; it was systematically advanced by Franz Boas in the early 20th century. It cautions against judging other societies by ethnocentric standards.�ans��src��Z弗朗茨·博厄斯《人类学与现代生活》（Boas, Anthropology and Modern Life）�.Franz Boas, “Anthropology and Modern Life”��id�fd61d7622e49�body�ٖ博弈论研究人们在相互影响中做决策的情形，比如竞价、谈判和竞争，关注每个人怎样选择对自己最有利的作法。٢Game theory studies decision-making when people's choices affect each other, as in bidding, negotiation, or competition, focusing on how each picks the best move.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�soc_25_006�body��快递员靠两样法宝:一张记在脑子里的地图(几号楼在哪个方向),和手机里的导航软件。跑得越多越熟,三个月后闭着眼都能找到你家单元门。这就是熟能生巧——大脑会给经常走的路线开快速通道。�Drivers use two tools: a map in their head (which block faces where) and phone navigation. The more they run routes the better they know them — three months later they find your door eyes-closed. Practice makes perfect because brains build fast lanes for familiar paths.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�soc_25_007�body��你手机里存的是一串数字账本:付款时,手机告诉银行把我的10元转到商店,银行核对后改两行数字——你的少10,商店的多10。钱没有飞走,只是账本换了页。所以要看管好手机密码,它就是账本的钥匙。�Your phone keeps a digital ledger: paying tells the bank move ten yuan from me to the shop; the bank checks then edits two lines — yours minus ten, theirs plus ten. Money never flies away; only ledger lines change. Guard your password well — it is the ledger key.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�soc_25_008�body��'语言像河流,隔着山就慢慢分岔:同一句话,广东、四川、东北各自越说越不同,成了方言。普通话是以北京语音为标准、全国共同推广的通用语,让大家跨省交流不隔阂。方言是家乡的声音宝藏,普通话是沟通的桥梁,两者都珍贵。�0Languages flow like rivers splitting around mountains: the same sentence drifts differently in Guangdong, Sichuan or Dongbei, becoming dialects. Mandarin uses Beijing sounds as a standard bridge so people across provinces connect. Dialects are hometown treasure; Mandarin is the bridge — both precious.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�009e4555bff0�body��W社会资本指人际关系网络、信任与规范所带来的资源与协作能力。�oSocial capital is the value derived from networks, trust, and norms that enable cooperation and mutual benefit.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�033b17f2457f�body��u外部性指一个人的行为给不相关的旁人带来好处或坏处，而双方并没有为此付钱或收钱。�zAn externality is when someone's action creates benefits or harms for uninvolved bystanders, without money changing hands.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�082e3305c191�body��x圆圆的硬币没有尖角，放进口袋和钱包不会扎到手。它还能轻轻滚动，机器数起来很方便。ٚRound coins have no sharp corners, so they do not poke your hand in a pocket or purse. They also roll gently, which makes them easy for machines to count.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�17092e348242�body�ف做冰淇淋要用牛奶、糖和冷柜，还要有人花时间把它做出来。付钱是在感谢这些材料和这份工作。ٖMaking ice cream takes milk, sugar, a freezer, and someone's time to make it. Paying money is a way of thanking people for those things and that work.�ans��src��@Richard Scarry,《What Do People Do All Day》,Random House,1968�8R. Scarry, What Do People Do All Day, Random House, 1968��id�2e940e8b5050�body��几百年前的英格兰，国王的税务官会在木棍上刻痕记录借债和税款，再把木棍劈成两半，双方各留一半作为凭证。这种「tally stick」（记账棍）因为难伪造、好核对，就当成了记账和还钱的依据。�In England centuries ago, the king's tax officers notched sticks to record debts and taxes, then split each stick in two so both sides kept a matching half as proof. Called a 'tally stick,' it was hard to fake and easy to check, so people used it as a record for paying money back.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�3179d262ab79�body�ٍ他们在说另一种语言，所以听起来很陌生。世界上有几千种语言，每一种都是一群人从小学会的说话方式。��They are speaking another language, which is why it sounds unfamiliar. There are thousands of languages in the world, and each one is a way of talking that a group of people learned as children.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�3201d36df2c4�body�ي垃圾进了桶，清洁工人就能一起收走，街道又干净又好看。乱扔的垃圾会弄脏地面，还可能伤到小动物。ٰWhen trash goes into the can, cleaning workers can collect it all at once and the street stays clean and pleasant. Litter on the ground makes a mess and can hurt small animals.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�324fb934e731�body��o说谢谢是告诉别人，你看见了他的好意。被感谢的人心里暖暖的，下次还愿意帮忙。�}Saying thank you tells someone that you noticed their kindness. The other person feels warm inside and is glad to help again.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�332b9bd03662�body��x图书馆里很多人在安静地看书，大声说话会打断他们。小声说话是让每个人都能安心读书。�zMany people in a library are reading quietly, and loud voices interrupt them. Speaking softly lets everyone read in peace.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�35661b2301f7�body�ل过生日是庆祝你来到这个世界，又长大了一岁。家人和朋友聚在一起，是想让你知道大家有多爱你。ٍA birthday celebrates that you came into the world and have grown a year older. Family and friends gather to show you how much you are loved.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�38ac116f959a�body��r存钱罐帮你把零钱一点点攒起来。等里面的钱变多了，你就能买到本来买不起的东西。ىA piggy bank helps you gather small coins little by little. When enough coins pile up, you can buy something you could not afford before.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�45a63bf0515f�body�ي因为那里天气热、雨水多，特别适合种水稻；米饭便宜、顶饱又能配很多菜，久而久之成了每天的主食。�rThe hot, rainy climate suits rice; it is cheap, filling and pairs with many dishes, so it became the daily staple.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�56d9d632ded0�body�٘现在的AI能根据数据做很多事，比如认图片、回答问题，但它不会像人一样真正理解和感受，更像很会模仿的助手。٭Today’s AI can do many tasks from data—recognize images, answer questions—but it doesn’t truly understand or feel like people do; it is more like a skilled imitator.�ans��src��0图灵 1950 年论文《计算机器与智能》�8Turing's 1950 paper Computing Machinery and Intelligence��id�570d6a885260�body�ٜ机器和工厂让商品变得更便宜、种类更多，但也让许多人离开农村、到城市工厂长时间工作，改变了家庭与日常生活。ٞMachines and factories made goods cheaper and more varied, but also pulled many from farms into long factory hours in cities, reshaping family and daily life.�ans��src��|E. P. 汤普森：《时间、工作纪律与工业资本主义》，《过去与现在》1967年第38期，第56–97页。�mE. P. Thompson, Time, Work-Discipline, and Industrial Capitalism, Past & Present, no. 38 (1967), pp. 56–97.��id�5d294e7543d3�body�ي交换就是我把我的东西给你，你把你的东西给我。你有多的蜡笔，我有多的贴纸，换一换两个人都开心。١Trading means I give you something of mine and you give me something of yours. If you have extra crayons and I have extra stickers, swapping makes us both happy.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�64136cd6fd4b�body��x钱是大家一起同意可以用来换东西的小纸片和小圆片。你把钱给店员，店员就把面包给你。ٚMoney is special paper and metal pieces that everyone agrees can be traded for things. You hand money to a shopkeeper, and the shopkeeper gives you bread.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6817c69110ea�body��r公共品是大家都能用、且一个人用了不会减少别人使用的东西，比如路灯和天气预报。كPublic goods are things everyone can use and one person's use doesn't reduce another's, such as streetlights and weather forecasts.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�692d77a1c95f�body�ٜ因为南方雨水多、产米多，而北方是皇帝和很多士兵、官员住的地方，自己种的粮不够吃，所以要用水路把米运过去。٘The south had more rain and rice; the north held the emperor, soldiers and officials whose local harvest fell short, so rice was shipped north by water.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�69c68cc11484�body�٥幼年阶段是规则意识、生活习惯与社交能力建立的关键期，比知识灌输更影响长远发展。好习惯能降低日后学习与行为成本。ٳEarly childhood is a key window for rules, habits, and social skills—more decisive for long-term growth than rote knowledge. Good habits lower later learning and behavior costs.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（习惯与学习章）�3Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), habits and learning��id�7412002528ee�body��~红灯和绿灯让车和人轮流走，大家就不会撞在一起。绿灯亮了再走，是在保护自己也保护别人。ٕRed and green lights make cars and people take turns so they do not bump into each other. Walking only on green protects you and protects others too.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7b6b194803f5�body�ِ过节的时候，大家会放下平时的忙碌，一起吃好吃的、看热闹的表演。和喜欢的人在一起，心里自然就高兴。ٟDuring a festival, people set aside their usual busy work to share tasty food and watch lively shows. Being together with people you love naturally feels good.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�84224b31333a�body�ِ有的家人很多，有的家人很少，有的和爷爷奶奶住在一起。不管家是什么样子，会互相照顾的家就是好的家。٥Some families have many people, some have few, and some live together with grandparents. However a family looks, a family that cares for each other is a good family.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�91f0ed8f1bd9�body�ِ幼儿园里有很多同龄的小伙伴，可以一起唱歌、画画和玩游戏。在那里你会学着交朋友，也学着自己做事情。ٓKindergarten is full of children your age to sing, draw, and play games with. There you learn how to make friends and how to do things by yourself.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a7ef9684d176�body��r地图上蓝色的地方一般是水，比如海洋、湖泊和河流。绿色和棕色的地方一般是陆地。�vThe blue parts on a map are usually water, like oceans, lakes, and rivers. The green and brown parts are usually land.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�aacc858f2c0f�body�ٱ排队是用一种非正式但被广泛接受的规则来分配稀缺资源，降低冲突与混乱。它体现社会秩序与公平预期，违反者会被群体压力约束。��Queuing is an informal but widely accepted rule for allocating scarce resources and reducing conflict and chaos. It reflects social order and a fair expectation, and violators face peer pressure.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ae1d76f80282�body�ل地图是把一个地方从高高的天上往下看的样子画在纸上。看着地图，你就知道公园和家在哪个方向。ِA map is a drawing of a place as if you looked down on it from high in the sky. Looking at a map shows you which way the park and your home are.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bc65abbda4df�body���17 世纪的英国为了把海运和殖民贸易「牢牢抓在自己手里」，立下航海条例，规定许多货物只能由英国或殖民地的船只运输。这保护了本国船主，却也惹恼了荷兰等对手，多次引发战争。�In the 1600s Britain wanted to keep sea trade and colonial commerce firmly in its own hands, so it passed Navigation Acts saying many goods could be carried only on British or colonial ships. It protected English shipowners but angered rivals like the Dutch and sparked wars.�ans��src��"英国议会《航海条例》1651�"UK Parliament, Navigation Act 1651��id�c3e739f79ad6�body�ٍ纸币上的图画讲的是这个地方的故事，比如有名的建筑、山水或人物。这些很细的花纹也让别人难以仿造。ٜThe pictures on banknotes tell stories about a place, such as famous buildings, mountains, or people. Those very fine patterns also make notes hard to copy.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�de3d99594bd8�body��{门牌号像你家的名字，让邮递员和客人知道该敲哪一扇门。没有号码，大家很容易走错地方。ٟA house number is like your home's name, so mail carriers and visitors know which door to knock on. Without numbers, people would easily go to the wrong place.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e0159fbfdf0f�body��{市场失灵指单靠买卖双方的自由交易，不能把资源分配到最合适的地方，造成浪费或不公平。ُMarket failure occurs when free exchanges between buyers and sellers fail to allocate resources to their best use, causing waste or unfairness.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e14c1ce5c941�body�ٖ阿拉伯数字（实际源自印度）符号简洁、进位清晰、便于书写与运算，全球通用。它降低了跨语言数学交流成本。ٮArabic numerals (actually from India) are concise, have clear place value, and are easy to write and compute, used worldwide. They cut cross-language math communication cost.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�ee52067f804f�body��u街道有了名字，我们说位置的时候才说得清楚。你告诉朋友你在花园路，他就能找到你。لOnce streets have names, we can say where things are clearly. If you tell a friend you are on Garden Road, your friend can find you.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�fc7726333157�body��f排队让每个人按先来后到轮到自己，不用挤也不用抢。这样又安全，又公平。�|Lining up lets everyone take a turn in the order they arrived, with no pushing or grabbing. That keeps things safe and fair.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�soc_25_002�body���因为面团发酵和烤面包需要好几个小时,要让人们在早餐时间买到热乎乎的面包,面包师就得在星星还在天上的时候开始干活。每个职业都在用自己的方式帮助别人。ٟDough needs hours to rise and bake, so bakers start while stars still shine to have warm bread ready for breakfast time. Every job helps people in its own way.�ans��src��@Richard Scarry,《What Do People Do All Day》,Random House,1968�8R. Scarry, What Do People Do All Day, Random House, 1968��id�soc_25_004�body���红灯是给所有车辆和行人的统一口令。大家都遵守,汽车知道什么时候停,小朋友知道什么时候走,就不会撞在一起。规则看起来让你等一下,其实是保护每个人的盾牌。��Red lights are one command for every car and walker. When everyone follows them cars know when to stop and kids know when to cross — no bumps. Rules look like waiting but they are shields protecting everyone.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�soc_25_005�body�پ传说怪兽「年」怕红色和响声,人们用红纸鞭炮吓跑它。现在知道没有怪兽,红色代表喜气,团圆饭代表一家人整整齐齐,祝福就这样一代代传下来。��Legend says a beast named Nian feared red and loud bangs, so people scared it away for a peaceful New Year. We know no beast exists now, but red means joy and reunion dinners mean family together — customs passing blessings down generations.�ans��src��?钟敬文主编《民俗学概论》,高等教育出版社,1998�?钟敬文主编《民俗学概论》,高等教育出版社,1998��id�001d3c3e2e53�body���米尔格拉姆的实验提示，任意两人之间平均通过约六个中间人即可连通，说明大规模社会网络具有惊人短的「小世界」路径。后续网络科学以平均路径长度量化这一性质。��Milgram's experiment suggested any two people are connected through about six intermediaries on average, showing large social networks have surprisingly short small-world paths. Later network science quantifies this via average path length.�ans��src��:Milgram, S. (1967), 《小世界问题》, 今日心理学�=Milgram, S. (1967), The Small World Problem, Psychology Today��id�003a22bc9a5a�body��联邦制下，中央与地方（州、邦）的权力由宪法明确划分，双方都不能单方剥夺对方的权力，地方有自己的立法权、税收权和行政体系；单一制下地方权力由中央立法授予、可被收回。联邦制通过“让不同地区保留自治”来容纳语言、民族、宗教或经济差异，减少统一强压引发的冲突，同时保持共同市场与统一外交国防，但也可能带来政策碎片化、地区差距与相互“推卸责任”的问题。�mIn a federation, central and subnational (state) powers are divided by the constitution; neither can unilaterally take away the other's powers, and states have their own legislative, taxing, and administrative authority. In a unitary state, subnational powers are granted and revocable by central legislation. Federalism accommodates linguistic, ethnic, religious, or economic diversity by letting regions keep autonomy, reducing conflict from forced uniformity while preserving a common market and unified foreign and defense policy—but it can also bring policy fragmentation, regional gaps, and mutual blame-shifting.�ans��src��&Lijphart，《协和式民主》(1969)�+Lijphart, 'Consociational Democracy' (1969)��id�0098e41273eb�body��~基尼系数是衡量收入或财富分配平等程度的核心指标：0表示绝对平均，人人相同；1表示极端不均，一个人拿走全部。现实中的国家大致落在0.25到0.65之间，数值越大分配越不均。它直观好用，但只反映相对差距，看不出穷人的绝对生活水平，所以通常和贫困率、中位数收入等指标一起看。�oThe Gini coefficient measures how evenly income or wealth is distributed: 0 means perfect equality where everyone holds the same, and 1 means one person holds everything. Real countries range roughly from 0.25 to 0.65, higher meaning more unequal. It's a handy single number but captures only relative gaps, so it's read together with poverty rates and median income.�ans��src��QOECD (2011), 《分化中的我们：不平等为何持续上升》, 经合组织�:OECD (2011), Divided We Stand: Why Inequality Keeps Rising��id�00dc3b8c0fa7�body���相对剥夺感指人们与参照群体比较后，感到本应得到却未得到的落差，即使绝对生活改善仍可能强烈。它是怨恨与社会动荡的重要心理来源。公平感知比绝对收入更影响满意度。�!Relative deprivation is the felt gap between what one believes they deserve and what they have, compared with a reference group—strong even when absolute life improves. It is a key psychological source of resentment and unrest. Perceived fairness often matters more than absolute income.�ans��src��bFrank, R. (1985), 《选择正确的池塘：人类行为与地位追求》, 牛津大学出版社�kFrank, R. (1985), Choosing the Right Pond: Human Behavior and the Quest for Status, Oxford University Press��id�00dcad5cd023�body��\因为它们同时具备“非排他性”和“非竞争性”：没法把不付钱的人挡在外面，多一个人使用也不会减少别人的使用。若交给私人提供，很多人会“搭便车”不付钱，结果供给严重不足。所以这类“公共品”要靠税收融资、由政府提供，才能让全体社会成员受益。�1Because they are both non-excludable and non-rival: you can't keep non-payers out, and one person's use doesn't diminish another's. Left to private providers, free-riding would leave them badly underprovided. Such public goods are therefore funded by taxes and supplied by government so everyone benefits.�ans��src��8《经济学原理》(曼昆)（公共品与政府章）�EPrinciples of Economics (Mankiw), public goods and government chapter��id�04480bceffec�body�ٷ城市里每天要和无数陌生人互动，礼貌（让座、说谢谢）是低成本的“安全阀”，避免小摩擦升级。它让高密度共处变得可忍受、可预期。��In cities we meet countless strangers daily; politeness (yielding a seat, saying thanks) is a cheap 'safety valve' preventing friction from escalating. It makes dense coexistence bearable and predictable.�ans��src��uYe,《The politeness bias and the society of strangers》,Language Sciences,2019 (DOI: 10.1016/j.langsci.2018.06.009)�sYe, 'The politeness bias and the society of strangers', Language Sciences, 2019, DOI: 10.1016/j.langsci.2018.06.009��id�0577f9d838b0�body�ف代际流动指子女相对父母在社会经济地位上的上升或下降，是衡量一个社会开放程度的重要指标。�uIt measures how children's socioeconomic status changes relative to their parents', indicating how open a society is.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0601b55fe034�body��~除丝绸外，还传播了纸张、香料、宗教（如佛教）与技术，连接了欧亚大陆的贸易与文化交流。�vBeyond silk, they spread paper, spices, religions like Buddhism, and technologies, linking Eurasian trade and culture.�ans��src��]联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《丝绸之路：长安—天山廊道的路网》�\UNESCO World Heritage Centre, Silk Roads: the Routes Network of Chang'an–Tianshan Corridor��id�076bd649d263�body���经济特区与自由贸易区是国家为吸引投资、促进贸易而在特定区域实行更优惠税收与监管政策的安排。它们通过降低壁垒来激励产业聚集与出口。许多新兴经济体借此推动了工业化与就业。�&Special economic zones and free trade zones are areas where states apply preferential tax and regulatory policies to attract investment and boost trade. By lowering barriers they encourage industrial clustering and exports. Many emerging economies used them to drive industrialization and jobs.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�07ef1c9271fc�body�ٜ算法与社交圈层让用户反复接触相似观点，强化既有立场、削弱异质信息接触，被称为回音室；它可能加剧社会极化。ٳAlgorithms and homogeneous circles repeatedly expose users to similar views, reinforcing priors and reducing dissent—an “echo chamber” that can deepen societal polarization.�ans��src��FEli Pariser《信息茧房:互联网正在隐藏什么》,Penguin,2011�YEli Pariser, The Filter Bubble: What the Internet Is Hiding from You, Penguin Press, 2011��id�082c9d4cb5be�body�٥常见原则包括目的限制（只用于约定用途）、最少收集、知情同意、安全保存与可更正删除，以在利用与隐私之间取得平衡。٤Core principles include purpose limitation, data minimization, informed consent, secure storage, and the right to correct or delete—balancing use against privacy.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�08b89f44a76e�body���非正式制度指不成文的习惯、信任规范与关系网络，如熟人社会的互惠规则。在正式法律缺位或执行成本高时，它们提供可预期的协作框架，有时也绕过正式制度形成「潜规则」。�Informal institutions are unwritten habits, trust norms, and networks, such as reciprocity in close-knit communities. Where formal law is absent or costly to enforce, they supply a predictable framework for coordination, though they can also substitute for law as hidden rules.�ans��src��6诺斯《制度、制度变迁与经济绩效》(1990)�RDouglass North, Institutions, Institutional Change and Economic Performance (1990)��id�08e87fa39821�body�٥同行评审虽过滤低质研究，但存在偏见、缓慢、难以发现造假与对新颖性的排斥；可重复性危机推动开放评审与预印本改革。٨Peer review filters poor work but shows bias, slowness, limited fraud detection, and resistance to novelty; the reproducibility crisis drives open review and preprints.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�08ec8196bd02�body�٭深度伪造用AI生成以假乱真的音视频，可被用于诈骗、造谣与操纵舆论。辨别需看破绽、查证原始出处，平台与法律也在加强治理。��Deepfakes use AI to fabricate convincing audio/video, enabling scams, rumors, and opinion manipulation. Spot flaws and verify the original source; platforms and laws are tightening governance.�ans��src���Liu, Padmanabhan, Viswanathan,《What Exactly is a Deepfake? A Systematic Literature Analysis of Concepts, Risks, and Potentials》,2026 IEEE Conference on Artificial Intelligence (CAI),2026 (DOI: 10.1109/cai68641.2026.11536577)��Liu, Padmanabhan, Viswanathan, 'What Exactly is a Deepfake? A Systematic Literature Analysis of Concepts, Risks, and Potentials', 2026 IEEE Conference on Artificial Intelligence (CAI), 2026, DOI: 10.1109/cai68641.2026.11536577��id�09c784df9032�body�٦该理论认为技术创新、市场激励与制度改革的结合可使经济增长与生态改善脱钩（decoupling），主张环保可以成为竞争力来源。ٟThe theory holds that tech innovation, market incentives, and reform can decouple growth from environmental harm, making greenness a source of competitiveness.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0a1be78243ed�body�ٜ占优策略是不管对方怎么选，对自己都最好的那招；若双方都有占优策略且相互冲突，就可能出现对集体不利的结果。٣A dominant strategy is the best move regardless of what the opponent does; when both have conflicting dominant strategies, a collectively worse outcome can result.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0ae638d455ec�body�ٱ自然实验利用现实中偶然发生的外生冲击（如政策突变、灾害）近似随机分配，比较受影响与未受影响群体，从而更接近地识别因果。ٹA natural experiment exploits real-world exogenous shocks (policy shifts, disasters) that mimic random assignment, comparing affected and unaffected groups to better identify causation.�ans��src���乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010) ; 另见: Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010)��Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010) ; see also: 乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010)��id�0ae6eb0a0663�body��k把各年龄段人口按性别画成条形图，当年轻人多、老年人少时，图形就是下宽上尖的“金字塔”形，代表人口快速增长的年轻社会。随着出生率下降，塔底收窄；在老龄化社会，图形甚至会变成接近倒梯形。所以看一眼金字塔的形状，就能大致判断一个社会是年轻还是老化。�dWhen each age group is drawn as a bar by sex, a population with many young people and few elderly forms a wide-base, narrow-top pyramid, representing a young, fast-growing society. As birth rates fall, the base narrows; in aging societies the shape can approach an inverted trapezoid. A glance at the pyramid thus reveals whether a society is young or old.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�0aff8fc0c8c1�body�ٱ越南历史上长期仿行科举、尊孔设学，重视家庭孝道、敬祖与读书取仕。虽然语言属南亚语系，社会结构却带有明显的东亚儒家痕迹。��Vietnam long ran its own exams and Confucian schools, valuing filial piety, ancestor respect and study-for-office. Though its language is Austroasiatic, its social structure shows clear East Asian Confucian marks.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0c9b99318967�body�٫许多印度村庄有长老会（panchayat）等自治组织，处理用水、纠纷与祭祀。村社在外部国家薄弱时，长期承担基层秩序与互助功能。��Many Indian villages have self-governing bodies like the panchayat handling water, disputes and ritual. Where the outside state was weak, the village long provided grassroots order and mutual aid.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0d291936a5af�body���差距来自多个叠加因素：职业隔离（女性和男性集中在不同行业岗位，女性集中的职业往往薪酬更低）、生育与家务分工导致的职业中断和经验积累减少、晋升中的隐性壁垒（“玻璃天花板”），以及部分刻板印象与歧视。即使控制行业、工时等变量，仍有不可解释的部分。OECD数据显示其成员平均性别工资差距约12%，缩小它需要育儿支持、同酬立法与破除职业隔离等组合政策。�TThe gap stems from overlapping factors: occupational segregation (women and men cluster in different jobs, with female-dominated fields paying less), career interruptions and slower experience accumulation from childbearing and domestic work, hidden barriers to promotion (the glass ceiling), and some stereotyping and discrimination. Even after controlling for industry and hours, an unexplained part remains. OECD data put the average gender pay gap across members around 12%; narrowing it requires combined policies—childcare support, equal-pay legislation, and desegregation of occupations.�ans��src��CN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017�=N. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017��id�0e955ec448b4�body�٨谣言是未经证实却广泛传播的信息。辨别可看来源是否权威、是否煽动情绪、是否缺乏具体时间与出处，必要时查证官方渠道。��A rumor is unverified yet widely spread information. Check whether the source is authoritative, whether it stirs emotion, and whether it lacks specific time and origin; verify via official channels if needed.�ans��src��-中国科学院（网络谣言传播研究）�BChinese Academy of Sciences (research on online rumor propagation)��id�0fea98dc6b57�body���议程设置理论认为媒体虽不能直接告诉人“怎么想”，却能决定“想什么”——通过报道频率影响公众议题重要性排序。它揭示注意力是一种被塑造的资源。政治竞选高度重视议程争夺。��Agenda-setting theory holds that media may not tell people what to think, but what to think about—shaping the perceived importance of issues through coverage frequency. It reveals attention as a shaped resource. Political campaigns prize agenda control.�ans��src��TMcCombs, M. & Shaw, D. (1972), 《大众媒体的议程设置功能》, 舆论季刊�bMcCombs, M. & Shaw, D. (1972), The Agenda-Setting Function of Mass Media, Public Opinion Quarterly��id�110014d5ac5a�body��$1944年，44国在美国新罕布什尔州的布雷顿森林召开会议，决定建立以美元为中心的国际货币体系。美元与黄金挂钩，其他货币与美元挂钩，并设立国际货币基金组织与世界银行。该体系在1971年美国停止美元兑黄金后瓦解。�9In 1944, 44 nations met at Bretton Woods, New Hampshire, and created a dollar-centered international monetary system. The dollar was pegged to gold while other currencies pegged to the dollar, and the IMF and World Bank were founded. The system collapsed in 1971 when the U.S. ended dollar convertibility to gold.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�110b7f6995e2�body���更替水平总和生育率约为 2.1（考虑死亡后的每对夫妇平均生育数）。长期低于该值会导致人口负增长与老龄化，联合国人口展望显示多国已持续低于此线。��The replacement-level TFR is about 2.1 (average births per woman net of mortality). Sustained below this leads to population decline and ageing; the UN World Population Prospects shows many countries persist below it.�ans��src��R联合国 (2019), 《世界人口展望 2019》, 联合国经济和社会事务部�?United Nations (2019), World Population Prospects 2019, UN DESA��id�117386f427dc�body�ٍ搭便车指有人享受公共品或集体成果却不愿分担成本，指望别人付费；若人人如此，公共品就会供给不足。ٙFree-riding means enjoying a public good or collective outcome without sharing the cost, hoping others pay; if everyone does, the good is under-provided.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�12d282f97853�body�ٺ在单一议题、选民偏好单峰且两党竞争下，两大党会向中位数选民立场收敛以争取多数。唐斯将其纳入理性选择框架，说明政策趋同的来源。��Under single-issue, single-peaked preferences and two-party competition, both parties converge toward the median voter to win a majority. Downs embedded this in a rational-choice framework, explaining policy convergence.�ans��src��>Downs, A. (1957), 《民主的经济理论》, 哈珀出版社�?Downs, A. (1957), An Economic Theory of Democracy, Harper & Row��id�130467aa080d�body���试用期是劳资双方相互考察的阶段，但劳动者仍受劳动法保护：合同、工资不得低于约定标准，解雇需有合法理由。不得随意“白干”或零薪酬。��Probation is a mutual evaluation phase, but workers are still protected by labor law: pay and contract must meet agreed standards, and dismissal needs lawful cause. Free or zero-pay work is not allowed.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�130c76441cf5�body���主要风险是个人隐私在“去标识”后仍可被再识别、数据偏向联网人群而忽略边缘群体，以及研究被用于监控；需知情同意、最小化与独立审查。��Key risks are re-identification despite “anonymization,” bias toward online populations that omits the marginal, and use for surveillance; remedies include consent, minimization, and independent review.�ans��src��R世界银行(World Bank)《World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives》�@World Bank, World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives��id�1399108cf986�body���意见领袖是社交圈内较活跃、被信任、善于解释信息的人，常把媒体信息重新解读、过滤后传递给身边人。传播学“两级传播”模型认为，媒体内容首先影响意见领袖，再由他们影响普通受众，因此在动员、带货和政治宣传中，影响意见领袖比大面积投放更高效。今天的网络KOL正是这一角色的数字化延续。��Opinion leaders are active, trusted people who interpret and filter media content for those around them. The two-step flow model of communication holds that media influence reaches opinion leaders first, then ordinary audiences through them, which is why campaigns, marketing, and political persuasion often find it more efficient to influence such individuals than to broadcast broadly. Today's online KOLs are the digital continuation of this role.�ans��src��-《社会学概论》（大众传播一章）�MIntroduction to Sociology (《社会学概论》, mass communication chapter)��id�13ccb1a3d1e2�body�٢发音省力、词汇借用、社会分层与代际差异推动语言演变；变化通常缓慢且不可逆，通过口语传播在自然语言中持续发生。٣Ease of articulation, borrowing, social stratification, and generational difference drive language change; it is slow, largely irreversible, and ongoing in speech.�ans��src��?威廉·拉波夫《纽约市英语的社会分层》（1966）�QWilliam Labov, “The Social Stratification of English in New York City” (1966)��id�16d324fb0d3f�body���善治强调政府透明、问责、法治、参与和有效，不只是“管得住”而是“管得好”。世界银行用它衡量发展质量。它要求制度能回应民众需求并抑制腐败。�Good governance emphasizes transparency, accountability, rule of law, participation, and effectiveness—not just control but competent management. The World Bank uses it to gauge development quality. It requires institutions that respond to citizens and curb corruption.�ans��src��4World Bank（《治理与发展》等治理研究）�GWorld Bank (Governance and Development and related governance research)��id�17a490540d19�body�٥《日内瓦公约》是规范武装冲突中对待战俘、伤病员与平民的国际条约体系，奠定现代国际人道法，要求区分战斗员与平民。ٿThe Geneva Conventions are treaties governing the treatment of prisoners, wounded, and civilians in war, founding modern international humanitarian law and the combatant/civilian distinction.�ans��src��jThe Lancet,《What are the Geneva Conventions for?》,The Lancet,2015 (DOI: 10.1016/s0140-6736(15)00522-x)�hThe Lancet, 'What are the Geneva Conventions for?', The Lancet, 2015, DOI: 10.1016/s0140-6736(15)00522-x��id�18553f41609a�body���代际流动性指子女相对于父母在社会经济地位上的变化，如教育、收入阶层。高流动性社会意味着“出身”影响小、机会更公平。北欧通常高于拉美。��Intergenerational mobility is the change in socioeconomic status of children relative to parents, in education or income rank. High mobility means origin matters less and opportunity is fairer. The Nordic countries typically exceed Latin America on this.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�199c50538e32�body�٫公共服务由政府或公共机构提供、面向全体且通常不以盈利为目的，如公交、义务教育、治安。私人服务由市场提供、按价交易。ٵPublic services are provided by government or public bodies for everyone, usually not for profit—e.g., transit, compulsory education, policing. Private services are market-priced.�ans��src��8《经济学原理》(曼昆)（公共品与政府章）�EPrinciples of Economics (Mankiw), public goods and government chapter��id�1b2c1e654eb2�body���代际公平要求当代人不透支资源与环境，使后代拥有可比的发展机会。它常用于气候、债务与社保讨论。过度举债或污染是把成本转嫁给未来世代。�Intergenerational equity demands the current generation not overdraw resources or the environment so future generations retain comparable opportunities. It is central to climate, debt, and pension debates. Excessive borrowing or pollution shifts costs onto future cohorts.�ans��src��BOECD（《经济政策改革》·长期财政可持续性分析）�HOECD (Economic Policy Reforms, long-term fiscal sustainability analysis)��id�1b3575ef16a9�body���多数制（如英美的单名选区）按“赢者通吃”分配议席，倾向产生两党制和单一多数政府，政治清晰但小党难获议席、得票与议席可能严重失衡；比例制（如欧洲多国）按得票比例分配议席，倾向产生多党制与联合政府，代表性更高但政府更易碎片化、组阁谈判成本高。杜瓦杰定律总结了这种规律性联系，实践中各国还通过门槛、选区规模等参数加以调节。�AMajoritarian systems (single-member districts in the UK and US) allocate seats winner-take-all, tending to produce two-party systems and single-party majorities—clear politics, but small parties get few seats and votes-to-seats ratios can be badly distorted. Proportional systems (common across Europe) allocate seats by vote share, tending to produce multiparty systems and coalition governments—more representative, but more fragmented and costlier to form. Duverger's law summarizes this regularity, and countries fine-tune it through thresholds and district magnitudes.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�1be830509bc0�body��安理会五个常任理事国（中、法、俄、英、美）在涉及实质性事项的非程序性投票中，任一国投反对票即可阻止决议通过。该机制源自《联合国宪章》第27条，旨在保障大国一致，但也常导致集体行动僵局。�Each of the five permanent members can block any substantive, non-procedural resolution by casting a negative vote. Established under Article 27 of the UN Charter, it was designed to secure great-power unanimity but often produces deadlock in collective action.�ans��src��*《联合国宪章》(UN Charter) 第27条�UN Charter, Article 27��id�1c01caaea56f�body�٫古腾堡印刷术降低成本、加速思想传播，使《圣经》与改革小册子广泛流通，削弱教会解释垄断，助推宗教改革与民族语言形成。ٱGutenberg’s press cut costs and spread ideas fast; bibles and reform pamphlets undercut the Church’s interpretive monopoly, fueling the Reformation and vernacular languages.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1cbc9f2a7031�body���城中村是城市扩张吞并原有村庄后，土地被包围却仍保留集体户籍与自建低层住宅的区域。因租金低廉，它们成为外来务工者的主要落脚点。它反映了快速城市化中规划与现实的错位。�7Urban villages are former villages engulfed by city expansion, where land is enclosed but collective household registration and self-built low-rise housing remain. Because rents are low, they become main foothold for migrant workers. They reflect the mismatch between planning and reality in rapid urbanization.�ans��src��5世界银行(World Bank)《Urban China》研究报告�World Bank, Urban China reports��id�1d2485e60efb�body��19世纪被称为“英镑霸权”时代，当时英国凭借工业与海军优势，使英镑成为最主要的国际结算和储备货币。伦敦是世界金融中心，许多贸易合同都以英镑计价。这一地位在两次世界大战后逐渐被美元取代。�VThe 19th century is called the era of “sterling hegemony,” when Britain's industrial and naval dominance made the pound the leading international settlement and reserve currency. London was the world's financial center, and many trade contracts were priced in pounds. This status gradually gave way to the dollar after the two world wars.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1f23d6de47a9�body���农业社会以家庭为生产单位，多代同堂能分摊劳力与风险；祭祖强化代际联系与家族认同，也起到道德约束作用。家族是福利与秩序的基本单元。��Farming made the household the unit of production; multi-generation homes spread labor and risk. Ancestor worship strengthened ties and identity and acted as moral restraint. The family was the basic unit of welfare and order.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�1f855b4bd0ac�body���因为文化认同不是单选题。移民家庭的孩子既说母语也说当地语言，既过传统节日又过当地节日，这些认同可以叠加而非互相排斥。全球化带来的流动性让跨文化成长越来越普遍，研究认为“混合认同”能带来更强的适应性和创造力，但有时也会伴随归属感的拉扯。认同是情境性的，不必强迫自己只选一边。��Because cultural belonging isn't a multiple-choice question. Children of immigrant families speak both languages and celebrate both sets of holidays; identities stack rather than exclude. Growing mobility makes cross-cultural lives common, and research suggests hybrid identity can bring adaptability and creativity, though sometimes with a pull of belonging. Identity is contextual; there's no need to force a single choice.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�1fc51c583418�body���政治效能感是个人相信政治体系会回应自己、自己行动有意义的感受。内在效能感越高，越倾向投票与参与，经验研究显示它是投票率的稳健预测因子。��Political efficacy is the feeling that the political system responds to you and that your action matters. Higher internal efficacy predicts greater voting and participation; empirical studies treat it as a robust predictor of turnout.�ans��src��]Putnam, R. (2000), 《独自打保龄：美国社区的衰落与复兴》, 西蒙与舒斯特�bPutnam, R. (2000), Bowling Alone: The Collapse and Revival of American Community, Simon & Schuster��id�1ff8b2a4b36b�body�ٿ当 NGO 主要依赖政府或少数大额捐助时，其议题与立场可能向资助方倾斜，出现“倡导靠捐款人”的张力；多元筹资与透明披露有助于保持独立。��When an NGO relies heavily on government or a few big donors, its agenda and stance may tilt toward funders—a tension between advocacy and money; diverse funding and disclosure help preserve independence.�ans��src�ٙJohn D. McCarthy & Mayer N. Zald, "Resource Mobilization and Social Movements: A Partial Theory", American Journal of Sociology, 1977, 82(6): 1212–1241٘John D. McCarthy & Mayer N. Zald, Resource Mobilization and Social Movements: A Partial Theory, American Journal of Sociology 82(6), 1977, pp. 1212-1241��id�2087c11838d4�body��l宜居气候、肥沃土地、河流与就业机会吸引人口，而极端地形与干旱则限制聚居。�mTemperate climate, fertile land, rivers, and jobs attract people; harsh terrain and aridity limit settlement.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�21234be023f2�body�ٴ远程办公指不在公司固定场所完成工作，可在家、咖啡馆或共享空间。它依赖网络与协作工具，能省通勤但也可能模糊工作与生活界限。ٸRemote work means doing the job away from a fixed office—home, café, or co-space. It relies on network and collaboration tools: it saves commuting but can blur work-life boundaries.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�21254b389e39�body�ٜ试用降低尝试门槛，并触发“互惠”心理——人们接受小恩惠后更愿意回报以购买。直接体验也比广告更能建立信任。ٶTrials lower the try barrier and trigger “reciprocity”: after receiving a small favor, people feel inclined to repay by buying. Direct experience also builds more trust than ads.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�213bd61518a9�body�ٺ特区在局部放宽管制、吸引外资与外贸，像“试验田”先试新规则；成功后经验再推广全国。集中资源突破，降低了全面改革的阻力与风险。��Zones relaxed rules locally to attract foreign capital and trade, acting as 'test fields' for new rules; success was then spread nationwide. Concentrating resources lowered the resistance and risk of wholesale reform.�ans��src�مZeng,《How do special economic zones and industrial clusters drive China's rapid development?》, 2011 (DOI: 10.1596/1813-9450-5583)فZeng, 'How do special economic zones and industrial clusters drive China's rapid development?', 2011, DOI: 10.1596/1813-9450-5583��id�220ba83174de�body��2铸币税指货币发行者凭借垄断发行权，用低成本印制货币换取实际商品与服务所获得的收益。古代君主降低硬币成色也能暗中获利，现代则主要表现为央行发行纸币的成本远低于面值。它本质上是一种由发行权带来的“隐形税收”。�YSeigniorage is the profit a currency issuer earns by using its monopoly on issuance to exchange low-cost money for real goods and services. Ancient rulers also profited by debasing coin metal content, while today it mainly appears as the gap between printing cost and face value. It is effectively an invisible tax from the power to issue money.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�230fa66fa69d�body���义务教育由国家依法规定、免费且强制适龄儿童入学，通常为九年左右。它通过普及基础人力资本、削弱家庭背景对早期教育的决定作用，为后续社会流动提供共同起点。�Compulsory education is state-mandated, free, and required schooling for children, typically around nine years. By universalizing basic human capital and weakening family background's grip on early learning, it provides a common starting point for later mobility.�ans��src��I联合国教科文组织(UNESCO)《Education for All》全球监测报告�2UNESCO, Education for All Global Monitoring Report��id�23442ef52814�body���劳动参与率是就业与积极求职人口占劳动年龄人口的比例。人口老龄化使退休者占比上升、适龄劳动人口下降，从而压低整体参与率，OECD 多国已观察到这一趋势。�The labour force participation rate is the share of the working-age population that is employed or actively seeking work. Population ageing raises the retired share and lowers the working-age share, dragging the rate down, a trend OECD observes across many countries.�ans��src��2OECD (2019), 《就业展望 2019》, 经合组织�)OECD (2019), OECD Employment Outlook 2019��id�254aef084085�body���把关人是决定哪些信息能通过、进入公众视野的角色，如编辑、平台审核员。他们依据价值、政策与算法筛选，塑造我们“看得见的世界”。数字时代把关权从编辑分散到算法与用户。��A gatekeeper decides which information passes into public view—editors, platform moderators. They filter by values, policy, and algorithms, shaping the world we “see.” In the digital era, gatekeeping shifts from editors to algorithms and users.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�258c9613ced6�body���人口红利指劳动年龄人口占比高、抚养负担轻时，社会生产和储蓄能力增强，有利于经济增长。它通常不是自动发生的，需要足够的就业与教育配合。红利期过后往往迎来老龄化挑战。�The demographic dividend refers to a period when the working-age share is high and dependency burden is low, boosting production and savings and aiding growth. It does not happen automatically; it needs enough jobs and education. After the dividend passes, aging challenges often arrive.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�263d27cb4a0b�body���三权分立把立法、行政、司法权力分配给不同机构，使其相互制衡，防止任何一支独大。它源于孟德斯鸠对英国政制的总结，被多国宪法采纳。但也有总统制与议会制等不同实现方式。�BSeparation of powers assigns legislative, executive, and judicial authority to different bodies so they check one another and prevent any one from dominating. It derives from Montesquieu's reading of British government and was adopted by many constitutions. It appears in forms like presidential and parliamentary systems.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2640ce012d8d�body���合同是双方对交易条件的书面约定，核心作用是管理风险和建立信任：白纸黑字写明权利义务，减少误解和事后扯皮；一旦一方违约，另一方可以诉诸法律要求履行或赔偿，违约要付出代价。这种“可执行的承诺”让大金额、长期、远距离的交易变得可能——没有合同保障，很多合作根本不会发生。��A contract is a written agreement on the terms of a transaction. Its core job is managing risk and building trust: putting rights and duties in writing reduces misunderstanding, and if one side breaches, the other can go to court for performance or damages, making breach costly. These enforceable promises make large, long-term, and distant deals possible; without them, much cooperation simply wouldn't happen.�ans��src��5《经济学原理》(曼昆)（契约与市场章）�?Principles of Economics (Mankiw), contracts and markets chapter��id�2657cecf2d21�body���腐败相当于对经济活动征收的隐性税收，且方向不可预测：企业投资前不知要“买通”谁、付多少，不确定性本身吓退投资；它还扭曲公共资源配置、奖励寻租而非生产。治理研究强调制度根源——透明度、问责、竞争与制衡，改革常从预算公开、独立审计、政府采购竞争化、公务员工资与晋升激励入手，并配合公民监督与数据开放，而非只依赖反贪运动。�OCorruption acts as an unpredictable hidden tax: firms do not know whom to bribe or how much before investing, and the uncertainty itself deters investment; it also distorts public-resource allocation and rewards rent-seeking over production. Governance research stresses institutional roots—transparency, accountability, competition, and checks—so reforms typically start with open budgets, independent audit, competitive procurement, and civil-service pay and promotion incentives, complemented by citizen oversight and open data, rather than relying on anti-corruption campaigns alone.�ans��src��4World Bank（《治理与发展》等治理研究）�GWorld Bank (Governance and Development and related governance research)��id�2838d95d1ffd�body���原子化社会指传统纽带（家庭、邻里、社群）松动，个体彼此孤立、缺乏稳定归属。它可能源自城市化、迁移与数字生活。后果包括孤独感上升与公共参与下降。�An atomized society is one where traditional bonds—family, neighborhood, community—weaken and individuals become isolated without stable belonging. It can stem from urbanization, migration, and digital life. Consequences include rising loneliness and declining public engagement.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�28dc8f23b023�body���推力包括来源国的冲突、贫困与就业机会短缺；拉力包括目的地的工资差异、安全与家庭团聚网络。世界银行指出收入差距与迁移网络是持续迁移的结构性驱动力。��Push factors include conflict, poverty and job scarcity at origin; pull factors include wage gaps, safety and family networks at destination. The World Bank notes income gaps and migrant networks are structural drivers of sustained migration.�ans��src��I世界银行 (2023), 《移民与发展简报 第 39 期》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2023), Migration and Development Brief 39��id�29a6f0c3f5a7�body�ٖ戴蒙德等将文明崩溃归因于环境退化、气候冲击、贸易中断、社会分裂与外来压力等多因素叠加，而非单一原因。٪Diamond and others attribute collapse to stacked factors—environmental damage, climate shocks, trade breakdown, social division, external pressure—not a single cause.�ans��src��xSmil, Diamond,《Collapse: How Societies Choose to Fail or Succeed》,International Journal,2005 (DOI: 10.2307/40204082)�vSmil, Diamond, 'Collapse: How Societies Choose to Fail or Succeed', International Journal, 2005, DOI: 10.2307/40204082��id�2a38aea8ed43�body���MPI 同时纳入健康、教育与生活水平等多维指标（如营养、受教育年限、卫生设施），捕捉「被收入线遗漏」的剥夺。联合国开发计划署据此识别同时面临多重匮乏的贫困人群。��The MPI combines health, education and living-standard indicators (e.g., nutrition, schooling, sanitation) to capture deprivations missed by an income line. UNDP uses it to identify people facing simultaneous multiple deprivations.�ans��src��X联合国开发计划署 (2023), 《人类发展报告 2023》, 联合国开发计划署�JUnited Nations Development Programme (2023), Human Development Report 2023��id�2a437cf010b1�body���老龄化提高老年抚养比，即每名劳动者需供养更多退休者，压缩缴费基数并扩大支出。联合国人口老化报告指出这迫使多国提高退休年龄或调整参数。��Ageing raises the old-age dependency ratio, meaning each worker supports more retirees, shrinking the contribution base while expanding outlays. The UN ageing report notes this forces many countries to raise retirement ages or adjust parameters.�ans��src��:联合国 (2019), 《世界人口老化 2019》, 联合国�3United Nations (2019), World Population Ageing 2019��id�2a87bd4239c9�body���难民是因战乱、迫害而有充分理由惧怕返回本国的人，受国际法保护并享有特定救助权利。经济移民则主要为改善生活而迁移，通常不受同等保护。区分二者关系到遣返与收容政策的合法性。�-A refugee is someone with well-founded fear of persecution or war who cannot return home, protected by international law with specific rights. An economic migrant moves mainly to improve life and usually lacks that protection. The distinction matters for the legality of deportation and asylum policy.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�2abc8e2b15c1�body��公共交通有显著的正外部性：缓解拥堵、减少排放与事故，这些收益无法通过票价收回；同时它有很强的规模经济和网络效应，载客量越大平均成本越低，按边际成本定价必然亏损。若票价定得过高，乘客转回私家车，反而加剧拥堵，社会总成本上升。因此补贴的合理性在于把外部收益内部化，但经济学也提醒要比较补贴与替代方案（如道路定价）的成本效益，避免无效率的过度投资。�fPublic transit generates large positive externalities—less congestion, lower emissions, fewer accidents—that fares cannot capture; it also has strong economies of scale and network effects, with average costs falling as ridership rises, so marginal-cost pricing inevitably runs a deficit. Setting fares too high pushes riders back into cars, worsening congestion and raising total social cost. Subsidies internalize these external benefits, but economics also warns that subsidized projects should be compared with alternatives such as road pricing on cost-benefit grounds, to avoid inefficient overinvestment.�ans��src��CN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017�=N. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017��id�2b2c885c6b1d�body��当政府把价格压低于市场均衡价（如房租管制），需求量会超过供给量，造成长期短缺与排队、黑市。生产者因利润下降而减少投入，反而损害消费者长远利益。价格管制需配合配给才能缓解短缺。�/When the government sets a price below the market equilibrium (e.g., rent control), quantity demanded exceeds quantity supplied, causing chronic shortages, queues, and black markets. Producers cut investment as profits fall, ultimately harming consumers. Price controls need rationing to ease shortages.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2bb2cdc2c849�body�ٱ玻璃天花板指某些群体（常指女性或少数族裔）在职业晋升到高层时遇到的隐形障碍，看似可破却难以逾越，反映结构性的机会不均。ٿThe glass ceiling is the invisible barrier some groups (often women or minorities) hit near top jobs—seemingly breakable yet hard to cross—reflecting structural inequality of opportunity.�ans��src��8Crenshaw，《取消种族与性别的边缘化》(1989)�CCrenshaw, 'Demarginalizing the Intersection of Race and Sex' (1989)��id�2bd280e2ac6e�body���青年缺少经验、工作频繁更替（摩擦高），且经济下行时雇主优先裁减“后来者”，故青年失业率普遍约为整体失业率的两倍。NEET指“既未就业也未接受教育或培训”的年轻人，即使经济回暖也可能长期边缘化。OECD研究显示NEET比例高的国家面临技能流失、收入损失和社会疏离风险，因此各国把降低NEET、强化职教与学徒制作为青年政策重点。�Youth lack experience, change jobs frequently (high frictional turnover), and in downturns employers let go the most recently hired first, so youth unemployment typically runs about twice the overall rate. NEET refers to young people “not in employment, education, or training,” who risk long-term marginalization even after recovery. OECD research shows high-NEET countries face skills loss, earnings damage, and social detachment, so reducing NEETs and strengthening vocational education and apprenticeships are key policy priorities.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2bd6da8e716b�body��适度温和的通货膨胀（如2%左右）通常被视为经济健康信号，能促使消费与投资、降低实际债务负担。真正有害的是恶性通胀或通缩——前者摧毁货币信任，后者抑制需求。关键在“适度”与“可预期”。�IModerate inflation (around 2%) is usually seen as a sign of a healthy economy, encouraging consumption and investment while easing real debt burdens. What is truly harmful is hyperinflation or deflation—the former destroys monetary trust, the latter suppresses demand. The key lies in “moderation” and “predictability.”�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2c529456ca59�body���常见原因包括女性教育与就业提升、育儿成本上升、婚育年龄推迟、城市化与社会保障替代了“养儿防老”，以及观念变化；往往是多因素叠加。��Common drivers are women's education and work, rising child-rearing costs, later marriage/childbirth, urbanization and pensions replacing “old-age security from children,” and value change—usually combined.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�2cb6fb976c6f�body�ٽ难学但“超方言、超时代”：它不依赖发音，能连接古今与各方言区，使典籍与制度可跨时空传承。对统一文明的维系价值，超过了学习成本。��Hard yet 'trans-dialect and trans-era': independent of pronunciation, it links ancient and modern and all dialects, letting classics and institutions pass across time and space. Its value to a unified civilization outweighed learning cost.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�2cecba8b28df�body�٨中产阶层一般指收入与教育处于社会中段、以专业或管理职业为主、有一定资产和稳定性的群体；不同国家界定标准差异很大。ٳThe middle class generally sits in the income and education middle, working in professional or managerial roles with some assets and stability; definitions vary widely by country.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�2e1851fc9ad9�body���主要通过“议程设置”和“框架效应”：媒体不可能报道所有事情，报道什么、放在哪个位置，就是在告诉公众“什么重要”；用什么样的角度和语言叙述，又影响公众如何理解。公众关注的热点常常跟着媒体报道走。但媒体并非单向灌输——读者会主动筛选信息，社交媒体的兴起也让受众和发布者的界限变得模糊。��Mainly through agenda-setting and framing: media can't cover everything, so what gets reported and where it's placed tells the public what matters, while the angle and language of a story shape how it's understood. Public attention often follows media coverage. But it's not one-way: audiences actively filter information, and social media blurs the line between audience and publisher.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2e46e6ec1e49�body�٥这是“职住分离”的结果：人们白天到中心上班、晚上回郊区居住，形成昼夜人口落差。它影响商业时段、治安与夜间活力。��This is “job-housing separation”: people work downtown by day and sleep in suburbs at night, creating a day-night population swing. It shapes business hours, safety, and nightlife vitality.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�2ea5403e8cd3�body�ٴ乌玛指全球穆斯林的信仰共同体，以宗教认同相连，超越民族与国界；它更像“跨国的精神—社会网络”，而非一块固定领土上的政府。ٱUmmah means the global community of Muslims, bound by faith beyond nation and border; it is more a transnational spiritual-social network than a government over fixed territory.�ans��src��t本尼迪克特·安德森：《想象的共同体：民族主义的起源与散布》，Verso出版社1983年初版�iBenedict Anderson, Imagined Communities: Reflections on the Origin and Spread of Nationalism, Verso, 1983��id�2f1e6ecdaa3f�body���代际公平指当代人的决策不能把不成比例的代价转嫁给未来世代。在公共财政上，表现为国债高企让后代纳税还债并挤占未来公共投资；在气候变化上，表现为今天的排放让后代承受海平面上升、极端天气的成本。由于未来世代没有投票权，市场也难以替他们“出价”，需要贴现率选择、长期预算制度和减排目标等制度安排把未来利益纳入当下决策。�8Intergenerational equity means current generations should not shift disproportionate costs onto future ones. In public finance it appears as high public debt that future taxpayers repay and that crowds out future investment; in climate policy it appears as today's emissions imposing sea-level rise and extreme-weather costs on descendants. Because future generations cannot vote and markets price their interests poorly, institutional arrangements—discount-rate choices, long-term budget rules, emissions targets—must bring future benefits into present decisions.�ans��src��BOECD（《经济政策改革》·长期财政可持续性分析）�HOECD (Economic Policy Reforms, long-term fiscal sustainability analysis)��id�321d8d762587�body���外在激励来自奖金、批评等外部回报，内在激励则来自兴趣、成就感等内部满足。研究提示过度依赖外在奖励有时反而削弱内在动力。有效管理常把两者结合，匹配任务与个人价值。�HExtrinsic motivation comes from external rewards like bonuses or criticism, while intrinsic motivation comes from internal satisfaction such as interest or achievement. Research suggests over-relying on external rewards can sometimes weaken intrinsic drive. Effective management blends both and matches tasks to personal values.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�327bb0dde9e4�body���老龄化指老年人口占比上升，加重养老金与医疗负担，并收缩劳动力供给。若储蓄与投资跟不上，可能拖累增长。应对包括延迟退休、提高生产率与移民补给。��Aging means a rising share of elderly, burdening pensions and healthcare while shrinking the labor supply. If savings and investment lag, growth may slow. Responses include raising retirement age, boosting productivity, and immigration.�ans��src��:联合国 (2019), 《世界人口老化 2019》, 联合国�3United Nations (2019), World Population Ageing 2019��id�33b6b4dc4f74�body���宗教用共同神话与仪式凝聚群体、解释未知、规范行为（如禁忌），并在灾荒时提供心理安慰与互助。它把“为何活、如何共处”变成共享答案。��Religion bonded groups with shared myth and ritual, explained the unknown, guided behavior (taboos) and offered comfort and mutual aid in hardship. It turned 'why live, how coexist' into shared answers.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�34b1a38d1287�body�٫本地品牌借国际流行元素显得“现代”和“高级”，既迎合年轻人认同，又保留本地口味与渠道。全球化与在地化因此互相借用。��Local brands borrow international trends to seem modern and premium, pleasing youth identity while keeping local taste and channels. Globalization and localization thus borrow from each other.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�34ccc7957df2�body���集体行动困境指众人共享目标却因“个人不愿出力、指望他人”而难以协同，如环保、罢工。奥尔森指出小集团更易行动。制度激励与领袖能打破困境。�The collective action problem is when many share a goal but coordination fails because each withholds effort, expecting others to act—as in environmental protection or strikes. Olson noted small groups act more easily. Incentives and leadership can break the deadlock.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�359bd9c303d8�body�٧指20世纪后期起避孕普及、同居与非婚生育上升、晚育与低生育成为常态、家庭形式多元化，反映价值个体化与性别角色变化。ٶSince the late 20th c., contraception, cohabitation, nonmarital births, delayed and low fertility, and diverse families rose—reflecting individualization and shifting gender roles.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�3736c540db38�body�ٺ天课是信徒按财产比例缴纳的施舍，集中用于救济贫者、债务人与公共需要。它把宗教义务变成再分配机制，强化共同体内部的互助与凝聚。��Zakat is a proportional charity from wealth, pooled for the poor, debtors and public needs. It turns religious duty into redistribution, strengthening mutual aid and cohesion within the community.�ans��src�ٝZafar, Aziz,《Zakat and Sustainable Development Goals: Does Islamic Almsgiving Reduce Food Insecurity?》,Food Ethics,2026 (DOI: 10.1007/s41055-025-00200-1)ٛZafar, Aziz, 'Zakat and Sustainable Development Goals: Does Islamic Almsgiving Reduce Food Insecurity?', Food Ethics, 2026, DOI: 10.1007/s41055-025-00200-1��id�37a886cf3621�body���反垄断法防止企业滥用市场支配地位，禁止卡特尔、垄断协议与掠夺性定价，以维护竞争。竞争能压低价格、激励创新并保护消费者。它平衡效率与公平，是市场制度的基础设施。�!Antitrust law prevents firms from abusing market dominance, banning cartels, monopoly agreements, and predatory pricing to preserve competition. Competition lowers prices, spurs innovation, and protects consumers. It balances efficiency and fairness as infrastructure of the market system.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�38105b6d0a83�body���格兰诺维特指出，强关系（亲友）彼此圈子重叠、信息冗余；弱关系（熟人）连接不同圈子，是获取新信息与求职机会的关键桥梁，因此弱关系在扩散中反而更有力。��Granovetter argued strong ties (close friends) share overlapping circles and redundant information, while weak ties (acquaintances) bridge different circles and are key to new information and job leads—so weak ties are stronger for diffusion.�ans��src��TGranovetter, M. (1973), 《弱关系的力量》, 美国社会学杂志 (AJS), 78(6)�WGranovetter, M. (1973), The Strength of Weak Ties, American Journal of Sociology, 78(6)��id�39107579f3b8�body���使用与满足理论把受众视为主动者，研究人们出于何种需求（信息、娱乐、社交）主动选择媒体。它颠覆了“被动受众”假设。今天的算法时代，主动选择更明显却也更易陷入茧房。�Uses and gratifications theory views the audience as active, studying why people purposely choose media to meet needs—information, entertainment, sociability. It overturned the “passive audience” assumption. In the algorithm era, active choice is sharper yet more prone to cocoons.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3b4f3f0cd9ff�body�ٺ生育决策受育儿成本、女性就业、住房与教育压力共同影响，补贴难以抵消机会成本。观念从“多子多福”转向“少而精养”也降低了意愿。��Birth choices are shaped by child-rearing cost, women’s employment, housing, and education pressure; subsidies rarely offset opportunity cost. The ideal shifted from “more children, more blessing” to “fewer, better cared-for.”�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3bf9e9bac23d�body��r大陆法系以成文法典为基础；英美法系以判例与法官造法为核心，强调先例的约束力。�aCivil law rests on codified statutes; common law centers on case law and precedent set by judges.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3d5fa774372a�body���政策反馈指一项政策不仅应对问题，还会反过来塑造公众态度、利益集团与后续政治，形成路径。如社保制度培养依赖其的选民群体。它说明政策是政治变迁的因也是果。�#Policy feedback means a policy not only addresses a problem but also reshapes public attitudes, interest groups, and later politics, creating path dependence. Social security, for instance, cultivates voter constituencies dependent on it. Policy is both cause and effect of political change.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3da1dd7bc2b0�body�ٱ推荐系统按用户过往行为推送相似内容以提升停留，可能形成“信息茧房”与极端化；它既满足兴趣，也限制了偶遇不同观点的机会。��Recommenders push similar content by past behavior to boost engagement, possibly creating “filter bubbles” and polarization; they satisfy interests but limit chance encounters with differing views.�ans��src��FEli Pariser《信息茧房:互联网正在隐藏什么》,Penguin,2011�YEli Pariser, The Filter Bubble: What the Internet Is Hiding from You, Penguin Press, 2011��id�3e58b0024dad�body��n因为GDP衡量产出，而生活质量还取决于收入怎么分配、健康、教育、安全感、环境和闲暇时间。同样的人均GDP，如果贫富差距悬殊、公共服务薄弱，普通人的实际感受会差很多。因此联合国开发计划署用“人类发展指数”把收入、教育、寿命放在一起衡量，提醒人们别只看GDP。��Because GDP measures output, while quality of life also depends on how income is distributed, health, education, safety, environment, and leisure. At the same GDP per person, wide inequality or weak public services make ordinary people far worse off. That's why the UNDP's Human Development Index combines income, education, and life expectancy, a reminder that GDP alone misses much of life.�ans��src��UNDP（人类发展报告）�UNDP (Human Development Report)��id�3eebdc10f269�body��2记账货币是银行账户中的数字余额，通过转账而非实物票据完成支付，现代经济中绝大部分交易都依赖它。与现金不同，它由商业银行创造并依托银行信用存在，央行无法直接控制其总量。电子支付的普及让记账货币成为日常主流。�WBook money is the digital balance in a bank account, used for payments by transfer rather than physical notes, and most modern transactions rely on it. Unlike cash, it is created by commercial banks on the basis of credit and cannot be directly controlled in total by the central bank. The spread of electronic payments made it the daily norm.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3fff90330466�body���外部性指经济活动的成本或收益外溢到未参与交易的第三方，如工厂污染损害居民健康（负外部性）。市场无法自动定价这些影响，常需税收、补贴或管制来纠正。它是市场失灵的重要来源。�kAn externality is a cost or benefit of an economic activity that spills over to third parties not involved in the transaction, such as factory pollution harming residents' health (a negative externality). Markets cannot price these effects automatically, so taxes, subsidies, or regulation are often needed to correct them. It is a major source of market failure.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�412802f0a15d�body���数字鸿沟指不同群体在接入和使用数字技术上的差距。AI既可降低使用门槛（如翻译、辅助），也可能因算力与技能门槛而扩大差距，取决于可及性政策。��The digital divide is unequal access to and use of digital technology. AI can lower barriers (translation, assistance) but may widen gaps via compute and skill requirements, depending on accessibility policy.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�419769b43f33�body���在重视关系与和谐的文化中，调解由中立第三方促成双方让步，避免对簿公堂伤和气，因而广受青睐。中国传统“无讼”观念与宗族调解即是典型。它通常更快、更省钱且易于执行。� In cultures valuing relationships and harmony, mediation has a neutral third party broker concessions, avoiding the rancor of a courtroom, so it is favored. China's traditional “no litigation” ideal and clan mediation are typical. It is usually faster, cheaper, and easier to enforce.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�4297dc9a8cfb�body�ٷ世界银行数据显示侨汇是许多发展中国家最大的外部资金流之一，直接改善家庭收入与减贫，但也可能削弱本地劳动激励并推高本地物价。��World Bank data show remittances are among the largest external financial flows to many developing countries, directly raising household income and reducing poverty, though they may also weaken local work incentives and raise local prices.�ans��src��I世界银行 (2023), 《移民与发展简报 第 39 期》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2023), Migration and Development Brief 39��id�431d044c8fa1�body���社会运动是有组织、持续地追求或抵制社会变迁的集体努力。通常包含共同诉求、非正式网络、集体身份认同与抗议性行动 repertoires（游行、请愿等）等要素。��A social movement is an organized, sustained collective effort to pursue or resist social change. It typically comprises shared grievances, informal networks, a collective identity, and a repertoire of contention such as marches and petitions.�ans��src��(蒂利《社会运动,1768-2004》(2004)�1Charles Tilly, Social Movements, 1768-2004 (2004)��id�44e63c65a8ba�body��预期寿命指在一定年龄和时期死亡率条件下，某人平均可存活的年数，常用出生时的预期寿命衡量整体健康水平。它受营养、医疗、卫生和环境等因素影响。过去一个世纪全球预期寿命总体显著上升。�>Life expectancy is the average number of years a person is expected to live given current age- and period-specific mortality, with life expectancy at birth commonly used to gauge overall health. It is affected by nutrition, healthcare, sanitation, and environment. Globally it rose substantially over the past century.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�46460482c154�body��x指一名女性按当前年龄别生育率一生平均生育的子女数，替代水平约为2.1以维持人口稳定。�mIt is the average children a woman would bear at current age-specific rates; about 2.1 replaces a population.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�468c4529abf9�body���合法性指民众内心认为统治“应当被服从”的程度，不单靠强制。它来自选举、传统、绩效或意识形态认同。合法性高的政权更稳定、治理成本更低。��Legitimacy is the degree to which people believe a rule “ought to be obeyed,” beyond mere coercion. It stems from elections, tradition, performance, or ideological consent. Regimes with high legitimacy are more stable and govern at lower cost.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�46b2608c79f1�body�٫指义务教育阶段按户籍或居住地划片，优先入读附近公办学校，旨在均衡资源、减轻择校焦虑。但它也引发学区房涨价等副作用。��In compulsory education, students are assigned to nearby public schools by household or residence zoning, to balance resources and ease school-choice anxiety. It also fuels school-district housing prices.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�49e1fc7768fa�body�ٴ受科举遗风与战后资源有限的影响，考试被视为最公平的上升通道；高学历直接挂钩好工作与社会评价，于是补习与升学竞争异常激烈。��Shaped by exam traditions and postwar scarcity, tests were seen as the fairest ladder up; degrees linked directly to good jobs and status, making cram schools and admission competition intense.�ans��src�ُLee,《Exams, districts, and intergenerational mobility: Evidence from South Korea》,Labour Economics,2014 (DOI: 10.1016/j.labeco.2014.05.006)ٍLee, 'Exams, districts, and intergenerational mobility: Evidence from South Korea', Labour Economics, 2014, DOI: 10.1016/j.labeco.2014.05.006��id�4af271e09bc3�body���公地悲剧指人人可自由使用的共享资源（如牧场、渔场），因各自过度索取而最终枯竭。它揭示在缺乏产权或规则时，个人理性使用会导致集体损失。解决思路包括明晰产权、配额与集体治理。�7The tragedy of the commons describes shared resources (pasture, fisheries) open to all, where everyone's over-extraction eventually depletes them. It reveals that without property rights or rules, rational individual use causes collective loss. Solutions include clear rights, quotas, and collective governance.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4d35ae5e2a3f�body�ٱ当草地、渔场等共有资源没有清晰产权时，每个人过度使用、他人分担后果，最终导致资源枯竭，这是典型的负外部性与搭便车问题。��When common resources like pastures or fisheries lack clear property rights, each user over-exploits them while others share the cost, eventually depleting the resource—a classic negative externality and free-rider problem.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4d574f66ab5a�body�ٱ税收主要用于公共服务：教育、医疗、基础设施、国防、社会保障与行政运转等。不同国家结构不同，但多数用于全民共享的公共品。ٵTaxes mainly fund public services: education, health, infrastructure, defense, social security, and administration. Structures differ by country, but most go to shared public goods.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4dd5f24f6fdc�body���紧凑城市主张高密度、混合用地和优先公共交通，以缩短出行距离、节约土地并减少碳排放。它反对无序蔓延，强调步行可达的生活圈。许多欧洲城市以此作为可持续发展方向。�The compact city advocates high density, mixed land use, and priority public transit to shorten travel, save land, and cut emissions. It opposes disorderly sprawl and emphasizes walkable living circles. Many European cities adopt it as a sustainable development direction.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4e79e4c4a86f�body��2推-拉理论由李（E.S. Lee）系统阐述，认为迁出地的「推力」（如贫困、冲突）与迁入地的「拉力」（如就业、教育）共同驱动迁移，中间障碍与个体因素调节流向。例如农村收入低（推）与城市工厂缺工（拉）共同促成农民工进城。�Systematized by E.S. Lee, push-pull theory holds that push factors at origin and pull factors at destination jointly drive migration, modulated by intervening obstacles and personal factors. For example, low rural income plus urban labor demand drives rural-to-city movement.�ans��src��%联合国《World Migration Report》�UN, World Migration Report��id�4e909c319de9�body�٨两变量相关可能由共同第三因素、反向因果或巧合造成；要确定因果需实验或准实验设计（如随机对照、工具变量）控制混杂。ٮCorrelation may reflect a confounder, reverse causality, or chance; establishing causation needs experiments or quasi-experiments (RCTs, instruments) controlling confounders.�ans��src���乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010) ; 另见: Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010)��Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010) ; see also: 乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010)��id�4eca5de46432�body�ٷ从众效应指人们因看到别人怎么做而跟随，哪怕自己并不确定，常见于抢购、投资追涨和舆论扩散；它放大波动，也可能引发泡沫或恐慌。ٵThe bandwagon effect is following what others do despite uncertainty, seen in panic buying, momentum investing, and rumor spread; it amplifies swings and can fuel bubbles or panics.�ans��src�ٗDeldoost,《Behavioral and Biological Bases of Herding and Conformity》, Basic and Clinical Neuroscience Journal, 2024 (DOI: 10.32598/bcn.2022.4654.1)ٓDeldoost, 'Behavioral and Biological Bases of Herding and Conformity', Basic and Clinical Neuroscience Journal, 2024, DOI: 10.32598/bcn.2022.4654.1��id�4ff4b41dd4de�body���市场失灵指自由市场无法有效配置资源，表现为垄断、外部性、公共物品短缺或信息不对称。此时单靠价格机制会损害效率或公平。政府干预（税收、管制、提供公共品）常被用来纠正。�CMarket failure occurs when free markets fail to allocate resources efficiently, seen in monopoly, externalities, public-goods shortages, or information asymmetry. Relying solely on price mechanisms then harms efficiency or fairness. Government intervention (taxes, regulation, public provision) is often used to correct it.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5048cfa112f5�body�ٔ数字货币是以电子形式存在的货币；CBDC是由央行发行、具有法偿性的数字版本币，不同于去中心化的加密货币。٬Digital currency exists only electronically; a CBDC is a central-bank-issued, legal-tender digital form of the national currency, distinct from decentralized crypto assets.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�50c7ade204df�body�ٮ好的旋律与故事跨越语言；平台与明星把内容推到全球，年轻人借它表达身份。文化产品轻、复制成本低，比货物更容易“旅行”。��Good melodies and stories cross language; platforms and stars push content globally, and youth use it to express identity. Cultural goods are light and cheap to copy, traveling easier than cargo.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�510dc8903185�body��5中国古代政治中心（如长安、北京）多在北方，而粮食主产区在南方。通过运河把南方的税粮运到都城，养活了皇室、军队和官员，使中央政权得以稳定运转。谁掌握了漕运，谁就掌握了都城的命脉；漕运一旦中断，北方权力就动摇。�[In imperial China the political center (Chang'an, Beijing) lay in the north while the grain heartland was in the south. Shipping tax grain north by canal fed the court, the army, and the bureaucracy, keeping the central state running. Whoever controlled the grain transport held the capital's lifeline; if the canal failed, northern power wobbled.�ans��src��?联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《中国大运河》�-UNESCO World Heritage Centre, The Grand Canal��id�5124a44efb93�body��马斯洛把人的需求由低到高分为生理、安全、归属、尊重与自我实现五层，认为低层满足后才会追求高层。它常用于理解员工激励，但后来被批评过于线性、忽视文化差异。它仍是管理学的经典框架。�8Maslow ranked needs from low to high as physiological, safety, belonging, esteem, and self-actualization, arguing people pursue higher needs only after lower ones are met. It is often used for employee motivation but later criticized as too linear and culturally blind. It remains a classic management framework.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5170c2be043d�body�٢从消费日到还款日之间，若全额还清通常不收利息，这段时间为免息期。利用好它可短期周转，但只还最低额会产生利息。��Between purchase and due date, if you pay in full you usually pay no interest—that gap is the grace period. Used well it aids short-term cash flow, but paying only the minimum incurs interest.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�51ba8f2d56a9�body�٨闲话传播谁可信、谁不可信的信息，让不守规矩的人有声誉代价，从而无形中维持合作。它是最早期的“社会信用”机制之一。٣Gossip spreads who is trustworthy, giving rule-breakers a reputation cost and quietly sustaining cooperation. It is one of the earliest 'social credit' mechanisms.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�52780de0aa82�body���韦伯提出的官僚制以层级分明、规则导向、按资历与专业任用为特征，追求理性高效。它减少任人唯亲，但也可能僵化、滋生“形式主义”。现代政府与企业都广泛采用。��Weber's bureaucracy features clear hierarchy, rule orientation, and recruitment by seniority and expertise, pursuing rational efficiency. It reduces nepotism but can become rigid and breed formalism. Modern governments and firms use it widely.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�52801d5b543d�body���贝克尔提出，是否犯罪取决于犯罪的期望收益与期望成本（被抓获概率×惩罚）的比较，而不只是道德缺陷。因此提高破案率、增加合法收入机会、减少犯罪机会（如目标强化）都能降低犯罪。这并不假定犯罪者都冷静计算，而是强调行为对激励有系统性反应——这一假设已被大量实证支持。��Gary Becker proposed that whether someone commits crime depends on comparing expected benefits to expected costs (probability of capture times punishment), not merely on moral failings. Raising detection rates, improving legal income opportunities, and reducing criminal opportunities (target hardening) therefore lower crime. This does not assume offenders calmly calculate; it asserts that behavior responds systematically to incentives—an assumption with substantial empirical support.�ans��src��%《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第1章�'Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 1��id�53128875a381�body���算法推荐以参与度为目标推送内容，可能放大极端、误导信息与成瘾，并因训练数据带偏见而歧视特定群体。它把私人公司置于“隐形编辑”地位。透明、可退出与监管是争议焦点。�
Algorithmic recommendation optimizes for engagement, potentially amplifying extremes, misinformation, and addiction, and discriminating via biased training data. It places private firms as invisible editors. Transparency, opt-out, and regulation are the flashpoints.�ans��src��NStephen Sunstein,《#Republic: Divide and Conquer》Yale University Press,2017�OStephen C. Sunstein, #Republic: Divide and Conquer, Yale University Press, 2017��id�541ba87aec51�body���契约自由指当事人在不违法、不违背公序良俗的前提下，可自主决定是否订约、与谁订约及约定内容。它是市场经济的基石，但现代法也通过消费者保护等规则加以限制，以防强弱失衡。�/Freedom of contract means parties may freely decide whether to contract, with whom, and on what terms, so long as it is lawful and not against public order. It is a cornerstone of the market economy, but modern law also limits it through consumer protection to prevent imbalance between strong and weak.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�542f44c5959d�body�٥执政者通过刻意绘制选区边界使本党占优，称为杰利蝾螈。它可扭曲民意与代表性，部分国家以独立委员会划界以减少偏见。ِGerrymandering draws district boundaries to favor a party, distorting representation; some countries use independent commissions to reduce bias.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�544c708e0dfa�body��影子银行指在传统受监管银行之外从事期限转换、流动性转换和信用中介的机构与活动，如货币市场基金、对冲基金、资产证券化渠道、P2P借贷平台。它们能绕过资本充足率等监管、提供更便宜的融资，使储蓄流向更高风险高收益的渠道，补充信贷供给；但期限错配（用短期资金投长期资产）使其在恐慌时极易遭到挤兑式赎回，风险可能蔓延到正规银行，2008年危机中证券化链条就是导火索之一。�BShadow banking refers to institutions and activities that perform maturity, liquidity, and credit intermediation outside the regulated banking system—money-market funds, hedge funds, securitization conduits, and peer-to-peer lending. They bypass capital-requirement rules, offer cheaper funding, and channel savings into riskier, higher-return uses, complementing credit supply; but maturity mismatch (funding long assets with short money) makes them vulnerable to runs in a panic, and stress can spill over to regulated banks—the securitization chain was a trigger in 2008.�ans��src��'IMF（《全球金融稳定报告》）�'IMF (Global Financial Stability Report)��id�556ae2cc48af�body�ٽ赡养指成年子女对父母的供养义务，扶养泛指家庭成员间（如夫妻、长辈对未成年晚辈）的经济与生活扶助。它们是法定义务，也是伦理基础。��Support (赡养) is adult children’s duty to parents; maintenance (扶养) covers mutual aid among family members, e.g., spouses or elders to minors. Both are legal duties and ethical foundations.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�564ccd22f708�body���亲属制度是用血缘与婚姻界定社会成员关系与义务的规则体系。摩尔根在《古代社会》中按世系计算方式将社会分为「母系」与「父系」两大类型，并据亲属称谓推断社会演进阶段。�Kinship is the system of rules defining social relations and obligations through blood and marriage. In Ancient Society, Morgan classified societies by descent reckoning into matrilineal and patrilineal types and inferred evolutionary stages from kinship terminology.�ans��src��2摩尔根《古代社会》(Ancient Society, 1877)�*Lewis Henry Morgan, Ancient Society (1877)��id�58ae1a48b38b�body�ٷ种姓是印度社会中按出身划分的等级群体，传统上影响职业、婚姻与交往。现代法律已禁止歧视，但作为社会分类仍在一些地区存在影响。��Caste is a birth-based hierarchy in Indian society that traditionally shaped occupation, marriage and contact. Modern law bans discrimination, yet as a social category it still influences some regions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�5a45a98da8f8�body���法律实证主义主张「法律是什么」与「法律应当是什么」分离，实在法只要由权威按程序制定即有效。自然法则认为法律的正当性须契合更高的道德秩序，恶法非法。�␀Legal positivism holds that what the law is is separate from what it ought to be, valid law is simply that enacted by authority through proper procedure. Natural law argues a law's legitimacy depends on a higher moral order, so unjust law is not truly law.�ans��src��5哈特《法律的概念》(The Concept of Law, 1961)�&H.L.A. Hart, The Concept of Law (1961)��id�5a6a941dbc21�body�٥节日把人从日常分工里拉出来，一起准备、吃喝、游行，制造共同记忆与话题。共同经历越多，邻里越把彼此当“自己人”。ٰFestivals pull people from daily roles to prepare, eat and parade together, making shared memory and talk. More shared experience makes neighbors treat each other as 'our own'.�ans��src�� Putnam,《Bowling Alone》(2000)�#Robert Putnam, Bowling Alone (2000)��id�5abdd4127a03�body��-埃斯平-安德森提出按“去商品化”程度（劳动者不靠出卖劳动力也能维持基本生活的程度）和制度设计把福利国家分为三类：自由主义型（美、英，以家计调查和市场化福利为主）、保守-法团主义型（德、法，以就业和家庭为单位、维持社会等级）、社会民主型（北欧，普遍性、高福利、重平等）。同样花钱，普惠型与救助型在覆盖面、激励结构与去污名效果上差别很大，因此制度类型比开支规模更能解释结果差异。�\Esping-Andersen classified welfare states by the degree of “decommodification”—how well people can maintain a basic living standard without selling their labor—and by institutional design: liberal (US, UK; means-tested, market-based welfare), conservative-corporatist (Germany, France; employment- and family-based, preserving status), and social-democratic (Nordic; universal, generous, egalitarian). The same budget can be spent very differently—universal versus targeted programs differ in coverage, incentives, and stigma—so institutional type explains outcomes better than spending size.�ans��src��TEsping-Andersen, G. (1990), 《福利资本主义的三个世界》, 政治出版社�PEsping-Andersen, G. (1990), The Three Worlds of Welfare Capitalism, Polity Press��id�5d543dfa5bf1�body��f全球化是商品、资本、信息、人员跨国流动加深、各国相互依存增强的过程。�xGlobalization is the deepening cross-border flow of goods, capital, information, and people, increasing interdependence.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�5de4c76823f9�body���洛伦兹曲线以图形刻画收入或财富的累计占比分布，对角线代表完全平等。曲线越偏离对角线，不平等越大，基尼系数即为其与对角线所围面积的两倍。��The Lorenz curve graphically depicts the cumulative share of income or wealth, with the diagonal representing perfect equality. The more it bows away from the diagonal, the greater the inequality; the Gini coefficient equals twice the area between them.�ans��src��C世界银行 (2020), 《贫困与共享繁荣 2020》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2020), Poverty and Shared Prosperity 2020��id�5ee9c7cb0f9c�body�ٙ团队规模过大易出现沟通成本上升、责任分散（“社会惰性”）。研究认为小团队更灵活高效，规模需与任务匹配。٤Oversized teams raise communication cost and diffuse responsibility (“social loafing”). Research suggests smaller teams are nimbler; size should match the task.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5fdf0bd4dc06�body���介于“完全不干预”和“全面审查”之间，平台通常需对违法内容（如仇恨、暴力、欺诈）采取删除与标识，并公开规则与申诉渠道；尺度平衡言论自由与安全防护。��Between “no intervention” and “full censorship,” platforms typically must remove or flag illegal content (hate, violence, fraud) and publish rules and appeal channels; the balance is free expression versus safety.�ans��src��NStephen Sunstein,《#Republic: Divide and Conquer》Yale University Press,2017�OStephen C. Sunstein, #Republic: Divide and Conquer, Yale University Press, 2017��id�600d4ddefd16�body���证券监管旨在保护投资者、维护市场公平透明并防范系统性风险。它要求信息披露、禁止内幕交易与市场操纵。没有监管，欺诈将侵蚀市场信任。��Securities regulation aims to protect investors, keep markets fair and transparent, and prevent systemic risk. It mandates disclosure and bans insider trading and market manipulation. Without it, fraud erodes market trust.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�606fde5feaae�body���朝贡体系是周边国家以“进贡”换“回赐”与通商许可的松散秩序，重礼仪与政治承认，而非平等的关税贸易。它更像一种等级化的外交—贸易混合体。��The tributary system let neighboring states 'present tribute' for gifts and trade rights—a loose order stressing ritual and political recognition over equal tariff-based trade. It was a hierarchical blend of diplomacy and commerce.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6298203dd9d5�body���因为市场自身存在局限：信息不对称（卖药的人远比买药的人知道得多）、外部性（污染）、自然垄断（电网）和公平问题（弱势一方易被剥削）。监管就是用规则纠正这些失灵，比如药品审批、食品安全标准、反垄断审查。但监管也有成本，过多过繁会抑制创新和效率，所以好的监管讲究适度与精准。��Because markets have built-in limits: information asymmetry, since sellers of drugs know far more than buyers; externalities like pollution; natural monopolies such as power grids; and fairness problems, where the weak can be exploited. Regulation corrects these failures through rules such as drug approval, food-safety standards, and antitrust review. But regulation also costs; too much of it stifles innovation and efficiency, so good regulation aims to be proportionate and targeted.�ans��src��5《经济学原理》(曼昆)（政府与市场章）�@Principles of Economics (Mankiw), government and markets chapter��id�63aa5f5e9ed1�body���零工经济以平台中介、短期任务化用工和劳动者缺乏传统雇佣保障为特征。劳动者多为独立承包商，工作时间灵活但缺少社保与集体谈判权，OECD 将其视为非标准就业的重要组成。�;The gig economy is characterised by platform mediation, short task-based jobs and the absence of traditional employment protections. Workers are mostly independent contractors with flexible hours but little social insurance or collective bargaining power, which OECD counts as a key form of non-standard employment.�ans��src��2OECD (2019), 《就业展望 2019》, 经合组织�)OECD (2019), OECD Employment Outlook 2019��id�63cc7306287b�body�ٱ职业倦怠是长期工作压力导致的身心耗竭，表现为情绪枯竭、效率下降与对工作的疏离感。它与单纯疲劳不同，需要休息与角色调整。ٵBurnout is exhaustion from chronic work stress, showing emotional depletion, falling efficiency, and detachment from the job. Unlike mere fatigue, it needs rest and role adjustment.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�63d222cb62e1�body�ٟ生理性别指由生物特征决定的男女分类；社会性别指社会文化赋予的角色、期待与行为规范，是可变的、由后天建构的。٬Sex refers to biologically based male/female categories; gender refers to the roles, expectations, and norms a culture assigns, which are variable and socially constructed.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�63d521b835d4�body���金融市场把闲置资金从储蓄者导向最具回报的投资项目，通过价格（利率、股价）反映风险与预期。它让资本流向高效用途，并分散风险。失灵时会引发危机并波及实体。�Financial markets channel idle funds from savers to the most rewarding projects, with prices (interest rates, stock prices) reflecting risk and expectations. They direct capital to efficient uses and spread risk. When they fail, crises spill into the real economy.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�63e0609fd261�body���代际流动性指子女的社会经济地位相对父母发生变动的程度。常用代际收入弹性（父母与子女收入排名的相关性）或地位获得模型（Blau-Duncan）来量化，数值越低代表流动性越高。��Intergenerational mobility is the extent to which children's socioeconomic status differs from their parents'. It is commonly measured by intergenerational income elasticity or status-attainment models; lower values mean more mobility.�ans��src��Q世界银行(World Bank)《Global Database on Intergenerational Mobility》(2020)�@World Bank, Global Database on Intergenerational Mobility (2020)��id�6457d0752339�body�٨邮票是预付邮资的凭证，伴随纸质信函普及；电子邮件与即时通讯让寄信锐减，邮票退为收藏与纪念。技术更替改变日常媒介。٫Stamps prepaid postage and spread with paper letters; email and instant messaging crashed letter volume, leaving stamps as collectibles. Tech shifts change everyday media.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�66a21afb3f73�body��}因为信息空前丰富但质量参差不齐，假新闻、标题党和深度伪造技术让人越来越难分辨真假。媒介素养就是批判性使用信息的能力：判断信源是否可靠、区分事实与观点、交叉验证说法、识别广告和算法操纵。它像数字时代的“免疫力”，因此许多国家和学校已把它作为基础能力来培养。��Because information is unprecedentedly abundant yet uneven in quality, and fake news, clickbait, and deepfakes make truth ever harder to tell. Media literacy is the ability to use information critically: judging source credibility, separating fact from opinion, cross-checking claims, and recognizing advertising and algorithmic manipulation. It's like immunity in the digital age, which is why many countries and schools now teach it as a basic skill.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�66aeb0e7f84f�body�ٴ麦库姆斯与肖 1972 年提出，媒体虽未必告诉人们怎么想，但成功告诉人们该想什么——媒体对议题的显著性会转移为公众的认知显著性。ٰMcCombs and Shaw (1972) proposed that media may not tell people what to think, but they tell them what to think about—media salience of issues transfers into public salience.�ans��src��TMcCombs, M. & Shaw, D. (1972), 《大众媒体的议程设置功能》, 舆论季刊�bMcCombs, M. & Shaw, D. (1972), The Agenda-Setting Function of Mass Media, Public Opinion Quarterly��id�66b50d6e55c5�body�ٽ本币升值意味着换外币更多，出国旅游、留学更便宜；贬值则相反，海外消费更贵。汇率波动主要影响跨境消费，对国内日常物价影响较间接。��A stronger currency buys more foreign money, making travel and study abroad cheaper; a weaker one does the opposite. Exchange moves mainly affect cross-border spending, less directly domestic prices.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�66bd48c35fcb�body�ٮ现代生产把零件分散到多地：一部手机可能来自十几个国家。某地工厂停工或港口堵塞，下游组装就会缺料，价格与交付随之波动。ٻModern production spreads parts across many places: a phone may draw from a dozen countries. A shutdown or port jam upstream means missing inputs downstream, swinging prices and delivery.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�67527abd97da�body�ٱ位于航线与陆桥交汇处的城市（如新加坡、鹿特丹）成为贸易枢纽；跨国基础设施串成的经济走廊重塑商品与资本流向，具战略意义。٬Cities at the crossroads of routes (Singapore, Rotterdam) become trade hubs; cross-border infrastructure corridors reshape flows of goods and capital with strategic weight.�ans��src��GWorld Bank（《世界发展报告2009：重塑世界经济地理》）�HWorld Bank (World Development Report 2009: Reshaping Economic Geography)��id�676ba86cfbac�body���人口老龄化使失能老人比例上升，而家庭规模缩小、女性（传统照护主力）就业率提高，使“家庭无偿照护”供给下降，形成照护缺口。若由公共养老或保险体系买单，护理开支在GDP中占比持续上升，挤压其他支出；护理劳动力缺口又推高工资成本。这就是“照护经济”议题：它关系到劳动供给、财政可持续与性别平等，需要护理保险、家庭照护者支持与正规护理产业协同应对。�GAging raises the share of disabled elderly, while shrinking family size and rising female employment—traditionally the main caregivers—reduce unpaid family care, creating a care gap. If public pensions and insurance pay for it, long-term-care spending keeps rising as a share of GDP, crowding out other spending, and shortages of care workers push up wage costs. Known as the “care economy,” the issue connects labor supply, fiscal sustainability, and gender equality, calling for coordinated long-term-care insurance, support for family carers, and a formalized care sector.�ans��src��-OECD（《健康一览》·长期护理篇）�)OECD (Health at a Glance, long-term care)��id�67a5573bc986�body�٫指子女离家后只剩父母（尤其老人）同住的家庭形态，随城镇化与少子化增多。它带来老人照料、情感陪伴与独居安全的新挑战。��It is a household where children have left, leaving parents (often elderly) alone; it grows with urbanization and low fertility. It raises new challenges in eldercare, companionship, and solo-living safety.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6c3542e23057�body�٫代际差异指不同出生年代的人在价值观、消费习惯和技术使用上呈现系统性不同，常由各自成长期的经济、社会与科技环境塑造。��Generational differences are systematic variations in values, consumption, and tech use across birth cohorts, shaped by the economic, social, and technological conditions of their formative years.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�6c6d6826a670�body�ٷ小社区里人们反复打交道，谁坑过人大家都知道，口碑是长期验证过的信号；广告只是一次信息，可信度低。信任来自重复互动而非宣传。��In small communities people meet repeatedly; everyone knows who cheated, so reputation is a long-verified signal, while ads are one-shot and less credible. Trust comes from repeated interaction, not promotion.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6ec662b4082c�body���个人数据可用于精准广告、信用评估、风险管理与产品改进，因此具有商业价值，平台提供“免费”服务实质是以数据“支付”。但数据与石油不同：它可无限复制、由个人产生、且本人往往不知道其流向，市场难以定价，还涉及同意、控制与尊严。因此各国立法（如GDPR）强调知情同意、可携带与删除权，把隐私视为基本权利而非纯粹的商品。�+Personal data enables targeted advertising, credit scoring, risk management, and product improvement, giving it commercial value—platforms offering “free” services are effectively paid in data. But unlike oil, data is infinitely replicable, produced by individuals, and its flow is often invisible to them, so markets price it poorly and consent, control, and dignity are at stake. That is why laws such as the GDPR stress informed consent, portability, and the right to erasure, treating privacy as a fundamental right rather than a mere commodity.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�6eca88232d51�body��n三权分立源于孟德斯鸠“以权力制约权力”的思想：立法机关制定法律，行政机关执行法律，司法机关解释和适用法律。三个部门通过否决权、违宪审查等方式互相制约，防止任何一方权力过大而滥用。各国体制不同，有的更偏重议会制，但分权制衡的核心理念已被广泛接受。��Separation of powers comes from Montesquieu's idea that power must check power: the legislature makes laws, the executive enforces them, and the judiciary interprets and applies them. Through vetoes and judicial review the branches check one another, preventing any one from dominating and abusing power. Systems differ, some leaning toward parliamentary models, but the core idea of checks and balances is widely adopted.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6fc25bc19bce�body�ٟ出自《淮南子》，讲祸福相依、坏事可能转好、好事也可能藏忧，劝人辩证看待得失。它体现中国哲学中的祸福转化观。��From Huainanzi, it teaches that fortune and misfortune are intertwined—bad may turn good, good may hide worry—urging a dialectical view of gain and loss. It reflects a Chinese philosophy of fortune’s reversibility.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�70dbcba1cb24�body�ٰ指居民步行或骑行15分钟内可到达买菜、就医、上学、健身等基本生活设施的城市规划理念。它减少通勤依赖、提升便利与社区活力。��It is an urban-planning idea where daily needs—groceries, clinics, schools, gyms—are reachable within a 15-minute walk or bike ride. It cuts commute dependence and lifts convenience and vitality.�ans��src��VCarlos Moreno《15 分钟城市》,载《Sustainability》(MDPI) 第12卷第11期,2020�GCarlos Moreno, 'The 15-minute city', Sustainability, 12(11), 4437, 2020��id�74a1884bf6a3�body��最低工资标准是政府规定的雇主必须支付给劳动者的最低小时或月薪，旨在保障基本生活并减少低收入贫困。支持者认为它提升低收入者收入，反对者担心可能减少就业。其效果取决于具体水平与经济环境。�A minimum wage is the lowest hourly or monthly pay employers must legally pay workers, aimed at securing basic living and reducing low-income poverty. Supporters say it raises low earners' income; opponents worry it may cut jobs. Its effect depends on the level set and economic context.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�75751f943dd5�body��\货币的价值主要体现在购买力——同样一笔钱能买到多少东西。通货膨胀让同样的钱买到的东西变少，购买力下降，所以“钱不值钱了”。存款和固定工资不会自动跟着物价涨，实际购买力就被悄悄侵蚀，这也是人们关注通胀率、并在通胀高企时设法保值的原因。�lMoney's value shows mainly in purchasing power, how much a given sum can buy. Inflation makes that same sum buy less, so purchasing power falls and money is worth less. Savings and fixed salaries don't automatically track prices, so real purchasing power is quietly eroded, which is why people watch inflation and look for ways to preserve value when it runs high.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�759a922832db�body��移民融入指新移民在经济（就业）、社会（交往）、文化（语言价值）和政治（权利参与）等层面逐步被接收社会接纳的过程。融入顺畅能减少冲突并释放人口红利。语言教育与反歧视政策是关键手段。�TMigrant integration is the process by which newcomers are accepted across economic (employment), social (interaction), cultural (language and values), and political (rights and participation) dimensions. Smooth integration reduces conflict and releases demographic dividends. Language education and anti-discrimination policy are key tools.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�75b490c40653�body�ٚ约公元前1200年东地中海的贸易网络与王国在数十年内相继瓦解，可能与海民入侵、干旱、地震与体系连锁失效有关。٣Around 1200 BCE, Eastern Mediterranean trade networks and kingdoms collapsed within decades, possibly from Sea Peoples, drought, earthquakes, and systemic failure.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�760117c265c4�body���精明增长是一套紧凑、混合用途、公交导向且保护开敞空间的城市规划策略。它通过提高密度与可步行性降低对小汽车的依赖和基础设施延伸成本，从而抑制无序扩张。��Smart growth is a planning approach favoring compact, mixed-use, transit-oriented development that protects open space. By raising density and walkability, it reduces car dependence and the cost of extending infrastructure, curbing disorderly expansion.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�765e587bbe45�body���京杭大运河贯通南北，把南方的粮食、丝绸和盐运往北方政治中心，是维系王朝运转的“漕运”命脉。它降低了大宗物资的陆运成本，也催生了沿线商业城市。直到铁路兴起，运河才开始衰落。�CThe Grand Canal linked north and south, carrying southern grain, silk, and salt to the northern political centers as the lifeline of “caoyun” grain transport that sustained the dynasties. It cut the cost of moving bulk goods over land and spawned commercial cities along its route. It declined only after railways rose.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�7904e1fc352a�body�ٴ政策旨在减轻学生作业与校外培训负担，缓解内卷与家庭焦虑，并降低教育成本。它引发培训行业收缩，也带来托管与素质教育新需求。��The policy aims to cut homework and after-school tutoring burdens, easing competition and family anxiety and lowering education cost. It shrank the tutoring industry and raised demand for childcare and well-rounded education.�ans��src���Yin,《The Dilemmas and Causes of After-School Tutoring Under China's Double Reduction Policy》,Lecture Notes in Education Psychology and Public Media,2023 (DOI: 10.54254/2753-7048/7/20220875)ٿYin, 'The Dilemmas and Causes of After-School Tutoring Under China's Double Reduction Policy', Lecture Notes in Education Psychology and Public Media, 2023, DOI: 10.54254/2753-7048/7/20220875��id�7a3106da8fef�body�٥市场失灵指自由市场无法有效配置资源，导致社会净福利损失。常见类型包括外部性、公共品供给不足、垄断与信息不对称。��Market failure occurs when free markets fail to allocate resources efficiently, reducing social net welfare. Common types are externalities, under-provision of public goods, monopoly, and information asymmetry.�ans��src��OBator,《The Anatomy of Market Failure》(Quarterly Journal of Economics, 1958)�UFrancis Bator, 'The Anatomy of Market Failure' (Quarterly Journal of Economics, 1958)��id�7a39ea319766�body���完全竞争市场有无数小企业、产品同质、价格由供需决定；垄断则只有一家卖方，能影响价格并往往抬高它、限制产量。竞争程度决定资源配置效率与消费者福利。现实市场多介于两者之间。�RIn perfect competition, countless small firms sell identical products and price is set by supply and demand; a monopoly has a single seller that can influence price, often raising it and restricting output. The degree of competition determines allocative efficiency and consumer welfare. Real markets usually lie between the two extremes.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7b76aa82f28c�body���鸦片战争后，大量华工以契约劳工身份前往东南亚、美洲和澳洲的矿山、铁路与种植园谋生。他们填补了殖民地开发的劳动力缺口，也常遭受歧视与严苛待遇。今天海外华人社区多源于此。�HAfter the Opium Wars, large numbers of Chinese laborers went as contract workers to mines, railways, and plantations in Southeast Asia, the Americas, and Australia. They filled labor shortages in colonial development but often faced discrimination and harsh treatment. Many overseas Chinese communities today trace back to them.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�7bd780121949�body��o隐性课程指学校通过制度、互动与文化无意中传递的价值观与规范，如守时与服从。مThe hidden curriculum is values and norms schools transmit unintentionally via routines and culture, like punctuality and compliance.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7cf8aa8eae93�body���否决政治（vetocracy）指制度中否决玩家过多，任何改革都被轻易阻挡，导致政府停摆与政策僵局。它可能源于过度分权或利益集团林立。它解释了为何某些民主体难以有效治理。�Vetocracy describes a system with so many veto players that any reform is easily blocked, causing gridlock and government shutdown. It can stem from excessive decentralization or entrenched interest groups. It explains why some democracies struggle to govern effectively.�ans��src�يAdiguzel,《Checks and Balances and Institutional Gridlock: Implications for Authoritarianism》,Governance,2025 (DOI: 10.1111/gove.70017)وAdiguzel, 'Checks and Balances and Institutional Gridlock: Implications for Authoritarianism', Governance, 2025, DOI: 10.1111/gove.70017��id�7f7d604814c3�body�١布林约尔松等用以描述数字技术、AI与自动化以指数速度重塑生产与认知劳动的时代，区别于蒸汽电力的第一次机器时代。٪Brynjolfsson et al. describe a digital, AI, and automation era reshaping production and cognitive work exponentially—distinct from the steam/electric First Machine Age.�ans��src�ٖAutor, D. (2015), 《为何仍有这么多工作？》, 经济展望杂志; 世界银行 (2019), 《世界发展报告 2019：工作性质的变革》٤Autor, D. (2015), Why Are There Still So Many Jobs?, Journal of Economic Perspectives; World Bank (2019), World Development Report 2019: The Changing Nature of Work��id�81a6828e452c�body���投票（选举）制度规定选票如何转化为席位的规则，主要有比例代表制、多数制和混合制等。不同制度会影响政党格局、代表性与执政稳定性。制度设计直接影响选民选择与政治结果。�/An electoral system is the set of rules converting votes into seats, mainly including proportional representation, majoritarian, and mixed systems. Different systems affect party systems, representation, and government stability. Institutional design directly shapes voter choice and political outcomes.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�83604ab8bc3b�body�ٮ退休者增多、缴费者相对减少，使现收现付式养老金的抚养比恶化，收支缺口扩大，可能需要提高缴费、延迟退休或增加财政补贴。ٿMore retirees and fewer contributors worsen the support ratio of pay-as-you-go pensions, widening deficits—possibly requiring higher contributions, later retirement, or more fiscal subsidy.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�846973bcc97c�body�٥知识产权保护人类智力成果，如著作权、专利、商标，赋予创作者一定期限独占权以激励创新。盗版与抄袭即侵犯此类权利。ٲIntellectual property protects human creations—copyright, patents, trademarks—granting creators time-limited exclusivity to spur innovation. Piracy and plagiarism violate it.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�86875d34de25�body�ٱ五常的一票否决使安理会在涉及大国核心利益时易陷于瘫痪，难以对强权冲突采取强制行动，推动在人道干预等议题上寻找替代机制。��The P5 veto lets any permanent member block action, often paralyzing the Council on conflicts touching great-power interests and prompting alternative mechanisms for humanitarian intervention.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�869b808e9c0b�body���道德风险指交易一方因被保护或信息隐蔽，事后更敢于冒险并让对方承担后果，如投保后疏于防火。它与逆向选择不同，发生在合约之后。保险与救助中的激励设计需防范它。�+Moral hazard is when one party, protected or hidden, dares to take more risk after the fact, leaving the other to bear consequences—like neglecting fire safety after insuring. Unlike adverse selection, it occurs after the contract. Incentive design in insurance and bailouts must guard against it.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�86e98aafedc8�body��数字鸿沟指不同群体在接入、使用和从数字技术中获益方面的差距，可分为接入鸿沟、技能鸿沟和结果鸿沟。当教育、就业与公共服务日益线上化，缺乏数字能力的群体在机会获取上进一步落后。�The digital divide is the gap between groups in access to, use of, and benefits from digital technology, spanning access, skills, and outcomes. As education, employment, and public services move online, those lacking digital capability fall further behind in opportunity.�ans��src��R世界银行(World Bank)《World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives》�@World Bank, World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives��id�8815244ad24c�body���主权债务是中央政府以本币或外币向国内外借入、以国家信用背书的债务。IMF 贷款常附加财政整顿、货币政策收紧与结构改革等「条件性」要求，以恢复偿债能力，但也常引发紧缩争议。�ESovereign debt is borrowing by the central government, denominated in domestic or foreign currency and backed by the state's credit. IMF lending typically attaches conditionality such as fiscal consolidation, tighter monetary policy, and structural reforms to restore solvency, though this often sparks debate over austerity.�ans��src��P国际货币基金组织(IMF)《贷款条件性指南》(2002制定, 2009修订)�6IMF, Guidelines on Conditionality (2002, revised 2009)��id�881dd049bb11�body���确认偏误指人倾向搜寻、相信支持既有观点的信息，忽略反证。它使人更难纠正错误、更易陷入极化。意识到偏误并主动求异是理性的重要一步。��Confirmation bias is the tendency to seek and believe information supporting existing views while ignoring counter-evidence. It makes correcting errors harder and polarization likelier. Recognizing the bias and seeking dissent is a key rational step.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�8974d56a0a8d�body�ٮ锈带指因制造业衰退而衰落的工业老区的美国北部；阳光带指因气候、军工与服务业兴起而增长的南部与西部，反映产业地理重构。ٲThe Rust Belt is the declining northern US manufacturing heartland; the Sun Belt is the growing South/West from climate, defense, and services—reflecting industrial relocation.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�89a990c1d29c�body�ه社会分层指社会成员按财富、权力、声望等维度形成的等级化排列，常见形式包括阶级、种姓与等级。ًSocial stratification is the hierarchical arrangement of people by wealth, power, and prestige, taking forms like class, caste, and estate.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8a51b62d70c0�body��	第一次世界大战后，德国背负巨额赔款，政府大量印钞以支付开支和债务。货币供应激增而商品供给不足，导致马克价值暴跌，1923年物价几近失控。恶性通胀摧毁了中产阶级储蓄，也动摇了社会信任。�5After World War I, Germany faced huge reparations and printed vast amounts of money to cover spending and debt. The money supply exploded while goods stayed scarce, causing the mark to collapse and prices to spiral out of control in 1923. Hyperinflation wiped out middle-class savings and eroded social trust.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8d68c5c518d3�body�٨指产品在设计中故意缩短使用寿命，促使消费者更快更换，如早期灯泡寿命被限制。它推动消费但也引发资源浪费与环保争议。��It means products are deliberately designed with shorter lifespans to make consumers replace them sooner, as with early light bulbs built to fail. It drives consumption but sparks waste and environmental debate.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8f4ff309b2a8�body���原因是城市化、经济发展和观念转变：大家庭的保障功能逐渐被社会保障和保险替代，女性受教育程度和就业率上升，婚育年龄推迟，人均寿命延长又使老人独居增多。小家庭和独居给了个人更多自由与隐私，但也意味着带娃、养老更多要依赖市场服务和公共制度，家庭内部的代际支持相应减弱。��Urbanization, economic development, and shifting values: extended families lose their safety-net role to social security and insurance, more women pursue education and careers, people marry and have children later, and longer lifespans mean more elderly living alone. Smaller households grant freedom and privacy, but they also push childcare and eldercare toward market services and public institutions while weakening support between generations.�ans��src��)《社会学概论》(家庭与人口章)�9Introduction to Sociology (family and population chapter)��id�901aa83c966f�body���仲裁是当事人约定把争议交给中立第三方裁决，过程不公开、一裁终局、效率较高，常见于商业纠纷。诉讼则由法院依公权力审理，程序公开且可上诉。两者都是解决争议的正式途径。� Arbitration lets parties agree to submit a dispute to a neutral third party whose decision is private, usually final, and efficient, common in commercial disputes. Litigation is heard by a court under public authority, is open, and allows appeal. Both are formal ways to resolve conflict.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�9083d6c8d289�body���公地悲剧指人人都可免费使用的共有资源（如牧场、渔场），因个体过度使用而最终枯竭。每个人都想多占一点收益，却由大家分担代价。解决办法包括产权界定、配额或集体治理。�"The tragedy of the commons occurs when a shared resource open to all (such as pasture or fisheries) is depleted because each individual overuses it. Everyone captures private gain while the cost is shared by all. Solutions include defining property rights, quotas, or collective governance.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�91093a62a1d7�body�٥推力是原居地的不利（战乱、失业、灾害），拉力是目的地的吸引（工作、安全、教育）；两者共同决定迁移的规模与方向。ٽPush factors are home-place negatives (war, unemployment, disaster); pull factors are destination attractions (jobs, safety, education); together they shape migration's scale and direction.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�91676a899de3�body���常见有一党制、两党制与多党制。两党制（如美国）往往政府更稳，多党制（如欧洲）更包容却易组阁难。制度设计深刻影响政策风格与代表性。�Common forms are one-party, two-party, and multi-party systems. Two-party systems (like the US) often yield stable government; multi-party systems (like Europe) are more inclusive but prone to coalition difficulty. Institutional design deeply shapes policy style and representation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9234e83d7ed4�body��传统货币由中央银行发行并受法律保护，价值依托国家信用；加密货币则基于区块链算法，由去中心化网络共同维护，没有单一发行机构。它不依赖银行清算，但也缺乏政府背书与稳定价值保障。�&Traditional money is issued by a central bank and backed by law and state credit, while cryptocurrency runs on blockchain algorithms maintained by a decentralized network with no single issuer. It does not rely on bank clearing, but it also lacks government backing and stable-value guarantees.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�93170ea623d9�body���信息茧房强调用户主动选择同质化信源、社区互相强化；过滤气泡强调算法基于行为数据被动窄化内容供给。帕里泽指出后者让用户更难察觉自己被隔离。�The echo chamber stresses users actively choosing homogeneous sources and mutually reinforcing communities; the filter bubble stresses algorithms passively narrowing supply based on behavioural data. Pariser notes the latter makes users less aware of their isolation.�ans��src��XPariser, E. (2011), 《过滤气泡：互联网对你隐藏了什么》, 企鹅出版社�ZPariser, E. (2011), The Filter Bubble: What the Internet Is Hiding from You, Penguin Press��id�94c4fcda2af0�body��G大规模农业帝国依赖治水、储粮和大型公共工程，这些只有集中组织才能办成。中央把税收、军队和官僚体系统一到手中，既能调配资源防灾，也能维持秩序、防止地方割据。地理上的连片平原和一致的农业节奏，也天然利于一个统一政权来管理。��Large agrarian empires depended on flood control, grain storage, and big public works that only centralized organization could manage. A central authority that unified taxation, the military, and bureaucracy could allocate resources against disasters and prevent regional warlords from breaking away. Connected plains and a shared agricultural cycle also naturally favored a single unifying state.�ans��src��aKarl Wittfogel,《东方专制主义:对极权社会的比较研究》,Yale University Press,1957�|Karl Wittfogel, Oriental Despotism: A Comparative Study of the Total Impact of Water on Society, Yale University Press, 1957��id�96f8e26a0f44�body�٨锚定效应指人会被最先看到的数字影响判断，例如先见“原价999”再看“现价399”会觉得便宜。商家常用划线价制造参照锚点。ٷAnchoring means people are swayed by the first number they see—e.g., seeing “was 999” then “now 399” feels cheap. Sellers use struck-through prices to set a reference point.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9726420323eb�body�ٖ标题党用夸张、隐瞒或误导的标题吸引点击，内容常名不副实。它消耗注意力、放大焦虑，长期损害媒体公信力。ٷClickbait uses exaggerated, withholding, or misleading headlines to draw clicks while the content under-delivers. It wastes attention, amplifies anxiety, and erodes media credibility.�ans��src��9Tim Wu,《The Attention Merchants》,Alfred A. Knopf,2016�5T. Wu, The Attention Merchants, Alfred A. Knopf, 2016��id�97a95923396c�body�ٖ合同一旦签署即具法律效力，模糊或不利条款可能让你承担额外义务。重点看价格、期限、违约责任与解除条件。ٕOnce signed, a contract is legally binding; vague or unfair clauses may add obligations. Focus on price, term, breach liability, and exit conditions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�97ce98eb15f1�body�٫它们提供放松、社交与运动的免费场所，缓解高密度生活的压力，也促进社会各阶层的交融。公共空间是城市宜居度的重要指标。٢They offer free places to relax, socialize, and exercise, easing high-density stress and mixing social classes. Public space is a key measure of urban livability.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�98e98213951f�body���离散族群指因迁移、贸易或被迫离开故土，分散居住世界各地却仍保持共同文化认同的族群，如犹太离散、非洲离散。他们常维持与祖籍地的情感与经济联系。离散研究揭示了身份的多重性。� A diaspora is a group scattered across the world after migration, trade, or forced removal yet retaining a shared cultural identity, such as the Jewish or African diasporas. They often keep emotional and economic ties to the homeland. Diaspora studies reveal the multiplicity of identity.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�995146016249�body�٢城市蔓延指低密度、依赖汽车的无序扩张，增加通勤与能耗；紧凑城市通过高密度混合用地提升公共交通效率与可持续性。٪Sprawl is low-density, car-dependent expansion raising commuting and energy use; compact cities use dense mixed-use land to improve transit efficiency and sustainability.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�99618f634548�body�ٓ通过对污染等负外部性征税，把社会成本计入生产者价格，使其减少过量排放；税额通常应等于边际外部损害。ٯBy taxing pollution and similar negative externalities, the social cost is added to the producer's price, discouraging excess; the tax ideally equals marginal external damage.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9b5d8502e81f�body��u强调公平、少考试、高自主权与强师资培训，学生在国际测评中表现稳定且校际差距小。�|It emphasizes equity, few standardized tests, teacher autonomy, and rigorous training, yielding stable, low-gap performance.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9bb0c5ea37da�body���工业化与城市让年轻人外出工作、独立居住；教育与健康改善降低了“多子防老”的需要；法律与福利部分替代了家族的养老与保障功能。家庭变小但更平等。��Industrialization and cities pulled youth out to work and live independently; better education and health cut the need for 'many children for old age'; law and welfare partly replaced the clan's care functions. Families shrank but became more equal.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�9e5a590dacc9�body�ٟ形式随支付技术与生活形态变化，但“长辈送祝福、晚辈纳吉”的内核不变。红包数字化降低了地理距离对拜年的阻碍。ٱThe form shifts with payment tech and lifestyle, but the core—elders’ blessing to juniors—stays. Digital red envelopes lower the barrier distance poses to New Year visits.�ans��src�ټXu,《The “Lucky Money” That Started It All—The Reinvention of the Ancient Tradition “Red Packet” in Digital Times》,Social Media + Society,2021 (DOI: 10.1177/20563051211041643)ٺXu, 'The “Lucky Money” That Started It All—The Reinvention of the Ancient Tradition “Red Packet” in Digital Times', Social Media + Society, 2021, DOI: 10.1177/20563051211041643��id�9fcaeede2d07�body���社会学家区分生理性别（sex）与社会性别（gender）。性别角色主要通过社会化习得：家庭（玩具、衣着、分工示范）、学校（教师期待、教材形象）、同伴与媒体（偶像、影视模板）不断传递“男孩/女孩应该怎样”的规范。不同时代与社会的性别分工差异很大，说明文化因素作用显著；但社会化并非单向强加，个体也会协商、偏离甚至重塑规范。�Sociologists distinguish biological sex from social gender. Gender roles are learned through socialization: family (toys, clothing, modeled division of labor), schools (teacher expectations, curriculum imagery), peers, and media (idols, screen templates) continually transmit norms of “how boys/girls should be.” The great variation in gender divisions across eras and societies shows culture matters greatly; yet socialization is not one-way imposition—individuals also negotiate, deviate from, and reshape norms.�ans��src��3《社会学概论》（社会化与性别一章）�SIntroduction to Sociology (《社会学概论》, socialization and gender chapter)��id�a00e3601b768�body�ٷ零工经济通过平台匹配短期、灵活的任务（如外卖、网约车），降低用工成本但弱化了传统雇佣关系，带来社保覆盖与劳动权益的新挑战。��The gig economy matches short, flexible tasks via platforms (delivery, ride-hailing), lowering labor costs but weakening traditional employment and raising challenges for social insurance and worker rights.�ans��src��4OECD（《就业展望2021》·平台经济章节）�8OECD (Employment Outlook 2021, platform economy chapter)��id�a0cd5b820d6a�body���联合国成立于1945年，核心宗旨是维护国际和平与安全、促进国际合作。安理会负责和平与安全问题，联合国大会讨论广泛议题，下属机构则开展人道援助、儿童保护、发展和卫生项目。但它的效力受大国利益制约：安理会常任理事国可行使否决权，维和行动需要成员国派兵出钱，因此在面对重大冲突时往往反应迟缓、行动受限。��Founded in 1945, the UN aims to keep international peace and security and to promote cooperation. The Security Council handles peace and security, the General Assembly debates broadly, and its agencies run humanitarian aid, child protection, development, and health programs. Effectiveness is constrained by great-power interests: permanent Security Council members can veto, and peacekeeping depends on member contributions of troops and money, so responses to major conflicts are often slow and limited.�ans��src��'联合国（联合国宪章与简介）�%United Nations (Charter and overview)��id�a14c711fd403�body��文化相对主义主张应依据某一文化自身的标准理解其习俗，反对以本文化为尺度做优劣评判，有助于遏制民族中心主义。但其极端形式会陷入「凡事皆可」的相对主义，难以回应人权等普世价值冲突。�Cultural relativism holds that a culture's practices should be understood by its own standards rather than judged by another's, countering ethnocentrism. Taken to extremes it risks anything-goes relativism, struggling to address conflicts with universal values like human rights.�ans��src��C赫斯科维茨《文化人类学》(1948) 文化相对主义论述�-Melville Herskovits, Man and His Works (1948)��id�a164c604168a�body��人口转变描述从「高出生高死亡」向「低出生低死亡」的长期演进，经典四阶段为：高稳态、死亡率下降、出生率下降、低稳态。部分国家进入「第五阶段」——低生育叠加老龄化导致人口负增长。�Demographic transition describes the long shift from high birth and death rates to low ones, classically in four stages: high equilibrium, falling mortality, falling fertility, and low equilibrium. Some countries enter a fifth stage of population decline as low fertility meets aging.�ans��src��2联合国《World Population Prospects》方法论�*UN, World Population Prospects methodology��id�a1fc3b7e1162�body���水路比陆路便宜得多，运河把产销地连成网络，使粮价、盐价在广大区域趋同，也促进人口与技术的流动，从而把分散的地方市场整合成一个大市场。��Water transport is far cheaper than land; a canal links producers and consumers into a network, equalizing grain and salt prices over a vast area and moving people and know-how, knitting local markets into one big market.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a2d950411f18�body���古罗马发展出系统的私法，如契约、物权和人格权概念，后经中世纪整理为《民法大全》。大陆法系多以其为蓝本，现代合同法与物权法仍可见其痕迹。它被称为“法律的语言”。�&Ancient Rome developed systematic private law—contracts, property, and personal rights—later compiled in the Corpus Juris Civilis in the Middle Ages. Civil-law systems largely modeled on it, and modern contract and property law still show its traces. It is called the “language of law.”�ans��src��R约翰·亨利·梅里曼《大陆法系》（Merryman, The Civil Law Tradition）�2John Henry Merryman, “The Civil Law Tradition”��id�a3ce4e2c93a5�body���司法独立指法官在审理中不受行政与政治干预、仅依法律与事实裁判。可预期、公正的合同执行与产权保护降低交易不确定性，从而鼓励投资与长期经济活动。�Judicial independence means judges decide cases free from executive or political interference, relying only on law and facts. Predictable, impartial enforcement of contracts and property rights lowers uncertainty and thereby encourages investment and long-term economic activity.�ans��src��iLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny,《Law and Finance》(Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)�gLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny, 'Law and Finance' (Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)��id�a405249f8784�body��`城镇人口占总人口的比重，是衡量发展阶段与经济结构变化的常用指标。�_It is the urban share of total population, a common gauge of development and structural change.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�a4fc473a6443�body�ٖ算法推荐根据用户行为预测偏好并推送内容，提升匹配效率，但也可能形成“信息茧房”和过滤气泡，收窄视野。��Algorithmic recommendation predicts preferences from behavior to push content, improving matching efficiency but potentially creating “information cocoons” and filter bubbles that narrow exposure.�ans��src��NStephen Sunstein,《#Republic: Divide and Conquer》Yale University Press,2017�OStephen C. Sunstein, #Republic: Divide and Conquer, Yale University Press, 2017��id�a7b91838702a�body��}因为法律、合同、声誉和制度提供了“可信的承诺”：违约会被追究，口碑差的商家会失去顾客。博弈论研究发现，在重复互动中，“以牙还牙”等策略能维持合作；而现代社会中大量匿名的交易，靠的是对规则和机构的信任，而不只是对某个人的信任。制度让陌生人的合作变得可预期。��Because laws, contracts, reputation, and institutions provide credible commitments: breaches get punished, and untrustworthy businesses lose customers. Game theory shows that in repeated interactions, strategies like tit-for-tat sustain cooperation; and in the anonymous transactions of modern society, we rely on trust in rules and organizations, not merely in individuals. Institutions make cooperation with strangers predictable.�ans��src��,《社会学概论》(信任与合作研究)�1Introduction to Sociology (trust and cooperation)��id�a7c690f59d01�body��在线教育借助网络把课程送到任意地点，打破了时空限制，使大规模开放课程（MOOC）成为可能。它降低了获取优质资源的门槛，也带来注意力分散与完课率低的问题。疫情进一步加速了它的普及。�Online education uses the internet to deliver courses anywhere, breaking time and space limits and enabling massive open online courses (MOOCs). It lowers the barrier to quality resources but also brings distraction and low completion rates. The pandemic accelerated its spread.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a7d23e950329�body�٧威慑取决于“被抓的概率×代价”。若破案率低，再重的刑罚也难吓住人；何况贫困、成瘾等根因不解决，惩罚只是事后补救。ٷDeterrence depends on caught-probability times cost. With low clearance rates, harsher penalties scare few; and without fixing poverty or addiction, punishment is only after-the-fact.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aaf7ed4fdcdf�body���与搭便车相对，集体声誉指群体因整体表现获得信任资本，使每个成员受益，如“德国制造”溢价。它激励成员维护标准、惩罚违规者。好的集体声誉是公共品。�Opposite to free-riding, collective reputation is trust capital a group earns from overall performance, benefiting each member, like the “Made in Germany” premium. It incentivizes members to uphold standards and punish violators. Good collective reputation is a public good.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�abd564e5643f�body��社会角色是与特定社会地位相联系的、被社会期望的行为模式，例如“教师”“父母”或“顾客”。人们在不同情境中扮演多重角色，角色之间可能发生冲突。角色期望有助于社会互动的可预期性。�A social role is the pattern of behavior expected of someone occupying a given social position, such as 'teacher,' 'parent,' or 'customer.' People play multiple roles in different contexts, and roles can sometimes conflict. Role expectations make social interaction more predictable.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b0080e9b69ce�body���价格歧视指同一商品对不同顾客收取不同价格，如学生票、动态机票。它能在不同支付意愿间榨取更多消费者剩余。只要不排他且可分割市场，企业就有动机实施。�Price discrimination charges different prices for the same good to different customers, like student tickets or dynamic airfares. It extracts more consumer surplus across willingness to pay. Firms are motivated whenever markets are separable and exclusion is feasible.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b26e2498201c�body�٢限时制造稀缺与紧迫感，触发“损失厌恶”——人们更怕错过优惠而非理性比较价格。商家借此缩短决策时间，减少比价。��Limited-time offers create scarcity and urgency, triggering “loss aversion”: people fear missing the deal more than they rationally compare prices. Sellers use this to shorten decision time and curb comparison.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b37127b3241b�body���协调博弈中存在多个互不冲突的好结果，但只有各方选择一致才获益，例如约定都靠右行驶。若预期不同就会撞车，所以需要信号、惯例或制度来统一选择。它说明制度与习俗能降低协调成本。�<A coordination game has several mutually consistent good outcomes, but players only gain if choices align—e.g., agreeing to drive on the right. Mismatched expectations cause collisions, so signals, conventions, or institutions are needed to unify choice. It shows institutions and customs lower coordination costs.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b422b55c000e�body���东印度公司由本国政府特许，不仅做买卖，还拥有铸币、建军、宣战和殖民治理等准国家权力。荷兰与英国的东印度公司都曾统治大片海外领土。它们既是贸易工具，也是早期殖民扩张的载体。�2Chartered by their governments, the East India Companies did more than trade: they could mint coins, raise armies, wage war, and govern colonies as quasi-states. Both the Dutch and British companies ruled large overseas territories. They were both commercial tools and vehicles of early colonial expansion.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b4326bb0237f�body�٥它是博弈论经典模型：两人各自选择“背叛”对己最安全，但都背叛的结果比都合作更糟，说明个人理性可能导致集体不利。ٺIt is a classic game-theory model: each person's safest choice is to defect, yet mutual defection is worse than mutual cooperation, showing how individual rationality can harm the group.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b59258658b1b�body��#在只玩一次的博弈里，背叛常是理性选择；但若双方要长期反复互动，今天的合作可换明天的好处，背叛则招致报复。因此重复博弈能维持信任与协作，即“一报还一报”策略的土壤。它解释了社区与商号间的长久信用。�5In a one-shot game, betrayal is often rational; but if the two sides interact repeatedly, today's cooperation buys tomorrow's benefit while betrayal invites retaliation. So repeated games sustain trust and collaboration—the soil of “tit-for-tat.” They explain lasting credit among communities and firms.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b5f8141b31be�body�٫移民往往更年轻、教育更高（正向选择）或特定群体集中，对来源国造成人才外流、对接收国补充技能，重塑两地人力资本结构。٪Migrants tend to be younger and better-educated (positive selection) or clustered, causing brain drain at origin and skill supply at destination, reshaping human capital.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�b8504b7bc4d8�body���日本村落强调“共同体”与相互扶助（如结、讲、组），讲究和睦与不出头；个人行为受邻里眼光约束。这种“纵向社会”与强集体规范影响至今。��Japanese villages stressed community and mutual aid (such as kumi groups), valuing harmony and not standing out; neighbors' eyes constrained behavior. This 'vertical society' with strong group norms still echoes today.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b8ca778d5998�body�ٮ宗族是由同一祖先繁衍的父系家族群体，有祠堂、族谱和族规。它管救济、调解、办学与祭祀，在国家和家庭之间填补了治理空白。��A clan is a patrilineal group descended from one ancestor, with ancestral halls, genealogies and rules. It provided relief, mediation, schooling and ritual, filling governance gaps between state and household.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�ba32b71cb9b4�body�ٽ东盟强调协商一致、不干涉内政与渐进合作，各国先在经贸与反恐等低敏感领域协作，再慢慢深化。它重面子与默契，区别于西式投票多数决。��ASEAN stresses consensus, non-interference and step-by-step cooperation, starting with low-sensitive areas like trade and counter-terrorism before deepening. It values face and tacit agreement over Western majority voting.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bb43f90bed32�body���囚徒困境是两个理性个体各自选择「背叛」虽为个体最优，却导致集体最差结局的博弈。它说明即便合作对所有人更有利，缺乏约束时个体仍有动机搭便车，这正是集体行动困境的核心。�3The prisoner's dilemma is a game where each rational player's dominant choice, to defect, yields a worse collective outcome than mutual cooperation. It shows that even when cooperation benefits all, individuals still have incentives to free-ride without enforcement, the heart of collective-action problems.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�bb5574670d5d�body���官方定价常低于均衡价，导致一票难求，黄牛在二级市场加价出售反映的是真实稀缺。买者愿付高价是因为对特定演出的强烈偏好与转售风险低。这本质是用价格筛选最想看的人。�Official prices are often below the equilibrium price, creating scarcity; scalpers resell at a markup reflecting true rarity. Buyers pay a premium because of strong preference for a specific show and low resale risk. In essence, price screens out those who want it least.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�bb65ff864a45�body���管理侧重计划、组织与控制以维持秩序，领导侧重设定方向、激励与变革以带动人心。优秀组织往往需要两者结合：既要稳健运营，也要有人描绘愿景。二者互补而非互相替代。�	Management focuses on planning, organizing, and controlling to keep order, while leadership sets direction, motivates, and drives change. Good organizations need both: steady operation and someone painting the vision. They complement rather than replace each other.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�bcc081614972�body���刑罚目的大致有四类：报应（让犯罪者“罪有应得”，维护正义与道德秩序）、威慑（阻止本人再犯和他人效仿）、剥夺犯罪能力（监禁使其无法再犯）、改造（通过教育、技能和矫正使其重返社会）。它们有时冲突：报应主张罚当其罪，改造则强调量罪定刑、以复归为本，各国实践在四者之间取舍不同。��Punishment has roughly four purposes: retribution (offenders deserve their fate—justice and moral order), deterrence (stopping the offender and discouraging others), incapacitation (imprisonment removes the ability to offend), and rehabilitation (education, skills, and correction to re-enter society). They sometimes conflict: retribution demands proportionality to the crime, while rehabilitation emphasizes tailoring punishment to the offender's prospects. Different countries weigh the four differently.�ans��src��,H.L.A. 哈特《法律的概念》（1961）�,H.L.A. Hart, “The Concept of Law” (1961)��id�bd341fd4d47e�body�ٺ汉字表意不表音：同一个“水”字，各地读音不同但字形意义相同。书面语因此跨越了语音鸿沟，使广阔地域形成“书同文”的文化共同体。��Characters encode meaning, not sound: the same '水' is read differently yet means water everywhere. Written language thus bridged the sound gap, forming a 'shared script' cultural community across vast regions.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�beb9ca254f18�body��=GDP 是一个国家（或地区）在一定时期内生产的所有最终商品和服务的总市场价值，是衡量经济规模的核心指标。它可以通过生产法、收入法和支出法三种方式核算。GDP 增长常被用作经济景气程度的参考，但它并不反映收入分配或环境质量。�]GDP is the total market value of all final goods and services produced within a country or region over a period, and is a core measure of economic size. It can be calculated by the production, income, or expenditure approach. While GDP growth is used as a gauge of economic activity, it does not capture income distribution or environmental quality.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�befdf2e73207�body�ٺ道德风险发生在交易或投保之后：因为有人替自己承担部分后果，一方变得更冒险，比如买了保险后疏于防范。它源于行为与责任的不匹配。��Moral hazard arises after a deal or insurance: shielded from some consequences, one behaves more recklessly—e.g., taking fewer precautions once insured. It stems from a mismatch between action and accountability.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�bfdfb7defb8b�body���受中国科举与儒家文化圈影响，它们用考试选官以集中皇权、减少门阀，并形成“读书取仕”的共同价值。考试成了东亚官僚社会的标志性机制。��Influenced by China's exam system and the Confucian cultural sphere, they used exams to centralize royal power and curb hereditary clans, sharing the value that study leads to office. Exams became a hallmark of East Asian bureaucracy.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c1120baeb658�body���诺埃勒-诺依曼认为，人们会感知主导舆论并因害怕孤立而隐瞒少数派观点，使主流意见在公开表达中被放大、少数意见进一步沉默，形成自我强化的螺旋。��Noelle-Neumann argued people sense the dominant opinion and, fearing isolation, hide minority views, so the majority view is amplified in public expression while minority views fall further silent—a self-reinforcing spiral.�ans��src��xNoelle-Neumann, E. (1974), 《沉默的螺旋：一种舆论理论》, 传播学期刊 (Journal of Communication), 24(2)�mNoelle-Neumann, E. (1974), The Spiral of Silence: A Theory of Public Opinion, Journal of Communication, 24(2)��id�c191c4b3d385�body�٢指一个人的行为与观念会受周围邻居、社区环境的影响，如邻里重视教育则孩子成绩倾向更好。社区氛围能塑造生活习惯。ٱA person’s behavior and views are shaped by neighbors and local environment—e.g., achievement rises where neighbors value education. Community atmosphere molds daily habits.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c19eef9ea073�body���城市因混凝土、少植被和人为散热，气温常高于周边乡村，这称为“城市热岛效应”，夏季更明显；它加剧用电高峰与健康风险，尤其影响弱势社区。��Cities run hotter than surrounding countryside due to concrete, less vegetation, and human heat—the “urban heat island” effect, peaking in summer; it spikes power demand and health risks, hitting vulnerable neighborhoods hardest.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c1d80c714843�body�٫隐私权保护个人生活安宁与不愿公开的信息不被非法收集散布。手机App频繁索取位置、通讯录，使数据与隐私保护成为日常议题。��Privacy protects personal tranquility and information one does not wish exposed from unlawful collection or disclosure. Apps constantly request location and contacts, making data privacy an everyday issue.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�c20144180ae4�body�ٷ程序正义关注过程是否公平、透明、可参与，而不只看结果；即使结果有利，若过程不公正，公众也会质疑其正当性，削弱对制度的信任。��Procedural justice focuses on whether the process is fair, transparent, and participatory, not just the outcome; even favorable results lose legitimacy if the process is unjust, eroding trust.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c3daf6acb40a�body���城市化把人口从乡村聚到城市，重塑家庭结构、就业与价值观念，常伴随个体化与世俗化。它推动服务业与制度创新，也带来交通、住房与不平等压力。城市是现代社会变迁的核心引擎。�,Urbanization moves population from villages to cities, reshaping family, employment, and values, often toward individualism and secularization. It drives services and institutional innovation yet brings transport, housing, and inequality pressures. Cities are the core engine of modern social change.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�c3e6f3f1832d�body��自然失业率是指经济在充分就业状态下仍存在的失业率，主要由摩擦性失业和结构性失业构成。弗里德曼指出，由于信息不对称、劳动力流动和技能错配，市场总有岗位空缺与求职并存，因此自然失业率不会为零。�=The natural rate of unemployment is the level that persists even when the economy is at full employment, driven by frictional and structural unemployment. Friedman argued that information asymmetry, labour mobility and skill mismatches mean vacancies and job seekers always coexist, so the natural rate is never zero.�ans��src��QFriedman, M. (1968), 《货币政策的作用》, 美国经济评论 (AER), 58(1)�QFriedman, M. (1968), The Role of Monetary Policy, American Economic Review, 58(1)��id�c4c61876b65e�body�ّ约16至17世纪，以哥白尼、伽利略、牛顿等为代表，强调观察、数学与实验，取代了亚里士多德式的自然哲学。ٟRoughly the 16th–17th centuries, led by Copernicus, Galileo, and Newton, it emphasized observation, mathematics, and experiment over Aristotelian philosophy.�ans��src��8Galileo（伽利略），《两种新科学》（1638）�PGalileo Galilei, 'Discorsi e Dimostrazioni Matematiche' (Two New Sciences, 1638)��id�c56341391370�body��i政党聚合利益、提名候选人、制定纲领并组织政府，是连接公民与国家的桥梁。ـParties aggregate interests, nominate candidates, formulate platforms, and organize government, bridging citizens and the state.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c5b150003794�body���东京都市圈依靠密集的轨道交通网、分层级的城市分工和高度集约的土地利用，把数千万人口高效组织起来。高效的通勤系统让远郊居民也能便捷进城工作。它是巨型城市管理的典型案例。�
The Tokyo metropolis organizes tens of millions through a dense rail network, tiered urban division of labor, and highly intensive land use. An efficient commute lets far-suburban residents work in the city center easily. It is a classic case of managing a megacity.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c5f7bc1ece88�body���“第三空间”指家和工作场所以外，人们可以自在停留、自由交往的公共去处，比如咖啡馆、公园、社区图书馆和广场。它们让人走出熟人圈、接触不同的人，是闲聊、偶遇和社区感的温床。社会学家雷·奥登伯格指出，第三空间的减少会让城市人更孤独、社区感更弱，因此重建它们是提升城市生活质量的重要部分。��Third places are public spots beyond home and work where people can linger and mingle freely, such as cafés, parks, community libraries, and squares. They let people step outside their inner circles and meet others, and are breeding grounds for chat, serendipity, and a sense of community. Sociologist Ray Oldenburg argued that their decline makes city dwellers lonelier and communities weaker, so rebuilding them matters for urban quality of life.�ans��src��)《社会学概论》(城市社区研究)�3Introduction to Sociology (urban community studies)��id�c64569275b07�body���大量囚犯刑满后重新犯罪（再犯），表明监狱若只“惩罚”而不干预，成本高且效果有限。监狱内的教育、职业培训、心理治疗，以及出狱后的就业与住房支持能显著降低再犯率，也减少未来监狱开支和社会伤害。而单纯加重刑罚的边际威慑作用有限，因此很多国家转向“循证矫正”，依据实证研究配置矫正资源。��Many released prisoners reoffend, showing that imprisonment that only punishes without intervention is costly and limited in effect. In-prison education, vocational training, psychological treatment, and post-release employment and housing support measurably reduce recidivism while cutting future prison costs and social harm. Since harsher sentences have limited marginal deterrent effect, many countries have shifted to “evidence-based corrections” that allocate programs according to empirical research.�ans��src��IUN（联合国毒品和犯罪问题办公室·犯罪预防相关报告）�&UN (UNODC reports on crime prevention)��id�c6ac66f4e974�body���征信系统记录个人与企业的借贷履约历史，降低放贷机构的信息不对称，使守信者更易获得低息贷款。它用“声誉资本”约束违约行为。缺失征信的市场往往利率高、覆盖窄。�8A credit reporting system records the borrowing and repayment history of individuals and firms, reducing lenders' information asymmetry and helping the creditworthy get cheaper loans. It uses “reputational capital” to deter default. Markets without credit bureaus tend to have high rates and narrow coverage.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c6e3bb1c5e6b�body�ٟ因为大量居民在同一时段从居住地前往工作区，造成“潮汐式”通勤。职住分离与集中上班时间叠加，使高峰运力紧张。٫Many residents travel from homes to workplaces at the same hour, creating “tidal” commuting. Job-housing separation plus synchronized work hours strains peak capacity.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�c769c3c5a808�body��“柠檬市场”是阿克洛夫提出的二手车市场模型：卖方比买方更清楚车况，劣质车（“柠檬”）把优质车挤出市场，最终市场充斥次品。这揭示信息不对称会摧毁市场。解决之道是担保、认证与信誉机制。�-The “market for lemons” is Akerlof's used-car model: sellers know more about quality than buyers, so bad cars (“lemons”) drive out good ones, leaving the market full of inferior goods. It shows information asymmetry can destroy a market. Warranties, certification, and reputation are remedies.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c9e8fd8a2bb6�body���组织文化是团队共享的价值观、信念与行为习惯，常体现在仪式、语言和做事方式中，非正式却深刻影响绩效。强文化能凝聚人心，也可能阻碍变革。它不像规章那样写明白，却“无处不在”。�Organizational culture is the shared values, beliefs, and habits of a team, shown in rituals, language, and ways of working; informal yet deeply affecting performance. A strong culture unites people but may resist change. It is not written like rules yet is “everywhere.”�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�cc1538e0e73d�body��}司法独立指法官审理案件时只依据法律和事实作出裁判，不受行政机关、立法机关或权势个人不当干涉。只有当人们相信判决看的是法律而非关系和权力，才愿意通过诉讼解决纠纷，而不是自行报复。独立还使法院能够审查政府行为是否合法，这是保护个人权利、约束公权力的重要机制。��Judicial independence means judges decide cases according to law and facts, free from improper interference by the executive, legislature, or powerful individuals. Only when people believe verdicts follow law rather than connections or power will they settle disputes in court instead of taking revenge. Independence also lets courts review whether government acts are lawful, a key mechanism for protecting rights and restraining power.�ans��src��D世界正义工程(World Justice Project)《法治指数》方法论�4World Justice Project, Rule of Law Index methodology��id�cc5586997f69�body�٢银行或兑换机构靠买卖价差（点差）赚取服务费，所以同一时刻买入外币价低、卖出价高。这是金融机构的正常盈利方式。ٜBanks and exchanges earn a service fee from the spread, so at any moment they buy foreign currency low and sell it high. This spread is their normal profit.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ce306c14c05f�body���郡县制由中央直接任命地方官、收税调兵，官员不世袭；分封制则把土地与权力交给诸侯世袭。郡县让中央更强、地方更难割据，适合大一统帝国治理。��The commandery-county system had centrally appointed, non-hereditary local officials who collected tax and troops; enfeoffment gave land and power to hereditary lords. Commanderies strengthened the center and reduced warlordism, suiting a unified empire.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ce423a27ec24�body�ٱ信用是个人履约还债的记录与能力，按时还款积累良好信用，能降低未来借贷成本。逾期会留下不良记录，影响贷款、租房甚至求职。ٹCredit is your record and ability to repay debts. Paying on time builds a good score that lowers future borrowing costs; defaults leave a bad record affecting loans, rentals, even jobs.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d32d717c21f3�body�٥克里斯坦森指新进入者以更简单廉价的方案从低端或新市场切入，逐步取代主流，而非在原有维度上竞争，称为颠覆式创新。٥Christensen: entrants start with simpler, cheaper offerings at the low end or new markets, then overtake incumbents—disruptive innovation, not head-on competition.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d4931515e374�body���治理绩效指政府实际解决问题的能力，如经济增长、公共服务与危机应对，而非制度形式本身。有些国家形式民主但绩效不佳，说明制度需与能力配套。民众满意度常随绩效波动。�#Governance performance is a government's actual problem-solving capacity—economic growth, public services, crisis response—not merely its institutional form. Some formally democratic states perform poorly, showing institutions need capacity. Public satisfaction often tracks performance.�ans��src��4World Bank（《治理与发展》等治理研究）�GWorld Bank (Governance and Development and related governance research)��id�d5f06ea56bc2�body��1845年起马铃薯病害导致爱尔兰大饥荒，依赖单一主食的穷人大量饿死。幸存者为求生涌向美洲和英国，仅数十年间数百万人离开家园。它深刻改变了爱尔兰的人口结构并塑造了海外爱尔兰裔社群。�/From 1845 a potato blight caused the Irish Famine, killing huge numbers of poor people who relied on that single staple. Survivors fled to the Americas and Britain, with millions leaving over just a few decades. It profoundly changed Ireland's population structure and shaped overseas Irish communities.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�d6065ed95304�body��"主要看三个维度：竞争性（执政者是否通过自由公正的选举竞争上岗、能否和平轮替）、参与（公民能否广泛平等地参与决策和表达）、问责（统治者是否受法律、议会、媒体和定期选举约束）。威权体制并非铁板一块，可分为军人政权、一党制、君主制、个人独裁等；不少“混合体制”兼有选举形式和威权实质。比较时还须注意经济发展水平与社会结构对两类体制的绩效和稳定都有影响，不能简单二分评价。��Comparison typically rests on three dimensions: contestation (whether rulers gain power through free and fair elections and peaceful alternation), participation (whether citizens broadly and equally take part in decision-making and expression), and accountability (whether rulers are bound by law, parliaments, media, and periodic elections). Authoritarianism is not monolithic—it ranges from military regimes, one-party systems, and monarchies to personal dictatorship; many “hybrid regimes” combine electoral form with authoritarian substance. Comparison should also note that development level and social structure shape the performance and stability of both types, so simple binary judgments are misleading.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d63125fb3559�body��|语言承载独特的世界观与知识，其灭绝会丢失文化记忆；全球约7000种语言中多数正面临萎缩。قLanguages encode distinct worldviews and knowledge; their loss erases cultural memory—of some 7,000 tongues, most are shrinking.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d679ebb93e67�body���征调民夫、劳役繁重曾造成大量伤亡与社会痛苦（高代价）；但它长期保障了都城供给、平抑粮价、促进南北交流（高收益）。代价由底层承担、收益由政权与商人共享，因此评价分歧。�Mass conscription caused huge hardship and death (high cost), yet it long secured the capital's supply, stabilized grain prices and linked north and south (high benefit). Costs fell on the poor while benefits went to the state and merchants, so views differ.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d8b8d2e7b670�body��u数字鸿沟指不同群体在接入与使用数字技术上的差距，加剧教育、就业与信息的不平等。لThe digital divide is the gap in access to and use of digital technology, widening inequalities in education, jobs, and information.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�dcf0134d812f�body���实证研究发现犯罪并非均匀分布，而是高度集中于少数“热点”地点和时间——少数街道、路口贡献了大部分警情。热点警务据此把有限警力集中投向这些高发地点，随机实验和准实验评估显示，此举能在不大规模扩张警力的情况下显著减少该区域犯罪，且一般无明显犯罪“转移”效应。它体现了“用证据决定警力投向”的问题导向理念。��Empirical research shows crime is not evenly distributed but concentrated in a few “hot spots”—a small number of streets or intersections account for most incidents. Hot-spots policing concentrates limited patrols on these high-crime locations; randomized and quasi-experimental evaluations find it significantly reduces crime there without large police expansions and generally without major displacement. It embodies the problem-oriented principle of allocating police resources by evidence.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�dd7daba0084b�body���该税由 OECD 主导的「双支柱」方案推动，旨在遏制各国为吸引跨国企业而竞相降低税率的「逐底竞争」。它对跨国集团境外利润设定 15% 最低有效税率，母国可对低税地利润补足征税。�Driven by the OECD's two-pillar plan, the 15% minimum tax curbs the race to the bottom in which countries cut rates to attract multinationals. It sets a 15% effective minimum on foreign profits, letting the parent country top up tax on income booked in low-tax jurisdictions.�ans��src�ٓPerez-Navarro,《Guest Editorial: What Does Pillar Two’s Global Minimum Tax Mean for Tax Incentives?》,Intertax,2023 (DOI: 10.54648/taxi2023017)ّPerez-Navarro, 'Guest Editorial: What Does Pillar Two’s Global Minimum Tax Mean for Tax Incentives?', Intertax, 2023, DOI: 10.54648/taxi2023017��id�dddf96845f7f�body�ٺ正当防卫指对正在进行的不法侵害采取制止行为，不负刑事责任，但需针对不法侵害且不过度。明显超过必要限度造成重大损害属防卫过当。��Justifiable defense is stopping an ongoing unlawful attack; it bears no criminal liability but must target the attack and not exceed necessity. Clearly excessive force causing grave harm is over-defense.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�de296702bb87�body���两股力量同时在发生。好莱坞电影、流行音乐、快餐和全球品牌让各国年轻一代共享大量相同符号，这是“同质化”的一面；但不同地区会在吸收外来文化时进行本地化改造，比如把西式食材做成当地风味，同时地方文化借助网络获得全球观众，文化组合反而更加多样。学者常用“混合化”来描述这种既有趋同又有创新的复杂过程。��Both forces are at work at once. Hollywood films, pop music, fast food, and global brands give young people everywhere many shared symbols, the homogenizing side. But regions adapt imported culture locally, such as turning Western ingredients into local dishes, and local cultures gain global audiences online, so cultural combinations multiply. Scholars describe this as hybridization: convergence and creativity intertwined.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�de744f0ad128�body���经济发展、个体表达与跨地域通婚使仪式从单一民俗走向个性化（旅行结婚、简约仪式等）。礼仪变迁反映价值观从“宗族展示”转向“自我叙事”。��Economic growth, self-expression, and cross-region marriage move rites from single folk forms to personalized ones (destination, minimalist). Etiquette change reflects a shift from “clan display” to “self narrative.”�ans��src��|Andrew J. Cherlin, "The Deinstitutionalization of American Marriage", Journal of Marriage and Family, 2004, 66(4): 848–861�{Andrew J. Cherlin, The Deinstitutionalization of American Marriage, Journal of Marriage and Family 66(4), 2004, pp. 848-861��id�e0b49c76234d�body�٫指一国达到中等收入水平后，因难以从低成本制造转向高附加值创新而增长停滞。突破依赖技术进步、制度质量与人力资本升级。��A country stagnates after reaching middle income when it can’t shift from low-cost manufacturing to high-value innovation; escape needs technological progress, institutions, and human-capital upgrading.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e2427260f2c4�body�٢考勤是管理出勤与工时的最直接方式，便于核算工资与纪律。但它只衡量“在场”，未必反映产出，近年被弹性考核挑战。��Attendance is the most direct way to manage presence and work hours for payroll and discipline. But it only measures “being there,” not output, and faces challenges from flexible assessment.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e2848109a1a7�body���制度是约束人们行为的规则体系，包括法律、产权保护、契约执行、政治体制和反腐败机制。好的制度——产权受保护、合同可执行、腐败少——让人敢于投资、创新和合作，经济就能长期增长；坏的制度即使资源丰富也会被浪费。诺斯等经济学家由此把“制度是长期增长的深层原因”作为制度经济学的核心结论，很多国家之间的贫富差距也由此得到解释。�+Institutions are the rule systems constraining behavior, including laws, property protection, contract enforcement, political systems, and anti-corruption mechanisms. Good institutions, where property is protected, contracts enforced, and corruption low, make people willing to invest, innovate, and cooperate, sustaining long-run growth; bad institutions waste even abundant resources. Douglass North and others made institutions as the deep cause of long-run growth the core of institutional economics, explaining much of the wealth gap between nations.�ans��src��iLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny,《Law and Finance》(Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)�gLa Porta, Lopez-de-Silanes, Shleifer & Vishny, 'Law and Finance' (Journal of Financial Economics, 1998)��id�e2afb8b57252�body���14世纪中期的黑死病在数年内夺走欧洲约三分之一到一半的人口。劳动力骤减推高了工资、削弱了封建农奴制，并间接催化了社会经济变迁。它是中世纪人口史的重大转折点。�The mid-14th-century Black Death killed roughly one-third to half of Europe's population within a few years. The sudden labor shortage raised wages, weakened feudal serfdom, and indirectly spurred socioeconomic change. It was a major turning point in medieval population history.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�e33c7d8d8a42�body�ٱ城乡差距指城市与乡村在收入、公共服务、基础设施和教育机会上的系统性差异，普遍存在于很多国家，并影响人口流动与社会公平。ٿThe urban-rural gap is the systematic difference between cities and countryside in income, public services, infrastructure, and education, common worldwide and affecting migration and equity.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�e4d41abb08d4�body���凡勃伦在《有闲阶级论》中指出，炫耀性消费是通过公开挥霍商品来彰显社会地位而非满足效用。它揭示消费的符号维度：商品成为阶层区隔的符号。��In The Theory of the Leisure Class, Veblen describes conspicuous consumption as publicly wasting goods to signal social status rather than satisfy utility. It reveals the symbolic dimension: goods become markers of class distinction.�ans��src��3Veblen, T. (1899), 《有闲阶级论》, Macmillan�=Veblen, T. (1899), The Theory of the Leisure Class, Macmillan��id�e5544d1c8d4b�body���消费文化提供用以表达「我是谁」的风格符号，个体通过品牌与品味选择建构身份。社会学研究指出这既赋予表达自由，也加深了以消费划分的阶层边界。��Consumer culture supplies style-signs for expressing who I am, and individuals build identity through brand and taste choices. Sociology notes this grants expressive freedom yet deepens class boundaries drawn by consumption.�ans��src��ABaudrillard, J. (1970), 《消费社会》, 加利马尔出版社�ABaudrillard, J. (1970), The Consumer Society, Éditions Gallimard��id�e5549cdb8e20�body�٨礼物是关系的“证据”：它制造人情与亏欠，绑定双方未来互帮。人类学家莫斯指出，礼物往往附带“必须回礼”的社会义务。ٛA gift is proof of a tie: it creates favor and obligation, binding future mutual help. Anthropologist Mauss noted gifts carry a social duty to reciprocate.�ans��src��"莫斯《礼物》(The Gift, 1925)�Marcel Mauss, The Gift (1925)��id�e758d103c723�body�ٺ普遍管辖权允许任何国家对严重危害人类罪等提起诉讼，不论发生地。实践中受政治意愿、证据获取与外交阻力限制，且常与主权原则冲突。٨Universal jurisdiction lets any state prosecute grave crimes like genocide regardless of where committed; limited by political will, evidence, and sovereignty tensions.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e7b906faa585�body�ٰ同一事实以不同方式表述（如“存活率”vs“死亡率”）会改变选择，框架效应揭示偏好并非稳定，对调查与政策沟通设计至关重要。ٙThe same fact framed differently (survival vs mortality rate) shifts choices; framing reveals unstable preferences, crucial for survey and policy design.�ans��src��[UN DESA,《Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses Rev.3》,2017�:UN DESA, Census Principles and Recommendations Rev.3, 2017��id�ead10b618fc6�body���绝对贫困看能否满足吃穿住行等基本生存，相对贫困看是否显著低于社会平均水平、被主流生活排斥。富裕社会更关注相对贫困，因它关系社会包容。两者政策含义不同。�Absolute poverty checks basic survival—food, clothing, shelter; relative poverty checks being markedly below the social average and excluded from mainstream life. Wealthy societies focus more on relative poverty as it bears on inclusion. Their policy implications differ.�ans��src��C世界银行 (2022), 《贫困与共享繁荣 2022》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2022), Poverty and Shared Prosperity 2022��id�eade3ddfa666�body�ٖ世界上最早使用的纸币是中国北宋时期的“交子”，出现在四川，便于大宗交易携带。它比欧洲纸币早约六百年。ٴThe world’s first paper money was China’s “Jiaozi” of the Northern Song dynasty in Sichuan, easing bulk-trade carriage. It predated European paper notes by about 600 years.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�eae7990f7773�body�٫污染设施与气候风险常不成比例地落在低收入与少数族裔社区，环境不平等与阶层、种族叠加，催生环境正义运动要求公平负担。��Polluting facilities and climate risk fall disproportionately on low-income and minority communities, entwining environmental inequality with class and race, fueling environmental-justice demands.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ec65569c75b7�body��l紧凑城市主张高密度、混合用途与公交导向开发，以减少通勤与能耗、保护绿地。مA compact city promotes high density, mixed use, and transit-oriented development to cut commuting, energy, and preserve green space.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ed12d4cf2ed4�body���莫斯考察波利尼西亚等地指出，礼物并非自由赠予，而是「馈赠—接受—回赠」的循环义务。通过迫使受礼者回报，交换维系了人、物与群体之间的持续纽带与相互依赖。��Surveying Polynesia and beyond, Mauss argues gifts are not free but part of a cycle of give, receive, and return. By compelling reciprocation, exchange sustains ongoing bonds of mutual dependence among persons, things, and groups.�ans��src��"莫斯《礼物》(The Gift, 1925)�Marcel Mauss, The Gift (1925)��id�ed36b7c52e26�body���代际弹性（IGE）与代际相关系数度量父代与子代收入关联。盖茨比曲线显示一国收入越不平等，代际流动性越低，暗示高不平等会固化机会结构。�Intergenerational elasticity (IGE) and correlation coefficients measure the link between parents' and children's income. The Great Gatsby Curve shows that countries with higher income inequality tend to have lower mobility, suggesting inequality entrenches opportunity structures.�ans��src��QOECD (2018), 《失灵的上升阶梯？如何促进社会流动》, 经合组织�EOECD (2018), A Broken Social Elevator? How to Promote Social Mobility��id�efac7c4fa75a�body���搭便车指某些人享受集体提供的好处却不出力或不付费，比如不出钱却用公共路灯。因为个人不付成本也能获益，公共物品常面临供给不足。这解释了为何许多公益需要强制或激励。�Free riding means some enjoy a collective benefit without contributing or paying, like using public streetlights without funding them. Because one gains without paying, public goods tend to be under-supplied. This explains why many public goods need compulsion or incentives.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f029ab4f9f95�body��公共品同时具有非排他性（难以排除他人使用）与非竞争性（一人使用不减少他人可得）。国防与灯塔是典型，而面包等私人物品则二者皆具对立属性，因此市场能自行供给后者却不愿供给前者。٧Public goods are both non-excludable and non-rival, while private goods like bread are rival and excludable, so markets supply the latter but under-provide the former.�ans��src��5萨缪尔森《公共支出的纯理论》(1954, AER)�CPaul Samuelson, 'The Pure Theory of Public Expenditure' (1954, AER)��id�f043cbf2d046�body��国际法由国家间条约与习惯构成，缺少世界政府强制执行，主要依靠国家同意、互惠、声誉与多边机构施压来落实。违反者可能面临制裁或外交孤立。它虽弱于国内法，却支撑着贸易、人权与和平秩序。�DInternational law consists of treaties and customs among states; lacking a world government to enforce it, it relies on consent, reciprocity, reputation, and pressure from multilateral bodies. Violators may face sanctions or diplomatic isolation. Though weaker than domestic law, it underpins trade, human rights, and peace.�ans��src��C联合国国际法院（ICJ）规约；《罗马规约》（1998）�'Statute of the ICJ; Rome Statute (1998)��id�f2e9b759b5be�body��L普通风险是单个机构的损失风险，可由分散化管理；系统性风险是某机构或市场失灵通过传染链条拖垮整个金融体系的危险。银行间借贷、共同资产持有、支付链和信心外溢使风险相互缠绕——单个银行看似稳健，但若所有银行同时依赖同一类融资或资产，集体上就是脆弱的。危机时，每个机构“抛售资产自保”的理性行为反而压低资产价格、恶化彼此处境。因此宏观审慎监管（压力测试、逆周期资本、杠杆上限）着眼于体系而非单家机构。��Ordinary risk is loss risk at a single institution, manageable through diversification; systemic risk is the danger that one institution's or market's failure topples the whole system through contagion. Interbank lending, common asset holdings, payment chains, and confidence spillovers entangle risks—each bank may look sound, yet if all rely on the same funding or assets, they are collectively fragile. Also, in a crisis each institution rationally selling assets to protect itself pushes prices down and worsens everyone's position. Macroprudential regulation (stress tests, countercyclical capital, leverage limits) therefore targets the system, not individual firms.�ans��src��'IMF（《全球金融稳定报告》）�'IMF (Global Financial Stability Report)��id�f370286fa176�body���基尼系数衡量收入分配的不平等程度，范围从 0（完全平等）到 1（完全不平等）。世界银行常用其跨国比较收入差异，值在 0.3 以下通常视为较平等，0.5 以上视为高度不平等。��The Gini coefficient measures income inequality, ranging from 0 (perfect equality) to 1 (perfect inequality). The World Bank uses it for cross-country comparison; below 0.3 is often seen as relatively equal, above 0.5 as highly unequal.�ans��src��C世界银行 (2020), 《贫困与共享繁荣 2020》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2020), Poverty and Shared Prosperity 2020��id�f53a8c819343�body���疫苗让接种者获得免疫力，同时降低病原体在人群中传播的概率，周围人也因此受益，这就是“正外部性”——你的行为给别人带来了额外的好处。因为个人决策时不会把自己带给别人的好处算进去，单靠市场时接种率会偏低，所以政府常通过补贴、免费接种甚至强制政策来提高覆盖率，直到形成“群体免疫”。�hVaccination gives you immunity and also lowers how easily the pathogen spreads to others, a positive externality, where your action benefits people beyond yourself. Since individuals don't count the benefits they confer on others when deciding, market outcomes leave vaccination too low, which is why governments subsidize or mandate it to reach herd immunity.�ans��src��/《经济学原理》(曼昆)（外部性章）�7Principles of Economics (Mankiw), externalities chapter��id�f62291f1786f�body���平台治理要在言论自由与公共安全、隐私、未成年人保护之间平衡。审核过严会压制合法表达、打击用户参与；过松则虚假信息、仇恨言论、诈骗和有害内容泛滥。由于内容规模巨大，平台依赖算法预筛加人工复核，而算法存在误判（误删、漏删）和文化语境盲区，加上对漏删的谴责往往强于对误删的关注，任何规则都难以两边讨好。�Platform governance balances free expression against public safety, privacy, and child protection. Over-moderation suppresses legitimate speech and participation; under-moderation lets misinformation, hate speech, scams, and harmful content flourish. Because content volume is enormous, platforms rely on algorithmic pre-filtering plus human review, and algorithms misjudge (over- and under-removal) and miss cultural context; blame for under-removal also tends to outweigh attention to over-removal, so no rule pleases both sides.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f70633b3db20�body���规模经济指产量扩大时平均成本下降的现象，源于固定成本摊薄与专业化分工。汽车制造、芯片生产都依赖大规模生产降低成本。但规模过大也可能出现“规模不经济”。�␀Economies of scale occur when average cost falls as output expands, due to spreading fixed costs and specialization. Car manufacturing and chip production rely on large-scale output to cut costs. But oversized scale can lead to “diseconomies of scale.”�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f852508c67dd�body��u高语境文化中含义多藏于关系与情境；低语境文化则依赖明确言辞，如美、德相对东亚。ٓHigh-context cultures embed meaning in relationships and situation; low-context ones rely on explicit words, as in the US/Germany versus East Asia.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f9937cb25e4c�body���回声室效应指人们只接触与自己观点一致的信息，看法在封闭圈子里被不断强化，难见异见。社交媒体算法常加剧它。它使公共讨论极化、共识更难达成。��The echo chamber effect is when people encounter only information matching their views, reinforcing opinions in a closed loop with little dissent. Social-media algorithms often worsen it. It polarizes public discussion and makes consensus harder.�ans��src��NStephen Sunstein,《#Republic: Divide and Conquer》Yale University Press,2017�OStephen C. Sunstein, #Republic: Divide and Conquer, Yale University Press, 2017��id�f9d0576d9d88�body���法治要求政府自身也受法律约束，法律面前权力可被审议与制约，保障个人权利。以法治国则仅把法律当作统治工具，权力高于法律、可随意立法施政。��The rule of law binds the government itself to law, subjecting power to review and constraint while protecting individual rights. Rule by law merely uses law as an instrument of rule, with power above the law and free to legislate at will.�ans��src��D世界正义工程(World Justice Project)《法治指数》方法论�4World Justice Project, Rule of Law Index methodology��id�f9d9be30571b�body���媒介事件指由媒体预先策划并大规模直播的仪式性盛事，如奥运会、国葬，凝聚全国乃至全球注意力。它塑造集体记忆与身份认同。戴扬与卡茨系统阐述了这一概念。��A media event is a ritualized spectacle pre-planned and broadcast live by media—like the Olympics or a state funeral—that concentrates national or global attention. It shapes collective memory and identity. Dayan and Katz formalized the concept.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�fadd78dbfa3a�body�ٷ随机抽样让每个对象有已知且非零的入选机会，结果可推广；方便抽样只找容易接触的人（如街头路人），便宜但容易偏差、难代表总体。ټRandom sampling gives every unit a known, non-zero chance, so results generalize; convenience sampling grabs easy-to-reach people (e.g., passersby)—cheap but biased and unrepresentative.�ans��src��[UN DESA,《Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses Rev.3》,2017�:UN DESA, Census Principles and Recommendations Rev.3, 2017��id�fb7fc2012c6c�body���主要是因为养育成本上升和观念变化：养孩子需要大量时间和金钱，女性教育水平提高后更多投入事业，社会保障让“养儿防老”不再必要，避孕普及也使人能自主决定生育的数量和时机。经济越发达，出生率往往越低，这是全球普遍趋势——许多国家的总和生育率已低于维持人口所需的2.1左右。��Mainly because the costs of raising children have risen and values have changed: kids demand time and money, better-educated women increasingly pursue careers, social security removes the need for children as old-age insurance, and contraception lets people decide whether and when to have them. Richer economies tend to have lower birth rates, a global trend, with many countries' total fertility now below the roughly 2.1 needed to sustain population.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�fc428ba609d9�body��#双语教育可指用两种语言授课，常见形式包括过渡型（先用母语再转主流语）、维持型（同时保留母语）和沉浸式（以少数语言为主环境）。选择哪种常涉及文化认同与平等议题。研究表明早期双语多有益于认知灵活性。�WBilingual education teaches through two languages; common forms include transitional (mother tongue then shift to majority language), maintenance (keep mother tongue), and immersion (minority language as the main environment). The choice involves cultural identity and equality. Research suggests early bilingualism aids cognitive flexibility.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fce845fbacb1�body��数据权利指个人对其被采集、存储和处理的数据所享有的控制与受益权，通常包括知情权、访问权、更正权和被遗忘权（删除权）。欧盟《通用数据保护条例》（GDPR）将这些权利制度化，要求数据处理以同意为基础。�DData rights refer to individuals' entitlements to control and benefit from data collected, stored, and processed about them, typically including the right to be informed, to access, to rectify, and to be forgotten. The EU's General Data Protection Regulation codifies these rights and makes consent the basis for processing.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�fd6e1ad0859c�body�� 长城不只是军事屏障。它也是一条“边境线”：设有关卡管理贸易、收税、控制人员往来，烽燧系统兼具通信功能。修墙与驻军带动了沿线屯田、物资运输和人口聚集，催生了边贸城镇。它还是国家权力与疆域的象征。��The Great Wall was more than a military barrier. It also served as a border line: its passes regulated trade, collected taxes, and controlled movement, while its beacon towers formed a communication network. Building and garrisoning it spurred farming, supply transport, and settlement along the frontier, giving rise to border trading towns. It was also a symbol of state power and territory.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�fecb5cd5232b�body���从众消费指人们因看到他人购买或商家销量数据而跟随购买，而非基于自身需求判断。它源于社会证明心理和不想错过的焦虑（FOMO），在社交媒体时代更明显。��Herd consumption means people buy because others do or because of displayed sales numbers, rather than their own needs. It stems from social-proof psychology and fear of missing out (FOMO), amplified by social media.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�soc_19_002�body���斯塔克与芬凯把宗教组织视为竞争市场中的供给方:在管制少、教派林立的环境里,各团体必须提升讲道质量、社群纽带与服务才能争取信众,总体参与率随之走高;国教垄断则滋生惰怠供给,参与趋于低迷。两人据此主张美国的高度虔诚与欧洲的冷清源于制度环境差异,而非现代性本身侵蚀信仰。批评者反驳称,北欧同样允许竞争却依旧世俗,可见需求侧因素不可省略。�!Stark and Finke treat religious bodies as suppliers in a competitive market: where regulation is light and denominations abound, groups must improve preaching, community bonds, and services to attract adherents, lifting aggregate participation; monopoly churches breed complacent supply and low attendance. On this view American devoutness and European apathy reflect institutional environments rather than modernity eroding belief. Critics counter that Scandinavia allows competition yet stays secular, so demand-side factors cannot be omitted.�ans��src���罗德尼·斯塔克、罗杰·芬凯《信仰的行为:宗教的人性面》(加州大学出版社,2000);罗杰·芬凯、劳伦斯·伊安纳康〈宗教变迁的供给侧解释〉,《宗教学科学期刊》第32卷第3期(1993)�Rodney Stark and Roger Finke, Acts of Faith: Explaining the Human Side of Religion (University of California Press, 2000); Roger Finke and Laurence R. Iannaccone, 'Supply-Side Explanations for Religious Change', Journal for the Scientific Study of Religion 32(3), 1993��id�soc_19_005�body���埃利希认为维系社会秩序的规则大多生长于家庭、商贩往来、行会与协会等联合体内部,人们依此行事却极少翻阅法典,他把这部分内生规范称作活法;国家颁行的条文仅在纠纷诉诸法庭时才直接登场。因此法律社会学的一手材料应是契约实践、组织章程与行业惯例,而非立法文本本身。这一立场孕育了此后的法律多元主义与法社会功能主义脉络。�
Ehrlich held that most rules sustaining social order arise inside families, trade, guilds, and associations; people live by these endogenous norms while rarely consulting statutes, and he named them living law. Enacted provisions step forward chiefly when disputes reach the courts. The primary materials for legal sociology are therefore contracting practice, organizational charters, and occupational custom rather than legislative texts, a stance that seeded later legal pluralism and functionalist sociolegal research.�ans��src��z欧根·埃利希《法社会学基本原理》,1913年德文初版,沃尔特·莫尔英译本(哈佛大学出版社,1936)وEugen Ehrlich, Fundamental Principles of the Sociology of Law, trans. Walter Moll (Harvard University Press, 1936; German original 1913)��id�soc_19_008�body���先行移民依托亲缘与乡籍纽带,为后来者提供落脚处、岗位线索与路费周转,使每次迁移的成本和风险随网络扩张而递减。当迁徙沉淀为社区内部约定俗成的人生阶段,流动便获得自我维持的动能,不再单纯听命于两地收入差。这种滞后性既解释了限制政策为何见效迟缓,也说明切断既有网络比调整工资信号艰难得多。��Earlier migrants pass lodging leads, job contacts, and travel funds to successors through kin and hometown ties, so each trip costs less and risks less as the web widens. Once movement settles into a routine life stage within sending communities, it acquires self-sustaining momentum no longer governed purely by income differentials. This hysteresis explains why restrictionist policies bite slowly and why severing existing networks proves far harder than tweaking wage signals.�ans��src���道格拉斯·梅西等〈国际移民理论:回顾与评估〉,《人口与发展评论》第19卷第3期(1993);迈克尔·皮奥雷《过客鸟:西印度工人与大都市工业》(剑桥大学出版社,1979)��Douglas S. Massey et al., 'Theories of International Migration: A Review and Appraisal', Population and Development Review 19(3), 1993; Michael J. Piore, Birds of Passage: Migrant Labor and Industrial Societies (Cambridge University Press, 1979)��id�soc_19_012�body��Q公有性规范要求研究者及时公开发表成果,并放弃对知识本身的所有权,以此换取科学共同体的承认。发现一经发表便进入公共知识库,他人可以自由地在之上继续建构。命名权和引用量成为主要的奖励形式,默顿称这种以承认为报酬的安排是科学的货币体系。��The norm of communalism requires researchers to publish promptly and surrender ownership claims over the knowledge itself in exchange for recognition by the scientific community. Once published, a finding joins the common stock on which anyone may freely build. Eponymy and citation serve as the chief rewards, and Merton described this arrangement as a system in which recognition functions as scientific currency.�ans��src��f罗伯特·金·默顿《科学社会学:理论与经验研究》,芝加哥大学出版社 1973 年版�wRobert K. Merton, The Sociology of Science: Theoretical and Empirical Investigations, University of Chicago Press, 1973��id�soc_19_018�body��Y贝拉识别出一套以建国文献为经典、以独立与内战等事件为神圣叙事的公共信仰体系。它不从属任何宗派,而是在就职典礼、阵亡将士纪念等国族仪式中表述共同体的集体自我理解。二者差别在于:公民宗教的成员资格就是公民身份,其殿堂是公共领域而非礼拜堂。��Bellah discerned a public creed whose canon consists of founding documents and whose sacred narrative moves from independence through civil war. Attached to no denomination, it voices the community's collective self-understanding during inaugurations, war memorials, and similar national rites. The contrast is sharp: membership in civil religion coincides with citizenship, and its sanctuary is the public sphere rather than the chapel.�ans��src��Y罗伯特·贝拉论文《美国的公民宗教》,载 Daedalus 杂志 1967 年第 96 卷�DRobert N. Bellah, Civil Religion in America, Daedalus, vol. 96, 1967��id�soc_20_002�body���作为资产，住房承载财富积累、代际转移与信贷抵押功能；作为居所，它是基本需要的满足物和归属感的物质基础。金融化使越来越多主体把住房当作收益来源，房价上涨因此同时意味着有房者增值和无房者被排斥。政府既要维护业主的资产价值，又要保障居住权利，两种目标难以兼得，政策便在供给补贴、租金管制与社会住宅之间反复摇摆。��As an asset, housing carries wealth accumulation, intergenerational transfer, and collateral functions; as a home, it meets basic needs and grounds belonging. Financialization turns housing ever more into a revenue stream, so price growth simultaneously enriches owners and excludes non-owners. States must protect owners' asset values while securing the right to dwell, two goals that conflict, which is why policy oscillates among supply subsidies, rent regulation, and social housing.�ans��src�٭Manuel B. Aalbers, "The financialization of home and the mortgage market crisis" 与其专著 The Financialization of Housing: A Political Economy Approach (Routledge, 2016)�nManuel B. Aalbers, The Financialization of Housing: A Political Economy Approach (Routledge, 2016), esp. intro��id�soc_20_005�body���去制度化指婚姻作为现成规范脚本的力量衰弱：同居、离婚、婚外生育等过去被视为越轨的安排如今成了可接受的个人选项。伴侣关系的正当性不再来自角色义务，而取决于关系本身能否带来成长、亲密与自我实现，因而需要双方持续协商来维系。其结果是，婚姻从成年的必经门槛变成一种需要论证的“成就”，其稳定性也更依赖于关系质量而非外部规范。�[Deinstitutionalization refers to the weakening of marriage as a ready-made normative script: cohabitation, divorce, and out-of-wedlock childbearing have shifted from deviant arrangements to acceptable personal choices. A couple's bond now derives legitimacy less from role obligations than from whether the relationship delivers growth, intimacy, and self-fulfillment, so it must be sustained through ongoing negotiation. Marriage consequently becomes an achievement to be justified rather than a compulsory rite of adulthood, and its stability rests more on relationship quality than on external norms.�ans��src��|Andrew J. Cherlin, "The Deinstitutionalization of American Marriage", Journal of Marriage and Family, 2004, 66(4): 848–861�{Andrew J. Cherlin, The Deinstitutionalization of American Marriage, Journal of Marriage and Family 66(4), 2004, pp. 848-861��id�soc_20_008�body���蒂利指出,欧洲体系内持续的生存竞争迫使统治者不断征税、招募常备军并削平地方割据,军事化进程由此与资本积累交织,催生出集权而专业的现代国家。“战争制造国家”强调的不是个别战事的偶然结果,而是地缘竞争作为结构性筛选机制,只让能有效动员资源并垄断合法暴力的政体存续下去。各地区在强制与资本结合方式上的差异,进一步解释了民族国家路径的分化。�)Tilly shows that relentless geopolitical competition forced European rulers to tax, build standing armies, and crush local rivals, weaving war-making together with capital accumulation into centralized, professional states. 'War made the state' means not that any single battle was decisive, but that interstate rivalry worked as a structural filter, letting survive only those polities able to mobilize resources and monopolize violence. Divergent regional combinations of coercion and capital then explain why paths toward the national state differed.�ans��src���查尔斯·蒂利:《强制、资本和欧洲国家(公元990—1992年)》,上海人民出版社,2007 ; 另见: Charles Tilly, Coercion, Capital, and European States, AD 990–1992, Blackwell, 1990��Charles Tilly, Coercion, Capital, and European States, AD 990–1992, Blackwell, 1990 ; see also: 查尔斯·蒂利:《强制、资本和欧洲国家(公元990—1992年)》,上海人民出版社,2007��id�soc_20_012�body���社会学家查尔斯·蒂利把社会运动界定为围绕共同诉求展开的持续性集体挑战,通过集会、请愿与公开声明向权力方施压。个体声音容易被忽视或压制,而集体行动能汇聚资源、制造政治压力并把议题送入公共议程。运动的成败还取决于政治机会结构与参与者之间的信任网络,这解释了相似的怨愤为何在不同时机会产生截然不同的动员效果。�Sociologist Charles Tilly defined social movements as sustained collective challenges built around common claims, pressuring powerholders through assemblies, petitions, and public statements. A lone voice is easily ignored or suppressed, whereas collective action pools resources, creates political pressure, and moves issues onto the public agenda. Movement outcomes also hinge on political opportunity structures and trust networks among participants, which is why similar grievances mobilize very differently at different moments.�ans��src��KCharles Tilly, Social Movements, 1768-2004, Paradigm Publishers, 2004年。�FCharles Tilly, Social Movements, 1768-2004, Paradigm Publishers, 2004.��id�soc_20_015�body���费孝通在《乡土中国》中以石子入水激起波纹作比,指出中国乡村的关系以己为中心、按亲疏远近层层外推,形成“差序格局”,有别于西方界限分明的团体格局。在这一结构里,道德义务与资源分配随关系远近伸缩,人情与面子成为促成合作的关键机制。该概念至今仍广泛用于分析乡村互助网络、家族企业运作与基层治理逻辑。�OIn From the Soil, Fei Xiaotong likened rural China's ties to ripples spreading from a stone dropped in water: relations radiate outward from the self in order of closeness, forming a differential mode of association that contrasts with the bounded group patterns of Western societies. Within this structure, moral obligation and resource allocation expand or contract with relational distance, so renqing (reciprocal favors) and mianzi (face) become crucial mechanisms for cooperation. The concept still guides analyses of rural mutual aid, family firm operations, and grassroots governance.�ans��src��}费孝通《乡土中国》,上海观察社,1948年初版;英译本 From the Soil, University of California Press, 1992年。٘Fei Xiaotong, From the Soil: The Foundations of Chinese Society, University of California Press, 1992 (Chinese original, Shanghai Observer Press, 1948).��id�soc_20_018�body���在对伯明翰斯帕克布鲁克社区的实地研究中,他们发现获取住房的不同途径——自有产权、市政公房、私人租赁——造就了利益与流动机会迥异的准群体。能否购房、能否排到公房决定了人们在围绕住房资源冲突中的位置,居住身份本身就构成一条分界线。这把消费领域的不平等引入了阶级分析,而不再只盯着生产场所的雇佣关系。�5In their fieldwork on the Sparkbrook district of Birmingham, they found that different routes into housing—owner occupation, council tenancy, private rental—produced quasi-groups with sharply divergent interests and mobility chances. Access to purchase or to the waiting list for public housing positioned people differently in conflicts over housing resources, so residential status itself marked a dividing line. The concept brought consumption-side inequality into class analysis instead of focusing solely on employment relations at the point of production.�ans��src�ٍ约翰·雷克斯、罗伯特·摩尔:《种族、社区与冲突:斯帕克布鲁克研究》,佩尔格蒙出版社(Pergamon Press)1967年版�dJohn Rex and Robert Moore, Race, Community and Conflict: A Study of Sparkbrook, Pergamon Press, 1967��id�soc_21_002�body���迪马乔与鲍威尔发现,处于同一组织场域中的组织会随时间变得越来越相似,驱动力常常不是效率而是对合法性的追求。他们区分了强制同构(法律法规与监管要求)、模仿同构(在高度不确定时效仿被视为成功的同行)与规范同构(专业教育和行业准则的扩散)。这解释了韦伯所言的科层制“铁笼”为何在现代组织中反复重现。�Paul DiMaggio and Walter Powell observed that organizations within the same organizational field grow increasingly alike over time, driven less by efficiency than by the pursuit of legitimacy. They distinguished coercive isomorphism imposed by law and regulation, mimetic isomorphism under uncertainty when firms copy apparently successful peers, and normative isomorphism spread through professional training and industry codes. This explains why Weber's iron cage of bureaucracy keeps reappearing across modern organizations.�ans��src�ٓ保罗·迪马乔与沃尔特·鲍威尔:《重访铁笼:组织场域中的制度同构与集体理性》,《美国社会学评论》第48卷(1983)ٻPaul J. DiMaggio and Walter W. Powell, The Iron Cage Revisited: Institutional Isomorphism and Collective Rationality in Organizational Fields, American Sociological Review, vol. 48 (1983)��id�soc_21_005�body���帕克主张族群关系依次经历接触、竞争、适应与同化四个阶段,并将其视为基本不可逆的自然进程。格拉泽与莫伊尼汉基于纽约的研究反驳道,族裔认同并不随代际更替而线性消退,各群体反而通过新的政治动员主动维系自身边界。这类批评促使研究者转向关注权力不平等与制度性排斥,而不是把同化当作必然结局。�=Robert Park proposed that ethnic relations move successively through contact, competition, accommodation, and assimilation, treating the sequence as a broadly irreversible natural process. Working on New York City, Nathan Glazer and Daniel Patrick Moynihan replied that ethnic identification does not fade linearly across generations, because groups actively sustain their boundaries through new forms of political mobilization. Such criticism pushed research toward power asymmetries and institutional exclusion instead of treating assimilation as the inevitable endpoint.�ans��src�ٴ罗伯特·帕克:《种族与文化》,自由出版社1950年版;内森·格拉泽与丹尼尔·帕特里克·莫伊尼汉:《超越熔炉》,麻省理工学院出版社1963年版نRobert E. Park, Race and Culture, Free Press, 1950; Nathan Glazer and Daniel Patrick Moynihan, Beyond the Melting Pot, MIT Press, 1963��id�soc_21_008�body��|灾害社会学强调,脆弱性是被社会制造出来的:住房质量、居住区位、保险可得性与政治发声渠道都按阶层分配。低收入群体更多住在洪泛区或老旧房屋里,灾后争取救助与重建资源的能力也较弱,于是伤亡与经济损失集中落在他们身上。把灾害仅仅归为天灾,会遮蔽这些本可改变的人为成因。��Disaster sociology stresses that vulnerability is socially manufactured: housing quality, residential location, access to insurance, and channels of political voice are all distributed by class. Low-income households are likelier to live in floodplains or aging buildings and have weaker capacity to claim relief and reconstruction resources afterward, so casualties and losses concentrate among them. Treating disasters as purely natural conceals these changeable human causes.�ans��src��N凯瑟琳·蒂尔尼《灾难:一种社会学视角》,政体出版社,2019年�HKathleen Tierney, Disasters: A Sociological Approach, Polity Press, 2019��id�soc_21_012�body��T霍克希尔德在《心灵的整饰》中提出情绪劳动概念:服务业雇员必须按雇主的脚本管理自己的感受,把内心状态整饰成职业表情。这种劳动持续消耗自我,容易产生表层扮演带来的情感疏离。它揭示情感不只是私人体验,更是被组织征用、监督并定价的生产要素。��In The Managed Heart, Arlie Hochschild introduced emotional labor: service employees must manage their feelings to an employer's script, polishing inner states into professional expressions. This work steadily drains the self and breeds the estrangement known as surface acting. It shows emotion is not merely private experience but a productive resource that organizations requisition, monitor, and price.�ans��src��S阿莉·罗素·霍克希尔德《心灵的整饰:人类情感的商业化》(1983)�VArlie Russell Hochschild, The Managed Heart: Commercialization of Human Feeling (1983)��id�soc_21_015�body���当老年人口增速超过家庭照护供给时,长期由女性无偿承担的照护出现结构性缺口,霍克希尔德以全球照护链描述富裕国家如何经由移民家务劳工跨国填补缺口。缺口同时迫使国家介入,推动长期照护政策与福利安排的重构。照护由此从私人家务转变为牵动性别平等、移民与福利国家的公共政治议题。��When older populations grow faster than family care supply, a structural gap opens in caregiving long provided unpaid by women, which Hochschild described through global care chains linking affluent households to migrant domestic workers across borders. The gap also forces states to step in, reshaping long-term care policy and welfare arrangements. Care thereby moves from private housework into public politics, entangling gender equality, migration, and the welfare state.�ans��src���阿莉·罗素·霍克希尔德〈爱与金〉,载芭芭拉·埃伦赖希与霍克希尔德主编《全球女性:第一世界的保姆、女佣与性工作者》,Metropolitan Books,2003年;联合国人口基金《世界人口状况报告》(年度系列)��Arlie Russell Hochschild, 'Love and Gold', in Barbara Ehrenreich and Arlie Russell Hochschild (eds.), Global Woman: Nannies, Maids, and Sex Workers in the First World, Metropolitan Books, 2003; UNFPA, State of World Population (annual report series)��id�soc_22_005�body���斯威德尔主张，文化更像一个装有符号、故事、仪式和行动风格的工具箱，而非直接支配行为的内在化价值体系。在相对稳定的时期，人们先确定行动目标，再挑选文化工具为做法辩护；只有在剧烈变动的时期，文化才参与塑造新的行动策略。文化因此被理解为人们组装行动时可取用的技能储备，发挥策略作用而非机械决定。��Swidler argues that culture resembles a toolkit holding symbols, stories, rituals, and styles of conduct rather than a value system that dictates behavior. In settled times people fix their goals first and draw on cultural tools to justify what they do; only in deeply unsettled times does culture help shape new strategies of action. Culture is thus a repertoire of skills people assemble into conduct, functioning strategically instead of mechanically determining outcomes.�ans��src�ٚ安·斯威德尔：《行动中的文化：符号与策略》，《美国社会学评论》1986年第51卷第2期，第273–286页，DOI:10.2307/2095521فAnn Swidler, Culture in Action: Symbols and Strategies, American Sociological Review 51(2), 1986, pp.273-286, DOI:10.2307/2095521��id�soc_22_008�body���韦伯区分了三种理想类型的合法权威。传统型依赖世代相传的习俗和对“历来如此”秩序的忠诚，如家长制和世袭王权；魅力型建立在追随者相信领袖具有超凡品质之上，通常需在领袖身后“例行化”为固定职务和规则；法理型以非人格规则为基础，服从由制度授权的职位而非个人，现代科层制是其典型。统治能否稳固，关键在于人们是否相信其正当性。�2Weber distinguished three ideal types of legitimate authority. Traditional authority rests on inherited custom and loyalty to an order that has “always existed,” as in patriarchal rule and hereditary kingship. Charismatic authority depends on followers’ belief in a leader’s extraordinary gifts and must usually be routinized into stable offices and rules after the leader’s departure. Legal-rational authority rests on impersonal rules: obedience goes to institutionally authorized offices rather than persons, with modern bureaucracy as its paradigm.�ans��src�ف马克斯·韦伯：《经济与社会》，1922年德文初版；Roth 与 Wittich 编英译本，加州大学出版社1978年版ٌMax Weber, Economy and Society, German original 1922; English ed. Guenther Roth & Claus Wittich (eds.), University of California Press, 1978��id�soc_22_012�body���该曲线由经济学家艾伦·克鲁格命名，用以呈现各国收入不平等程度与代际收入弹性（父辈收入预测子女收入的强度）之间的关系：不平等越高的国家（如美、英），子女收入越受出身束缚、流动性越低；较平等的北欧社会则相反。其机制在于高不平等会放大教育投入、居住环境与人脉资源的阶层差距，令优势更易代际传递。��Named by economist Alan Krueger, the curve plots countries' income inequality against intergenerational income elasticity—how strongly parents' income predicts children's. More unequal societies such as the United States and the United Kingdom show lower mobility, while egalitarian Nordic countries show higher. The mechanism is that wide inequality magnifies class gaps in educational investment, neighborhood quality, and connections, making advantage easier to hand down across generations.�ans��src��Q世界银行(World Bank)《Global Database on Intergenerational Mobility》(2020)�@World Bank, Global Database on Intergenerational Mobility (2020)��id�soc_23_005�body���汤普森考察了工业资本主义对时间纪律的重塑：前工业社会依循任务节奏劳作，忙闲交替，昼夜与季节支配安排；工厂制度要求劳动同步化，钟表与汽笛便把一天切分为可计量、可出售的单位。“时间就是金钱”的观念经学校、教会与车间的纪律反复灌输，迟到旷工遂成为道德问题。今日的守时习惯与日程文化，正是这场转型留下的遗产。�␀E. P. Thompson traced how industrial capitalism rebuilt time discipline. Pre-industrial labor followed the rhythm of tasks, alternating intense effort with idleness under the sway of daylight and seasons; factories demanded synchronized work, and clocks and whistles cut the day into measurable, sellable units. Schooling, churches, and shop-floor discipline drilled in the idea that time is money until lateness became a moral failing; modern punctuality and scheduling culture descend from that transformation.�ans��src��|E. P. 汤普森：《时间、工作纪律与工业资本主义》，《过去与现在》1967年第38期，第56–97页。�mE. P. Thompson, Time, Work-Discipline, and Industrial Capitalism, Past & Present, no. 38 (1967), pp. 56–97.��id�soc_23_008�body���安德森强调，一国成员终其一生无法认识绝大多数同胞，民族只能靠共享的媒介在每个人心中想象出来。十八世纪前后，逐利的出版业大量印行方言报纸与小说，素不相识的读者在同一时刻消费同样的文本，由此形成统一的交流场域与“同质而空洞”的共同时间感。正是这种同时性体验，让陌生人得以想象彼此是命运与共的同胞。��Anderson stresses that no citizen will ever meet most fellow members of the nation, so nationhood must be imagined in each mind through shared media. From the late eighteenth century onward, profit-seeking publishing mass-printed vernacular newspapers and novels; strangers consumed identical texts at the same hour, forming a unified field of exchange and a shared sense of homogenous, empty time. This experience of simultaneity lets millions imagine themselves as compatriots bound together in a common fate.�ans��src��Q本尼迪克特·安德森：《想象的共同体：民族主义的起源与散布》，伦敦：Verso 1983年初版、1991年修订版；中译本吴叡人译，上海人民出版社2005年版。 ; 另见: Benedict Anderson, Imagined Communities: Reflections on the Origin and Spread of Nationalism, London: Verso, 1983; rev. ed. 1991.�SBenedict Anderson, Imagined Communities: Reflections on the Origin and Spread of Nationalism, London: Verso, 1983; rev. ed. 1991. ; see also: 本尼迪克特·安德森：《想象的共同体：民族主义的起源与散布》，伦敦：Verso 1983年初版、1991年修订版；中译本吴叡人译，上海人民出版社2005年版。��id�soc_23_012�body���亚历山大等人于2004年提出，集体是否陷入创伤取决于意义建构而非事件本身：由知识分子组成的承载群体围绕事件性质、受害方与加害方展开宣称竞争，借助媒体、法律与仪式把特定叙事固化为公共记忆。唯有当创伤叙述被广泛接受、群体边界随之重划时，文化创伤才告成立。该理论解释了同一灾难为何在不同社群留下迥异的记忆后果。�2As Jeffrey C. Alexander and colleagues argued in 2004, whether a collectivity becomes traumatized depends on meaning-making rather than the raw event. Carrier groups—typically intellectuals—compete in claims about the nature of the event, its victims, and its perpetrators, fixing chosen narratives into public memory through media, law, and ritual. Cultural trauma exists only once such narratives win broad acceptance and group boundaries are redrawn. The theory explains why one catastrophe can leave very different memory consequences across communities.�ans��src��pJeffrey C. Alexander 等《Cultural Trauma and Collective Identity》，University of California Press，2004。�kJeffrey C. Alexander et al., Cultural Trauma and Collective Identity, University of California Press, 2004.��id�soc_23_020�body���诺拉主编的同名多卷本研究认为，当活态记忆环境随传统社会瓦解而消退，共同体便把记忆固定在特定场所：档案馆、纪念碑、周年庆典乃至教科书。因自发口传传承不再可靠，这类场所被刻意营造，用以凝结身份认同，却也常因纪念谁、遗忘谁而起争议。它揭示集体记忆必须依附物质与象征载体方能延续。�1Pierre Nora's multi-volume project argues that as living environments of memory dissolved along with traditional society, communities fixed remembrance in particular places: archives, monuments, anniversary celebrations, even textbooks. Because spontaneous transmission could no longer be relied upon, such sites were deliberately created to condense group identity, yet they often become controversial over whom they commemorate and whom they omit. The concept reveals that collective memory persists only by attaching itself to material and symbolic supports.�ans��src�ٵPierre Nora主编，《Les Lieux de Mémoire》（记忆之场），巴黎：Gallimard，1984–1992；英译Realms of Memory，纽约：哥伦比亚大学出版社，1996–1998。ٚNora, P. (ed.) (1984–1992). Les Lieux de Mémoire. Paris: Gallimard; English trans.: Realms of Memory. New York: Columbia University Press, 1996–1998.��id�soc_26_001�body��因为弱关系连接着不同的社交圈，能传递好友圈内没有的新信息。机理：强关系双方彼此相识，各自掌握的信息高度重叠，你知道的职位空缺对方多半也知道；泛泛之交则嵌入另一张网络，充当连通两个群体的桥梁，其消息对你才是非冗余的增量。格兰诺维特对波士顿地区白领的调查显示，多数人经由偶尔见面的人际渠道获知工作线索，而职业流动性越强、职位越高的人越依赖弱关系获取新工作。�`Weak ties reach into circles that close friends never touch, so they carry genuinely new information. Strong ties know one another and overlap heavily in what everyone has heard—an opening your best friend knows about, you have heard of too—whereas an acquaintance is embedded in another network and acts as a bridge between groups, delivering non-redundant news. Surveying white-collar workers around Boston, Granovetter found most people learned of their jobs through contacts seen only occasionally, and the more mobile (higher-status) the workers, the more they relied on such weak ties for new jobs.�ans��src��f马克·格兰诺维特：《弱关系的力量》，《美国社会学杂志》1973年第78卷第6期�]Mark Granovetter, The Strength of Weak Ties, American Journal of Sociology, 1973, vol.78 no.6��id�soc_26_007�body��分为传统型、魅力型与法理型。机理：传统型靠对古老惯例神圣性的信仰，臣民服从的是居于高位的那个具体的人，如世袭君主与家长；魅力型靠追随者相信领袖身怀非凡禀赋，先知与革命领袖的权威随其人存亡起落；法理型靠对非人格规则的信仰，人们服从抽象职权而非官员本人，现代科层制是其典型。三者只是理想类型，现实支配常混合并存，垄断合法暴力的现代国家主要立足法理型。��Traditional, charismatic, and legal-rational. Traditional rule rests on faith in the sanctity of age-old custom: people obey the concrete person occupying an exalted station, as with hereditary monarchs and patriarchs. Charismatic rule rests on followers' conviction that the leader carries extraordinary gifts; a prophet's or revolutionary's authority rises and falls with that person. Legal-rational rule rests on impersonal norms: people obey an office rather than an officeholder, with modern bureaucracy as the model case. All three are ideal types that blend in practice, and the modern state monopolizing legitimate violence leans chiefly on the legal-rational form.�ans��src��?马克斯·韦伯：《经济与社会》，1922年德文初版�?Max Weber, Economy and Society, posthumous German edition, 1922��id�soc_26_011�body���差距源自社会资本存量不同。机理：北方延续深厚的公民共同体传统——人际信任、互惠规范以及合唱团、合作社这类横向参与网络，使居民便于合作、官员难于懈怠；南方盛行自上而下的庇护依附关系，个人仰赖恩主而非平级伙伴，信任稀薄，集体行动屡屡落空。帕特南以二十年制度绩效评分印证近千年公民传统，指出民主质量不取决于宪法文本，而取决于公民社会的土壤。��The gap reflects differing stocks of social capital. Northern regions carried on a deep civic-community tradition—interpersonal trust, norms of reciprocity, and horizontal participation networks such as choirs and cooperatives—that made cooperation easy and kept officials on their toes. The South ran on top-down patron-client ties: individuals depended on bosses rather than equals, trust stayed thin, and collective action repeatedly failed. Matching twenty years of institutional performance scores against nearly a thousand years of civic history, Putnam concluded that democratic quality rests less on constitutional texts than on the soil of civil society.�ans��src��{罗伯特·帕特南：《使民主运转起来：现代意大利的公民传统》，普林斯顿大学出版社1993年版�kRobert D. Putnam, Making Democracy Work: Civic Traditions in Modern Italy, Princeton University Press, 1993��id�soc_26_016�body���称为弱者的武器，即农民以低调隐蔽方式进行的日常抵抗。机理：公开造反在村庄里代价高昂，贫农便改用偷懒磨蹭、装糊涂、假意顺从、小偷小摸和流言中伤等手段，在不招致报复的前提下蚕食地主利益；单个行动微不足道，日积月累却能悄然改写剥削的实际边界。斯科特由此提醒学界：底层政治未必表现为公开的集体行动。�He called it the weapons of the weak—the quiet, low-profile everyday resistance of the rural poor. Open defiance carried crushing costs in the village, so peasants turned to shirking, feigned ignorance, false compliance, petty theft, and malicious gossip, nibbling away at landlord advantage without inviting reprisal. Each act looked trivial, yet accumulated over time they quietly redrew the real boundaries of exploitation. Scott's lesson to scholarship: grassroots politics need not take the open form of collective action.�ans��src��o詹姆斯·C·斯科特：《弱者的武器：农民革命的日常形式》，耶鲁大学出版社1985年版�fJames C. Scott, Weapons of the Weak: Everyday Forms of Peasant Resistance, Yale University Press, 1985��id�00040190731b�body���阿帕杜莱提出族群景观、媒体景观、技术景观、金融景观与意识形态景观五种可拼装、非同步的流动，强调全球化是断裂而非单一同质化。这解释了本土抵抗与混杂身份的生成。��Appadurai proposed five disjunctured flows—ethnoscapes, mediascapes, technoscapes, financescapes, ideoscapes—emphasizing globalization as fractured, not homogenized. This explains local resistance and hybrid identities.�ans��src��P阿尔君·阿帕杜莱《消散的现代性：全球化的文化维度》(1996)�PArjun Appadurai, Modernity at Large: Cultural Dimensions of Globalization (1996)��id�05df1f2e4bd5�body���框架整合指运动把自身议题与参与者的既有认知图式对齐，包括框架桥接、扩展、放大与转换四种机制。它说明动员成败取决于能否把不满转化为可行动的集体身份。��Frame alignment links a movement's agenda to participants' existing schemas via bridging, extension, amplification, and transformation. It shows mobilization hinges on turning grievances into actionable collective identities.�ans��src��k大卫·斯诺等《框架整合过程、微观动员与运动参与》(1986, American Sociological Review)�VDavid A. Snow et al., 'Frame Alignment Processes' (1986), American Sociological Review��id�0e49902e312d�body���概率抽样使每个总体单元有已知非零入选概率，从而可用统计推断到总体并量化误差。在探索性研究或难以框定总体时，方便或滚雪球抽样可作为补充，但结论不能外推。��Probability sampling gives each population unit a known nonzero chance, enabling statistical inference and error quantification. In exploratory work or when no sampling frame exists, convenience or snowball sampling is acceptable but cannot generalize.�ans��src��埃莉诺·辛格与约翰·M·G·范德卢（编）《调查研究方法学》(2009) 及莎伦·L·洛尔《抽样：设计与分析》(1999) ; 另见: Eleanor Singer and John M. G. van der Loo (eds.) survey methodology; Sharon L. Lohr, Sampling: Design and Analysis (1999)�Eleanor Singer and John M. G. van der Loo (eds.) survey methodology; Sharon L. Lohr, Sampling: Design and Analysis (1999) ; see also: 埃莉诺·辛格与约翰·M·G·范德卢（编）《调查研究方法学》(2009) 及莎伦·L·洛尔《抽样：设计与分析》(1999)��id�0f4f1aa5a2f9�body�ٮ农时决定播种收割的节点，古人借节日感谢自然、祈求丰收；宗教则把固定日期变成集体礼拜。节日因此既安排生产，也凝聚社群。��The farming calendar set sowing and harvest nodes; ancients used festivals to thank nature and pray for yield, while religion fixed dates for collective worship. Festivals thus scheduled work and bonded communities.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�107f0f4ca111�body��布坎南在 1965 年提出「俱乐部物品」：像收费公路或会员制泳池，一个人使用不排斥他人（非竞争性有限），但可通过收费「排他」。它介于私人物品与纯公共物品之间，说明制度安排能改变物品的供给方式。�Buchanan coined 'club goods' in 1965—like toll roads or members-only pools, where use by one person does not fully exclude others yet access can be restricted by charging. Sitting between private and pure public goods, they show institutions shape how goods are supplied.�ans��src��/Buchanan，《俱乐部的经济理论》(1965)�.Buchanan, 'An Economic Theory of Clubs' (1965)��id�132045e1578c�body���格莱泽强调面对面交流、技能匹配与知识溢出带来的生产率提升，主张城市是高密度人力资本网络。他比雅各布斯更强调市场集聚收益，对怀旧式街区保护较不浪漫。��Glaeser stresses productivity gains from face-to-face exchange, skill matching, and knowledge spillovers, framing cities as dense human-capital networks. He leans more on market agglomeration than Jacobs and is less romantic about preservation.�ans��src��/爱德华·格莱泽《城市的胜利》(2011)�*Edward Glaeser, Triumph of the City (2011)��id�16e575a2134e�body��社会契约论认为政府的合法权力来自人民自愿达成的协议，人们让渡部分自然权利以换取秩序与安全。霍布斯、洛克和卢梭分别从不同角度阐述了这一理论。它成为现代国家合法性与公民义务论述的重要基础。�NSocial contract theory holds that a government's legitimate authority comes from the consent of the people, who surrender some natural rights in exchange for order and security. Hobbes, Locke, and Rousseau each developed the idea from different angles. It remains a foundation for discussions of state legitimacy and civic obligation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�189e8d909c66�body���米德主张自我通过扮演他人角色、内化社会态度而在社会互动中生成。'客我'是被内化的社会期望，'主我'是对这些期望的自发创造性回应，二者张力推动行为。��Mead held that the self emerges through taking the role of the other and internalizing social attitudes. The 'Me' is the internalized social expectation; the 'I' is the spontaneous, creative response to it, and their tension drives conduct.�ans��src��Y乔治·赫伯特·米德《心灵、自我与社会》(1934, 查尔斯·W·莫里斯编)�JGeorge Herbert Mead, Mind, Self, and Society (1934, ed. Charles W. Morris)��id�190f9beb6d36�body�ٷ格尔茨认为斗鸡是巴厘社会的文本，下注与羽色隐喻地位、男性气概与宗族张力。深描要求还原行动者的意义脉络，而非仅记录行为频率。��Geertz treated the cockfight as a text of Balinese society where wagers and plumage encode status, masculinity, and kin tension. Thick description recovers actors' meaning contexts rather than merely counting behavior.�ans��src��^克利福德·格尔茨《文化的解释》(1973, 含《深描：迈向文化解释理论》)�QClifford Geertz, The Interpretation of Cultures (1973), incl. 'Thick Description'��id�19e5cece86d0�body��拉弗曲线由阿瑟·拉弗在 1970 年代提出，描绘税率从 0 升到 100% 时，税收总额先增后减、呈倒 U 形。其道理在于税率过高会抑制工作与投资，税基缩小反而使总收入下降，因此存在「最优」税率。�0Arthur Laffer advanced the Laffer curve in the 1970s, showing that as the tax rate rises from 0% to 100%, total revenue first increases then falls—an inverted U. The logic is that very high rates discourage work and investment, shrinking the tax base so revenue drops; hence some 'optimal' rate exists.�ans��src��<Laffer，《拉弗曲线：过去、现在与未来》(2004)�<Laffer, 'The Laffer Curve: Past, Present, and Future' (2004)��id�2646af82e6ae�body��收入是一定时期内获得的经济流入（如工资、利息），财富则是某一时点持有的资产净值（资产减去负债）。两者都反映经济状况，但财富更能体现长期积累与代际传递。不平等在财富维度上通常比收入维度更突出。�PIncome is the economic flow received over a period (such as wages or interest), while wealth is the net asset value held at a point in time (assets minus liabilities). Both reflect economic status, but wealth better shows long-term accumulation and intergenerational transmission. Inequality is usually sharper in wealth than in income.�ans��src��7Piketty,《Capital in the Twenty-First Century》(2014)�:Thomas Piketty, Capital in the Twenty-First Century (2014)��id�2ca20ca2d89c�body���数字痕迹并非随机样本，偏向特定平台与活跃用户；脱离访谈情境易误读行为；平台算法又塑造可见数据。研究者须把大数据与传统方法三角验证，避免把相关性当普遍规律。�Digital traces are not random samples and skew toward certain platforms and active users; stripped of interview context they mislead; platform algorithms shape what is visible. Researchers should triangulate big data with traditional methods rather than treat patterns as universal law.�ans��src��\马修·萨尔甘尼克《计算社会学：数据科学在社会科学中的应用》(2018)�JMatthew J. Salganik, Bit by Bit: Social Research in the Digital Age (2018)��id�3834fadcc17f�body��功利主义是边沁和密尔等人发展的伦理学说，主张行为的对错取决于其能否带来“最大多数人的最大幸福”。它强调结果导向与可计算的利益权衡。该思想对现代公共政策与成本效益分析影响深远。�3Utilitarianism, developed by Bentham and Mill, holds that the rightness of an act depends on whether it produces 'the greatest happiness of the greatest number.' It emphasizes consequence-based and calculable trade-offs of interest. The idea deeply influences modern public policy and cost-benefit analysis.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�3dc88d6e5569�body���现实主义认为国家是国际政治的主要行为体，在无政府状态下以追求安全与权力为核心目标。它强调国家利益、军事能力和均势，对合作持审慎态度。代表人物包括摩根索和沃尔兹。�"Realism holds that states are the main actors in international politics and, in an anarchic system, pursue security and power as core goals. It stresses national interest, military capability, and balance of power and is cautious about cooperation. Key figures include Morgenthau and Waltz.�ans��src��6肯尼思·沃尔兹《国际政治理论》（1979）�<Kenneth Waltz, “Theory of International Politics” (1979)��id�4da5a16ee24a�body���美国最高法院在 1803 年该案中首次宣布「国会法案若违宪则无效」，由此开创司法审查制度。它让法院成为宪法的「最终解释者」，深刻塑造了美国三权分立的运作方式。�In 1803 the U.S. Supreme Court first declared that an act of Congress conflicting with the Constitution is void, creating the power of judicial review. It made the court the final interpreter of the Constitution and deeply shaped American separation of powers.�ans��src��%Marbury v. Madison, 5 U.S. 137 (1803)�%Marbury v. Madison, 5 U.S. 137 (1803)��id�54dc2cd591bf�body���迁移改变的主要是年龄与性别构成，而不只是总人口数。外迁者集中在劳动年龄、常带配偶子女，于是迁入地结构偏轻、劳动力获补充，迁出地留下更多长辈与更少青年，出现留守式老龄化。这也是过渡效应：移民自己会变老，其子女的较高出生数只在结构偏年轻的阶段明显，生育水平随后向当地靠拢。迁入地人数增加不等于当地总人口长期由此上升，也推不出公共服务负担的方向。��Migration chiefly changes age and sex composition rather than simply the total population. Movers are concentrated in working ages and often bring spouses and children, so a receiving place gains a younger structure and a replenished labour force, while a sending place is left with more elders and fewer young people, producing a left-behind form of ageing. The effect is transitional as well: migrants grow old themselves, the higher birth count of their children shows only while the structure is still young, and fertility then converges on local levels. A larger headcount in a receiving place is not a long-term rise in its total population in itself, and it does not indicate which way the load on public services moves.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�5caa40a2bc8a�body���戈夫曼认为人在互动中像演员一样管理他人对自己的印象，前台是按规范展演的公开区域，后台是放松与准备的真实区域。这一视角把自我视为情境性产物，挑战了固定人格观。��Goffman argued people manage the impressions others form of them; the front stage is the normative public performance, the back stage the relaxed preparation area. This frames the self as situationally produced rather than fixed.�ans��src��;欧文·戈夫曼《日常生活中的自我呈现》(1956)�@Erving Goffman, The Presentation of Self in Everyday Life (1956)��id�5dd7eca92897�body���萨瑟兰在 1939 年提出「白领犯罪」，指身居企业或专业职位的人利用职务之便进行的欺诈、贪污等违法，如虚假财报。它揭示犯罪并非底层专属，「体面人」的职务犯罪同样造成巨大社会损失。�5Sutherland coined 'white-collar crime' in 1939 to describe fraud, embezzlement, and the like committed by people in business or professional roles through their occupation, such as fake financial reports. It shows crime is not confined to the lower class—respectable insiders cause enormous social loss too.�ans��src��%Sutherland，《白领犯罪》(1949)�'Sutherland, 'White Collar Crime' (1949)��id�601bb5cee956�body��蒂奇纳等学者在 1970 年提出，随着大众媒介信息增多，社会经济地位高的人吸收得更快，导致不同群体间的知识差距反而扩大。该假说揭示了「信息不平等」会随媒介发展而加剧，而非自动弥合。�+Tichenor, Donohue, and Olien argued in 1970 that as mass-media information grows, higher socio-economic-status people absorb it faster, so the knowledge gap between groups actually widens. The hypothesis shows information inequality can deepen with media development rather than automatically close.�ans��src��PTichenor、Donohue & Olien，《大众媒介流通与知识差异增长》(1970)�XTichenor, Donohue & Olien, 'Mass Media Flow and Differential Growth in Knowledge' (1970)��id�83c3fde756dd�body���贝克认为现代化的副作用（核、化学、气候风险）超越阶级边界且难以追责，传统的因果与赔偿框架失效。风险社会要求以“有组织的不负责任”视角重构政治与科学。��Beck argued modern hazards (nuclear, chemical, climate) cross class lines and resist attribution, defeating traditional causality and compensation. The risk society demands rethinking politics and science via 'organized irresponsibility'.�ans��src��h乌尔里希·贝克《风险社会：迈向一种新的现代性》(1986, 马克·里特英译本 1992)�SUlrich Beck, Risk Society: Towards a New Modernity (1986; trans. Mark Ritter, 1992)��id�8dcbd43e9e6d�body��李帕特在 1969 年提出，族群或宗教严重对立的国家可通过「大联合政府、相互否决、比例代表与区域自治」等机制共享权力，而非靠多数压制少数。瑞士、荷兰等案例显示，这种「权力分享」能降低内战风险。�?Lijphart argued in 1969 that societies split by ethnicity or religion can stay stable by sharing power—grand coalitions, mutual vetoes, proportional representation, and segmental autonomy—rather than majority rule over minorities. Cases like Switzerland and the Netherlands show power-sharing lowers civil-war risk.�ans��src��&Lijphart，《协和式民主》(1969)�+Lijphart, 'Consociational Democracy' (1969)��id�8f0e52638b7c�body���杜波依斯在 1903 年《黑人的灵魂》中提出，非裔美国人常透过「别人的眼光」看自己，既身为美国人又被视为「他者」，在两种身份间拉扯。这一概念成为种族与认同研究的经典起点。�In 'The Souls of Black Folk' (1903), Du Bois wrote that African Americans often see themselves through 'the eyes of others,' torn between being American and being treated as 'the other.' The concept became a classic starting point for studies of race and identity.�ans��src��%Du Bois，《黑人的灵魂》(1903)�)Du Bois, 'The Souls of Black Folk' (1903)��id�909f5d8ebfe9�body��社会事实是涂尔干提出的概念，指外在于个人、具有约束力的社会现象，如法律、道德、习俗和制度。他主张用社会事实解释社会事实，而非还原为个人心理。这一思路奠定了实证社会学的方法论基础。�FA social fact, proposed by Durkheim, is a social phenomenon external to individuals and exerting constraint, such as laws, morals, customs, and institutions. He urged explaining social facts by other social facts rather than reducing them to individual psychology. This shaped the methodological basis of positivist sociology.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�94c88c4adf0e�body���贝克尔在 1964 年提出，教育、培训与健康投入会提升人的「生产力与收入能力」，如同给企业添置机器。该理论把上学解释为「理性投资」——今天花钱花时间，未来获得更高的终身回报。�Becker argued in 1964 that spending on education, training, and health raises a person's productivity and earning capacity, much like a firm buying machines. The theory frames schooling as rational investment—costing time and money now for higher lifetime returns later.�ans��src��!Becker，《人力资本》(1964)�Becker, 'Human Capital' (1964)��id�98ae8658132f�body��)货币政策由中央银行制定，通过调整利率和货币供应量来影响经济；财政政策由政府制定，通过改变税收和支出来调节经济。两者都可用来刺激或冷却经济，但作用渠道不同。配合得当的政策组合有助于稳定物价与促进就业。�;Monetary policy is set by a central bank and works through interest rates and the money supply, while fiscal policy is set by government and works through taxes and spending. Both can stimulate or cool an economy, but through different channels. A well-coordinated mix helps stabilize prices and promote employment.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9e89ba65714c�body��)自由主义是一种重视个人自由、平等、法治和有限政府的政治哲学传统，起源于启蒙运动。它主张保护私有财产与言论自由，并在历史上发展为强调市场或个人权利的多种流派。现代自由主义也日益关注社会福利与平等机会。�MLiberalism is a political philosophy valuing individual liberty, equality, rule of law, and limited government, rooted in the Enlightenment. It champions private property and free expression and has branched into market- or rights-oriented variants. Modern liberalism also increasingly addresses social welfare and equal opportunity.�ans��src��,Friedman，《资本主义与自由》(1962)�)Friedman, 'Capitalism and Freedom' (1962)��id�9eb5802ba3dc�body��2“书同文”让各地的人能跨越方言障碍读写交流，“车同轨”让道路和车辆互通、物资人员顺畅往来。统一的标准大幅降低治理与贸易的成本，也催生共同的文化认同。没有这些标准，庞大帝国很容易被语言、距离和地方习惯割裂。�}'Uniform writing' let people across regions communicate in writing despite different dialects, and 'uniform axle widths' made roads and vehicles compatible so goods and people moved freely. Common standards sharply cut the cost of governance and trade and nurtured a shared cultural identity. Without them, a vast empire easily fragments along language, distance, and local custom.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a52e7196cc7a�body���它指符号与生活方式脱离原产地，靠电子媒介和网络跨国流动，在到达处被重新解读改造；移民网络把远方送进日常视野，即流动的空间取代地方的空间。它与经济全球化相关却不是一回事：文化载体是能读懂、可改写的符号，接收方不会照单全收，同一部影片在不同社会长出不同用法。争论因此摆在同质化与本土再造之间，简单等同西方化就抹掉了多向流动。��It is the movement of symbols and ways of life beyond their places of origin, crossing borders on electronic media and networks, then reinterpreted and remade where they arrive; migrant networks bring distant events into everyday view, which is what is meant by the space of flows displacing the space of places. It is bound up with but not identical to economic globalization: its cargo is signs people can read and rewrite, so recipients never simply take them as given, and one film grows different uses in different societies. The argument therefore swings between homogenization and local reinvention, and flattening it into Westernization erases multidirectional flow.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�a950b8cc25e7�body��舆论是社会成员对公共事务持有的分散或集中的看法与态度，常通过民调、媒体与选举表达。它影响政策制定与政治合法性，但并非总是一致或可简单测量。媒体与信息环境会显著塑造舆论的形成。�@Public opinion is the dispersed or concentrated views and attitudes of members of society on public affairs, expressed through polls, media, and elections. It influences policy and political legitimacy but is not always consistent or easily measured. Media and information environments significantly shape its formation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b4e65d714d07�body���迪马吉奥与鲍威尔指出强制、模仿与规范三种同形机制，使组织在制度压力下趋向相似结构而非最优效率。这说明组织形态受合法性逻辑而非纯技术效率支配。��DiMaggio and Powell identified coercive, mimetic, and normative mechanisms driving organizations toward similarity under institutional pressure, not efficiency. Organizational form follows legitimacy logic more than technical optimality.�ans��src�ق保罗·迪马吉奥与沃尔特·鲍威尔《铁笼重访：组织场域中的制度同形》(1983, American Sociological Review)�bPaul DiMaggio and Walter W. Powell, 'The Iron Cage Revisited' (1983), American Sociological Review��id�b7fd371c0308�body��仪式是依照固定程序、具有象征意义的重复性活动，常见于宗教、生命周期和公共庆典中。它强化群体的身份认同与价值共识，并帮助人们应对生死、过渡等关键时刻。人类学家视仪式为社会凝聚的重要机制。�OA ritual is a repeated activity with symbolic meaning performed according to a fixed procedure, common in religion, life-cycle events, and public ceremonies. It reinforces group identity and shared values and helps people navigate key moments like birth, death, and transitions. Anthropologists see rituals as vital to social cohesion.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c14fd99fe427�body���社会认同理论主张个体通过所属群体获得自尊，因而倾向于偏袒内群体。最小群体范式证明仅凭任意分类即可诱发偏袒，说明认同与偏见可在无真实利益冲突时产生。�␀Social identity theory holds that self-esteem is tied to group membership, prompting in-group favoritism. The minimal group paradigm showed arbitrary categorization alone suffices to induce bias, implying identity and prejudice arise without real conflict.�ans��src��x亨利·塔杰菲尔与约翰·特纳《群际冲突的整合理论》(1979, 收入《群际关系的社会心理学》)مHenri Tajfel and John Turner, 'An Integrative Theory of Intergroup Conflict' (1979), in The Social Psychology of Intergroup Relations��id�c1c4a465f96c�body�ٽ韦伯把祛魅定义为神秘与神圣体验被科学解释与科层计算取代，世界变得可计算、可预测。理性化提升了效率却也带来“铁笼”式的意义空洞。��Weber defined disenchantment as the replacement of mystery and the sacred by scientific explanation and bureaucratic calculation, making the world predictable. Rationalization boosts efficiency yet risks a meaning-empty 'iron cage'.�ans��src��_马克斯·韦伯《宗教社会学论文集》(1920, 埃弗拉伊姆·菲绍夫英译本 1963)�JMax Weber, The Sociology of Religion (1920; trans. Ephraim Fischoff, 1963)��id�c50c67dc9517�body���泽利泽表明人们会把钱标记为“礼物钱”“津贴”“丧葬费”等不同意义，用以维持而非腐蚀社会关系。她证明货币的社会意义随关系情境而分化。��Zelizer showed people mark money as 'gift money', 'allowance', or 'condolence money' to sustain rather than corrupt relationships. She demonstrated that the social meaning of money varies by relational context.�ans��src��`维维安娜·泽利泽《货币的社会意义》(1994) 与《亲密关系中的金钱》(2005)�WViviana Zelizer, The Social Meaning of Money (1994) and The Purchase of Intimacy (2005)��id�c79c284984e9�body��~指通过讲述、歌唱等非文字方式代际传递历史、法律与知识的体系，许多社会倚赖它保存记忆。�~It is the intergenerational transmission of history, law, and knowledge by speech and song, central to many societies' memory.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�cb7dd8a0855d�body���阿克塞尔罗德发现善良、报复、宽容且清晰的“一报还一报”在重复博弈中最具适应性，因为它既避免被剥削又鼓励对方合作。该研究表明合作可由互惠规则自发涌现，无需中央权威。��Axelrod found that 'tit for tat'—nice, retaliating, forgiving, and clear—was most adaptive in iterated play, avoiding exploitation while inviting cooperation. It shows cooperation can emerge from reciprocity without central authority.�ans��src��8罗伯特·阿克塞尔罗德《合作的进化》(1984)�3Robert Axelrod, The Evolution of Cooperation (1984)��id�cd438d90ee21�body���信息不对称指交易双方掌握的相关信息不相等，例如卖方比买方更了解商品质量。它会导致逆向选择和道德风险等市场失灵。政策上常通过披露要求、认证和监管来缓和这一问题。�<Information asymmetry means one side of a transaction has more relevant information than the other, such as a seller knowing product quality better than the buyer. It can cause market failures like adverse selection and moral hazard. Policy often mitigates it through disclosure rules, certification, and regulation.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�cfd4053347fc�body���蒙台梭利把儿童当作自身发展的主体，成人的工作从讲授移到环境：教具按难度成系列、自身能显示错误，孩子自选自己做，从物件而非分数发现规律，教师只观察示范。混龄让年幼的看示范、年长的靠重做巩固，社会性学习在组里发生。她的依据是「吸收性心智」与敏感期，内在动机比奖惩靠得住。但要注意自由不等于放任：教具有限度，环境准备最吃设计。��Montessori treats the child as the agent of his or her own development, so the adult's work moves from lecturing to the environment: materials in graded series that display their own errors, letting a child choose and handle them, finding the rule in the object rather than in a score, while the teacher watches and demonstrates. Mixed-age groups let the younger watch and the older consolidate by doing it again, so social learning arises inside the group. Her warrant is the "absorbing mind" and sensitive periods, which make intrinsic motivation sounder than praise and punishment. Freedom here is not permissiveness: the materials come with limits, and a quiet teacher presupposes a painstakingly prepared setting.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d3ba58e225dd�body���当一种味道被标准化、能被快速复制，它就从地方习惯变成可买卖的“品牌”。本地口味借资本与物流走向世界，却也常被简化以迎合多数人口味。ٳOnce a taste is standardized and quickly copied, it becomes a sellable 'brand'. Local flavor rides capital and logistics worldwide, yet is often simplified for the average palate.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�e26a79b38a99�body���城市蔓延指城市用地以低密度、摊大饼的方式向外扩张：郊区地块大、路网稀疏、功能单一，同样多的人口要摊上更长的道路、管线和通勤距离，人均的基建与能耗因此高于紧凑城区，被占的多是城市边缘的农田。它不等于城市化或郊区化：后两者说人口与岗位迁往何处，蔓延说占地的形态，所以总人口不增长、只要密度继续摊薄，也照样在蔓延。�TUrban sprawl is the outward expansion of urban land at low density, spreading like a pancake: suburbs have large blocks, sparse roads and single uses, so the same population is spread over longer streets, pipelines and commutes, which makes infrastructure and energy use per person higher than in a compact city, while the land taken is usually farmland at the urban edge. It is not the same as urbanization or suburbanization: those say where people and jobs go, sprawl describes the form of land occupation, so a city with a flat population can keep sprawling as long as density keeps thinning.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ea74718f5274�body��)女权主义是主张男女平等、批判性别压迫与结构性不平等的思想与运动，内部有自由主义、激进与交叉性等不同流派。它推动了选举权、同工同酬与反暴力等社会变革。当代讨论日益关注交叉性（种族、阶级与性别的交叠）。�UFeminism is the thought and movement advocating gender equality and critiquing sex-based oppression and structural inequality, with liberal, radical, and intersectional strands. It drove changes like suffrage, equal pay, and anti-violence measures. Contemporary debate increasingly addresses intersectionality across race, class, and gender.�ans��src��8Crenshaw，《取消种族与性别的边缘化》(1989)�CCrenshaw, 'Demarginalizing the Intersection of Race and Sex' (1989)��id�f802f6bc9df3�body���社会学家格兰诺维特发现：亲密好友消息往往重叠，而“弱关系”（不太熟的人）反而带来新机会，比如不常联系的朋友介绍的工作。广而浅的联系常比深而窄的更有用。��Sociologist Granovetter found close friends' info overlaps, while 'weak ties' (acquaintances) bring fresh opportunities, like a job from a rarely-contacted friend. Broad shallow links often beat deep narrow ones.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�fffd0c123bfe�body��托马斯夫妇在 1928 年提出：如果人们把某种情境定义为真实的，那么它在后果上就是真实的。该定理揭示「社会建构」的力量——谣言、标签或偏见一旦被广泛相信，就会引发真实的社会行为改变。�Thomas and Thomas argued in 1928 that if people define a situation as real, it is real in its consequences. The theorem reveals the power of social construction: rumors, labels, or prejudice, once widely believed, trigger genuine changes in social behavior.�ans��src��*Thomas & Thomas，《美国儿童》(1928)�.Thomas & Thomas, 'The Child in America' (1928)��id�019b379afc84�body���代际支持指家庭内不同世代间的经济、照料与情感互助，如子女赡养父母、祖辈协助育儿。在养老金不足的老化社会中，它构成非正式社会保障的重要补充。�Intergenerational support is the economic, caregiving and emotional mutual aid across generations within families, such as children supporting parents or grandparents helping with childcare. Where pensions are thin, it supplements informal social security in ageing societies.�ans��src��:联合国 (2019), 《世界人口老化 2019》, 联合国�3United Nations (2019), World Population Ageing 2019��id�0218a9b3c0fc�body�ٍ登记让婚姻获得法律承认，明确双方在财产、抚养和继承上的权利与义务，也为子女身份和权益提供保障。٢Registration makes marriage legally recognized, clarifying rights and duties over property, support, and inheritance, and protecting children's status and rights.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�023c503175f8�body�ي考试用统一标准检验学生是否掌握了知识和技能，能提供可比较的信息，帮助老师和学生发现薄弱之处。٠Exams use uniform standards to check whether students have mastered knowledge and skills, giving comparable information to help teachers and students spot gaps.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�025f2568c0b6�body�ٍ许多国家把教育视为公共福利，由政府用税收负担费用，目的是让所有孩子不论贫富都能上学，促进公平。قMany states treat education as a public good funded by taxes, so all children can attend regardless of wealth, promoting fairness.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�041295386d7f�body��t当一家企业供给整个市场的平均总成本最低（规模经济极强，固定成本高、边际成本低），就出现自然垄断，如电网、供水、铁路。强行分拆会重复铺设管网、推高成本。因此政府通常允许独家经营，但用价格监管（回报率规制、价格上限）防止其漫天要价，并施加普遍服务义务。��A natural monopoly arises when one firm can supply the entire market at the lowest average total cost—extreme economies of scale with high fixed and low marginal costs—as with power grids, water, and railways. Forcing competition would duplicate costly infrastructure. Governments therefore allow exclusive supply but regulate prices (rate-of-return or price-cap regulation) and impose universal-service obligations.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第15章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 15��id�041c949ea88a�body���标准化考试是用统一题目、施测与评分规则大规模测评学业水平的考试，如高考、SAT。它便于横向比较，但也被批评可能窄化教学、不利于多元能力。��A standardized test uses uniform questions, administration, and scoring to assess achievement at scale, like China’s gaokao or the SAT. It aids comparison but is criticized for narrowing teaching and missing diverse abilities.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�054e9d948b61�body�٢因为个人理性地选择不付费也能享用，需求被低估，自愿出资的总额低于社会实际需要，于是路灯、清洁空气等供给偏少。��Since individuals rationally choose to enjoy benefits without paying, revealed demand is understated and voluntary contributions fall short of what society needs, leaving goods like streetlights or clean air under-supplied.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�066ec1172992�body���投票的预期个人收益极低（单票难定结果），理性人似不应投票。解释包括「表达性投票」、履行公民义务的心理收益，以及把投票视为公共品供给的集体行动修正。�The expected personal benefit of one vote is negligible, so a rational actor seemingly should not vote. Explanations include expressive voting, the psychological payoff of civic duty, and revised collective-action models treating voting as public-good provision.�ans��src��>Downs, A. (1957), 《民主的经济理论》, 哈珀出版社�?Downs, A. (1957), An Economic Theory of Democracy, Harper & Row��id�06e464813bdb�body�ٖ直立行走让早期人类在开阔草原上更省力地远行、腾出双手使用工具，并减少阳光直射体表，有利于生存和繁衍。٨Walking upright let early humans travel farther on open savanna with less effort, freed the hands for tools, and reduced sun exposure, aiding survival and reproduction.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�06e58f7995d1�body�ٙ该理论认为任意两人平均通过约六层熟人关系即可相连，反映社交网络的“小世界”特性：高度聚类却又路径很短。٩The theory holds any two people are connected by about six acquaintance links, reflecting social networks’ “small world” property: high clustering yet short paths.�ans��src��:Milgram, S. (1967), 《小世界问题》, 今日心理学�=Milgram, S. (1967), The Small World Problem, Psychology Today��id�0735b01a2ef2�body�ٓ文化人类学通过观察和参与，研究不同人群的生活方式、信仰、习俗和意义系统，帮助理解人类文化的多样性。٪Cultural anthropology studies people's livelihoods, beliefs, customs, and meaning systems through observation and participation, helping us understand cultural diversity.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�094483b20b4c�body���社交媒体极大降低了组织与传播信息的边际成本，使去中心化动员（如标签行动）更易发起。但也带来「懒人行动主义」，浅层点击未必转化为线下参与。��Social media sharply lower the marginal cost of organising and spreading information, enabling decentralised mobilisation such as hashtag campaigns. But it also spawns 「slacktivism」, where shallow clicks may not convert into offline participation.�ans��src��O世界银行 (2016), 《世界发展报告 2016：数字红利》, 世界银行�CWorld Bank (2016), World Development Report 2016: Digital Dividends��id�098e1c722f6b�body�ه口述历史是采访亲历者、记录他们回忆的史料方法，能保存没有被文字记载的普通人经历和集体记忆。٥Oral history records interviews with witnesses to capture their memories, preserving ordinary people's experiences and collective memory absent from written records.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0bf358c058a8�body���直升机父母指过度关注、随时介入子女生活的教养方式。研究提示，过度监控可能削弱孩子的独立解决问题能力与内在动机，并在升学后增加焦虑与依赖，但适度支持仍有益发展。�Helicopter parenting describes over-involved, constantly monitoring child-rearing. Studies suggest excessive control can weaken children's independent problem-solving and intrinsic motivation and raise anxiety and dependency at college, though moderate support remains beneficial.�ans��src�ٶSchiffrin 等,《Helping or Hovering? The Effects of Helicopter Parenting on College Students' Well-Being》,Journal of Child and Family Studies,2014 (DOI: 10.1007/s10826-013-9716-3)ٷSchiffrin et al., 'Helping or Hovering? The Effects of Helicopter Parenting on College Students' Well-Being', Journal of Child and Family Studies, 2014, DOI: 10.1007/s10826-013-9716-3��id�0f7ef33ccf91�body�ٿ累进税制对高收入适用更高税率，使税后收入分布较税前更平等。结合转移支付，OECD 国家借此显著降低市场不平等，是社会保护网的核心工具。��A progressive tax applies higher rates to higher incomes, making post-tax distribution more equal than pre-tax. Combined with transfers, OECD countries use it to markedly lower market inequality, a core tool of the social protection net.�ans��src��QOECD (2011), 《分化中的我们：不平等为何持续上升》, 经合组织�:OECD (2011), Divided We Stand: Why Inequality Keeps Rising��id�113052ed5559�body���雅各布斯批评功能分区割裂街道生活、削弱“街道眼”式的自然监视，反而制造犯罪与衰败。她主张短街块、混合用途与老旧建筑共存以提升城市活力与安全。��Jacobs criticized zoning and clearance for severing street life and weakening 'eyes on the street' natural surveillance, breeding crime and decay. She advocated short blocks, mixed use, and old-building diversity for urban vitality and safety.�ans��src��8简·雅各布斯《美国大城市的死与生》(1961)�?Jane Jacobs, The Death and Life of Great American Cities (1961)��id�11b3ef574532�body��u生育率通常指一名女性一生平均生育的孩子数；总和生育率约2.1才能维持人口不增不减。كFertility rate usually means the average number of children a woman has; a total fertility rate around 2.1 keeps population stable.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�11d718a38702�body�ٯ《巴黎协定》旨在把全球升温控制在远低于工业化前2摄氏度、并努力限制在1.5摄氏度内，由各缔约方自主提出并定期更新减排贡献。ٺThe Paris Agreement aims to keep global warming well below 2°C above pre-industrial levels and pursue 1.5°C, with each party submitting and regularly updating its own emission targets.�ans��src��P联合国气候变化框架公约《巴黎协定》文本(2015 年通过,UNFCCC)�UUnited Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change, Paris Agreement (adopted 2015)��id�1287184d1ad0�body�ٗGDP 是国内生产总值的缩写，指一个国家在一段时间内生产的所有最终商品和服务的总价值，常用来衡量经济规模。ٯGDP stands for Gross Domestic Product, the total market value of all final goods and services produced within a country over a period. It is a common measure of economic size.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1316f5b75367�body���政治文化是特定社会中成员对政治的认知、情感与评价的倾向总和，如对新制度的信任、对参与的态度。阿尔蒙德提出此概念，用以解释为何相同制度在不同国家运作效果迥异。�Political culture is the sum of a society’s orientations—cognitive, affective, evaluative—toward politics, such as trust in institutions and attitudes to participation. Almond coined it to explain why the same institutions work differently across countries.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1356316b8a5c�body���强连接（家人、密友）构成紧密小圈子，成员掌握的信息高度重叠、传递快但同质；弱连接（点头之交、旧同事、普通熟人）桥接不同圈子，能带来新信息。社会学家格兰诺维特发现，很多人找到工作靠的是弱连接。但弱连接只是信息桥而非情感支持，职业高技能岗位的信息可能更多经强连接流动，两类连接功能互补。��Strong ties (family, close friends) form tight clusters whose members share overlapping, quickly circulating but homogeneous information; weak ties (acquaintances, former colleagues) bridge across clusters and bring novel information. Sociologist Mark Granovetter found that many people find jobs through weak ties. But weak ties are information bridges rather than emotional support, and strong ties may matter more for high-skill job information—the two types complement each other.�ans��src��TGranovetter, M. (1973), 《弱关系的力量》, 美国社会学杂志 (AJS), 78(6)�WGranovetter, M. (1973), The Strength of Weak Ties, American Journal of Sociology, 78(6)��id�13a0f918e68d�body�٫民族主义是一种认同并忠诚于本民族、主张民族自决的政治意识形态，既推动了现代民族国家的建立，也可能走向排他乃至冲突。��Nationalism is an ideology of identification with and loyalty to one’s nation, asserting self-determination. It helped build the modern nation-state but can also turn exclusive or conflictual.�ans��src��fMichael Billig，《Banal Nationalism》（平庸民族主义），伦敦：Sage出版社，1995年。�3Billig, M. (1995). Banal Nationalism. London: Sage.��id�141cd36c5f91�body��h因为存在严重的信息不对称：生产者远比消费者清楚食品是否安全，而安全问题往往要到出事后才暴露。在竞争压力下，个别企业可能偷工减料，损害却由消费者健康和整个行业的信誉承担。政府通过标准、检验、许可和处罚提高违规成本，保护消费者的知情权和健康权。��Because of severe information asymmetry: producers know far more about whether food is safe than buyers do, and problems surface only after harm occurs. Under competitive pressure, some firms cut corners while consumers' health and the industry's reputation absorb the damage. Government regulation, through standards, inspection, licensing, and penalties, raises the cost of cheating and protects consumers' right to know and their health.�ans��src��OBator,《The Anatomy of Market Failure》(Quarterly Journal of Economics, 1958)�UFrancis Bator, 'The Anatomy of Market Failure' (Quarterly Journal of Economics, 1958)��id�18fa7be4a68e�body���回音室效应指人们被封闭在重复自身观点的信息环境中，难以接触异见。个性化推送为追求互动而持续供给同质内容，使观点极化与错误信念更易固化。��The echo chamber effect describes being enclosed in information that merely echoes one's own views, with little exposure to dissent. Personalization feeds homogeneous content to maximize engagement, entrenching polarization and misbelief.�ans��src��a凯斯·桑斯坦《共和国 2.0:数字时代的民主复兴》,普林斯顿大学出版社,2018�kCass R. Sunstein, Republic.com 2.0: Reviving Democracy in the Digital Age, Princeton University Press, 2018��id�191e87cc23b0�body��米尔斯在 1959 年提出，社会学想象力是看清「个人烦恼」与「公共议题」之间联系的能力，例如失业若普遍发生，就不是个人懒散而是经济结构问题。它提醒我们跳出自身经验，从更广阔的社会背景理解命运。�KMills argued in 1959 that the sociological imagination is the ability to see the link between 'personal troubles' and 'public issues'—for instance, widespread unemployment is a structural economic problem, not mere personal laziness. It urges us to step beyond private experience and read our fate against broader social context.�ans��src��&Mills，《社会学想象力》(1959)�,Mills, 'The Sociological Imagination' (1959)��id�1a461d5204c9�body���外部性是一方经济活动对无直接交易关系的第三方产生的影响。疫苗接种使他人也免于感染，是正外部性；工厂排污损害下游居民健康，是负外部性。��An externality is an effect of one party's economic activity on third parties with no direct transaction. Vaccination protects others from infection, a positive externality; a factory's pollution harms downstream residents' health, a negative one.�ans��src��/《经济学原理》(曼昆)（外部性章）�7Principles of Economics (Mankiw), externalities chapter��id�1aa821807247�body�پNGO 提供本地信息、监督政府与企业的行为、在谈判中代表弱势声音，并填补公共服务空白；它们也常因代表性不足或受资助方影响而受到质疑。��NGOs supply local knowledge, monitor states and firms, voice marginalized groups in negotiations, and fill service gaps—though they're also questioned for weak representativeness or funder influence.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1ac509f44d0f�body���贸易逆差意味着一国进口多于出口，其反面是资本净流入：外国人持有该国资产，或该国借款消费，因此贸易余额与储蓄-投资缺口是一体两面。逆差国当下获得更多商品与服务，但资产转移到了外国；是否“吃亏”取决于资金用途——若投向高回报项目而非纯消费，未来仍可偿债。经济学家普遍认为贸易本身是双赢，逆差并非简单的好坏标志。�HA trade deficit means a country imports more than it exports; the mirror image is net capital inflows—foreigners hold its assets, or it borrows to consume, so the trade balance and the savings-investment gap are two sides of the same coin. The deficit country gets more goods and services now but transfers assets abroad; whether it is “losing” depends on how borrowed funds are used—if for high-return investment rather than consumption, debts remain serviceable. Economists generally view trade itself as mutually beneficial, so a deficit is not a simple good-or-bad signal.�ans��src��8IMF（《金融与发展》·“贸易逆差”专题）�1IMF (Finance & Development, “Trade Deficits”)��id�1ac7d55560e4�body���迁移是“推拉因素”共同作用的结果：家乡的推力包括收入低、就业机会少、自然灾害或环境压力；目的地的拉力包括更高的工资、更好的教育医疗和发展机会。人们会权衡迁移的成本（路费、适应困难、与家人分离）与收益。经济机会是最主要的动因，而迁移也会反过来改变迁出地与迁入地的人口结构和家庭关系。��Migration results from push and pull factors working together: home pushes include low income, scarce jobs, disasters, or environmental pressure; destination pulls include higher wages, better education and health care, and opportunity. People weigh the costs of moving, such as expense, adjustment, and separation from family, against the gains. Economic opportunity is the strongest driver, and migration in turn reshapes population and families in both origin and destination.�ans��src��*联合国（国际移民与人口研究）�CUnited Nations (research on international migration and population)��id�1b16d857bf70�body��2国家结盟主要为了安全和共同利益。单个国家面对威胁时力量有限，结盟能互相承诺军事保护、分摊成本和威慑对手（集体安全）。联盟也方便贸易、情报共享和外交协调。本质上，结盟是“抱团”以降低风险、放大影响力的策略。�tCountries form alliances mainly for security and shared interests. A single state facing a threat is limited, but an alliance offers mutual defense, shares costs, and deters adversaries through collective security. Alliances also ease trade, intelligence sharing, and diplomatic coordination. In essence, banding together is a strategy to lower risk and amplify influence.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1b31589485ee�body�٥双曲贴现指人们极度偏好即时小奖励而低估未来大奖励，导致拖延与储蓄不足；与指数贴现不同，偏好会随延迟缩短而反转。��Hyperbolic discounting means people heavily prefer a smaller immediate reward over a larger later one, causing procrastination and under-saving; unlike exponential discounting, preferences reverse as the delay shrinks.�ans��src�ٰBrocas, Carrillo,《Rush and Procrastination Under Hyperbolic Discounting and Interdependent Activities》, Journal of Risk and Uncertainty, 2001 (DOI: 10.1023/a:1011161709914)٬Brocas, Carrillo, 'Rush and Procrastination Under Hyperbolic Discounting and Interdependent Activities', Journal of Risk and Uncertainty, 2001, DOI: 10.1023/a:1011161709914��id�1c084b85cce6�body�ف因材施教指根据每个学生的能力、兴趣和节奏来调整教学内容与方法，让不同的人都能有效进步。ْIndividualized instruction adapts content and method to each student's ability, interest, and pace so different learners can progress effectively.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1c6339d4b10e�body���句法研究词语如何组合成合乎语法的句子、以及句子结构背后的规则。不同语言语序不同（如汉语主谓宾、日语主宾谓），但都受普遍语法原则约束。��Syntax studies how words combine into grammatical sentences and the rules behind sentence structure. Languages differ in word order (Mandarin SVO, Japanese SOV) yet follow universal grammatical principles.�ans��src��0诺姆·乔姆斯基《句法结构》（1957）�/Noam Chomsky, “Syntactic Structures” (1957)��id�1d488f4dc1e8�body��r非劳动年龄人口（少儿与老人）与劳动年龄人口之比，反映每百名劳动者供养的人数。�kIt is the ratio of dependents (young and old) to working-age people, showing how many each worker supports.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�1e075cb98b5c�body���城市贫困的空间聚集与住房市场的歧视性做法（如历史上的红线拒贷）、公共住房选址，以及区划规则把廉价住房挡在资源丰富社区之外密切相关。隔离使低收入居民更难获得好学校、正规工作信息与公共服务，并强化社会污名。因此政策强调“去集中化”、社区综合更新和改革区划壁垒，而不只是向穷人转移收入。�Spatial clustering of urban poverty is closely tied to discriminatory housing practices (such as historical redlining), the siting of public housing, and zoning rules that keep affordable housing out of well-resourced neighborhoods. Segregation makes it harder for low-income residents to access good schools, formal job networks, and public services, and reinforces stigma. Policy therefore emphasizes deconcentration, comprehensive neighborhood renewal, and zoning reform, not just income transfers to the poor.�ans��src��(World Bank（《世界发展报告》）�%World Bank (World Development Report)��id�1e3f80c5ef4b�body���仪式是高度程式化、重复性的象征行为，如成人礼、祭祀与节气庆典。它强化群体认同、标记生命转折、维系宇宙观与社会秩序，并通过集体参与凝聚共同体。�Ritual is a highly formalized, repetitive symbolic act, such as initiations, sacrifices, and seasonal festivals. It reinforces group identity, marks life transitions, sustains cosmologies and social order, and binds community through collective participation.�ans��src��0涂尔干《宗教生活的基本形式》(1912)�=Emile Durkheim, The Elementary Forms of Religious Life (1912)��id�2024229d0901�body�ل社会阶层是根据收入、职业、教育等把人们划分成的不同群体，影响他们的生活方式、机会和权利。�tSocial class groups people by income, occupation, and education, shaping their lifestyle, opportunities, and rights.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�205cdd5da6bc�body�ٱ项目制、考核导向与“在场文化”使加班被默认为努力象征，有时也因人手不足。但长期加班损害健康与效率，多地已立法限制工时。��Project-based work, metrics, and “presenteeism” make overtime a default symbol of effort, sometimes from understaffing. But chronic overtime harms health and efficiency; many places now cap hours by law.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�20a6efdbf5be�body�ٓ常见类型包括外部性（交易影响无关第三方）、公共品供给不足、垄断造成的低效，以及买卖双方信息不平等。٪Common types include externalities (effects on third parties), under-provision of public goods, monopoly inefficiency, and unequal information between buyers and sellers.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�21bc194f5c86�body�ل摩擦性（换工作过渡期）、结构性（技能与岗位不匹配）和周期性（总需求不足）是三类主要失业。ىFrictional (job transitions), structural (skill mismatches), and cyclical (insufficient demand) are the three main types of unemployment.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2294fc2933e9�body���声调语言用音高变化区分词义，如汉语普通话有四个声调，“妈、麻、马、骂”音高不同意义各异。世界上过半语言具有声调特征，在非洲和东南亚尤为常见。��Tonal languages use pitch to distinguish meaning—Mandarin has four tones, so “mā, má, mǎ, mà” mean different things. Over half the world’s languages are tonal, especially across Africa and Southeast Asia.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�241d4c71697d�body��胡德在 1991 年概括的新公共管理，主张把竞争、绩效指标、分权与「顾客导向」引入政府，像经营企业一样提供公共服务。它在英美等国广泛推行，却也因「过度量化」与削弱公共价值而受到批评。�0Hood summarized in 1991 a New Public Management that brings competition, performance metrics, decentralization, and a 'customer orientation' into government, running public services like a business. Widely adopted in the US and UK, it is also criticized for over-quantification and eroding public values.�ans��src��1Hood，《四季皆宜的公共管理？》(1991)�3Hood, 'A Public Management for All Seasons?' (1991)��id�243f9108128d�body��18世纪欧洲对中国茶叶需求暴涨，英国人用白银购买，后来以鸦片抵偿逆差，直接酿成鸦片战争与贸易体系重塑。茶叶贸易也推动了中国与全球市场的深度连接。它说明单一商品能牵动国际政治。�MIn the 18th century European demand for Chinese tea surged; the British paid in silver and later offset the deficit with opium, directly precipitating the Opium Wars and a reshaping of the trade system. Tea also pulled China into deeper connection with global markets. It shows how a single commodity can move international politics.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�24f74401ecbe�body���谣言常裹着强烈的情绪——恐惧、愤怒或新奇，而情绪化内容更容易被转发；它简单易懂，不需要专业知识就能传播；很多人转发时并不核实来源，只在乎内容够不够劲爆。社交平台的推荐算法又偏好互动量高的内容，客观上放大了谣言。研究还发现，谣言在传播中会被不断“重塑”，越传越夸张。��Rumors are wrapped in strong emotion, such as fear, anger, or novelty, and emotional content gets shared more; they're simple and easy to grasp, needing no expertise to spread; many people forward without checking sources as long as it's sensational. Recommendation algorithms that favor high-engagement content amplify them, and research shows rumors get reshaped in transmission, becoming increasingly exaggerated.�ans��src��-中国科学院（网络谣言传播研究）�BChinese Academy of Sciences (research on online rumor propagation)��id�255ad96c34f0�body�ٖ法治指所有人和机构，包括政府，都必须遵守公开、公平的法律，而不是由掌权者随意决定。它保障公平与自由。ټThe rule of law means everyone and every institution, including government, is bound by open, fair laws rather than arbitrary decisions by those in power. It protects fairness and liberty.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�26f9ee360258�body���帕特南以社团参与、信任与互助频率的下降（如保龄球联赛式微）说明公民参与萎缩。黏合型资本强化群体内纽带，桥接型资本连接不同群体，后者更利于跨群体合作。��Putnam cited falling membership, trust, and reciprocity (e.g., declining bowling leagues) as evidence of eroding civic engagement. Bonding capital tightens in-group ties; bridging capital links diverse groups and aids cross-group cooperation.�ans��src��P罗伯特·帕特南《独自打保龄：美国社区的衰落与复兴》(2000)�VRobert D. Putnam, Bowling Alone: The Collapse and Revival of American Community (2000)��id�275b931d309e�body���不一定。社会学研究发现，许多传统能在现代化中存续并自我更新：传统节日与商业结合，传统服饰进入时尚设计，民俗成为旅游和文创资源。冲突确实存在——当某些习俗与平等、个体权利等现代价值相抵触时就会引发争议。社会通常通过“创造性转化”重新诠释传统，让它在新条件下仍有意义。��Not necessarily. Sociological research finds many traditions survive and renew themselves amid modernization: festivals merge with commerce, folk dress enters fashion, and customs become tourism and cultural-creative resources. Real conflicts do occur when customs clash with modern values like equality and individual rights. Societies usually creatively transform traditions, reinterpreting them so they stay meaningful under new conditions.�ans��src��,《社会学概论》(社会变迁与文化)�5Introduction to Sociology (social change and culture)��id�277a836de739�body���人口骤然密集、饮水与排污系统跟不上，使霍乱、鼠疫等传染病在城市中极易传播。19世纪欧洲城市就曾因卫生落后爆发多次瘟疫。现代下水道与公共卫生体系正是为应对这一问题而建。� Sudden population density with lagging water and sewage systems made cities ideal for spreading cholera, plague, and similar diseases. 19th-century European cities saw repeated outbreaks due to poor sanitation. Modern sewers and public health systems were built precisely to address this.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�28afe1f3dfa2�body��&人口迁移指人们为了工作、学习、家庭或安全等原因跨越一定边界（国内或国际）的长期居住地变动。它改变来源地与目的地的年龄结构和劳动力供给。迁移既是个人追求更好生活的选择，也带来文化融合与社会治理议题。�JMigration is the long-term change of residence across a boundary, domestic or international, for reasons like work, study, family, or safety. It alters the age structure and labor supply of both origin and destination. Migration is both a personal pursuit of better life and a source of cultural integration and governance issues.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�29282428ec61�body�ٍ人群因地理隔离、迁徙和历史交流不同，语音、词汇逐渐分化，就形成了同一语言下彼此略有差异的方言。ٞGeographic separation, migration, and distinct historical contact make pronunciation and vocabulary drift apart, producing regional varieties of one language.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2981afbccd03�body�٨社会化是个体学习所在社会的规范、价值观和技能的过程，主要通过家庭、学校、同伴和媒体完成，让人成为合格的社会成员。٥Socialization is how individuals learn a society's norms, values, and skills, mainly through family, school, peers, and media, becoming competent members of society.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2c805ae6b1ee�body��M竞争企业是“价格接受者”，按市场价格出售，只能调整产量；垄断者是“价格制定者”，面对向下倾斜的需求曲线，会通过限产把价格抬到边际成本之上以最大化利润。结果垄断产量低于、价格高于竞争水平，产生无谓损失，并伴随更高的垄断利润。�qA competitive firm is a price taker—it sells at the market price and only chooses how much to produce; a monopolist is a price setter facing a downward-sloping demand curve, restricting output to push price above marginal cost to maximize profit. The result is output below and price above the competitive level, creating deadweight loss and earning monopoly profits.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第15章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 15��id�2cd3543efb45�body���图腾是某些社会中被视为氏族祖先或保护象征的自然物（动植物或自然现象），成员以它命名并遵守相关禁忌。它体现了人类早期的族群认同与信仰体系。��A totem is a natural object—plant, animal, or phenomenon—regarded by a group as its ancestor or protective symbol, giving the group its name and associated taboos. It reflects early clan identity and belief systems.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2ceb38d990c9�body��《拿破仑法典》（法国民法典）以清晰条文统一了此前散乱的封建与地方法，确立「法律面前平等、私有财产保护与契约自由」等原则。它后来被欧洲多地及前殖民地借鉴，奠定了大陆法系的样板。�)The Napoleonic Code (French Civil Code) of 1804 replaced fragmented feudal and local laws with clear articles, establishing equality before the law, protection of private property, and freedom of contract. Later adopted across Europe and former colonies, it became the model for civil-law systems.�ans��src��#法国民法典（Code civil）1804�#French Civil Code (Code civil) 1804��id�2da78949be8e�body���该理论描述经济活动中心（发达地区）集聚资本与技术、外围（欠发达）提供原料并依附中心，造成区域不平衡，源于对贸易与投资的地理分析。��The theory pictures developed “cores” concentrating capital and tech while “peripheries” supply raw materials and depend on cores, producing regional imbalance via trade and investment geography.�ans��src��oFujita, Krugman & Venables,《The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade》(MIT Press, 1999)�kFujita, Krugman & Venables, The Spatial Economy: Cities, Regions, and International Trade (MIT Press, 1999)��id�2dda44932c4e�body���世界贸易组织（WTO）是管理全球贸易规则的国际组织，成立于1995年，前身是关贸总协定（GATT）。它推动关税减让、解决成员间贸易争端，并实行最惠国待遇原则。��The World Trade Organization (WTO), founded in 1995 from the General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade (GATT), administers global trade rules. It promotes tariff cuts, settles disputes, and applies the most-favored-nation principle.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2e6eefd82b6a�body�ٷ性别工资差距指平均而言女性收入低于男性，常用同龄同岗或全样本的比值衡量；成因包括职业隔离、工时、育儿负担与歧视等多重因素。ٸThe gender wage gap is women's lower average earnings versus men's, measured overall or by role; causes include occupational segregation, hours, caregiving burdens, and discrimination.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2ee4151cce9b�body���当人们依赖观察他人的行为而非自己的私有信息做决定时，早期决策会传递信号，使后来者忽视自身判断、模仿前者行为，形成“信息瀑布”。它解释了股市追涨、产品爆红、排队跟风等现象。瀑布对微小扰动高度敏感，一个早期随机事件就能锁定结果，因此群体可能一致走向并非最优的选择。��An informational cascade occurs when people rely on observing others' actions rather than their own private information; early decisions transmit signals that make later people ignore their own judgment and imitate, forming a cascade. It explains stock-market herding, viral products, and queue-following. Cascades are highly sensitive to small disturbances—one early random event can lock in an outcome—so crowds can converge on choices that are not optimal.�ans��src�ٻBikhchandani, Hirshleifer, Welch,《Learning from the Behavior of Others: Conformity, Fads, and Informational Cascades》,Journal of Economic Perspectives,1998 (DOI: 10.1257/jep.12.3.151)ٹBikhchandani, Hirshleifer, Welch, 'Learning from the Behavior of Others: Conformity, Fads, and Informational Cascades', Journal of Economic Perspectives, 1998, DOI: 10.1257/jep.12.3.151��id�2f4ba7ad31e6�body��比较优势理论由大卫·李嘉图在 1817 年《政治经济学及赋税原理》中提出，认为即使一国在所有商品上都不具绝对优势，只要专注生产机会成本较低的商品并贸易，双方仍能获益。它是现代国际贸易理论的基石。�HThe theory of comparative advantage, proposed by David Ricardo in 1817 (“On the Principles of Political Economy and Taxation”), holds that even if a country has no absolute advantage, both sides gain by specializing in goods with lower opportunity cost and trading. It is the foundation of modern international trade theory.�ans��src��?大卫·李嘉图《政治经济学及赋税原理》（1817）�ODavid Ricardo, “On the Principles of Political Economy and Taxation” (1817)��id�30f322f30c00�body��购买力平价认为，同样的商品篮子在各国的价格经汇率折算后应趋于一致，因此汇率会向两国物价水平之比靠拢。古斯塔夫·卡塞尔在 1918 年系统阐述该理论，国际货币基金组织也据此构建可比的「实际」汇率指标。�DPurchasing power parity holds that a basket of goods should cost the same everywhere once prices are converted at the exchange rate, so the rate gravitates toward the ratio of the two countries' price levels. Gustav Cassel formalized it in 1918, and the IMF still builds comparable 'real' exchange-rate measures on the idea.�ans��src��KCassel，《国际汇兑的异常偏差》(1918)；国际货币基金组织�DCassel, 'Abnormal Deviations in International Exchanges' (1918); IMF��id�30f33c540ba6�body���平台以「独立承包」身份归类劳动者，使其脱离雇主缴费的社保与工伤体系，失去稳定缴费基础。算法派单的不透明与收入波动又使自愿参保能力下降，保障进一步弱化。� Platforms classify workers as independent contractors, excluding them from employer-funded social insurance and injury schemes and removing a stable contribution base. Opaque algorithmic dispatch and income volatility also lower their ability to self-insure, weakening protection further.�ans��src��R国际劳工组织(ILO)《World Employment and Social Outlook》零工经济研究�@ILO, World Employment and Social Outlook (platform work studies)��id�315a4e5d8b4a�body���它证明在满足几项合理条件（如尊重个人偏好、不独裁）时，不存在一种投票规则能始终把个人偏好汇成一致的集体排序，说明集体决策总有难以兼顾的权衡。��It proves no voting rule can always turn individual preferences into a consistent social ordering while meeting sensible conditions (respecting preferences, no dictator), showing collective choice always involves trade-offs.�ans��src��/Arrow，《社会选择与个人价值》(1951)�3Arrow, 'Social Choice and Individual Values' (1951)��id�3173c169ea75�body�٢代际公平要求今天的政策不把成本转嫁给未来世代，如控制债务、保护环境、维持养老金可持续，使各代人负担相对合理。��Intergenerational equity demands today's policies not shift costs to future generations—e.g., controlling debt, protecting the environment, and keeping pensions sustainable—so burdens are fairly shared across eras.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�324c5257add4�body�ِ选举制度规定如何把选票转换成席位，如多数制、比例代表制等，不同规则会影响政党和候选人的胜出方式。ّAn electoral system rules how votes convert into seats, such as plurality or proportional representation, shaping how parties and candidates win.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�325b03611ccd�body���OECD 研究表明，移民总体对接收国财政多为小幅净贡献或中性，取决于年龄结构与技能构成；年轻、高技能移民长期更可能净贡献，老龄低技能短期或增加福利支出。�OECD research shows immigrants are mostly a small net fiscal contribution or neutral, depending on age structure and skills; young, high-skilled migrants are more likely to contribute net long run, while older low-skilled ones may raise welfare outlays short term.�ans��src��8OECD (2018), 《移民融合指标 2018》, 经合组织�5OECD (2018), Indicators of Immigrant Integration 2018��id�3367a00eab80�body���流域是地表水与地下水汇入同一条河流及其支流所覆盖的集水区域，以分水岭为界。上下游共享同一水系，使水污染、灌溉与洪水管理必须跨越行政边界协作。��A river basin is the land area where surface and groundwater drain into one river and its tributaries, bounded by watersheds. Up- and downstream share one system, so pollution, irrigation, and flood control need cross-boundary cooperation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�336cafed7354�body�ٖ知识产权保护人们创造的脑力成果，如发明、文学艺术作品和品牌，让创造者在一定时间内独占收益，鼓励创新。٦Intellectual property protects mental creations such as inventions, artistic works, and brands, giving creators exclusive benefits for a time to encourage innovation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�34ba5c85d36c�body���价格弹性衡量需求量对价格变动的敏感程度。弹性大说明小幅涨价会导致需求大幅下降（如奢侈品），弹性小说明价格变化对需求影响有限（如食盐、必需药品）。��Price elasticity measures how sensitive demand is to price changes. High elasticity means a small price rise sharply cuts demand (e.g., luxury goods); low elasticity means demand barely moves (e.g., salt, essential medicine).�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3936da2bbde6�body��JGDP（国内生产总值）是一年内一国生产的全部最终商品和服务的市场价值，反映经济活动的总体规模。人均GDP越高，通常意味着平均收入和物质生活水平越高。但它并不等于幸福：它不计入家务劳动、休闲和环境损失，也反映不出收入分配是否公平。��GDP (gross domestic product) is the market value of all final goods and services a country produces in a year; it captures the overall scale of economic activity. Higher GDP per person usually goes with higher average income and material living standards. But it isn't happiness: unpaid housework, leisure, and environmental damage are excluded, and it says nothing about how income is shared.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�394ca8d3c473�body���嵌入性主张市场与交易并非发生在真空，而是根植于人际关系与信任之中。经济行为受社会纽带约束，信任降低交易成本，但也可能因关系封闭而排斥外人或滋生腐败。��Embeddedness holds that markets and transactions are not in a vacuum but rooted in personal relations and trust. Social ties constrain economic action and lower transaction costs, yet can also exclude outsiders or breed corruption through closure.�ans��src�ٌGranovetter,《Economic Action and Social Structure: The Problem of Embeddedness》,American Journal of Sociology,1985 (DOI: 10.1086/228311)يGranovetter, 'Economic Action and Social Structure: The Problem of Embeddedness', American Journal of Sociology, 1985, DOI: 10.1086/228311��id�3a4fb7c65b9e�body��z股东（委托人）将经营交给经理（代理人），而经理的激励与股东不一定一致，可能追求帝国扩张、在职消费或过度避险，这就是“代理人问题”。董事会代表股东监督和任免高管、批准重大决策，并通过薪酬设计（股权激励、业绩挂钩）和监督机制缓解利益冲突，降低委托代理成本。��Shareholders (principals) delegate management to executives (agents) whose incentives may diverge from owners'—empire building, perks, or excessive risk-aversion—the classic principal-agent problem. The board of directors represents shareholders in overseeing and appointing executives, approving major decisions, and using incentive pay (equity, performance-based compensation) and monitoring to align interests and reduce agency costs.�ans��src��"OECD（《公司治理原则》）�2OECD (G20/OECD Principles of Corporate Governance)��id�3bd006fb5c57�body���社会控制是社会通过奖惩、舆论、法律与内化规范，使成员行为符合社会期待的机制，既可由国家自上而下的强制，也可由社区与家庭自下而上完成。��Social control is how society keeps conduct within expected bounds—through rewards, sanctions, public opinion, law, and internalized norms. It ranges from top-down state coercion to bottom-up community and family pressure.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3be2f00b8384�body�ي供给是生产者愿意卖出的数量，需求是消费者愿意购买的数量。两者相遇的平衡点决定了价格和交易量。ّSupply is how much producers want to sell, demand is how much consumers want to buy. Their intersection determines the price and quantity traded.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3bedabc2c73b�body�ٟ姓氏常与古代氏族迁徙、郡望与人口迁徙有关，如中原南迁使某些姓在南方聚集。地名与族谱保留了这种历史分布痕迹。��Surnames often trace to ancient clan migrations, distinguished lineages, and population moves—e.g., central-plain southward migration clustered some names in the south. Place names and genealogies preserve these historical patterns.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�3cbb08ae26f2�body���最低工资是劳动力市场的“价格下限”，法律不允许工资低于这个水平。支持者认为它能保障低收入者基本生活、减少贫困；反对者担心如果定得过高，企业会减少用工，反而让部分低技能劳动者失去工作。实际影响取决于定多高、劳动力市场状况如何，多数经济学研究的共识是：温和的最低工资副作用很小，大幅提高才可能带来明显的就业代价。��A minimum wage is a price floor on labor: by law, wages can't fall below a set level. Supporters say it protects low earners and cuts poverty; critics worry that if set too high, firms hire fewer people and some low-skill jobs disappear. The real effects depend on the level and market conditions, and most economic research finds modest floors cause little harm while large jumps carry clearer employment costs.�ans��src��2《经济学原理》(曼昆)（价格控制章）�8Principles of Economics (Mankiw), price controls chapter��id�3d35add601f8�body���政治意识形态是一套关于理想社会应如何组织、权力应如何分配的系统化信念，如自由主义、保守主义、社会主义。它为政党纲领与政策辩论提供基本坐标。��A political ideology is a coherent set of beliefs about how society should be organized and power distributed—liberalism, conservatism, socialism. It frames party platforms and policy debate.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4186265c76a2�body�ٓ宪法规定国家的基本制度、政府结构和公民权利，是治理的最高规则。它像游戏规则书，防止权力被随意滥用。ٷA constitution sets out the basic system, government structure, and citizens' rights as the supreme rule of governance. Like a rulebook, it prevents power from being used arbitrarily.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�441a7e55f616�body���侵权法调整因过错或危险行为侵害他人人身、财产权益而产生的赔偿责任，如交通事故、医疗过失。它不同于刑法：其目的是补偿受害人而非惩罚犯罪。��Tort law governs compensation when wrongful or risky conduct harms another’s person or property—car accidents, medical negligence. Unlike criminal law, its aim is to compensate the victim, not punish.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�4589d339b8bf�body�ف死亡率是某时期死亡人数与人口之比；预期寿命指新生儿平均预期存活年数，二者反映健康水平。ًMortality is deaths per population in a period; life expectancy is the average years a newborn is expected to live, both reflecting health.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�45ebab5c6458�body���常见中心性包括度中心性（直接连接数）、接近中心性（到他人平均距离）与中介中心性（位于路径要冲的程度）。它们分别刻画一个节点在连接、可达与桥接上的重要性。��Common centralities include degree (number of direct ties), closeness (average distance to others) and betweenness (position on shortest paths). They capture a node's importance in connection, reachability and brokering respectively.�ans��src��cWasserman, S. & Faust, K. (1994), 《社会网络分析：方法与运用》, 剑桥大学出版社�oWasserman, S. & Faust, K. (1994), Social Network Analysis: Methods and Applications, Cambridge University Press��id�46c0f4860536�body��7比较优势是指一方在生产某种商品时相对成本低于另一方，即使它并非在所有方面都更高效。根据大卫·李嘉图的贸易理论，各国专注生产具有比较优势的产品并相互贸易，能使整体产出增加。这一原理是国际贸易分工的重要理论基础。�lComparative advantage means one party can produce a good at a lower opportunity cost than another, even if it is not absolutely more efficient at everything. David Ricardo's trade theory shows that when countries specialize in their comparative advantages and trade, total output can increase. This principle underlies the division of labor in international trade.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�46c72e0865d6�body�ٟ中秋赏月团圆、以圆月与圆饼象征圆满；重阳登高源于避灾与敬老传统，后定为老年节。节俗多与自然节律和祈福有关。��Mid-Autumn pairs moon-viewing and reunion, with round moon and cakes symbolizing completeness; Double Ninth climbing stems from disaster-avoidance and elder-respect, later made Seniors’ Day. Festivals tie to natural rhythms and blessings.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�47fa4852433d�body�ٺ认知偏差是人们在判断与决策中系统性偏离理性的思维捷径，如锚定效应、可得性偏差。它们多为大脑节省认知能量的产物，却常导致误判。ٳA cognitive bias is a systematic deviation from rational judgment—like anchoring or availability bias. They are mental shortcuts that save mental energy but often lead to error.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�492890e38373�body���NGO 是由民间发起、以公益为目标的非营利组织，在人道救援、环保、人权等领域运作。它们通过提供实地信息、监督履约和倡导议程，填补国家与政府间组织的治理缝隙。�'NGOs are non-profit, civil-society organizations pursuing public-interest goals in areas like humanitarian aid, environment, and human rights. They fill governance gaps left by states and intergovernmental bodies by supplying ground-level information, monitoring compliance, and shaping agendas.�ans��src��B联合国经社理事会(ECOSOC) 非政府组织咨商地位文件�,UN ECOSOC, NGO consultative status documents��id�4a3528a54c60�body��#物质文化指人类创造的可触知的实物，如工具、建筑、服饰和艺术品；非物质文化指观念、语言、习俗、信仰与制度等不可触知的部分。两者共同构成一种文化，并相互影响。研究它们有助于理解社会的物质与精神维度。�VMaterial culture refers to tangible objects humans create, such as tools, buildings, clothing, and art; non-material culture refers to intangible parts like ideas, language, customs, beliefs, and institutions. Together they form a culture and influence each other. Studying both helps understand a society's material and spiritual dimensions.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4bb0a1c9514e�body���公民社会指国家与政府之外、由公民自愿结成的非营利性组织与公共空间，如社团、工会、公益团体和媒体。它在民主社会中起到监督权力、凝聚公共意见的作用。��Civil society is the realm outside the state and government formed by citizens’ voluntary, non-profit associations and public spaces—clubs, unions, charities, and media. In democracies it checks power and helps form public opinion.�ans��src��J联合国（UN）《千年宣言》；托克维尔《论美国的民主》�UUnited Nations, “Millennium Declaration”; Tocqueville, “Democracy in America”��id�4cd2da99c0a2�body��q社会角色是社会对处在特定位置的人的一套行为预期，比如老师要教书育人、医生要救死扶伤。每个人同时是子女、学生、朋友、员工，因此同时承担着多种角色。当不同角色的要求彼此冲突（比如加班与陪家人），就会产生“角色冲突”，这是现代人普遍承受的压力来源之一。��A social role is the set of behaviors society expects from someone in a particular position, such as teachers teaching and doctors healing. Everyone is simultaneously a child, a student, a friend, and an employee, so we carry many roles at once. When the demands of different roles clash, such as overtime versus family time, role conflict arises, a common source of stress in modern life.�ans��src��,《社会学概论》(社会化与角色章)�;Introduction to Sociology (socialization and roles chapter)��id�4d459c9deef6�body���弗里德曼在 1962 年主张把政府教育拨款换成「直接发给家庭的券」，让家长用券「选购」学校，迫使公立校相互竞争、提升质量。该设想深刻影响了后来的择校与特许学校改革。�	Friedman argued in 1962 that governments should give education funds as vouchers directly to families, letting parents 'shop' for schools and forcing public schools to compete and improve. The idea strongly influenced later school-choice and charter-school reforms.�ans��src��,Friedman，《资本主义与自由》(1962)�)Friedman, 'Capitalism and Freedom' (1962)��id�4f23836a5164�body���文化资本指家庭传递的语言、品味、教养与知识等符号性资源。学校评价体系往往契合中产文化，使拥有这类资本的学生更易获得认可与高分数，从而把家庭背景转化为学业优势。�Cultural capital is the symbolic resources transmitted by families, such as language, taste, and knowledge. School evaluation tends to align with middle-class culture, so students possessing it gain recognition and grades, converting family background into academic advantage.�ans��src��$布迪厄《资本的形式》(1986)�.Pierre Bourdieu, 'The Forms of Capital' (1986)��id�4f7b26c2fc6c�body��)人道主义干预指为一国境内制止大规模人道灾难（如种族灭绝）而未经东道国同意使用武力。它在《联合国宪章》禁止使用武力的一般规则下缺乏明确授权，支持者诉诸「保护的责任」，反对者担忧其被用作干涉内政的借口。�@Humanitarian intervention is the use of force, without the host state's consent, to halt mass atrocities such as genocide. It lacks clear authorization under the Charter's general ban on force; supporters invoke the Responsibility to Protect, while critics fear it becomes a pretext for interference in internal affairs.�ans��src��=联合国《保护的责任》(2005 世界峰会成果文件)�9UN, Responsibility to Protect (2005 World Summit Outcome)��id�4ffdc242ba7f�body�ٺ杜瓦杰定律指出，单一选区多数制倾向于形成两党制，而比例代表制有利于多党并存。制度设计通过「机械」与「心理」效应塑造政党体系。��Duverger's law holds that single-member plurality systems tend toward two parties, while proportional representation favours multiparty systems. Electoral design shapes party systems through mechanical and psychological effects.�ans��src��CDuverger, M. (1951), 《政党概论》, 阿尔芒·科兰出版社�4Duverger, M. (1951), Political Parties, Armand Colin��id�500d13374bec�body���普特南与福山等表明普遍信任降低交易成本、促进大规模合作组织，而仅限血缘的特殊信任限制企业规模。信任因此被视为非正式制度资本，影响增长与治理质量。��Putnam and Fukuyama show generalized trust lowers transaction costs and enables large cooperative organizations, whereas kin-bound particularistic trust limits firm scale. Trust acts as informal institutional capital shaping growth and governance.�ans��src��x弗朗西斯·福山《信任：社会美德与创造经济繁荣》(1995) 与帕特南《使民主运转起来》(1993)�wFrancis Fukuyama, Trust: The Social Virtues and the Creation of Prosperity (1995); Putnam, Making Democracy Work (1993)��id�50698c04c4b8�body��《联邦党人文集》是汉密尔顿、麦迪逊和杰伊在 1787–1788 年匿名撰写的 85 篇论文，主张批准美国宪法并以分权与联邦制防范暴政。它被视为美国宪政思想的核心文献，对理解美国制度设计影响最大。�“The Federalist Papers” are 85 essays written anonymously in 1787–1788 by Hamilton, Madison, and Jay advocating ratification of the U.S. Constitution through separation of powers and federalism to guard against tyranny. It is a central text of American constitutional thought.�ans��src��J汉密尔顿、麦迪逊、杰伊《联邦党人文集》（1787–1788）�BHamilton, Madison & Jay, “The Federalist Papers” (1787–1788)��id�515d6d3b3dc9�body��z18世纪晚期始于英国，以蒸汽机与工厂制度取代手工生产，引发了持续的经济增长与城市化。ىBeginning in late-18th-century Britain, steam power and factories replaced hand production, triggering sustained growth and urbanization.�ans��src��|E. P. 汤普森：《时间、工作纪律与工业资本主义》，《过去与现在》1967年第38期，第56–97页。�mE. P. Thompson, Time, Work-Discipline, and Industrial Capitalism, Past & Present, no. 38 (1967), pp. 56–97.��id�525dbc527c62�body���全民医疗保险指所有居民都能获得所需医疗服务而不致陷入经济困境。世界卫生组织将其列为可持续发展目标，实现方式包括单一支付方、社会医疗保险等。��Universal health coverage means all residents can access needed health services without financial hardship. The WHO marks it as a Sustainable Development Goal, achieved via single-payer, social insurance, and other models.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5264e9f40681�body��e紧密的社区提供“社会支持”：遇到困难有人帮忙，压力有处倾诉；邻里互助（照看孩子、照顾老人）减轻家庭负担；社区活动让人感到被需要、有归属感，减少孤独。大量研究一致发现，社会联系强的人身心更健康、寿命更长，社会支持就像健康的重要“保护因素”。�{Close-knit communities provide social support: help in hard times, someone to talk to under stress, shared childcare and eldercare, and a sense of being needed and belonging that fights loneliness. A large body of research consistently finds people with strong social ties are healthier in body and mind and live longer; social support acts as a key protective factor for health.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�527ab5b9914b�body���普通法（以英国、美国为代表）以判例和法官造法为核心，强调遵循先例；大陆法（以法德为代表）以成文法典为基础，由立法机关系统编纂规则。两者在法律渊源和审判推理方式上差异显著。�Common law (exemplified by the UK and US) centers on case law and judge-made precedent, emphasizing stare decisis; civil law (exemplified by France and Germany) is built on codified statutes enacted by legislatures. They differ markedly in sources of law and reasoning.�ans��src��R约翰·亨利·梅里曼《大陆法系》（Merryman, The Civil Law Tradition）�2John Henry Merryman, “The Civil Law Tradition”��id�56e76072a32a�body�ٽ核心家庭化指家庭规模缩小、以夫妻加未婚子女为主，传统扩大家庭减少。城市化、流动与观念变化推动该趋势，并改变代际同住与赡养模式。��Nuclear-family formation means smaller households centred on a couple and unmarried children, with traditional extended families declining. Urbanisation, mobility and changing norms drive this, altering co-residence and care patterns.�ans��src��:联合国 (2019), 《世界人口老化 2019》, 联合国�3United Nations (2019), World Population Ageing 2019��id�58065481768d�body���当居住地登记绑定教育、医疗和福利资格时，乡村居民进城后可能难以平等享受城市公共服务，限制其流动与融入，固化城乡落差（以具体国家的制度为准）。��When residence registration ties access to education, health, and welfare, rural migrants to cities may be excluded from equal services, limiting mobility and integration and locking in the gap (varies by country's system).�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�58d69d6c83c2�body���它相对世袭更公平，但偏向有财力长期读书的男性家庭，且以诗赋经义取士，偏好文学记忆而非技术、商业与实操能力。它塑造了文官精英，却也弱化了工商与技术阶层的上升通道。��It was fairer than heredity but favored male families who could afford years of study, and tested classical essays over technical, commercial or practical skill. It built a literary elite while narrowing paths for merchants, engineers and artisans.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�598f68f9cc60�body���贸易逆差指一国进口额大于出口额，意味着对外净支出；贸易顺差则相反，出口大于进口。长期巨额逆差可能加重外债，长期大额顺差则可能积累外汇储备并引发贸易摩擦。�A trade deficit occurs when a country imports more than it exports, implying a net outflow of funds; a trade surplus is the opposite. Persistent large deficits can raise external debt, while large surpluses build foreign reserves and may spark trade tensions.�ans��src��8IMF（《金融与发展》·“贸易逆差”专题）�1IMF (Finance & Development, “Trade Deficits”)��id�5a817a6685b5�body���议会制中政府首脑通常由议会多数党领袖出任，行政与立法联系紧密，不信任投票可倒阁；总统制下总统独立于议会、任期固定，权力划分更清晰。��In a parliamentary system the head of government is usually the legislative majority leader and can be ousted by a no-confidence vote; in a presidential system the president is elected separately with a fixed term and clearer separation of powers.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�5b32ae841128�body���族群是指基于共同的祖先、语言、宗教或文化认同而自我认同并被他人识别的社会群体。族群身份既有客观特征，也在社会互动中被建构和维系。理解族群有助于认识多元社会中的身份与冲突。�PAn ethnic group is a social group bound by shared ancestry, language, religion, or cultural identity, both self-identified and recognized by others. Ethnic identity has objective features but is also constructed and maintained through social interaction. Understanding ethnicity helps explain identity and conflict in diverse societies.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5c4a0d90f8aa�body�ٽ社会保障体系是国家通过立法为公民在年老、失业、疾病、工伤等风险时提供基本经济保障的制度集合，包括养老金、医疗保险与失业救济等。��A social security system is the set of state-backed programs giving citizens basic economic protection against old age, unemployment, illness, and injury—pensions, health insurance, unemployment benefits, and more.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5e2574fac8ab�body��举证责任指由哪一方负责提供证据以证明其主张的规则。在刑事案件中通常由控方承担，且需达到“排除合理怀疑”的高标准；民事案件多为“谁主张、谁举证”。合理分配举证责任对公正裁判至关重要。�2The burden of proof determines which party must produce evidence to support its claim. In criminal cases it usually rests on the prosecution and must meet a high 'beyond reasonable doubt' standard; in civil cases it is often 'he who asserts must prove.' Its fair allocation is crucial to just adjudication.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�5e2b3bda6d35�body���联合国于 1945 年 10 月 24 日（《联合国宪章》生效日）正式成立于二战结束之际，总部设在美国纽约。其前身是国际联盟，旨在维护国际和平与安全并促进合作。��The United Nations was formally established on October 24, 1945, when the UN Charter took effect, in the aftermath of World War II, with its headquarters in New York City. It succeeded the League of Nations to maintain peace, security, and cooperation.�ans��src��《联合国宪章》（1945）�$Charter of the United Nations (1945)��id�5eb9ba3361be�body���政治社会化是个人习得政治态度、价值观与行为方式的过程，家庭、学校、媒体和同龄人都是重要媒介。它解释了不同社会中政治文化为何得以代际延续。��Political socialization is how individuals acquire political attitudes, values, and behaviors, with family, school, media, and peers as key agents. It explains how political culture persists across generations.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5f7f43234795�body�ٷ两国都不扩军最安全、也最省钱，但各自担心对方先动手而选择扩军，结果双方都更危险、更费钱，陷入“互不信任—竞相扩军”的循环。پBoth countries would be safest and richest without arming, but each fears the other moving first and arms anyway, leaving both more dangerous and poorer—a cycle of distrust and escalation.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6098a0ccfc12�body�ٺ性别比是人口中男性对女性的数量之比，通常用每100名女性对应的男性数表示。出生性别比自然约为105，但某些地区因偏好男孩而明显偏高。��The sex ratio is the number of males per females in a population, often per 100 females. The natural sex ratio at birth is about 105, but some regions show higher imbalances due to son preference.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�619ecc4e2701�body���经济制裁是国家或多边组织以冻结资产、限制贸易或金融往来等手段，迫使目标国改变政策的外交工具。其效果不一，且常对普通民众产生连带影响。��Economic sanctions are tools—asset freezes, trade or financial restrictions—used by states or multilateral bodies to push a target country to change policy. Effects vary, and they often hurt ordinary citizens too.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�626fe258eaef�body���罗肯认为民族、宗教、阶层与城乡等历史裂痕固化了政党阵营，使政党体系长期稳定。新建政党难以跨越既有裂痕重组，解释了欧洲多数政党格局的持久性。�Rokkan argued that historical cleavages—centre-periphery, church-state, class and rural-urban—froze party alignments, lending party systems long-run stability. New parties struggle to reconfigure across entrenched cleavages, explaining the durability of European party maps.�ans��src��RLipset, S. & Rokkan, S. (1967), 《政党体系与选民结盟》, 自由出版社�NLipset, S. & Rokkan, S. (1967), Party Systems and Voter Alignments, Free Press��id�632afdcc30ba�body���成本效益分析把所有可货币化的收益（如节省的时间、挽救的生命、改善的健康）加总，减去包括机会成本在内的全部成本，比较净现值并给项目排序。困难在于为生命、环境、时间定价，以及贴现率的选择会显著影响长期项目结论。它帮助决策者识别投入产出比更高的方案，避免决策被个别受益群体的声音主导。��Cost-benefit analysis sums all monetizable benefits (time saved, lives saved, health gains) minus all costs including opportunity costs, compares net present values, and ranks projects. Difficulties include valuing life, the environment, and time, and choosing a discount rate that heavily affects long-term projects. It helps decision-makers identify higher-value uses of public funds rather than being swayed by vocal interest groups.�ans��src�قDavid,《Benefit-Cost Analysis in State and Local Investment Decisions》,Public Administration Review,1979 (DOI: 10.2307/3110373)ـDavid, 'Benefit-Cost Analysis in State and Local Investment Decisions', Public Administration Review, 1979, DOI: 10.2307/3110373��id�63b7f6bf767d�body���利他模型（贝克尔）认为父母转移出于对子女效用的关切，会填补子女收入缺口；交换模型认为转移是对子女照料等服务的对价。两种逻辑对遗产税与赡养政策的预测截然不同。�The altruistic model (Becker) holds parents transfer out of concern for children's utility, filling income gaps; the exchange model sees transfers as payment for services like care. The two imply very different predictions for estate taxes and eldercare policy.�ans��src��9Becker, G. (1981), 《家庭论》, 哈佛大学出版社�EBecker, G. (1981), A Treatise on the Family, Harvard University Press��id�63bdae7c20bb�body���客观阶层按收入、职业、学历等可测量的标准划分；主观阶层则是个人自认为属于哪一层。两者常不一致：有人收入高却自认“普通”，也有人认同高于自身条件。��Objective class uses measurable criteria like income, occupation, and education; subjective class is what people feel they belong to. They often diverge—some high earners feel “ordinary,” others identify above their means.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�63c8a63c01ae�body���复利是指利息不仅计入本金生息，还会对之前产生的利息再计息，使财富随时间呈指数增长。其威力在长期坚持的投资中尤为显著，因而常被夸张地赞誉为“奇迹”。�Compound interest means interest is earned not only on the principal but also on previously accrued interest, so wealth grows exponentially over time. The effect is especially powerful in long-term investing, which is why it is often praised hyperbolically as a “wonder.”�ans��src��(美国消费者金融保护局（CFPB）�0U.S. Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB)��id�64424f556e08�body���多元文化政策旨在承认并支持少数族裔保持语言与文化，同时保障平等公民权，以缓解排斥、促进融入。但批评者担心它可能固化族群边界、削弱共同认同。��Multiculturalism policy aims to recognise and support ethnic minorities' languages and cultures while guaranteeing equal citizenship, easing exclusion and aiding integration. Critics worry it may entrench group boundaries and weaken common identity.�ans��src��8OECD (2018), 《移民融合指标 2018》, 经合组织�5OECD (2018), Indicators of Immigrant Integration 2018��id�64b81240ed83�body���1971 年 8 月，美国总统尼克松宣布暂停美元按固定价格兑换黄金，关闭「黄金窗口」。这一单边决定瓦解了布雷顿森林体系的固定汇率根基，世界从此进入浮动汇率与纯信用货币时代。��In August 1971 President Nixon suspended the dollar's fixed conversion into gold, closing the 'gold window.' This unilateral move unraveled the Bretton Woods fixed-rate foundation and ushered the world into floating rates and purely credit-based money.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6528609bdc09�body��,因为需求快速增长而供给在短期内来不及跟上，买的人多、货不够，卖方就会抬高价格，直到愿意出高价的买家和愿意出售的卖家重新平衡。价格上涨既是商品变稀缺的信号，也在给生产者发信号：利润变高了，值得扩大生产。�When demand jumps faster than supply can follow, buyers outnumber the goods on offer, so sellers raise prices until those willing to pay the new price match the supply. A rising price signals scarcity and simultaneously signals producers that profits warrant more output.�ans��src��2《经济学原理》(曼昆)（市场供求章）�;Principles of Economics (Mankiw), supply and demand chapter��id�66554a649db5�body���义务教育是国家依法规定适龄儿童和少年必须接受、通常由政府免费提供的基础教育阶段。它旨在保障基本学习权利并提升国民素质。义务教育年限在不同国家从6年到12年不等。�Compulsory education is the basic education stage that the state legally requires school-age children to attend, usually provided free by government. It aims to guarantee basic learning rights and raise national literacy. Its duration varies from about 6 to 12 years across countries.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�672d437fc91b�body���“看不见的手”是亚当·斯密用来描述个人在追求自身利益时，往往会无意中促进社会整体福利的机制。这一思想出自他 1776 年的《国富论》，成为自由市场理论的核心隐喻。�The “invisible hand” is Adam Smith’s metaphor for the mechanism by which individuals pursuing their own self-interest unintentionally promote the welfare of society as a whole. It appears in his 1776 “The Wealth of Nations” and became a cornerstone of free-market theory.�ans��src��>亚当·斯密《国富论》（The Wealth of Nations, 1776）�.Adam Smith, “The Wealth of Nations” (1776)��id�67e41017f6bf�body���社会资本是嵌入社会网络中的信任、规范与关系资源，可像物质资本一样被「投资」并带来回报（如更低交易成本、更易合作）。普特南将其定义为能通过协调行动提高效率的社会组织特征。� Social capital is the trust, norms and relational resources embedded in social networks that, like physical capital, can be invested and yield returns such as lower transaction costs and easier cooperation. Putnam defines it as features of social organisation enabling coordinated action.�ans��src��]Putnam, R. (2000), 《独自打保龄：美国社区的衰落与复兴》, 西蒙与舒斯特�bPutnam, R. (2000), Bowling Alone: The Collapse and Revival of American Community, Simon & Schuster��id�684af60c9a6f�body���研发投入大、风险高，而成果一旦公开就容易被模仿，若无保护将无人愿意投资。专利给予发明人有限期限（一般20年）的排他权，使其能收取高于竞争水平的价格以收回研发成本，形成动态创新激励。代价是专利期内价格偏高、产量受限（静态无效率），所以政策要在激励创新与限制垄断之间权衡，例如限定保护期限与范围。�
R&D is costly and risky, and once results are public they are easy to imitate, so without protection firms would underinvest. Patents grant inventors exclusive rights for a limited term (typically 20 years), letting them charge above-competitive prices to recoup R&D costs—creating dynamic innovation incentives. The cost is higher prices and restricted output during the patent term (static inefficiency), so policy must balance innovation incentives against monopoly power, for example through patent length and scope.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第15章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 15��id�6b8197be7e43�body�٣定作、鲜活易腐、拆封音像/软件、报纸期刊及个人卫生用品等通常不适用无理由退货。它平衡消费者反悔权与商家防滥用。��Custom-made, perishable, opened audio/video or software, newspapers, and personal hygiene items usually are excluded. The rule balances buyers’ regret rights with sellers’ abuse prevention.�ans��src�ِ曹,《Exceptions to “Seven-Day No-Reason Return”: Dilemmas and Countermeasures》,E-Commerce Letters,2025 (DOI: 10.12677/ecl.2025.14124140)َ曹, 'Exceptions to “Seven-Day No-Reason Return”: Dilemmas and Countermeasures', E-Commerce Letters, 2025, DOI: 10.12677/ecl.2025.14124140��id�6bf55d86bd89�body���戈德索普以“雇佣关系”（是否受雇、是否拥有自主权与晋升）划分阶级，服务阶级享有稳定契约与内部劳动力市场。该分类与客观生活机会高度相关，便于跨国比较代际流动。�Goldthorpe classifies by employment relations (whether one is employed, has autonomy and promotion prospects); the service class enjoys secure contracts and internal labor markets. The schema correlates strongly with life chances, enabling cross-national mobility comparison.�ans��src��K约翰·戈德索普《社会流动与阶级结构》(1980, 第二版 1987)�^John H. Goldthorpe, Social Mobility and Class Structure in Modern Britain (1980; 2nd ed. 1987)��id�6c10b10dbb7d�body�ه口语靠声音和表情即时交流，句子短而随意；书面语更规范、结构完整，适合记录和远距离传递信息。٩Spoken language uses sound and gesture for instant, casual, short exchanges; written language is more formal and structured, suited to records and distant communication.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6c60cfee48e4�body�ٜ刑法处理危害社会的行为，由国家追诉并可能判处刑罚；民法处理个人之间的纠纷，如合同或侵权，目的是赔偿损失。��Criminal law deals with acts harmful to society, prosecuted by the state and punished by penalties. Civil law handles disputes between individuals, such as contracts or torts, aiming to compensate losses.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6d2931b15c6b�body�ٟ陪审团由普通公民组成，负责根据事实判断被告是否有罪（或民事责任），让司法决定反映社会常识而非仅由官员决定。ْA jury of ordinary citizens decides the facts of a case, ensuring verdicts reflect community commonsense rather than being made only by officials.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6dc26a6f62a6�body��#这是格雷欣法则的通俗说法：当两种成色不同的货币法定等值流通时，人们会囤积足值的“良币”而花掉成色差的“劣币”，结果良币退出流通。它说明人为固定比价往往违背市场选择。该现象在双金属本位下尤为常见。�SThis is the popular phrasing of Gresham's law: when two coins of different fineness circulate at equal legal value, people hoard the full-weight “good” money and spend the debased “bad” money, so good money leaves circulation. It shows that fixed official ratios often contradict market choice, and it was common under bimetallism.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6f97cede58d4�body���帕森斯认为工业化使家庭丧失生产功能，核心家庭集中于抚育子女（社会化）与为成年成员提供情感慰藉（紧张舒缓）。该观点后被批评忽视了家庭内部的权力与冲突。��Parsons held that industrialization stripped the family of productive functions, leaving the nuclear family to socialize children and provide emotional relief (tension management). Critics note it ignored intra-family power and conflict.�ans��src��[塔尔科特·帕森斯与罗伯特·贝尔斯《家庭、社会化与互动过程》(1955)�YTalcott Parsons and Robert F. Bales, Family, Socialization and Interaction Process (1955)��id�71e046fad087�body�٢心理学家发现“选择过载”：选项太多会让人犹豫、担心选错，事后也更容易后悔。少而精的选择常比多而杂更让人踏实。٭Psychologists found 'choice overload': too many options cause hesitation, fear of wrong choice and later regret. Fewer, better choices often feel safer than many messy ones.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�72c47862e105�body���多边主义指三个或以上国家通过多边规则与机构（如联合国、世贸组织）协调行动、共同解决问题的合作方式，相对于单边或双边行动更具稳定性与代表性。��Multilateralism is cooperation among three or more states through shared rules and institutions like the UN and WTO, solving problems jointly—offering more stability and representation than unilateral or bilateral action.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�73e03d83828b�body��u公交减少拥堵、污染与道路占用，其社会效益常高于使用者付费，因此需要补贴来矫正。�oTransit cuts congestion, pollution, and road use; its social benefits often exceed fares, justifying subsidies.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�74ab672ca739�body��参与观察要求研究者长期生活在研究对象社区中、既参与又系统记录当地生活，这一民族志方法的现代范式由马林诺夫斯基在 1922 年《西太平洋的航海者》中确立。它至今仍是社会人类学收集资料的核心方法。�3Participant observation requires the researcher to live long-term in the studied community, both joining and systematically recording local life; its modern ethnographic form was established by Malinowski in 1922’s “Argonauts of the Western Pacific.” It remains the core method of social anthropology.�ans��src��N布罗尼斯拉夫·马林诺夫斯基《西太平洋的航海者》（1922）�DBronisław Malinowski, “Argonauts of the Western Pacific” (1922)��id�7588b77bee01�body���哈特曼指出男性“家庭工资”制度以单一养家者为前提，把女性固定在无酬家务劳动上，使资本得以低薪再利用劳动力。她把父权制与资本主义视为相互支撑的体系。��Hartmann argued the male 'family wage' presumed a single breadwinner, fixing women in unpaid domestic labor and letting capital reuse cheap labor. She viewed patriarchy and capitalism as mutually reinforcing systems.�ans��src��Q海蒂·哈特曼《马克思主义与女性主义的失败联姻》(1979, Signs)�LHeidi Hartmann, 'The Unhappy Marriage of Marxism and Feminism' (1979), Signs��id�75daf9792c5c�body���复杂传播需要多次、可信的社会确认才会被采纳；强关系提供反复互动与信任，足以克服采纳门槛。与之相对，弱关系擅长扩散简单信息却难以推动需要改变习惯的行为。��Complex contagions require multiple, credible social reinforcements to be adopted; strong ties supply repeated interaction and trust to clear adoption thresholds. Weak ties spread simple information but fail at behaviors needing habit change.�ans��src�ٗ达蒙·森托拉《网络与扩散的社会起源》(2010, American Journal of Sociology) 及其著作《改变一切：如何让大事发生》(2018)�wDamon Centola, 'The Social Origins of Networks and Diffusion' (2010, AJS); Change: How to Make Big Things Happen (2018)��id�76bac71fbb8c�body�ٷ负外部性是行为给旁人带来成本（如污染），正外部性是带来收益（如接种疫苗保护他人）；市场往往生产过多负外部性、过少正外部性。��Negative externalities impose costs on others (e.g., pollution); positive ones create benefits (e.g., vaccination protecting others). Markets tend to produce too much of the former and too little of the latter.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�78d4931d780f�body��,教育能减少贫困，是因为它提升人的生产力和就业能力，使人获得收入更高的工作。受教育程度高的人通常更健康、更会做财务与育儿决策，也更容易参与社会和公共事务。教育还能打破“贫困代际传递”，让下一代起点更高。�dEducation reduces poverty by raising people's productivity and employability, opening access to better-paid work. Better-educated people tend to be healthier, make sounder financial and parenting choices, and engage more in civic life. Education also breaks the intergenerational transmission of poverty, giving the next generation a higher starting point.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�79ab24041261�body��q身份认同回答“我是谁”，包含国籍、民族、性别、职业、信仰等许多维度。它由家庭和社会化过程塑造——语言、习俗、教育和共同经历让我们把自己归入某些群体，他人的看法也影响自我认知。身份并不是单一固定的，而是多重的、动态的，在不同场合会凸显出不同的面向。��Identity answers the question of who I am, spanning nationality, ethnicity, gender, occupation, faith, and more. It's shaped by family and socialization: language, customs, education, and shared experience place us in groups, while others' perceptions shape our self-image. Identity isn't single and fixed; it's multiple and dynamic, with different facets coming to the fore in different settings.�ans��src��,《社会学概论》(文化与社会化章)�=Introduction to Sociology (culture and socialization chapter)��id�79f364b98c41�body��]在多国拥有生产或经营实体的企业，能够优化成本与市场的全球配置。�SAn MNC operates entities in several countries, optimizing global costs and markets.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�7ab40401ec00�body�ٜ社会保障制度由政府向失业、生病、年老或贫困的人提供金钱或服务支持，像一张安全网，减少人们陷入绝境的风险。ٌThe social security system provides money or services to the unemployed, sick, elderly, or poor, acting as a safety net against destitution.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7b05d0b34177�body���该现象源于文化资本（家庭语言、教养方式）、经济资源与学校筛选机制叠加，使优势家庭能将其地位传递给子女。布迪厄指出，学校看似中立，实则复制了主导阶层的文化符码。��The pattern stems from the stacking of cultural capital, economic resources, and school selection, letting advantaged families transmit status. Bourdieu argued schools appear neutral yet reproduce the dominant class's cultural codes.�ans��src��=布迪厄《资本的形式》(1986) 与教育社会学研究�.Pierre Bourdieu, 'The Forms of Capital' (1986)��id�7cb7dba51310�body�ٓ活期利率通常远低于通胀率，实际购买力可能还在下降，所以“利息”感知很弱。它主要提供流动性而非增值。ٚChecking-account rates are usually far below inflation, so real purchasing power may even fall; the interest feels tiny. Its job is liquidity, not growth.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7f023ddc2341�body�ٍ通常通过消费者价格指数（CPI）或GDP平减指数的同比变化来衡量，反映一篮子商品与服务价格的总体上涨。ٶInflation is commonly measured by the year-on-year change in the Consumer Price Index (CPI) or the GDP deflator, capturing the broad rise in prices of a basket of goods and services.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7f6729a8f094�body��“丝绸之路”一词由德国地理学家费迪南·冯·李希霍芬在 1877 年的著作中首次使用，用来概括汉代中国与地中海世界之间通过中亚的古老贸易通道。这一名称后被广泛用于指代横跨欧亚的古代商路网络。�The term “Silk Road” was first used by German geographer Ferdinand von Richthofen in his 1877 work to describe the ancient trade routes linking Han China with the Mediterranean via Central Asia. The name later came to denote the broader Eurasian trade network.�ans��src��9费迪南·冯·李希霍芬《中国》（China, 1877）�,Ferdinand von Richthofen, “China” (1877)��id�7f73bcadd0f5�body��格伯纳在 1970 年代提出，长期大量看电视的人会逐渐把荧幕里的世界当成真实世界，例如高估暴力犯罪的发生概率。培养理论强调媒介不是直接「说服」，而是缓慢「培养」出一套关于社会的共识性想象。�%Gerbner argued in the 1970s that long-term heavy TV viewers gradually take the screen world for the real one—for example, overestimating the likelihood of violent crime. Cultivation theory stresses that media rarely persuades directly but slowly 'cultivates' a shared imagination of society.�ans��src��AGerbner，《培养分析》(1970年代)；Annenberg 传播学院�9Gerbner, 'Cultivation Analysis' (1970s); Annenberg School��id�8225a96ebae0�body�ٍ手语有完整的词汇和语法，能表达抽象和复杂的意思，而且是聋人社群自然形成的语言，和口语一样丰富。١Sign languages have full vocabularies and grammar, express abstract and complex meaning, and arise naturally in Deaf communities, as rich as any spoken language.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�82299c7c052c�body��u粮食安全指所有人随时随地都能获得充足、安全、营养的食物，以满足健康生活的需要。�lFood security means all people have reliable access to sufficient, safe, nutritious food for a healthy life.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�84864a0d31cf�body��w老龄化主要由出生率下降和人均寿命延长共同造成：出生的人变少，而人们活得更久，老年人口占比自然上升。它带来的挑战包括劳动力减少、养老金和医疗负担加重、失能照护需求增加。应对思路有延迟退休、完善生育支持政策、发展养老产业，以及在必要时引入移民补充劳动力。��Aging is driven mainly by falling birth rates and longer life expectancy: fewer births and longer lives raise the share of older people. Challenges include a shrinking workforce, heavier pension and health-care burdens, and rising care needs. Responses include later retirement, stronger support for childbearing, growing eldercare industries, and, where needed, immigration to replenish labor.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�85a2b9199f4e�body���语系指由共同原始语言分化而来的一组语言，如汉藏语系、印欧语系。语言学家通过比较词汇和语法复原“母语”，据此把全球数千种语言归类成若干语系。��A language family is a group of languages descended from a common ancestral language, such as Sino-Tibetan or Indo-European. Comparing vocabulary and grammar lets linguists reconstruct the parent tongue and classify thousands of languages.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�876c06b478e9�body��w零工劳动者通常按单计酬、自备工具、自主安排工作时间，平台多以“独立承包商”而非“雇员”身份对待他们，因而往往不享有最低工资、带薪休假、工伤保险等劳动保护，也难以集体协商。好处是进入门槛低、时间灵活，但伴随收入波动、社会保障缺失和算法管理不透明等问题。��Gig workers are usually paid per task, supply their own tools, and set their own hours; platforms typically classify them as “independent contractors” rather than employees, so they often lack minimum-wage protection, paid leave, and occupational-injury insurance, and can struggle to bargain collectively. Benefits include low entry barriers and flexible schedules, but gig work also brings income volatility, weak social protection, and opaque algorithmic management.�ans��src��4OECD（《就业展望2021》·平台经济章节）�8OECD (Employment Outlook 2021, platform economy chapter)��id�8ae8d3549f09�body�ٖ外交是国与国之间通过谈判、沟通和协议来处理关系、避免冲突、争取利益的活动，通常由外交官代表国家进行。٣Diplomacy is how states manage relations through negotiation, communication, and agreements to avoid conflict and pursue interests, usually conducted by diplomats.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8c1cde99e655�body���该理论把转变分为高死高产、死亡率先降、出生率跟进下降、低死低产四阶段，核心机制是工业化后死亡率下降而出生率滞后。它把生育率下降与城市化、教育及儿童成本上升联系起来。�The theory's four stages move from high stationary, through falling mortality, then falling fertility, to low stationary; the lag of fertility behind mortality is central. It links fertility decline to urbanization, education, and rising child-rearing costs.�ans��src�ك弗兰克·诺特斯坦《人口：长远视角》(1945, 收入《人口史研究》)；联合国《世界人口展望2022》报告َFrank W. Notestein, 'Population: The Long View' (1945), in Schulz (ed.) Population and Food Supplies; UN DESA, World Population Prospects 2022��id�8c23f135f5b0�body�ٖ濒危语言是使用者越来越少、年轻一代不再相传的语言，全球约有大量语言面临消失，常因强势语言同化而消亡。٣Endangered languages have few speakers and are not passed to younger generations; many face extinction worldwide, often through assimilation by dominant languages.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�8c699b8b1b28�body�ٜ当生育率长期低于更替水平、且移民不足时，去世的人多于出生的人，人口就会逐渐萎缩，常见于老龄化的发达国家。ِWhen fertility stays below replacement and immigration is low, deaths exceed births and population shrinks, common in aging developed countries.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�8d5267d190c7�body���框架理论关注媒体如何通过选取、强调与编排信息的角度，来塑造受众对事件的理解。同一事件用“事故”或“悲剧”框架呈现，会引发不同的公众反应。��Framing theory examines how the media shapes understanding by selecting, emphasizing, and organizing angles. The same event framed as an “accident” versus a “tragedy” evokes different public reactions.�ans��src��gRobert Entman,《Framing: Toward Clarification of a Fractured Paradigm》,Journal of Communication,1993�8R. M. Entman, Framing, Journal of Communication 43, 1993��id�8dde132290e7�body�ٜ氏族是以共同祖先为基础的血缘群体，部落则是由多个氏族或族群组成的更大共同体，常有共同的领袖、语言或领地。ٛA clan is a kin group based on a common ancestor; a tribe is a larger community of several clans or groups, often sharing a leader, language, or territory.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8f2405a17876�body���年龄结构指各年龄段人口在总人口中的占比，常用少年比、劳动年龄比和老年比表示。它决定抚养负担与发展潜力，老龄化社会表现为老年比重显著上升。��Age structure is the share of each age band in the total population, often as child, working-age, and elderly ratios. It shapes dependency and development potential; an aging society shows a rising elderly share.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�8f46504d9eb1�body���哈丁以公共牧场为例：每个牧民为私利增加牲畜，个体理性导致草场枯竭这一集体恶果。它说明在开放进入、缺乏产权或规则的公共资源上，自由使用必然走向耗竭。��Hardin's pasture example shows each herder adds livestock for private gain, and individual rationality exhausts the commons, a collective loss. It shows that open-access resources without property rights or rules are inevitably depleted by free use.�ans��src��7Hardin,《Science》(1968) 'The Tragedy of the Commons'�Garrett Hardin, Science (1968)��id�8f474754ec6c�body���发展援助是发达国家或机构向发展中国家提供的资金、技术与物资支持，旨在减贫、改善卫生与教育，常通过官方发展援助（ODA）统计。其有效性取决于治理与本地参与。�Development aid is financial, technical, and material support from developed countries or agencies to developing ones, aimed at reducing poverty and improving health and education, tracked as Official Development Assistance (ODA). Its impact depends on governance and local ownership.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8fe57a518c7a�body���工业革命是18世纪末至19世纪始于英国、以蒸汽机与工厂制度为代表的生产方式巨变。它推动城市化、生产力飞跃和社会结构重塑。其影响延续至今，也带来了环境与社会问题。�/The Industrial Revolution was the late-18th to 19th-century transformation beginning in Britain, marked by the steam engine and the factory system. It drove urbanization, a leap in productivity, and reshaped social structure. Its effects persist today and also brought environmental and social problems.�ans��src��JPolanyi, K. (1944), 《大转型：我们时代的政治与经济起源》�\Polanyi, K. (1944), The Great Transformation: The Political and Economic Origins of Our Time��id�90905863df44�body�ٹ复杂模型（如深度神经网络）的决策过程难以被人理解，称为黑箱。在医疗、司法等高风险场景，可解释AI帮助人们审查、追责并建立信任。��Complex models like deep neural networks make decisions hard to interpret (“black box”). In high-stakes domains like medicine and justice, explainable AI aids review, accountability, and trust.�ans��src���Rudin, Radin,《Why Are We Using Black Box Models in AI When We Don’t Need To? A Lesson From An Explainable AI Competition》,Harvard Data Science Review,2019 (DOI: 10.1162/99608f92.5a8a3a3d)ٿRudin, Radin, 'Why Are We Using Black Box Models in AI When We Don’t Need To? A Lesson From An Explainable AI Competition', Harvard Data Science Review, 2019, DOI: 10.1162/99608f92.5a8a3a3d��id�912dc590ab19�body���购买力平价（PPP）认为，同一篮子商品在不同国家的价格经汇率换算后应趋同，因为套利者会在价低处买、价高处卖（一价定律）。长期看，通胀较高国家的货币倾向贬值，这一方向大致成立。但它假定商品可自由交易，而服务业、住房等不可贸易品价格差异大，加上贸易壁垒与运输成本，使汇率在短期内大幅偏离PPP水平。��Purchasing power parity (PPP) holds that the same basket of goods should cost the same across countries once converted at the exchange rate, because arbitrageurs buy low and sell high (the law of one price). Over the long run, high-inflation currencies tend to depreciate, so the direction broadly holds. But PPP assumes goods are freely tradable; services, housing, and other non-tradables differ hugely in price, and trade barriers and transport costs push exchange rates far from PPP in the short run.�ans��src��;IMF（《金融与发展》·“购买力平价”专题）�:IMF (Finance & Development, “Purchasing Power Parity”)��id�9138e50dd111�body���好处是地方政府更了解本地、便于试验与竞争（“用脚投票”）；风险是地区间财力不均、为招商而放松监管或陷入“逐底竞争”，以及宏观协调变难。��Benefits: local governments know local needs and can experiment and compete (“voting with feet”). Risks: uneven regional wealth, regulatory races to attract business, and harder macro coordination.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9268deb49296�body��~人口密度是单位面积土地上住了多少人，通常用每平方公里人数表示，用来比较各地拥挤程度。ـPopulation density is how many people live per unit area, usually people per square kilometer, comparing how crowded places are.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�9332f3add660�body�ٮ世俗化指宗教在社会公共生活与制度中的影响逐渐减弱、宗教活动转向私人的精神趋势，常见于现代化与科学普及程度较高的社会。٪Secularization is the declining public and institutional role of religion as faith becomes a more private matter, common in modernized, scientifically advanced societies.�ans��src��MNorris 与 Inglehart,《Sacred and Secular》,Cambridge University Press,2004�PP. Norris and R. Inglehart, Sacred and Secular, Cambridge University Press, 2004��id�93de7d4ee621�body�ٟ禀赋效应指人一旦拥有某物，就比未拥有时更看重它，导致要价高于买价；它解释了为何人们不愿割舍、市场成交偏少。ٳThe endowment effect means people value something more once they own it, demanding more to sell than they'd pay to buy; it explains reluctance to part with items and thin markets.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�943146492170�body���该报告将发达国家不平等上升归因于技能偏向型技术进步、全球化与制度弱化（如工会与最低工资的退潮）。它强调再分配税收与转移支付在抑制市场不平等中的关键作用。�The report attributes rising inequality in developed countries to skill-biased technological change, globalisation and weakened institutions such as unions and minimum wages. It stresses the key role of redistributive taxes and transfers in curbing market inequality.�ans��src��QOECD (2011), 《分化中的我们：不平等为何持续上升》, 经合组织�:OECD (2011), Divided We Stand: Why Inequality Keeps Rising��id�94ddd7d568a7�body��f公共政策是政府为解决问题或达成目标而采取的行动、法律与资源分配方案。�uPublic policy is the set of government actions, laws, and resource allocations aimed at addressing problems or goals.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�95009701f25c�body�ٿ社交媒体降低组织成本、加速信息传播，使去中心化动员更容易（如#MeToo），但也带来虚假动员、注意力碎片化与“点赞式行动”（slacktivism）。��Social media lowers organizing costs and speeds diffusion, enabling decentralized mobilization (e.g., #MeToo), but also fosters fake mobilization, attention fragmentation, and “slacktivism.”�ans��src��>Bennett & Segerberg,《The Logic of Connective Action》(2012)�:Bennett & Segerberg, The Logic of Connective Action (2012)��id�956f290aef81�body���影响健康的最大因素不是医疗可得性，而是收入、教育、职业、住房、环境和社会地位等“健康的社会决定因素”。它们通过慢性压力、生活方式、环境暴露与心理机制塑造疾病模式，形成明显的健康梯度：社会地位越低，预期寿命越短、疾病负担越重。因此促进健康需要教育、劳动、住房和税收政策协同，而非只靠医疗系统。�The biggest determinants of health are not medical access but the social determinants of health—income, education, occupation, housing, environment, and social status. These shape disease patterns through chronic stress, lifestyle, environmental exposure, and psychological mechanisms, producing a clear health gradient: the lower the social position, the shorter life expectancy and the heavier disease burden. Improving health therefore requires coordinated education, labor, housing, and tax policy, not just healthcare.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�98221b998934�body�ٓ国家主权指一个国家在其领土内拥有最高、独立的统治权，不受外部势力干涉。它是现代国际关系的基本准则。ٰNational sovereignty means a state has supreme, independent authority within its territory, free from external interference. It is a basic principle of international relations.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�988cacab0554�body���情绪劳动指员工被要求按组织脚本管理自己的情绪表达（如微笑服务），造成表层或深层扮演。霍克希尔德在《第二轮班》中指出职业女性回家后仍承担多数家务，形成双重负担。��Emotional labor means workers must manage feeling displays to fit organizational scripts (e.g., smiling service), entailing surface or deep acting. In The Second Shift, Hochschild showed employed women still do most housework, a double burden.�ans��src��l阿莉·R·霍克希尔德《被管理的心：人类情感的商品化》(1983) 与《第二轮班》(1989)�IArlie R. Hochschild, The Managed Heart (1983) and The Second Shift (1989)��id�98b3af19bf4b�body���威慑理论认为，人会在权衡犯罪收益与被抓、被罚的概率和代价后决定是否犯罪，因此提高破案率或刑罚严厉度可降低犯罪（贝卡利亚的“罪刑相应”）。但威慑依赖确定性、及时性与严厉性：被抓获概率的作用通常强于刑期长短，而冲动犯罪、情绪困扰或精神障碍者受威慑影响小，这就解释了为何单靠严刑并不总能奏效。�Deterrence theory holds that people weigh the benefits of crime against the probability and cost of being caught and punished, so raising detection rates or penalty severity can reduce crime (Beccaria's proportionality principle). But deterrence depends on certainty, swiftness, and severity: the probability of apprehension usually matters more than sentence length, and impulsive offenders, people in emotional distress, or those with mental conditions respond little to threats—which is why harsh penalties alone often fail.�ans��src��)Tyler,《Why People Obey the Law》(2006)�)Tom Tyler, Why People Obey the Law (2006)��id�9950ae57f859�body���教育会带来未来更高的收入流，其成本（学费与放弃的工资）发生在当下，收益延后兑现，本质上是用今天的成本换取未来的回报，与资本投资逻辑一致，故称“人力资本投资”。回报率大致等于教育带来的额外终身收入除以投入成本。也正因如此，人力资本与实物资本一样会折旧、需要维护与补充。��Education yields higher future earnings: costs (tuition and forgone wages) are paid today while returns arrive later—essentially trading present costs for future returns, the same logic as capital investment, hence “human capital investment.” Its rate of return is roughly the extra lifetime income from education divided by its cost. Like physical capital, human capital depreciates and needs maintenance and renewal.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第19章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 19��id�99fae2eb1084�body���表意文字用字符直接表示词或语素（如汉字），拼音文字用字母表示语音（如拉丁字母、西里尔字母）。两者各有优劣，许多现代文字系统其实是混合形态。��Logographic systems use characters to represent words or morphemes (e.g., Chinese characters), while alphabetic systems use letters for sounds (e.g., Latin, Cyrillic). Each has trade-offs, and many modern scripts are mixed.�ans��src�ٸMashanlo, Rezanova,《INTERCULTURAL WRITTEN COMMUNICATION: BILINGUAL READING OF TEXTS WRITTEN IN ALPHABETIC AND LOGOGRAPHIC WRITING SYSTEMS》,Rusin,2018 (DOI: 10.17223/18572685/51/19)ٶMashanlo, Rezanova, 'INTERCULTURAL WRITTEN COMMUNICATION: BILINGUAL READING OF TEXTS WRITTEN IN ALPHABETIC AND LOGOGRAPHIC WRITING SYSTEMS', Rusin, 2018, DOI: 10.17223/18572685/51/19��id�9a0f2121e506�body���民族志通过沉浸式观察捕捉行动者自身的意义与日常实践，能发现问卷预设之外的机制。它与大规模量化互为补充：一个提供深度机制，一个提供广度代表性。��Ethnography captures actors' meanings and everyday practice through immersion, surfacing mechanisms surveys miss. It complements large-scale quantification: one supplies depth of mechanism, the other breadth of representativeness.�ans��src��e汤姆·博尔斯托夫等《民族志与虚拟世界》(2012) 及克利福德·格尔茨深描传统�jTom Boellstorff et al., Ethnography and Virtual Worlds (2012); Clifford Geertz thick-description tradition��id�9a3a8134f01c�body���新石器时代革命约始于一万年前，人类由采集狩猎转向定居农耕与动物驯化，开始储存粮食、建立村落。它奠定了人口增长、社会分工和国家起源的物质基础。�␀The Neolithic Revolution, beginning around 10,000 years ago, saw humans shift from foraging to settled farming and animal domestication, enabling food storage and villages. It laid the material basis for population growth, division of labor, and the state.�ans��src��:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937�:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937��id�9a9a3631ba61�body���大量农村劳动力进城市做工，既给城市提供廉价劳力、又往家乡汇钱；乡村变“留守”与“汇款”，城市出现新移民群体。城乡从隔离走向互相依赖。��Many rural laborers took city jobs, supplying cheap urban labor while sending money home; villages became 'left-behind' and 'remittance' places, and cities gained new migrant groups. Country and city shifted from separate to interdependent.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9c16cfbaca52�body�ٓ语言学是系统研究人类语言的学科，探讨声音、词义、句法和语言如何随社会变化，帮助我们理解沟通的本质。٠Linguistics is the systematic study of human language, examining sound, meaning, syntax, and language change, helping us understand the nature of communication.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9dbff2da1bf3�body�ٓ商品价格由供给和需求共同决定。当某种商品稀缺而想要的人多时价格上升，供给充足而需求减少时价格下降。٠Prices are set by supply and demand. When a good is scarce but many people want it, the price rises; when supply is plentiful and demand falls, the price drops.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9eac9d466f45�body���因为污染的代价没有全部算进工厂的成本和产品价格里，受害的是附近的居民和公众，且他们得不到补偿。经济学家把这种由旁观者承受的代价称为“负外部性”。外部性存在时，价格不能反映真实社会成本，生产量会高于社会最优，市场自己无法纠正，所以需要政府用排污费、排放标准等干预。��Because the cost of pollution isn't fully included in the factory's costs or its product price, while nearby residents absorb the damage uncompensated. Economists call this a negative externality. With externalities, prices no longer reflect true social costs, output exceeds the social optimum, and the market can't fix itself, which is why governments step in with pollution fees and emission standards.�ans��src��/《经济学原理》(曼昆)（外部性章）�7Principles of Economics (Mankiw), externalities chapter��id�a092f60495b4�body���初级群体是社会学家库利提出的概念，指成员间面对面、情感亲密、关系持久的群体，如家庭、亲密朋友圈。它对人的自我认同和价值观形成影响最深。��The primary group, a concept from sociologist Charles Cooley, is a small group with face-to-face, intimate, enduring ties—such as family and close friends. It most deeply shapes self-identity and values.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a1a7803cc76e�body�� 这就是需求定律：在其他条件不变时，价格越高，愿意购买的数量越少。一方面，涨价让一部分消费者觉得不划算而放弃；另一方面，同样一笔钱能买到的东西变少了。市场正是靠价格来协调“买多少”与“卖多少”。�This is the law of demand: other things being equal, the higher the price, the smaller the quantity people are willing to buy. Higher prices make some consumers drop out, and a fixed budget simply buys less. Markets rely on prices to coordinate how much is bought and sold.�ans��src��2《经济学原理》(曼昆)（市场供求章）�;Principles of Economics (Mankiw), supply and demand chapter��id�a2416f60755e�body�ٽ粗出生率是一年内每千名总人口中活产婴儿的数量，是最常用的生育水平指标之一。它简便但受年龄结构影响，因此常与总和生育率配合使用。��The crude birth rate is the number of live births per 1,000 total population in a year, a common fertility indicator. Simple but sensitive to age structure, so it is often paired with the total fertility rate.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�a38752aa8680�body���同工同酬指从事同等价值工作的人不论性别、种族或其他身份，应获得相同的报酬。它是消除薪酬歧视、促进职场公平的基本原则。实现它需要透明的薪酬制度与反歧视执法。�0Equal pay for equal work means people doing work of equal value receive the same pay regardless of sex, race, or other identity. It is a basic principle for eliminating pay discrimination and promoting workplace fairness. Achieving it requires transparent pay systems and anti-discrimination enforcement.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a3f6cad2ded4�body���普特南指出，社区中的信任、网络与规范降低集体行动成本，提升投票与公民参与。社团成员更可能参与公共生活，体现为横向联系促进政治效能感。��Putnam argues that trust, networks and norms in communities lower the cost of collective action and raise voting and civic engagement. Associational members tend to participate more, as horizontal ties foster a sense of political efficacy.�ans��src��]Putnam, R. (2000), 《独自打保龄：美国社区的衰落与复兴》, 西蒙与舒斯特�bPutnam, R. (2000), Bowling Alone: The Collapse and Revival of American Community, Simon & Schuster��id�a436d6675af4�body���城市蔓延指低密度、依赖小汽车、跳跃式向外扩张的城市形态。它推高基础设施与通勤成本、加剧碳排放与耕地占用，并常伴随中心区衰败与社会空间隔离。��Urban sprawl is low-density, car-dependent, leapfrog outward expansion of cities. It raises infrastructure and commuting costs, increases emissions and farmland loss, and often accompanies inner-city decline and socio-spatial segregation.�ans��src��\经济合作与发展组织(OECD)《Compact City Policies: A Comparative Assessment》(2012)�<OECD, Compact City Policies: A Comparative Assessment (2012)��id�a44855e868b3�body���他们认为性别不是属性而是互动中随时问责、可被观察的成就：人们按情境规范展示符合男/女的举止并被他人评价。此举把性别再生产成本定位到微观互动层面。��They argued gender is not an attribute but an emergent achievement accountable in interaction: people display norm-appropriate conduct and are judged for it. This locates the reproduction of gender in micro-interaction.�ans��src��R坎迪斯·韦斯特与唐娜·齐默尔曼《做性别》(1987, Gender & Society)�JCandace West and Don H. Zimmerman, 'Doing Gender' (1987), Gender & Society��id�a72913740649�body�ٷ消费降级指在经济不确定下，消费者转向更务实、低价的替代品，弱化符号性炫耀。它反映风险预期上升时的防御性储蓄与去虚荣化倾向。��Consumption downgrading means consumers shift to pragmatic, cheaper substitutes and shed symbolic showiness amid economic uncertainty. It reflects defensive saving and de-vanity tendencies when risk expectations rise.�ans��src��mCarroll, C. (1997), 《缓冲库存储蓄与生命周期/持久收入假说》, 经济学季刊 (QJE), 112(1)�~Carroll, C. (1997), Buffer-Stock Saving and the Life Cycle/Permanent Income Hypothesis, Quarterly Journal of Economics, 112(1)��id�a79310996c1e�body�ٴ国防一旦提供，难以排除任何公民受保护（非排他），且一人受保护不会减少他人受保护（非竞争），因此私人市场很难靠收费来供给。��Once provided, defense is hard to deny to any citizen (non-excludable) and one person's protection doesn't reduce another's (non-rival), so private markets struggle to supply it by charging fees.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a7b104ce4377�body��米尔格拉姆在 1961–1963 年于耶鲁大学让受试者对“学习者”施加递增电击，结果发现约三分之二的人在权威指令下愿意施加到致命的最高电压。该实验揭示了普通人在权威压力下可能做出违背良知的行为。�&In 1961–1963 at Yale, Milgram had subjects administer increasing electric shocks to a “learner,” finding that about two-thirds obeyed authority to the maximum, supposedly lethal voltage. The experiment revealed that ordinary people may act against conscience under authoritative pressure.�ans��src��a斯坦利·米尔格拉姆《服从权威》（1974）；《变态与社会心理学杂志》1963�fStanley Milgram, “Obedience to Authority” (1974); Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology (1963)��id�a7cf2f2bdfe7�body���城市因混凝土、沥青吸热且绿地少，气温常高于周边郊区（热岛效应）。它加剧中暑与心脑血管风险、推高空调能耗，可通过增加绿地、反光屋顶与通风廊道缓解。��Cities are warmer than suburbs (the urban heat island) due to heat-absorbing surfaces and less greenery. It raises heat-illness and cooling energy use, mitigated by green space, reflective roofs, and ventilation corridors.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a7ecb82449fe�body���两党制下竞争主要在两大政党间展开（如美国），政府更替清晰但选择有限；多党制（如德国、印度）政党众多，常需联合组阁，更能反映多元诉求却易生僵局。��In a two-party system (e.g., the U.S.) competition centers on two major parties—clear turnover but limited choice; in multi-party systems (e.g., Germany, India) many parties often require coalitions, reflecting diversity but risking deadlock.�ans��src��]乔瓦尼·萨托利《政党与政党体系》（Sartori, Parties and Party Systems, 1976）�8Giovanni Sartori, “Parties and Party Systems” (1976)��id�a846ed4f2a98�body���可再生资源是能在合理时间内自然恢复或循环利用的资源，如太阳能、风能、森林与淡水。若开采速度超过再生速度，它们也会枯竭，因此仍需可持续管理。��Renewable resources regenerate or recycle within a reasonable time—solar, wind, forests, fresh water. If extraction outpaces renewal they can still be depleted, so sustainable management matters.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aa11523171a9�body���赫希提出依恋、承诺、参与与信念四种纽带：对他人的情感依恋、对传统目标的投入、对常规活动的参与以及对共同价值的信念。任一纽带薄弱都会提高越轨概率。��Hirschi proposed four bonds—attachment, commitment, involvement, and belief: emotional ties to others, investment in conventional goals, engagement in routine activities, and adherence to shared values. Weakness in any raises deviance risk.�ans��src��5特拉维斯·赫希《导致越轨的原因》(1969)�,Travis Hirschi, Causes of Delinquency (1969)��id�aa87d2c8b981�body��i指强势群体未经同意借用弱势群体的文化元素并常去语境化，引发公平性质疑。لIt is the borrowing of marginalized groups' cultural elements by dominant groups, often decontextualized, raising fairness concerns.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aad4535953f4�body���越轨行为是指违反社会公认规范的行为，其界定因时因地而异——某些过去的越轨如今已被接受。社会学家关注越轨如何被定义、被贴上标签以及相应的社会控制机制。��Deviance is behavior that violates socially accepted norms, and what counts as deviant varies by time and place—some past deviance is now accepted. Sociologists study how deviance is defined, labeled, and controlled.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ab61ace5b747�body���外部性是一方行为给无关第三方带来未补偿的成本（负）或收益（正）。政策常用庇古税（对污染征税）、可交易的排污权或侵权法上的损害赔偿，把外部成本计入决策者的账本。�An externality arises when one party's action imposes uncompensated costs or benefits on uninvolved third parties. Policy typically internalizes it via Pigouvian taxes on pollution, tradable permits, or tort-law damages that put the external cost back on the decision-maker.�ans��src��/《经济学原理》(曼昆)（外部性章）�7Principles of Economics (Mankiw), externalities chapter��id�ab97655b2acc�body��t因为气候变化、疫情、金融风险、跨境污染等问题的根源和影响都跨越国界，一国的努力很容易被别国的行为抵消。国际治理就是各国通过条约、国际组织和规则协调行动，比如《巴黎协定》让各国共同承诺减排。它的难点在于，如何让利益不同的国家都愿意遵守规则并分摊成本。��Because the causes and effects of climate change, pandemics, financial risk, and cross-border pollution all cross borders, and one country's efforts can be offset by others' behavior. International governance coordinates action through treaties, organizations, and rules, such as the Paris Agreement committing countries to shared emissions cuts. The hard part is getting states with divergent interests to comply and share costs.�ans��src��-联合国（气候变化与可持续发展）�;United Nations (climate change and sustainable development)��id�abafa5b08ca0�body�٫失业可能来自经济衰退、技术替代人工、工人技能与岗位不匹配，或人们正在换工作之间的空档。完全零失业在现实中很难做到。پUnemployment arises from recessions, technology replacing workers, skills mismatched with jobs, or the gap between leaving and finding work. Zero unemployment is hard to achieve in practice.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ac713fadc493�body���一是“接入鸿沟”（有无网络与设备），二是“技能鸿沟”（能否有效使用），三是“使用鸿沟”（用网络做什么、收益多少）；后两层在接入普及后更显关键。��First an “access gap” (having network and devices), then a “skills gap” (using them effectively), and a “usage gap” (what and how much one gains); the latter two matter more once access spreads.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�ac794e72ec40�body���隐私政策冗长、默认勾选与「接受或退出」的二选一，使同意常流于形式而非真实授权。当用户别无替代选项时，同意缺乏自愿性，难以构成有效的权利行使。��Lengthy privacy policies, pre-ticked boxes, and take-it-or-leave-it choices turn consent into a formality rather than real authorization. When users have no viable alternative, consent lacks voluntariness and fails as an exercise of rights.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�adcd615de3b5�body�٨软实力指通过文化、价值观与制度吸引力而非强制来影响他国；多边主义指多个国家依共同规则协调，常见于联合国与WTO框架。٫Soft power influences others via culture, values, and institutions rather than coercion; multilateralism coordinates multiple states by shared rules, as in the UN and WTO.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�aea8a297566c�body��阿布戴尔·奥姆兰于 1971 年提出，社会从「瘟疫与饥荒期」走向「退化性疾病与人为疾病期」，主要死因由传染病转为心脑血管病与癌症。该理论把人口健康变化与经济发展、公共卫生进步直接联系起来。�7Abdel Omran argued in 1971 that societies move from an 'age of pestilence and famine' to an 'age of degenerative and man-made diseases,' shifting the main causes of death from infections to heart disease and cancer. The theory links population health directly to economic development and public-health progress.�ans��src��,Omran，《流行病学转变理论》(1971)�,Omran, 'The Epidemiologic Transition' (1971)��id�af8085a2958b�body���因为当一家或几家企业主导市场（垄断或寡头），它们可能抬高价格、降低质量、排挤新进入者，最终损害消费者。反垄断法（竞争法）禁止滥用市场支配地位和合谋定价，必要时可阻止并购甚至拆分企业。但大企业也能借助规模经济降低成本、提供低价服务，所以执法要判断“大”是否真的损害了竞争和消费者福利。��When one or a few firms dominate a market, a monopoly or oligopoly, they may raise prices, lower quality, and crowd out new entrants, ultimately hurting consumers. Antitrust law prohibits abusing market dominance and colluding on prices, and can block mergers or even break firms up. But large firms also gain economies of scale that cut costs and prices, so enforcement must ask whether being big actually harms competition and consumer welfare.�ans��src��,《经济学原理》(曼昆)（垄断章）�2Principles of Economics (Mankiw), monopoly chapter��id�afe22fc548af�body�٧该理念规划居民在步行或骑行15分钟内可达工作、购物、教育与绿地，以减少通勤、提升生活品质与减排，已在巴黎等地试点。ٟThe 15-minute city plans daily needs (work, shops, school, green space) within a 15-minute walk or bike ride, cutting commutes and emissions; piloted in Paris.�ans��src��VCarlos Moreno《15 分钟城市》,载《Sustainability》(MDPI) 第12卷第11期,2020�GCarlos Moreno, 'The 15-minute city', Sustainability, 12(11), 4437, 2020��id�b29fc1712e11�body��}这些属于典型的“公共品”：无法把不付费的人排除在外，一个人使用也不减少他人的使用。若交给市场，多数人会搭便车，供给必然不足。它们还涉及暴力的合法垄断——只有公共机构依法执法，才能避免私人报复和无序争斗。政府依靠税收融资提供这类服务，是现代国家的基本职能。�IThese are classic public goods: non-excludable and non-rival. Left to markets, free-riding would leave them underprovided. They also involve the legitimate monopoly on force, and only public institutions enforcing law can prevent private revenge and chaos. Funded by taxes, providing them is a basic function of the modern state.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b2bae4f2594b�body��萨丕尔与沃尔夫提出，人们所使用的语言结构会影响其认知与看待世界的方式，即“语言塑造思维”。强版本（语言决定思维）已被大多数学者否定，但弱版本（语言影响认知倾向）仍有研究支持。�2Sapir and Whorf proposed that the structure of one’s language influences cognition and how the world is perceived—“language shapes thought.” The strong version (language determines thought) is largely rejected, while the weak version (language influences cognitive tendencies) retains some support.�ans��src��c本杰明·沃尔夫《语言、思维与现实》（Whorf, Language, Thought, and Reality, 1956）�?Benjamin Lee Whorf, “Language, Thought, and Reality” (1956)��id�b4d2da5bb5f4�body���正当程序指政府剥夺个人生命、自由或财产前，必须遵循公平、预先设定的法律程序，如告知、听证与上诉。它源于英国普通法，被多国宪法与《世界人权宣言》所确认。�Due process means the state must follow fair, established legal procedure—notice, hearing, appeal—before depriving anyone of life, liberty, or property. Rooted in English common law, it is affirmed in many constitutions and the Universal Declaration of Human Rights.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b5158b9a5565�body���集体行为指大量人在相对自发、非制度化的情境下采取的相似行动，如抢购、谣言传播、恐慌与集会。勒庞的群众心理学与斯梅尔塞的“加值理论”都试图解释其成因。��Collective behavior is the relatively spontaneous, unstructured action of many people—panic buying, rumor spread, crowds. Le Bon’s crowd psychology and Smelser’s “value-added” theory both explain its causes.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b985e376ad87�body���常用方法是明瑟收入方程：比较不同受教育年限者的收入，把教育年限作为解释变量估计系数，得出每多读一年带来的收入增幅，发达国家一般在6%-10%。但存在“能力偏差”——更聪明、更有毅力的人本就收入更高，简单回归会高估教育的作用，因此研究者用出生季节、义务教育法变动、双胞胎等自然实验来控制混淆因素。��A common method is the Mincer earnings equation: comparing income across education levels and estimating the coefficient on schooling years—the extra earnings per added year, typically around 6-10% in developed countries. But ability bias means smarter, more persistent people would earn more anyway, so simple regressions overstate education's causal effect; researchers therefore use natural experiments such as birth quarter, compulsory-schooling-law changes, or twins to control for confounding.�ans��src���乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010) ; 另见: Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010)��Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010) ; see also: 乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010)��id�b9e35e613140�body���PISA是由经济合作与发展组织（OECD）每三年对15岁学生进行的国际测评，考察阅读、数学与科学素养及实际问题解决能力，用以比较各国教育成效。٪PISA is the OECD’s triennial assessment of 15-year-olds’ reading, math, and science literacy and problem-solving, used to compare education outcomes across countries.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ba23ba9b78ac�body�ٓ偏见是对某一群体的负面先入为主的看法，歧视则是基于这种看法做出的不公平对待行为，二者都会伤害平等。ٓPrejudice is a negative preconceived attitude toward a group; discrimination is the unfair treatment that follows from it. Both undermine equality.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�bac6a3da524a�body���贸易顺差指一国出口额大于进口额，逆差则相反。顺差常被视为赚入外汇，但长期逆差也可能反映强劲的内需与消费能力。单看顺差逆差并不能简单判断经济好坏。�5A trade surplus means a country's exports exceed its imports, while a deficit is the opposite. A surplus is often seen as earning foreign exchange, but a persistent deficit may also reflect strong domestic demand and consumption. Surplus or deficit alone does not simply tell whether an economy is doing well.�ans��src��8IMF（《金融与发展》·“贸易逆差”专题）�1IMF (Finance & Development, “Trade Deficits”)��id�bb8c7dbbb6bb�body���预算赤字是政府一年内支出超过收入的部分；国家债务则是历年赤字累积未还的余额。适度的赤字可刺激经济，但长期过高会增加利息负担并削弱财政可持续性。�A budget deficit is the gap when a government's annual spending exceeds its revenue; national debt is the accumulated sum of past deficits. Moderate deficits can stimulate the economy, but persistently high debt raises interest costs and weakens fiscal sustainability.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�be12e4f7ad6b�body���绝对贫困以固定购买力门槛（如世界银行每日 2.15 美元国际贫困线）定义能否满足基本生存。相对贫困则按社会中位数收入的比例（如 50%）界定，反映相对被剥夺，常用于高收入国家。�Absolute poverty uses a fixed purchasing-power threshold (e.g., the World Bank's $2.15-a-day international line) for basic survival. Relative poverty is defined as a share of society's median income (e.g., 50%), capturing relative deprivation and used mostly in high-income countries.�ans��src��C世界银行 (2022), 《贫困与共享繁荣 2022》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2022), Poverty and Shared Prosperity 2022��id�bf848645a59b�body��n标准供求模型预测，高于均衡水平的最低工资会减少劳动需求、降低就业，尤其影响低技能青少年；但现实中企业可能有买方垄断力，工资提高反而可降低离职率、提升效率。实证结果不一，学界对净就业效应的大小尚无共识，主流立场承认存在潜在权衡，而非简单断言好坏。��The standard supply-and-demand model predicts that a minimum wage above equilibrium lowers labor demand and employment, especially among low-skilled teens; but in practice firms may have monopsony power, and higher pay can cut turnover and raise productivity. Empirical results differ, so there is no consensus on the net employment effect, and mainstream economics sees a genuine trade-off rather than a simple verdict.�ans��src��%《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第6章�'Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 6��id�c02ec4ea2baf�body��法律援助是为经济困难或特定案件中的当事人提供免费或低成本法律帮助的制度，以保障其平等诉权。它体现“法律面前人人平等”的原则，常由政府或公益机构提供。完善的法律援助有助于实质正义的实现。�$Legal aid is a system providing free or low-cost legal help to those with financial difficulty or in certain cases, protecting equal access to justice. It embodies 'equality before the law' and is often provided by government or nonprofit bodies. Sound legal aid supports substantive justice.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�c076a9ad6a05�body���机会成本是指为了得到某种东西而放弃的其他选择中价值最高的那个。例如，用一小时去兼职赚钱，就放弃了用这一小时休息或学习所能带来的价值。��Opportunity cost is the value of the next-best alternative that is forgone to obtain something. For example, spending an hour doing part-time work means giving up the value of resting or studying during that hour.�ans��src��g曼昆《经济学原理》（Mankiw, Principles of Economics）；奥地利学派维塞尔提出概念�QMankiw, “Principles of Economics”; concept introduced by Friedrich von Wieser��id�c0d841078b42�body���经济周期是指整体经济活动围绕长期增长趋势出现的扩张与收缩交替波动，通常分为繁荣、衰退、萧条、复苏四个阶段。它由投资、消费、技术创新和政策等多因素共同作用形成。�The business cycle is the alternating expansion and contraction of overall economic activity around its long-term growth trend, usually described as boom, recession, downturn, and recovery. It results from interacting forces such as investment, consumption, technology, and policy.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c34a46e065cb�body�ٟ仪式用固定的动作和符号标记重要时刻、表达信仰、凝聚群体，并帮助人们应对出生、结婚、死亡等不确定的生命转折。ٴRituals use fixed actions and symbols to mark important moments, express beliefs, bond groups, and help people cope with uncertain life transitions like birth, marriage, and death.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c389ed444e32�body��#洛伦兹曲线由马克斯·洛伦兹于 1905 年提出，横轴为人口累计比例、纵轴为收入累计比例；曲线越偏离对角线，分配越不均。基尼系数就是该曲线与对角线之间面积占三角总面积的比例，0 表示绝对平等、1 表示绝对集中。�cIntroduced by Max Lorenz in 1905, the Lorenz curve plots cumulative population share against cumulative income share; the more it bows from the diagonal, the more unequal the distribution. The Gini coefficient is the area between that curve and the diagonal as a share of the whole triangle, where 0 means perfect equality and 1 means total concentration.�ans��src��-Lorenz，《财富集中测度方法》(1905)�ALorenz, 'Methods of Measuring the Concentration of Wealth' (1905)��id�c3fe6496a950�body�ٓ代际流动性指子女社会经济地位相对父母的变化程度。教育不平等、财富代际传递与居住隔离会削弱向上流动。٬Intergenerational mobility is how much children’s status differs from parents’. Unequal education, inherited wealth, and residential segregation hinder upward mobility.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�c483e481e3da�body��#工资大体由工人的边际产量价值决定，即企业多雇用一名工人所带来的额外收入。若工人创造的价值高于工资，企业会增雇；反之则减雇，市场会在两者相等处出清。因此教育、技能与经验能提升生产率，从而抬高工资。�2Wages tend to equal the value of the marginal product (VMP)—the extra revenue a firm earns from hiring one more worker. If a worker adds more value than their wage, firms hire more; if less, they hire fewer, until the two balance. Education, skills, and experience raise productivity and therefore wages.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第18章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 18��id�c4f62a993cc0�body���搭便车指个体在不出资的情况下享受他人提供的公共品收益。由于公共品非排他，人人等待他人付费，结果供给不足甚至为零，需要税收或强制来破解。��Free-riding is enjoying a public good's benefits without paying. Because public goods are non-excludable, everyone waits for others to pay, leading to under-provision or none at all, resolved only by taxation or compulsion.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�c503875032e2�body�٫婴儿死亡率是每千名活产婴儿中，在满一岁前死亡的人数。它是综合反映一国医疗卫生、营养与母婴保健水平最敏感的指标之一。��The infant mortality rate is the number of deaths before age one per 1,000 live births. It is one of the most sensitive indicators of a country’s health care, nutrition, and maternal-child care.�ans��src��CJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》�>John Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues��id�c558a9fe07be�body�ٙ国际法缺乏世界政府，主要依靠国家同意、互惠、声誉、争端机制与有限制裁来执行；违反会损害信用并招致反制。��International law lacks a world government; it relies on state consent, reciprocity, reputation, dispute mechanisms, and limited sanctions; violations cost credibility and invite countermeasures.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c6617e43fbce�body�ٍ当一个人同时承担的多重社会角色要求相互矛盾时，便产生角色冲突，例如工作责任与家庭责任相互拉扯。ٷRole conflict arises when the multiple social roles a person holds at the same time place contradictory demands on them, as when work obligations pull against family responsibilities.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c7ee8f060e6d�body��辩诉交易指被告承认较轻指控或更少罪名，以换取检察官较轻的刑罚建议，从而免去漫长审判。美国司法部的数据显示，绝大多数联邦刑事案件通过这种方式了结，既节省司法资源，也引发「透明度」与公平的争议。�Plea bargaining lets a defendant plead to a lesser or fewer charges in exchange for a lighter recommended sentence, avoiding a long trial. U.S. Department of Justice data show most federal criminal cases end this way—saving resources yet raising debates over transparency and fairness.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�c86230f31790�body���政教分离指宗教机构与国家政权在制度上相互独立，政府不确立国教、不干预信仰，信仰也不直接支配立法。它旨在保障宗教自由并维持公共领域的中立。��Separation of church and state keeps religious institutions and government independent: the state establishes no official religion and does not dictate belief, nor does faith directly rule legislation. It protects religious freedom and public neutrality.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c87f1d2be20a�body���垄断是指单一卖者控制整个市场、缺乏相近替代品的情形，使该卖者拥有较强的定价能力。它可能抬高价格、降低产量并抑制创新。反垄断法通常用来限制滥用市场支配地位。�A monopoly is a market with a single seller controlling the whole market and few close substitutes, giving that seller strong pricing power. It may raise prices, cut output, and dampen innovation. Antitrust law typically limits abuse of dominant market position.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c9efb923151d�body���合同法规范当事人之间自愿达成的协议，规定要约、承诺、对价与履约，以及违约时的救济（如损害赔偿）。它是市场经济运转最基础的法律支柱之一。��Contract law governs voluntary agreements between parties—offer, acceptance, consideration, performance—and remedies for breach such as damages. It is a foundational pillar of market economies.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�ca9c7514c819�body�ٿ排序复选允许按偏好排序、逐步剔除末位并转移选票，减少“弃保”策略；两轮决选则通过 runoff 迫使联盟形成，均影响选民与政党的策略行为。ټRanked-choice voting lets voters rank candidates and transfers eliminate last-place votes, reducing tactical “spoiler” voting; runoffs force coalition-building—both reshape strategy.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�cace08ba426c�body���制度信任是公众对有形制度（政府、司法、媒体、市场）公正可靠运作的信心。高制度信任降低监督与履约成本，使大规模陌生人协作成为可能；信任崩塌则推高交易成本并助长机会主义。�9Institutional trust is the public's confidence that tangible institutions such as government, courts, media, and markets operate fairly and reliably. High trust lowers monitoring and enforcement costs, enabling large-scale cooperation among strangers; its collapse raises transaction costs and breeds opportunism.�ans��src��=世界价值观调查(World Values Survey) 制度信任模块�/World Values Survey, institutional trust module��id�ce65822e9785�body���他们主张供给侧（多元教派竞争）决定宗教活力，国家垄断信仰反令需求萎缩。该模型挑战了世俗化必然论，解释为何美国高度信教而欧洲低落。��They argued supply—competition among denominations—drives religious vitality, while state monopolies stifle demand. The model challenges secularization as inevitable, explaining high U.S. religiosity versus European decline.�ans��src��V罗德尼·斯塔克与罗杰尔·芬克《信仰之Acts：解释宗教经济》(2000)�YRodney Stark and Roger Finke, Acts of Faith: Explaining the Human Side of Religion (2000)��id�d034cadb15fa�body���GATT 在 1947 年成立后，通过多轮「减税谈判」大幅降低了成员国关税，成为事实上的国际贸易规则。1995 年它正式升级为「世界贸易组织」（WTO），新增了争端解决机制与服务贸易规则。�*After its founding in 1947, GATT ran repeated rounds of tariff-cutting negotiations that sharply lowered members' duties and became the de facto rules of world trade. In 1995 it was formally upgraded into the World Trade Organization (WTO), adding a dispute-settlement system and rules on services.�ans��src��L世界贸易组织(WTO)《关于争端解决规则与程序的谅解》(DSU)�UWTO, Understanding on Rules and Procedures Governing the Settlement of Disputes (DSU)��id�d08236fc0844�body��#凯恩斯在 1936 年《就业、利息与货币通论》中指出，家庭为应对不确定而集体增加储蓄，会导致总需求下降、企业减产裁员，结果「总收入减少」，全社会反而存不下更多钱。它揭示个体理性在宏观上可能「适得其反」。�(In 'The General Theory' (1936) Keynes noted that when households collectively save more to cope with uncertainty, aggregate demand falls, firms cut output and jobs, and total income drops—so society ends up saving less, not more. It shows individual rationality can backfire at the macro level.�ans��src��3Keynes，《就业、利息与货币通论》(1936)�EKeynes, 'The General Theory of Employment, Interest and Money' (1936)��id�d4546c3aa96a�body���沉没成本是指已经发生、无法收回的支出，比如已买的电影票。理性决策只看未来成本与收益，不应因为“已经花了钱”就继续投入，这就是“沉没成本谬误”。��A sunk cost is money already spent and unrecoverable, like a bought movie ticket. Rational decisions weigh only future costs and benefits, not past spending—ignoring this is the “sunk cost fallacy.”�ans��src��曼昆《经济学原理》�Mankiw, Principles of Economics��id�d716a961c6fb�body���蒙特梭利法由意大利医师蒙特梭利创立，主张以儿童为中心、在准备好的环境中通过自主操作教具来学习。教师是观察者而非灌输者，重视敏感期与动手探索。它在幼儿教育中影响广泛。�#Founded by Italian physician Montessori, the method is child-centered: children learn in a prepared environment through self-directed use of materials. The teacher observes rather than lectures, valuing sensitive periods and hands-on exploration. It is widely influential in early education.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d873b83f332b�body���消费者剩余是消费者愿意支付的最高价格与实际支付价格之间的差额之和，反映购买带来的额外满足。它是衡量市场福利与政策影响（如征税）的重要指标。��Consumer surplus is the sum of differences between what consumers are willing to pay and what they actually pay, capturing the extra satisfaction from purchases. It is key to measuring market welfare and policy effects like taxation.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�da3f0159cbd8�body��~从众是因为人希望被群体接纳、避免被排斥，也因为在不确定时相信多数人的选择更可能正确。٘People conform to be accepted and avoid rejection by the group, and because in uncertain situations they assume the majority is more likely to be right.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�de8219d12949�body���联合国通常把 65 岁及以上人口占总人口 7% 以上称为老龄化社会，14% 为老龄社会，20% 为超老龄社会。该指标用于监测人口结构转变对养老与医疗体系的压力。��The UN generally labels a society aging when those aged 65 and over exceed 7% of the population, aged at 14%, and super-aged at 20%. The thresholds track how demographic shift strains pension and health systems.�ans��src��,联合国《World Population Ageing》报告�"UN, World Population Ageing report��id�debe3d6832ad�body�٣当一个国家或地区65岁及以上老人占总人口比例较高（通常超过7%或14%）时，就称为老龄化社会，会带来养老和劳动力压力。ٖWhen the share of people aged 65 and over is high (often above 7% or 14%), a society is called aging, bringing pressure on pensions and the workforce.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�e0b7333478ba�body���算法推荐是利用用户行为数据（点击、停留、点赞）训练模型，预测并推送最可能吸引注意力的内容。平台借此提升用户黏性与广告收益，但也可能让个体越来越局限于符合其偏好的信息流。�IAlgorithmic recommendation uses behavioral data such as clicks, dwell time, and likes to train models that predict and surface the content most likely to capture attention. Platforms use it to increase engagement and ad revenue, but it can also trap individuals within information streams that confirm their existing preferences.�ans��src��NStephen Sunstein,《#Republic: Divide and Conquer》Yale University Press,2017�OStephen C. Sunstein, #Republic: Divide and Conquer, Yale University Press, 2017��id�e16cec146d59�body���1955 年起，西德与土耳其、意大利等国签订招募条约，引入被视为「临时」的客籍劳工填补工厂空缺。许多人最终定居并接来家人，使德国从「临时用工」转变为长期的多元移民社会。�From 1955 West Germany signed recruitment treaties with Turkey, Italy, and others to bring in 'guest workers' seen as temporary fillers of factory jobs. Many stayed and later reunited families, turning Germany from temporary labor import into a lasting, diverse immigration society.�ans��src��8OECD (2018), 《移民融合指标 2018》, 经合组织�5OECD (2018), Indicators of Immigrant Integration 2018��id�e19e9505ea12�body���绿色消费动机包括利他环保价值、自我形象提升与制度激励（如补贴、标签）。但「漂绿」使消费者难以辨别真实环境效益，常需第三方认证支撑信任。�Green-consumption motives include altruistic environmental values, self-image uplift and institutional incentives like subsidies and labels. But 「greenwashing」 makes real environmental benefit hard to judge, often requiring third-party certification to sustain trust.�ans��src��-OECD (2017), 《环境概览》, 经合组织�$OECD (2017), Environment at a Glance��id�e3c345ebd43b�body�ٺ损失厌恶指人们对损失的痛苦约为同等收益带来快乐的两倍，导致回避风险、过早卖出或固守现状。它在投资、谈判与公共选择中广泛存在。��Loss aversion means losses hurt about twice as much as equivalent gains feel good, leading to risk avoidance, premature selling, and status-quo bias. It appears across investing, negotiation, and public choice.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�e42c635827a5�body���利益集团是为影响公共政策而组织起来的群体，如商会、工会；游说则是它们向议员和官员表达诉求、争取有利立法的活动。它既是民主参与渠道，也可能放大少数强势者的声音。�Interest groups organize to influence public policy—for example business chambers or labor unions; lobbying is their activity of pressing lawmakers for favorable laws. It is both a channel of participation and a way powerful minorities may gain outsized voice.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�e4751041cbef�body��\因为城市生活节奏快、流动性大，人们早出晚归，社区归属感弱；住宅多为封闭式高楼，缺乏共同交往的空间；朋友圈更多建立在同事、兴趣社群而非地缘上。社会学家称之为“邻里关系弱化”。但社区活动、公共空间设计和邻里互助组织都能重新拉近邻居关系。�~City life is fast-paced and mobile: people leave early and return late, neighborhood attachment is weak, housing is often closed high-rises with few shared spaces, and friendships form around work and interest groups rather than proximity. Sociologists call this the weakening of neighborly ties. Community events, better public-space design, and mutual-aid groups can rebuild them.�ans��src��&《社会学概论》(社区研究章)�-Introduction to Sociology (community chapter)��id�e53ce445c3e7�body��>这是“补偿性工资差异”：危险、脏累或声誉不佳的工作必须支付更高工资，才能吸引足够工人。工人会把非货币待遇（风险、工时、工作环境）与货币收入放在一起权衡。例如井下矿工、海上钻井工人的工资通常高于相近技能的地面工作。�>This is the “compensating differential”: risky, dirty, or unpleasant jobs must pay higher wages to attract enough workers. Workers weigh non-monetary conditions (risk, hours, environment) against pay. For example, underground miners and offshore rig workers typically earn more than similarly skilled surface jobs.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第19章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 19��id�e6750e3ad18b�body���人口红利指劳动年龄人口占比上升、抚养比下降带来的潜在增长窗口。它并非自动实现，需要充足就业、教育与资本积累把“数量优势”转化为生产力。��The demographic dividend is the growth window when the working-age share rises and dependency falls. It is not automatic; it requires sufficient employment, education, and capital to convert numerical advantage into productivity.�ans��src��x戴维·布鲁姆与杰弗里·威廉姆森《人口转变与东亚奇迹》(1998, 收入《东亚奇迹的再思考》)نDavid E. Bloom and Jeffrey D. Williamson, 'Demographic Transitions and Economic Miracles' (1998), in Rethinking the East Asian Miracle��id�e6ceefff2e32�body���社会距离描述不同群体之间在交往意愿、亲密程度上的心理或社会远近，常用于研究偏见与族际关系。博加德斯量表即用“是否愿意通婚、做邻居”等测量它。��Social distance describes the psychological or social nearness between groups in willingness to interact, used to study prejudice and inter-ethnic relations. Bogardus’s scale measures it via willingness to marry, neighbor, etc.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e751f69e4fb9�body��y15至17世纪欧洲国家航海探索新航路，连接各大陆并开启了殖民、物种与贸易的全球性交换。ٗIn the 15th–17th centuries European powers explored new sea routes, linking continents and launching global exchange of colonies, species, and trade.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e7a826221df9�body���义务教育指由国家法律规定、适龄儿童和少年必须接受且政府免费提供的基础教育，通常为小学到初中阶段。它旨在保障基本文化素质与平等起点。多数国家把九年左右作为义务教育的年限。�.Compulsory education is basic education that the state legally requires school-age children to attend and provides free of charge, usually from primary through junior secondary. It aims to guarantee basic literacy and an equal starting point. Most countries set about nine years as the compulsory span.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e8d1623a3c57�body���贸易壁垒是限制商品跨境自由流动的措施，分为关税（如进口税）与非关税壁垒（如配额、技术标准和补贴）。它们保护国内产业，但也会抬高消费者价格、扭曲资源配置。�
A trade barrier is a measure that restricts the free cross-border flow of goods, either as a tariff (e.g., import tax) or a non-tariff barrier (quotas, technical standards, subsidies). They shield domestic industries but raise consumer prices and distort allocation.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e96eeac5191e�body�ٓ文字让信息可以跨越时间和空间保存与传递，使复杂管理、法律和文学成为可能，是人类进入文明的关键一步。ٝWriting lets information be stored and transmitted across time and space, enabling complex administration, law, and literature, a key step into civilization.�ans��src��:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937�:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937��id�ea74158b6c82�body���摩擦性失业是工人转换工作或初次进入劳动力市场时的短期过渡性失业，反映信息搜索与匹配需要时间，属于正常现象。结构性失业则源于技能、行业或地理位置与岗位需求的长期错配，例如自动化和产业转移使部分工人技能过时。前者常可通过改进信息匹配缓解，后者需要再培训与劳动力再配置。��Frictional unemployment is short-term unemployment from job transitions and labor-market entry, reflecting the time needed to search and match—a normal feature of a dynamic economy. Structural unemployment arises from long-term mismatches between workers' skills, industries, or locations and available jobs, such as when automation or industrial shifts make skills obsolete. The former can be eased by better information and matching, the latter requires retraining and reallocation.�ans��src��&《经济学原理》(曼昆) 第28章�(Principles of Economics (Mankiw), ch. 28��id�eb3db5201c99�body�ٽ多数制（如单一选区相对多数）易形成两党与稳定政府但代表性弱；比例代表制按得票比例分配席位，更反映多元诉求但易碎片化、组阁复杂。��Majoritarian systems (plurality) favor two parties and stable government but weak representation; PR allocates seats by vote share, mirroring diversity yet fragmenting and complicating coalitions.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�eb94aebdf31c�body��~非政府组织是不以营利为目的、独立于政府的民间团体，常从事环保、扶贫、人权等公益工作。ٌA non-governmental organization is a non-profit, government-independent group often working on environment, poverty relief, or human rights.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ebbf38110dc0�body�ٽ平台同时服务两类相互吸引的用户（如买家与卖家），一边用户增多会提升对另一边的价值，形成网络效应；平台常对一边补贴、另一边收费。��Platforms serve two interdependent user groups (e.g., buyers and sellers); more users on one side raise value for the other via network effects. Platforms often subsidize one side and charge the other.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�ecf9dedbd5a2�body�٥经济发展、女性就业机会增加、城市化、法律变化和观念开放，使家庭从大家族趋向核心家庭、单亲或未婚同居等多样形态。ٵEconomic development, more women working, urbanization, legal change, and shifting values have moved families from extended clans toward nuclear, single-parent, or cohabiting forms.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ee4baabb1d8b�body�٢纳什均衡是一种局面：在别人策略不变时，没有任何一方能通过单独改变自己的选择而变得更好，因而各方都不再愿意动。ًA Nash equilibrium is a situation where, given others' choices, no player can improve by changing only their own—so no one wants to move.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ef0172b3d6af�body�٥企业和人才在城市集中可共享供应链、知识与劳动力池，降低成本和提升创新，形成集聚经济，是城市吸引人口的核心动力。ٱFirms and talent cluster in cities to share supply chains, knowledge, and labor pools, cutting costs and boosting innovation—agglomeration economies draw population to cities.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f16a1dfe9a26�body�١比例代表制常设得票门槛（如5%），未达标政党无法进入议会，旨在防止碎片化，但也可能排斥新兴小党与少数群体代表。ٗPR systems often set a vote threshold (e.g., 5%); parties below it are excluded, curbing fragmentation but possibly sidelining new or minority parties.�ans��src�وRein Taagepera & Matthew Soberg Shugart, Seats and Votes: The Effects of Determinants of Electoral Systems, Yale University Press, 1989.وRein Taagepera & Matthew Soberg Shugart, Seats and Votes: The Effects of Determinants of Electoral Systems, Yale University Press, 1989.��id�f2a9c4b4c415�body�ٙ公民社会指政府和企业之外的民间组织和网络，如慈善团体、社团和志愿者组织，它们让民众能自发参与公共事务。ٮCivil society refers to the web of non-governmental, non-business groups like charities, associations, and volunteer organizations through which people engage in public life.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f3f7c4f1b786�body���国际刑事法院（ICC）成立于2002年，总部位于海牙，专门审理灭绝种族、战争罪和危害人类罪等最严重国际犯罪。它只在国家不愿或不能追诉时行使管辖权。��The International Criminal Court (ICC), established in 2002 in The Hague, prosecutes the gravest crimes—genocide, war crimes, crimes against humanity. It steps in only when states are unwilling or unable to prosecute.�ans��src��C《国际刑事法院罗马规约》(1998 年通过,2002 年生效)�NRome Statute of the International Criminal Court (adopted 1998, in force 2002)��id�f780084c4d7b�body��&人口转型理论描述了社会从工业化前到后工业化的生育与死亡模式演变：第一阶段高出生高死亡、第二阶段死亡率下降而出生率仍高、第三阶段出生率下降、第四阶段低出生低死亡并趋于稳定。多数国家已走过前三个阶段。�1The demographic transition theory describes how fertility and mortality evolve from pre-industrial to post-industrial society: Stage 1 high birth/high death, Stage 2 falling death but high birth, Stage 3 falling birth, Stage 4 low/stable birth and death. Most countries have passed the first three stages.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�f87576f7a007�body���社会网络由个体（节点）及其相互关系（连线）构成，用来分析信息、资源与影响的传播路径。强弱关系、桥接与社群结构都是其研究重点。社会网络分析已广泛用于组织、健康与舆论研究。�-A social network consists of individuals (nodes) and their relationships (ties), used to analyze how information, resources, and influence travel. Strong/weak ties, bridging, and community structure are key topics. Social network analysis is widely used in organizations, health, and opinion research.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f97489a378d5�body��9货币作为通用媒介，降低以物易物的成本。�/Money is a common medium that cuts barter cost.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fa018ccdfbbc�body���赫茨在 1950 年提出，一国为自保而加强军备，会被邻国视为威胁，邻国随之扩军，结果双方都更不安全。这种「防御性行为引发对方恐惧」的循环，常使本无恶意的强国陷入对抗。��Herz argued in 1950 that when one state arms for defense, neighbors see a threat and rearm too, leaving everyone less secure. This cycle—where defensive acts provoke the other's fear—can drive powers with no hostile intent into rivalry.�ans��src��JHerz，《理想主义国际主义与安全困境》，World Politics 1950�OHerz, 'Idealist Internationalism and the Security Dilemma,' World Politics 1950��id�fa3f4cdbf41b�body�ٖ发票是消费与纳税凭证，可用于保修、退换、报销和维权。电子发票普及后更易保存，但仍需防丢失与重复报销。ٶInvoices are proof of purchase and tax, useful for warranty, returns, reimbursement, and rights claims. E-invoices are easier to keep, but still guard against loss and double claims.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�faa325b2a442�body���人口分布描述人口在地理空间上的疏密格局，受地形、气候、水源与经济活动影响。全球人口高度集中于亚洲、沿海低地与大河流域，而极地、沙漠人烟稀少。��Population distribution describes how people are spread across space, shaped by terrain, climate, water, and economic activity. Globally, population concentrates in Asia, coastal lowlands, and river valleys, while poles and deserts are sparse.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�fb0342812e3c�body�ٖ第一手史料是事件发生时或接近当时由亲历者留下的材料，如日记、信件、照片和官方档案，最能直接反映历史。ٲA primary source is material created during or near an event by those who experienced it, such as diaries, letters, photos, and official records, giving the most direct evidence.�ans��src��SAdam Matthew Digital,《What is a primary source?》,2021 (DOI: 10.47594/rmps_0001)�PAdam Matthew Digital, 'What is a primary source?', 2021, DOI: 10.47594/rmps_0001��id�fc9bdf31022d�body���病毒式传播依赖情绪唤醒和高的“共享价值”：内容唤起强烈情绪（惊讶、愤怒、感动或好笑），让人觉得转发能表达自己或帮到别人。同时，早期的关键传播者（意见领袖、活跃群组）和平台推荐起着点火作用，一旦越过临界量，传播就进入滚雪球阶段。内容本身易于理解和二次创作（表情包、玩梗）也会加快扩散。��Virality depends on emotional arousal and high share value: content triggers strong feelings, such as surprise, anger, empathy, or humor, and gives people a way to express themselves or help others. Early spreaders such as influencers and active groups, plus platform recommendation, light the fuse; past a critical mass, sharing snowballs. Content that's easy to grasp and remix, such as memes and jokes, also travels faster.�ans��src��5Harvard Business Review（社交媒体传播研究）�<Harvard Business Review (research on social media contagion)��id�fcdfb88bdfe1�body��逆城市化指城市人口向郊区或小城镇回流，城市中心增长放缓甚至减少的现象。它常见于发达国家，因交通改善、中心城区成本高和生活偏好变化而出现。与城市化相反，它是城市扩散的下一阶段。�LCounter-urbanization means population flowing back from cities to suburbs or small towns, with city-center growth slowing or even shrinking. It is common in developed countries, driven by better transport, high central-city costs, and changing lifestyle preferences. Opposite to urbanization, it is the next phase of city dispersal.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fcec3edc2d45�body���社会分层指社会中稀缺资源（财富、权力、声望）在群体间不平等分配并往往代际传递的结构。社会学通常用阶级/收入、教育程度和职业地位等维度来衡量分层。��Social stratification refers to the structured, often inherited unequal distribution of scarce resources—wealth, power, and prestige—among groups in a society. Sociologists commonly measure it through class/income, education, and occupational status.�ans��src��b韦伯《经济与社会》（Wirtschaft und Gesellschaft）；赖特·米尔斯《权力精英》�HWeber, “Economy and Society”; C. Wright Mills, “The Power Elite”��id�fd5ad0884c19�body�ٺ回音室效应指人们只接触与自己观点一致的信息，使原有立场不断被强化、异见被隔绝的现象，常由算法推荐与同温层社交放大，加剧极化。��The echo chamber effect is when people encounter only like-minded information, reinforcing their views and shutting out dissent—amplified by recommendation algorithms and homogeneous social circles, deepening polarization.�ans��src��NStephen Sunstein,《#Republic: Divide and Conquer》Yale University Press,2017�OStephen C. Sunstein, #Republic: Divide and Conquer, Yale University Press, 2017��id�fd79d9d8239b�body���集聚经济指企业与人在地理上集中带来的效率提升：共享投入品和基础设施、劳动力“蓄水池”降低招工风险、知识外溢（“站在别人肩膀上”）、同行业集聚深化专业化分工。这些效应使生产率随城市规模上升，但也会带来通勤拥堵、地价房价上涨和环境污染等“拥挤成本”。城市规模正是集聚收益与拥挤成本的平衡点。��Agglomeration economies are efficiency gains from geographic concentration: sharing inputs and infrastructure, labor-market pooling that reduces hiring risk, knowledge spillovers (“standing on others' shoulders”), and deepening specialization. These make productivity rise with city size, but also bring congestion, higher land and housing prices, and pollution—“agglomeration costs.” A city's size balances these gains and costs.�ans��src��GWorld Bank（《世界发展报告2009：重塑世界经济地理》）�HWorld Bank (World Development Report 2009: Reshaping Economic Geography)��id�fdf5c0ff88d3�body��9产业聚集提供就业，吸引人口向城市集中。�1Industry clusters draw jobs and people to cities.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�fe351c51adf4�body���田野调查是人类学家长期住进研究对象社区、通过参与观察和深度访谈收集第一手资料的方法。马林诺夫斯基在特罗布里恩群岛的研究奠定了现代民族志范式。��Fieldwork is when anthropologists live long-term in a community, gathering first-hand data through participant observation and deep interviews. Malinowski’s work in the Trobriand Islands founded the modern ethnographic method.�ans��src��N布罗尼斯拉夫·马林诺夫斯基《西太平洋的航海者》（1922）�DBronisław Malinowski, “Argonauts of the Western Pacific” (1922)��id�feed21ff24a0�body��文化适应指两个文化接触后，一方或双方在习俗、语言与价值观上的变迁。贝瑞（Berry）提出四种策略：同化、分离、整合与边缘化，整合（保留原文化并接纳主流文化）通常伴随更好的适应结果。��Acculturation is the change in customs, language, and values when cultures contact. Berry identified four strategies, assimilation, separation, integration, and marginalization, with integration typically yielding better adaptation.�ans��src��>Berry,《Cross-Cultural Psychology》(1997) 文化适应模型�,John Berry, Cross-Cultural Psychology (1997)��id�ff35a4f293e5�body��t产权规定一项资源归谁所有、由谁使用和处置。产权明确，人们才有动力投资和改进自己的资产——地是自己的，人才愿意长期经营；收益归自己，人才肯花力气。产权模糊则会引发过度使用或无人维护，即“公地悲剧”。法律对产权的保护，也是合同与交易能够建立信任的基础。�~Property rights define who owns, uses, and disposes of a resource. Clear rights give people incentives to invest in and improve what they own: people tend land only if it's theirs and work hard only when gains accrue to them. Vague rights invite overuse or neglect, the tragedy of the commons. Legal protection of property is also the trust base that makes contracts and trade work.�ans��src��5《经济学原理》(曼昆)（产权与激励章）�HPrinciples of Economics (Mankiw), property rights and incentives chapter��id�soc_19_001�body���第一次人口转变刻画死亡率率先下降、随后生育率伴随现代化持续走低的进程,关注的是数量的变化。第二次转变聚焦质的重构:初婚推迟、同居与非婚生育增多、离婚攀升、自愿不育扩散,并把动因归结为个体自我实现的更高诉求。莱斯特黑格与范德卡在1980年代系统阐述该框架,用以解释西北欧家庭形态的多元化。��The first demographic transition described mortality falling ahead of sustained fertility decline under modernization, essentially a story of quantity. The second transition centers on qualitative restructuring: postponed marriage, rising cohabitation and nonmarital births, divorce, and deliberate childlessness, traced to post-material aspirations for self-realization. Lesthaeghe and van de Kaa systematized this frame in the 1980s to explain family diversification in northwestern Europe.�ans��src���范德卡〈欧洲的第二次人口转变〉,《人口与发展评论》第11卷第1期(1985);莱斯特黑格〈西欧百年人口与文化变迁〉,《人口与发展评论》第9卷第3期(1983)��Dirk van de Kaa, 'Europe's Second Demographic Transition', Population Development Review, 11(1), 1985; Ron Lesthaeghe, 'A Century of Demographic and Cultural Change in Western Europe', Population and Development Review, 9(3), 1983��id�soc_19_004�body���默顿观察到,声名显赫的科学家在合作成果中往往独揽注意力,其姓名更易被记诵、引用与授奖,而无名者的同等贡献遭到低估,承认遂沿既有声望层层累积。这与普遍主义规范——按工作内在价值而非作者身份施予承认——构成紧张,说明奖励体系内嵌着累积优势的结构性偏差。该概念后来被延伸到署名排序、经费评审与期刊审稿中的不平等研究。�
Merton noticed that eminent scientists monopolize attention on joint work: their names are more readily recalled, cited, and rewarded, while equally strong contributions from unknown peers are undervalued, so recognition compounds along existing prestige. This sits uneasily with universalism, which demands credit by intrinsic merit regardless of authorship, revealing an embedded structural bias toward cumulative advantage. The concept was later extended to authorship order, grant review, and peer review inequalities.�ans��src�ٮ罗伯特·金·默顿〈科学中的马太效应〉,《科学》第159卷第3810期(1968);后收入《科学社会学:理论与经验研究》(芝加哥大学出版社,1973)ٕRobert K. Merton, 'The Matthew Effect in Science', Science 159(3810), 1968; reprinted in The Sociology of Science (University of Chicago Press, 1973)��id�soc_19_007�body���依据1960年代针对法国人的摄影、音乐偏好与博物馆参观调查,布迪厄发现趣味沿经济资本与文化资本的总量及构成整齐分布:文化资本雄厚的阶层偏爱克制而形式化的欣赏姿态,大众趣味系于必需品与直接快感,小资产阶级则在效仿正统中流露焦虑。趣味经由幼年家庭熏陶习得,却被当事人体验为天赋,于是把社会出身伪装成个人禀赋之别。这正是符号暴力嵌入日常生活品位的运作方式。�4Drawing on 1960s surveys of French photographic, musical, and museum-going preferences, Bourdieu showed tastes distributing neatly along the volume and composition of economic and cultural capital: capital-rich classes favor detached formal appreciation, popular taste clings to necessity and immediate pleasure, and the petty bourgeoisie betrays anxiety while mimicking orthodoxy. Taste is absorbed through early upbringing yet lived as innate gift, disguising social origin as personal endowment, which is how symbolic violence settles into everyday consumption.�ans��src�ه皮埃尔·布迪厄《区分:鉴赏判断的社会批判》,1979年法文初版,理查德·尼斯英译本(哈佛大学出版社,1984)ٕPierre Bourdieu, Distinction: A Social Critique of the Judgement of Taste, trans. Richard Nice (Harvard University Press, 1984; French original 1979)��id�soc_19_010�body���贝拉细读肯尼迪就职演说等公共文本,发现上帝、天命、牺牲与末世审判等圣经意象脱离具体教派反复出现,为国家的政治抉择提供超越性参照。这套符号不属于任何教会的信纲,也不同于私人内心的敬虔,而是在典礼与演说构成的公共舞台上运转,授予政治权威神圣合法性。文章刊出后引发长久论战,焦点包括这种宗教是否助长民族自义以及政教分离的边界所在。�3Reading Kennedy's inaugural alongside other public texts, Bellah found biblical imagery of God, destiny, sacrifice, and final judgment recurring apart from any denomination, supplying transcendental reference points for political choice. These symbols belong to no church creed and differ from private devotion, operating instead on the civic stage of ceremony and oratory, where they confer sacred legitimacy on authority. The essay ignited lasting debate over whether such religion feeds national self-righteousness and where church-state separation should run.�ans��src��T罗伯特·贝拉〈美国的公民宗教〉,《代达罗斯》第96卷第1期(1967)�CRobert N. Bellah, 'Civil Religion in America', Daedalus 96(1), 1967��id�soc_19_011�body��-议程设置研究发现,媒体很难直接决定人们怎么想,但其选择报道什么显著塑造了人们想些什么。高频显著的报道提升议题在公众心中的显著度,使之被优先感知为社会问题。当受众对议题缺乏亲身经验时,这种效应表现得最为明显。�tAgenda-setting research finds that the press rarely dictates what people conclude, yet its selection decisions powerfully shape which issues people think about at all. Prominent repeated coverage raises an issue's salience, so it gets perceived first among competing social problems. The effect grows strongest where audiences lack direct personal experience of the issue.�ans��src��nMcCombs 与 Shaw 发表于《舆论季刊》1972 年第 36 卷的论文《大众传播的议程设置功能》�qMaxwell McCombs & Donald Shaw, The Agenda-Setting Function of Mass Media, Public Opinion Quarterly, vol. 36, 1972��id�soc_19_017�body��x生育率下行初期,劳动年龄人口占比抬升而少儿与老年抚养压力同步减轻,储蓄和投资的空间随之扩大,这就是人口红利的来源。红利不会自动兑现,充分就业与人力资本投入决定其能否转化为增长。若配套制度缺位,待庞大世代步入老年后抚养比反转,养老支出骤增,红利便蜕变为人口负债。��Early in fertility decline the working-age share climbs while child and elderly dependency eases, enlarging room for saving and investment—that is the dividend's source. It does not pay out automatically; full employment and human-capital spending decide whether it becomes growth. Where supporting institutions lag, the vast cohorts eventually age, dependency reverses, pension costs balloon, and the dividend decays into a liability.�ans��src��yBloom 与 Williamson 论文《人口转型与新兴亚洲的经济奇迹》,载《世界经济评论》1998 年第 12 卷ّDavid E. Bloom & Jeffrey G. Williamson, Demographic Transitions and Economic Miracles in Emerging Asia, World Bank Economic Review, vol. 12, 1998��id�soc_20_001�body���他区分了以美国为代表的自由主义体制、以德国为代表的保守主义法团体制和以瑞典为代表的社会民主体制。自由主义体制依靠家计调查式救助并把风险交给市场，去商品化程度最低；法团体制通过职业分立的社会保险维系地位差别，家庭承担大量照护职能；社会民主体制提供普惠而优厚的给付，去商品化程度最高，并推动双薪化与普遍公共服务。�IHe distinguishes liberal regimes exemplified by the United States, conservative corporatist regimes exemplified by Germany, and social democratic regimes exemplified by Sweden. Liberal regimes rely on means-tested assistance and leave risks to the market, showing the lowest decommodification; corporatist regimes preserve occupational status differentials through contribution-based insurance while families carry heavy care duties; social democratic regimes provide universal, generous benefits, achieve the highest decommodification, and promote dual-earnerhood and public services.�ans��src��nGøsta Esping-Andersen, The Three Worlds of Welfare Capitalism (Princeton University Press, 1990), 第1—2章�\Gosta Esping-Andersen, The Three Worlds of Welfare Capitalism (Princeton UP, 1990), chs. 1-2��id�soc_20_004�body���经典集体行为理论把运动归因于结构性紧张积累下的怨恨与失范，视其为情绪性的爆发。麦卡锡与扎尔德则指出不满几乎总是存在，真正的变量是能否动员金钱、组织网络、传播渠道和专业干部等资源，运动组织如同其他组织一样追求目标的理性化。由此，研究重心从心理状态转向组织生态、专业运动组织（SMO）与赞助结构之间的互动。�Classical collective behavior theory attributed movements to grievances and anomie bred by structural strain, treating them as emotional eruptions. McCarthy and Zald countered that grievances are nearly always present, so the real variable is whether resources—money, organizational networks, communication channels, professional staff—can be mobilized; movement organizations rationalize goals like any other organization. Research accordingly shifted from psychological states to organizational ecology, SMOs, and sponsor structures.�ans��src�ٙJohn D. McCarthy & Mayer N. Zald, "Resource Mobilization and Social Movements: A Partial Theory", American Journal of Sociology, 1977, 82(6): 1212–1241٘John D. McCarthy & Mayer N. Zald, Resource Mobilization and Social Movements: A Partial Theory, American Journal of Sociology 82(6), 1977, pp. 1212-1241��id�soc_20_007�body��z空心化指青壮年长期外出务工,导致村庄常住人口锐减、宅基地闲置与公共服务萎缩的现象。家庭随之呈现半工半耕格局:老人留村务农,青年进城务工,儿童多由祖辈照料,亲子纽带被拉长为跨地域的远程维系。婚姻与养老安排日益货币化,彩礼攀升和传统养儿防老机制的松动成为普遍后果。�'Hollowing-out' refers to the sharp decline of village populations when working-age adults migrate for urban jobs, leaving idle homesteads and shrinking public services. Families reorganize around a half-work, half-farm arrangement: elders farm at home, youth earn wages away, and grandparents raise left-behind children, stretching parent-child bonds across long distances. Marriage and eldercare become monetized, visible in soaring bride-prices and the loosening of traditional family-based support for the aged.�ans��src���贺雪峰:《新乡土中国》(修订版),北京大学出版社,2013 ; 另见: Ye Jingzhong & Pan Lu, Differentiated childhoods: impacts of rural labor migration on left-behind children in China, The Journal of Peasant Studies 38(2), 2011��Ye Jingzhong & Pan Lu, Differentiated childhoods: impacts of rural labor migration on left-behind children in China, The Journal of Peasant Studies 38(2), 2011 ; see also: 贺雪峰:《新乡土中国》(修订版),北京大学出版社,2013��id�soc_20_010�body���住房兼具消费属性与财富属性,能否取得产权住房直接影响家庭的资产积累、子女教育机会乃至婚姻达成,因而成为阶层位置再生产的关键环节。雷克斯与摩尔提出住房阶级概念,指出按居住权属划分的自置业主、私房租户与公房租户在获取城市资源时境遇悬殊,形成近似阶级的对立。在中国,从单位分配到商品房的转变使住房成为市场转型时期不平等扩大最显著的渠道之一。�@Housing fuses consumption with wealth: access to owner-occupied property shapes a family's asset accumulation, children's schooling chances, even marriage prospects, making it central to the reproduction of class position. Rex and Moore's idea of housing classes shows that owners, private renters, and public-housing tenants face starkly unequal access to urban resources, generating quasi-class antagonisms. In China, the move from work-unit allocation to commodity housing turned housing into one of the sharpest channels through which market transition widened inequality.�ans��src�ٖ约翰·罗根、边燕杰等:《1990年代中国城市的住房不平等》,International Journal of Urban and Regional Research 第23卷第1期,1999ٙJohn R. Logan, Yiping Bian & Fuqin Bian, Housing Inequality in Urban China in the 1990s, International Journal of Urban and Regional Research 23(1), 1999��id�soc_20_014�body���网约车与外卖平台借助算法派单、动态定价和评分机制对劳动过程实施实时控制,学界称之为算法管理。这种安排把管理成本转移给劳动者,他们名义上时间自由,实则暴露于收入波动、超时接单与账号被单方面停用的风险之中。由于零工彼此分散、多与平台构成承揽而非雇佣关系,传统工会模式难以直接移植,劳动者更多依靠线上社群互助与集体法律行动维护权益。�;Ride-hailing and delivery platforms exert real-time control over the labor process through algorithmic dispatch, dynamic pricing, and rating systems, which scholars call algorithmic management. This design transfers managerial costs onto workers who enjoy nominal schedule freedom yet face volatile earnings, extended hours, and unilateral account deactivation. Because gig workers are dispersed and usually classified as contractors rather than employees, standard union models transfer poorly, and workers lean on online communities and collective legal action instead.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�soc_21_004�body��k情绪劳动指劳动者按照雇主设定的表达规则管理自身感受,以便向顾客展示规定情绪并以此换取工资,典型如空乘人员必须始终保持微笑。它与私人生活中的情感管理不同:后者是霍克希尔德所称的“情感工作”(emotion work),服务于家庭与亲密关系,既不出售也不受组织监督,而情绪劳动则把感受本身变成出售的商品。她进一步区分仅调整外显表情的“表层扮演”与真正改动内心体验的“深层扮演”,并指出当感受被商品化时,从业者容易出现自我疏离、角色混淆与职业倦怠。��Emotional labor denotes workers managing their feelings according to employer-set display rules so as to show customers prescribed emotions in exchange for wages, as when flight attendants must keep smiling. It differs from the parallel managing of feeling in private life, which Hochschild calls 'emotion work': the latter serves family and intimate ties and is neither sold nor organizationally supervised, whereas emotional labor turns feelings themselves into commodities. She further distinguished 'surface acting', which adjusts only outward expression, from 'deep acting', which genuinely reshapes inner experience, warning that commodified feeling tends toward self-alienation, role confusion, and burnout.�ans��src��n阿莉·罗素·霍克希尔德:《被管理的心:人类情感的商品化》,加州大学出版社1983年版�uArlie Russell Hochschild, The Managed Heart: Commercialization of Human Feeling, University of California Press, 1983��id�soc_21_007�body��f比较福利研究显示,多数国家把家庭当作长期照护的默认单位,而性别分工又把无偿照护推给女性亲属。生育率下降和人口流动使可参与照护的家庭成员减少,照护缺口随之扩大。其后果包括女性被迫中断就业、养老金积累受损,以及公共照护服务供给不足的问题被持续掩盖。��Comparative welfare research shows that most countries treat the family as the default unit of long-term care, and gendered divisions push unpaid caring onto female kin. Falling fertility and population mobility shrink the pool of relatives able to give care, so the care gap keeps widening. Consequences include interrupted careers and weakened pension accrual for women, alongside the persistent masking of shortfalls in public care provision.�ans��src��r阿莉·霍克希尔德《第二轮班》,维京出版社,1989年;OECD《健康一览》长期照护指标,2023年�jArlie Hochschild, The Second Shift, Viking, 1989; OECD, Health at a Glance long-term care indicators, 2023��id�soc_21_010�body���米歇尔在研究德国社会民主党时发现,大规模组织必然催生专业化领导层,科层程序与领导者的既得利益会把组织拉离初衷,这就是寡头铁律。组织目标由此从原始宗旨转向自我延续,例如工会将资源用于维系会员而非推进原有诉求。默顿进一步指出,对规则的僵化服从本身也可能取代规则所要服务的目的。�	Studying the German Social Democratic Party, Robert Michels found that large organizations inevitably produce professionalized leaderships whose bureaucratic routines and vested interests pull the body away from its founding purpose—the iron law of oligarchy. Goals then drift from mission toward self-perpetuation, as when unions devote resources to keeping members rather than advancing their original demands. Merton added that rigid rule-following itself can come to displace the ends the rules were meant to serve.�ans��src��f罗伯特·米歇尔《政党论》,1911年;罗伯特·默顿《社会理论与社会结构》,1949年�`Robert Michels, Political Parties, 1911; Robert Merton, Social Theory and Social Structure, 1949��id�soc_21_011�body��s哈默梅什与比德尔利用美国数据发现,被评为容貌高于平均水平的劳动者享有可观的工资溢价,低于平均者则遭受惩罚,服务业尤为明显。这表明外貌不是纯粹的私人禀赋,而是可以投入、积累并兑换回报的资本形态。身体由此被卷入阶层再生产,审美标准也随之成为一种社会筛选机制。��Using US data, Daniel Hamermesh and Jeff Biddle showed that workers rated above average in looks enjoy a sizable wage premium while those rated below average suffer a penalty, most visibly in service occupations. Appearance is thus not a purely private endowment but a form of capital that can be invested, accumulated, and converted into returns. The body is thereby drawn into class reproduction, and aesthetic standards become one mechanism of social sorting.�ans��src�٨皮埃尔·布迪厄《区分:判断力的社会批判》(1979);丹尼尔·哈默梅什、杰夫·比德尔《美貌与劳动力市场》,《美国经济评论》(1994)ٮPierre Bourdieu, Distinction: A Social Critique of the Judgement of Taste (1979); Daniel Hamermesh & Jeff Biddle, Beauty and the Labor Market, American Economic Review (1994)��id�soc_21_014�body��U康拉德把医疗化界定为将人类问题划归医学议题、纳入医生管辖的过程,典型如害羞被改写为社交焦虑障碍。其推动力已从医生的职业扩张转向制药公司、患者团体与保险制度的合力。这一进程带来治疗资源的同时,也使许多原本属于生活常态的体验被病理化。��Peter Conrad defined medicalization as the process by which human problems are framed as medical issues and brought under physician jurisdiction, with shyness recast as social anxiety disorder as the classic case. Its engine has shifted from professional expansion toward pharmaceutical companies, patient groups, and insurance systems acting together. While the process delivers therapeutic resources, it also pathologizes experiences once considered ordinary life.�ans��src��彼得·康拉德《社会的医疗化》(2007);康拉德《医疗化与社会控制》,《健康与社会行为杂志》(1992)ّPeter Conrad, The Medicalization of Society (2007); Peter Conrad, Medicalization and Social Control, Journal of Health and Social Behavior (1992)��id�soc_21_017�body���他在1985年刊于《美国社会学杂志》的经典论文中指出,经济行动总是嵌入于具体且持续运转的人际关系网络之中,并同时批评“低度社会化”(原子化个体)与“过度社会化”(完全受规范支配)两种极端假设。以求职为例,岗位信息大多经由熟人网络而非公开的市场竞价流动,说明秩序与信任主要依靠关系结构而非普遍道德或正式契约来维系。�%In his classic 1985 article in the American Journal of Sociology he argued that economic action is always embedded in concrete, ongoing networks of personal relations, attacking both the “undersocialized” picture of atomized actors and the “oversocialized” picture of norm-dominated ones. Job seeking illustrates the point: vacancy information travels mostly through acquaintance networks rather than open market bidding, showing that order and trust rest mainly on relational structure rather than on universal morality or formal contracts.�ans��src�مMark Granovetter,“Economic Action and Social Structure: The Problem of Embeddedness”,American Journal of Sociology 第91卷(1985)وMark Granovetter, “Economic Action and Social Structure: The Problem of Embeddedness”, American Journal of Sociology, vol. 91 (1985)��id�soc_22_001�body��w学校把统治阶层熟悉的语言风格、审美趣味和知识储备当作普遍才能来考核。优势家庭的孩子入学前已在家庭熏陶中积累这些文化资本，因而在评价中被判为有天分；弱势家庭的孩子则被判为能力不足。社会出身由此转换成官方认定的学业成就，不平等获得合法形式并实现代际传递。��Schools evaluate the language styles, tastes, and knowledge that children of the dominant classes acquire at home as if they were universal talent. Advantaged pupils therefore appear gifted in examinations while disadvantaged pupils appear incapable. Social origin is thereby converted into officially certified academic achievement, giving inequality a legitimate form and transmitting it across generations.�ans��src��X皮埃尔·布尔迪厄、让-克洛德·帕斯隆：《再生产——一种教育系统理论的要点》，巴黎子夜出版社1970年初版；商务印书馆中译本（邢克超译） ; 另见: Pierre Bourdieu & Jean-Claude Passeron, Reproduction in Education, Society and Culture, Paris: Editions de Minuit, 1970 (English ed. Sage, 1977)�ZPierre Bourdieu & Jean-Claude Passeron, Reproduction in Education, Society and Culture, Paris: Editions de Minuit, 1970 (English ed. Sage, 1977) ; see also: 皮埃尔·布尔迪厄、让-克洛德·帕斯隆：《再生产——一种教育系统理论的要点》，巴黎子夜出版社1970年初版；商务印书馆中译本（邢克超译）��id�soc_22_004�body���该模型以1962年美国男性职业变迁调查为基础，把父亲的教育与职业、本人教育年限、初职和现职连成一条分析路径。结论是：父代优势只有一部分直接传递，更大份额经由子代的教育发生作用，受教育越久越可能进入声望较高的职业。教育因而成为代际流动的关键通道，其公平与否直接影响分层体系的开放程度。��Built on the 1962 survey of American men's occupational careers, the model chains father's education and occupation, respondent's own schooling, first job, and current job into one pathway. Only part of paternal advantage passes directly; most works through the son's years of education, since longer schooling raises the chance of reaching prestigious occupations. Education is thus the key channel of intergenerational mobility, and its fairness largely determines how open the stratification order is.�ans��src��w彼得·布劳、奥蒂斯·达德利·邓肯：《美国职业结构》，纽约 John Wiley & Sons 出版社1967年版�jPeter M. Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, New York: John Wiley & Sons, 1967��id�soc_22_007�body���韦斯特和齐默尔曼提出，性别并非个人与生俱来的固定属性，而是在日常互动中被不断“做出”的成就。人们按照社会对其生理性别的规范期待来安排言行——穿着、声调、姿态、分工等——并对偏离这些期待负责，一旦“出格”便会遭到纠正。正是这种持续的责任追究反复再生产出性别差异与不平等，使人为建构的性别看起来像自然而然的事实。�West and Zimmerman argue that gender is not an innate attribute people possess but an accomplishment continually produced through everyday interaction. Individuals arrange their conduct—dress, voice, posture, division of tasks—according to normative expectations tied to their sex category, and are held accountable when they deviate. Because such accountability constantly recreates difference, gender appears natural while remaining socially sustained, and inequality is reproduced through routine conduct itself.�ans��src�ٙ坎迪丝·韦斯特、唐·齐默尔曼：《做性别》；West & Zimmerman,《Doing Gender》,Gender & Society,1987 (DOI: 10.1177/0891243287001002002)�ZWest & Zimmerman, 'Doing Gender', Gender & Society, 1987, DOI: 10.1177/0891243287001002002��id�soc_22_010�body���沃斯在1938年提出，人口规模、密度和异质性三者结合，塑造出独特的都市生存方式：人多使交往多为次级的、限于特定角色的接触；高密度带来竞争与摩擦，催生防御性的冷漠；异质性则瓦解亲属和邻里纽带，加剧分化。结果，都市人置身人群却彼此疏离，社会控制也从熟人舆论转向法律等正式制度，形成典型的“都市人格”。�.In his 1938 essay Louis Wirth held that large size, high density, and heterogeneity together produce a distinctive urban way of life. Sheer numbers make most contacts secondary and confined to specific roles; density breeds competition, friction, and defensive reserve; heterogeneity weakens kinship and neighborhood ties and sharpens differentiation. City dwellers are therefore surrounded by crowds yet remain relatively detached, and social control shifts from acquaintance opinion to formal institutions such as law—the classic “urban personality.”�ans��src��~路易·沃斯：《作为一种生活方式的城市性》，《美国社会学杂志》1938年第44卷第1期，第1–24页�ZLouis Wirth, Urbanism as a Way of Life, American Journal of Sociology 44(1), 1938, pp.1-24��id�soc_22_017�body���1966年科尔曼团队调查约六十万名美国学生后发现：校际经费、校舍与班级规模的差距，远不如父母受教育程度、家中藏书与语言环境等家庭背景更能解释成绩差异；同校学生的构成即同伴效应同样显著。报告由此将教育公平的关切从“投入均等”转向“结果均等”，推动补偿教育与废除种族隔离就学改革，并将家庭与社区确立为学业研究的核心变量。�<In 1966, surveying roughly 600,000 American students, Coleman's team found that gaps between schools in funding, facilities, and class size explained far less achievement variation than family background—parents' schooling, books, and language at home—while the composition of schoolmates showed marked peer effects. The report therefore moved concern for equity from equalizing inputs toward equalizing outcomes, spurring compensatory programs and desegregation of schooling, and it fixed family and community as central variables in research on academic achievement.�ans��src��fJames S. Coleman 等，Equality of Educational Opportunity，U.S. Government Printing Office，1966。�tJames S. Coleman et al., Equality of Educational Opportunity, Washington, DC: U.S. Government Printing Office, 1966.��id�soc_23_004�body���哈布瓦赫主张，回忆虽发生在个体头脑之中，其组织方式却来自群体：语言、家庭、宗教与阶级为个人提供定位过去的框架，人们唯有在与他人的交谈和对照中才能稳定地记住事件。因此集体记忆不是历史的忠实存档，而是服务于当下群体需要的持续重构——每个世代都按自身关切重新讲述昨天，纪念仪式与共同叙事正是这种重构的制度化形态。�1Maurice Halbwachs argued that although remembering happens inside individual minds, its organization comes from the group: language, family, religion, and class supply the frameworks through which people locate the past, and memories stabilize only in conversation and comparison with others. Collective memory is thus not a faithful archive of history but a continuing reconstruction serving present group needs—each generation retells yesterday according to its own concerns, with commemorations and shared narratives institutionalizing that reconstruction.�ans��src�٢莫里斯·哈布瓦赫：《论集体记忆》，Lewis A. Coser编译，芝加哥大学出版社1992年版（法文原著《记忆的社会框架》1925年）。فMaurice Halbwachs, On Collective Memory, ed. and trans. Lewis A. Coser, University of Chicago Press, 1992 (French original 1925).��id�soc_23_010�body���道格拉斯在1972年的论文中用结构分析指出，餐食像语言一样自有句法：酒水与菜肴的分界、主菜与配菜的次序共同宣告眼前是正餐、点心还是款待——同样一块饼干，夹进面包便是午餐，抹上果酱就成了茶点。这些编码标记亲属关系、待客义务与内外之别，可见进食首先是在操演社会分类、维系群体边界，营养只是其意义之一。�<Using structural analysis in her 1972 essay, Douglas argued that meals obey a grammar of their own: the division between drinks and dishes and the ranking of staple and trimmings jointly announce whether an occasion is a dinner, a nibble, or hospitality — the same biscuit becomes lunch when sandwiched in bread, and tea when spread with jam. Such codes mark kinship, obligations to guests, and the border between insiders and outsiders; eating thus chiefly performs social classification and keeps group boundaries alive, with nourishment only one layer of its meaning.�ans��src�ً玛丽·道格拉斯：《解读一顿饭》，载《代达罗斯》（Daedalus）第101卷第1期（1972年冬季号），第61–81页。�RMary Douglas, “Deciphering a Meal”, Daedalus 101(1), Winter 1972, pp. 61–81.��id�soc_24_005�body��[世俗化理论曾断言现代化必然稀释宗教,但二十世纪末的数据打了脸:全球信教人口比例不降反升,美国保持高度虔信,而欧洲却显著世俗化。诺里斯与英格哈特的解释是存在性安全假说:宗教满足的是不确定与匮乏中的意义与保障需求,凡福利国家健全、贫富差距小、人身安全高的社会,宗教热情自然降温;反之在动荡与生存焦虑浓重的社会,无论科技多进步,宗教依旧繁荣。宗教因此不是被科学打败的过时品,而是随生存条件涨落的深层需求,其形态还在不断翻新。��Secularization theory predicted modernity would dilute religion, but late-twentieth-century data embarrassed it: global religiosity rose rather than fell, America stayed devout while Europe secularized sharply. Norris and Ingleharts existential security thesis explains this: religion supplies meaning and reassurance against uncertainty and want, so societies with strong welfare states, small gaps and personal safety cool off naturally, whereas wherever survival anxiety runs high, faith thrives regardless of technology. Religion is thus not an obsolete artifact defeated by science but a deep demand rising and falling with existential conditions — and it keeps reinventing its forms.�ans��src��MNorris 与 Inglehart,《Sacred and Secular》,Cambridge University Press,2004�PP. Norris and R. Inglehart, Sacred and Secular, Cambridge University Press, 2004��id�soc_24_012�body��?跨国比较给出三个理由。逆周期性:母国经济危机货币贬值时,外币汇款购买力反而上升,移民倾向多寄;而外资与旅游在危机中最先撤离。微观直达性:侨汇绕开政府与金融中介直接进入家庭预算,转化为学费、医疗与小型创业,减贫效率高。成本低争议小:不附带政治条件、不形成主权债务。代价面同样清楚——接收地可能产生依赖与劳动力退出,输出地承受人才流失。政策方向因此是降低汇款手续费(全球平均仍超百分之六)而非限制流动。��Cross-country evidence gives three reasons. Counter-cyclicality: when the home economy slumps and its currency falls, foreign-currency remittances gain purchasing power and migrants send more — while investment and tourism flee first. Micro-directness: money bypasses states and intermediaries straight into household budgets for school fees, healthcare and microbusinesses, with high poverty-reduction efficiency. Low-contestation: no political strings, no sovereign debt. Costs remain real — dependence, labor withdrawal abroad, brain drain. Policy therefore targets cutting transfer fees (still above six percent globally) rather than restricting flows.�ans��src�ٙRatha,《Workers' Remittances: An Important and Stable Source of External Development Finance》,World Bank Policy Research Working Paper 第3083号,2003ٓD. Ratha, Workers' Remittances: An Important and Stable Source of External Development Finance, World Bank Policy Research Working Paper 3083, 2003��id�soc_26_003�body��因为科层化必然把权力集中到少数专职干部手里，这就是他提出的寡头统治铁律。机理：组织规模一大，全员议事在技术上不再可行，日常事务只好交给领袖处理；领袖逐渐垄断信息、专业知识与对外谈判的经验，普通成员缺少时间、兴趣和自信，反而乐于有人代劳；在职者还能利用职务资源不断巩固地位。米歇尔斯考察德国社会民主党后概括道：组织催生对领袖的需要，需要又催生领袖的永久化。��Bureaucratization concentrates power in the hands of full-time officials—the iron law of oligarchy. Once an organization grows, decision-making by the entire membership becomes technically impossible, so routine business passes to leaders. These leaders monopolize information, expertise, and negotiating experience, while ordinary members lack time, interest, and confidence, and are quietly grateful to let someone else carry the load; incumbents meanwhile use the resources of office to entrench themselves. From his study of the German Social Democratic Party, Michels distilled the formula: organization demands leadership, and the demand makes leaders permanent.�ans��src��罗伯特·米歇尔斯：《政党：现代民主中寡头倾向的社会学研究》，1911年德文初版，1915年英译本ٚRobert Michels, Political Parties: A Sociological Study of the Oligarchical Tendencies of Modern Democracy, German original 1911, English translation 1915��id�soc_26_009�body��用结构分化来解释：工业化迫使家庭交出大部分传统功能，小家庭反而最适应新环境。机理：生产移入工厂，教育移交学校，济贫转给政府，庞大的亲属共同体因功能被剥离而解体；家庭仅保留儿童初级社会化与成年人情感支持两项核心职能，而规模小、易流动的核心家庭恰好能追随劳动力市场的岗位迁徙。所以在帕森斯看来，核心家庭普及不是家庭衰败，而是对工业社会的功能适应。�tThrough structural differentiation: industrialization stripped the family of most inherited functions, and the small household proved best fitted to what remained. Production moved into factories, schooling into schools, relief into government agencies, so the large kinship community dissolved once its functions were taken away. The family kept two core tasks—primary socialization of children and emotional stabilization of adults—and a small, mobile nuclear unit could follow jobs through the labor market. Hence for Parsons the spread of the nuclear family was not decay but functional adaptation to industrial society.�ans��src��x塔尔科特·帕森斯、罗伯特·贝尔斯：《家庭、社会化与互动过程》，Free Press出版社1955年版�bTalcott Parsons & Robert F. Bales, Family, Socialization and Interaction Process, Free Press, 1955��id�soc_26_013�body���主张轻微失序会一步步酿成严重犯罪，治理必须赶在前头。机理：破窗向路人宣告此处没人关心、没人管事，恐惧令守法居民撤出街头，非正式监控随之松动，潜在越轨者收到纵容信号，街区沿失序螺旋下滑。因此政策重心应是及时修缮环境、制止涂鸦与逃票等小过错，重建居民对秩序可预期的信心，避免零星混乱固化为重罪温床。�FMinor disorder, left alone, ripens into serious crime, so policing must act early. A broken window tells passersby that nobody here cares and nobody is in charge; fear pulls law-abiding residents off the street, informal surveillance slackens, and would-be offenders read a license to misbehave as the neighborhood slides down a spiral of decline. Policy should therefore repair the environment promptly and check small offenses like graffiti and fare evasion, rebuilding residents' confidence that order can be expected before scattered mess hardens into fertile ground for felony.�ans��src��u詹姆斯·Q·威尔逊、乔治·凯林：《警察与邻里安全：破窗》，《大西洋月刊》1982年3月号�yJames Q. Wilson & George L. Kelling, Broken Windows: The Police and Neighborhood Safety, The Atlantic Monthly, March 1982��id�soc_26_018�body��答案是街头规范：在正式权威失灵的街区，赢得他人敬重本身就是生存装备。机理：警察保护遥远且难以指望，年轻人相信谁显得好欺负谁就会先被挑中，于是靠衣着言谈、眼神姿态乃至先发制人地展示武力来立威，免得沦为软柿子；这套摆面子的规则反过来抬高冲突升级的概率，形成恶性循环。安德森强调多数家庭仍是教子有方的正派家庭，街头规范是恶劣环境逼出的自保策略，而非社区固有的价值观。��Through the code of the street: where formal authority fails, commanding respect becomes survival equipment. Police protection feels distant and unreliable, so teenagers assume that whoever looks easy to prey upon gets picked first; they build deterrence through dress, speech, eye contact, even preemptive shows of force, determined never to be taken for soft targets. Those same face-saving rules raise the odds that minor disputes escalate, locking the block into a vicious cycle. Anderson stresses that most households remain decent ones raising children right—the code is a survival adaptation to desperate conditions, not the community's native values.�ans��src�ف伊利亚·安德森：《街头规范：内城贫困、暴力与家庭生活的道德法则》，W·W·诺顿出版社1999年版�pElijah Anderson, Code of the Street: Decency, Violence, and the Moral Life of the Inner City, W. W. Norton, 1999��id�04f38aaba013�body��乔姆斯基在 1957 年《句法结构》及之后提出，人类天生具备一套内嵌于大脑的语言习得机制，即普遍语法，使儿童能在有限输入下快速掌握复杂语法。这一假说引发了语言学与认知科学的长久争论。�+In “Syntactic Structures” (1957) and later, Chomsky proposed that humans are born with an innate language-acquisition device—universal grammar—enabling children to rapidly master complex grammar from limited input. The hypothesis sparked lasting debates in linguistics and cognitive science.�ans��src��0诺姆·乔姆斯基《句法结构》（1957）�/Noam Chomsky, “Syntactic Structures” (1957)��id�0d64929ab576�body���米德在 1928 年通过对萨摩亚少女的田野调查，认为青春期困扰主要源于文化而非生物本能，即“天性 vs 教化”之争中偏向教化。该结论后来受到德里克·弗里曼的强烈质疑。�In 1928 Mead’s fieldwork among Samoan girls argued that adolescent turmoil stems mainly from culture rather than biological instinct—a nurture-over-nature claim in the nature vs. nurture debate. Her conclusions were later strongly challenged by Derek Freeman.�ans��src��9玛格丽特·米德《萨摩亚人的成年》（1928）�2Margaret Mead, “Coming of Age in Samoa” (1928)��id�0da0ec01d83a�body��"马尔萨斯在 1798 年提出，人口若不受限制会按几何级数（1,2,4,8…）增长，而生活资料至多按算术级数（1,2,3,4…）增长，因此贫困与饥荒会以“积极抑制”方式必然出现。这一悲观论题深刻影响了后世的经济学与人口学。�In 1798 Malthus argued that population, unchecked, grows geometrically (1,2,4,8…) while subsistence grows at best arithmetically (1,2,3,4…), so poverty and famine inevitably act as “positive checks.” This pessimistic thesis deeply influenced later economics and demography.�ans��src��Y托马斯·马尔萨斯《人口论》（An Essay on the Principle of Population, 1798）�DThomas Malthus, “An Essay on the Principle of Population” (1798)��id�205a6a312516�body���凯恩斯在 1936 年提出，当私人需求不足导致失业时，政府应通过财政赤字支出和公共投资来刺激总需求，从而恢复充分就业。这一思想奠定了现代宏观经济学和“需求管理”政策的基础。�#In 1936 Keynes argued that when private demand is insufficient and causes unemployment, governments should use deficit spending and public investment to stimulate aggregate demand and restore full employment. This idea founded modern macroeconomics and the policy of “demand management.”�ans��src��J约翰·梅纳德·凯恩斯《就业、利息和货币通论》（1936）�VJohn Maynard Keynes, “The General Theory of Employment, Interest and Money” (1936)��id�2c4d9367d099�body��涂尔干在 1897 年通过分析欧洲各国的自杀统计数据，发现自杀率随宗教归属、家庭状况和动荡时期系统性变化，而非由个人心理随机决定。他据此提出“社会整合”程度影响自杀率，奠定了实证社会学的方法基础。�ZIn 1897 Durkheim analyzed suicide statistics across European countries and found that rates varied systematically with religion, family status, and periods of upheaval rather than random individual psychology. He concluded that the degree of “social integration” shapes suicide rates, founding the methodological basis of empirical sociology.�ans��src��9埃米尔·涂尔干《自杀论》（Le Suicide, 1897）�(Émile Durkheim, “Le Suicide” (1897)��id�309777f2a281�body�ٺ规范多从重复互动中浮现：大家都这么做、这么做更方便或被奖励，便成了习惯；再经模仿与责备强化。它靠自发协调，而非单靠法律强制。��Norms emerge from repeated interaction: what everyone does and what pays off becomes habit, then is reinforced by imitation and blame. They rest on spontaneous coordination, not just legal force.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�37f6d18cf22a�body��多数决（如单一选区相对多数制）通常产生两党格局和强政府，但小党代表不足；比例代表制按得票比例分配席位，更能反映多元民意，但常导致多党联合政府。制度选择会影响政党体系与治理稳定性。�BMajoritarian systems (e.g., first-past-the-post) tend to produce two-party systems and strong governments but under-represent small parties; proportional representation allocates seats by vote share, better reflecting diverse opinion but often yielding coalition governments. The choice shapes party systems and stability.�ans��src��T阿伦·利普哈特《民主的模式》（Lijphart, Patterns of Democracy, 1999）�2Arend Lijphart, “Patterns of Democracy” (1999)��id�38d4ba26acc9�body��%班杜拉在 1961/1963 年让儿童观看成人殴打充气玩偶的影片，之后这些儿童更可能模仿攻击行为，支持了“社会学习（观察学习）”理论——人可以通过观察他人而非仅由奖惩直接塑造行为。该发现推动了对媒体暴力的讨论。�9In 1961/1963 Bandura showed children a film of an adult beating an inflatable doll, after which those children imitated the aggression, supporting “social (observational) learning” theory—that people learn by watching others, not only through direct reward or punishment. It fueled debate on media violence.�ans��src��V阿尔伯特·班杜拉《攻击：社会学习的分析》（1973）；1961 年实验�TAlbert Bandura, “Aggression: A Social Learning Analysis” (1973); 1961 experiment��id�59ffec418d7b�body��韦伯在 1905 年提出，加尔文宗等新教教派强调勤奋、节俭和天职观，这些观念无意中培育了以理性积累和再投资为核心的资本主义精神。他并非声称这是唯一原因，而是强调宗教价值观对经济发展的文化影响。�]Weber argued in 1905 that Protestant sects such as Calvinism, with their emphasis on hard work, frugality, and a “calling,” unintentionally fostered a capitalist spirit centered on rational accumulation and reinvestment. He did not claim this was the sole cause but highlighted the cultural influence of religious values on economic development.�ans��src��B马克斯·韦伯《新教伦理与资本主义精神》（1905）�IMax Weber, “The Protestant Ethic and the Spirit of Capitalism” (1905)��id�62daead0d268�body�ٺ五个常任理事国（中、法、俄、英、美）对重大决议可一票否决，使安理会行动需大国一致；这保障了大国参与，也常被批评阻碍及时干预。��The five permanent members (China, France, Russia, the UK, US) can veto substantive resolutions, so Council action needs great-power consensus; this secures their buy-in but is criticized for blocking timely action.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�64bf2f74221b�body�ٲJIT 通过减少库存提高效率，但也使生产高度依赖即时交付；一旦港口拥堵、灾害或地缘冲突打断运输，整条线会迅速停摆，韧性较弱。��JIT boosts efficiency by cutting inventory but makes production rely on on-time delivery; once ports clog, disasters strike, or conflicts interrupt transport, the line stalls quickly, with weak resilience.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�7610d6d451bc�body�٥数据跨越国界带来隐私、安全与主权争议。各国通过数据本地化、充分性认定与协议（如跨境隐私规则）来平衡流通与监管。ٮCross-border data raises privacy, security, and sovereignty disputes. States balance flow and control via data localization, adequacy decisions, and frameworks like the CBPR.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�7785a31af489�body��碳中和指一定时期内人为温室气体排放与被吸收或抵消的量相等，实现净零排放。政府间气候变化专门委员会（IPCC）由联合国环境署与 WMO 于 1988 年设立，负责评估气候科学并为《巴黎协定》等提供权威依据。� Carbon neutrality means that over a period, human-caused greenhouse gas emissions equal the amount absorbed or offset, achieving net zero. The IPCC, established by UNEP and WMO in 1988, assesses climate science and provides the authoritative basis for agreements like the Paris Agreement.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�7b6f6f307086�body�ٙ青春期大脑奖赏中枢活跃、渴望被同伴接纳，加上独立意识增强，使青少年更看重朋友看法，因而容易受同伴影响。��In adolescence the brain's reward centers are active and the need for peer acceptance is strong, while independence grows, so teenagers weigh friends' opinions heavily and are easily influenced.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8593a2e510c7�body���孟德斯鸠在 1748 年主张将国家权力分为立法、行政和司法三部分，并相互制衡，以防止权力集中导致专制。这一思想深刻影响了美国宪法和许多现代民主制度的架构。�In 1748 Montesquieu argued that state power should be divided into legislative, executive, and judicial branches with mutual checks to prevent tyranny from concentrated power. This idea strongly shaped the U.S. Constitution and many modern democratic systems.�ans��src��C孟德斯鸠《论法的精神》（De l’esprit des lois, 1748）�0Montesquieu, “The Spirit of the Laws” (1748)��id�8872ca2c1768�body���逆向选择发生在交易前，掌握信息多的一方利用优势获益。二手车市场里卖家比买家更懂车况，劣质车把优质车挤出市场，买家整体只愿出低价，形成“劣币驱逐良币”。��Adverse selection happens before a deal, when the better-informed side exploits its edge. In used cars, sellers know condition better; lemons drive out good cars, so buyers only offer low prices—“bad drives out good.”�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8deedc1acc78�body�٭深度伪造利用生成式AI合成逼真的音视频，可被用于误导与操纵。它侵蚀“眼见为实”的信任基础，推动事实核查与内容溯源技术。ٲDeepfakes use generative AI to fabricate realistic audio/video for deception, eroding the “seeing is believing” trust basis and spurring fact-checking and content provenance.�ans��src��-中国科学院（网络谣言传播研究）�BChinese Academy of Sciences (research on online rumor propagation)��id�958efbf41b43�body�ِ知名科学家更易获得荣誉、经费与引用，无名者贡献易被低估，优势累积放大不平等，即科学界的马太效应。ٮFamous scientists more easily gain credit, funding, and citations while lesser-known contributors are overlooked—advantage accumulates, the “Matthew effect” in science.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9f981c3e7567�body�ٍ这是国际法基本原则：合法缔结的条约对当事国具有约束力，须善意履行，构成国际秩序可预期性的基础。ّA core principle: treaties in force bind parties and must be performed in good faith, underpinning the predictability of the international order.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�b09d4a44a3ec�body��美国总统伍德罗·威尔逊在 1918 年提出十四点原则，主张公开外交、民族自决和建立国际联盟，试图以道义与集体安全重塑战后秩序。它直接促成了国际联盟的成立，但美国国会最终未批准加入。�$U.S. President Woodrow Wilson’s 1918 Fourteen Points called for open diplomacy, national self-determination, and a League of Nations to reshape the post-war order through morality and collective security. They directly led to the League’s creation, though the U.S. Senate refused to join.�ans��src��K伍德罗·威尔逊 1918 年国会演讲；《凡尔赛条约》（1919）�;Woodrow Wilson’s 1918 speech; Treaty of Versailles (1919)��id�bf322e9b08ee�body�ٺ法治强调法律约束政府、保障权利；以法治国只是把法律当作统治工具，政府自身可不受同等约束。前者限制权力，后者可能只是便利管理。��Rule of law binds government and protects rights; rule by law merely uses law as a tool of rule, with government possibly unbound. The former limits power; the latter may just ease administration.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c1fa16cbaac6�body���拉波夫在 1966 年《纽约市英语的社会分层》中通过“随机应变的 (r)”等实验发现，即便无意识，说话者的发音变体也随社会阶层和教育程度系统性变化，并存在向高声望变体靠拢的倾向。�In 1966’s “The Social Stratification of English in New York City,” Labov showed via experiments like the variable (r) that speakers’ pronunciation variants shift systematically with social class and education even unconsciously, with a tendency toward prestige variants.�ans��src��?威廉·拉波夫《纽约市英语的社会分层》（1966）�QWilliam Labov, “The Social Stratification of English in New York City” (1966)��id�d3a8a081185d�body���代内流动是一个人一生中地位的变化（如跳槽升职）；代际流动是子女相对父母地位的变化（如是否比父辈更富裕）。两者衡量流动的不同维度。��Intra-generational mobility is a person's change over their own life (e.g., promotion); intergenerational mobility is children's status versus parents' (e.g., richer than one's parents). They measure different dimensions.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�d6a874914dfa�body���罗马帝国从尼禄起便逐渐降低银币含银量，到三世纪危机时几乎变成包铜的「白铜」。货币贬值推高物价、侵蚀税收与军饷信誉，被许多经济史家视为帝国财政与政治崩溃的助推因素。�<Starting with Nero, Rome steadily lowered the silver content of the denarius until the third-century crisis left it essentially copper-clad. Debasement drove prices up and undermined the credibility of taxes and soldiers' pay, which many economic historians see as fueling the empire's fiscal and political collapse.�ans��src��<Harper，《罗马的命运》(2017)；剑桥大学出版社�=Harper, 'The Fate of Rome' (2017); Cambridge University Press��id�dd82bbe30dfe�body��现实主义认为国家是国际政治的主要行为体，在无政府状态下为生存与权力而理性竞争，安全是首要目标。肯尼思·沃尔兹在 1979 年《国际政治理论》中以“结构现实主义”系统阐述了这一视角。�(Realism holds that states are the primary actors in an anarchic international system, rationally competing for survival and power with security as the top goal. Kenneth Waltz systematically presented this perspective as “structural realism” in 1979’s “Theory of International Politics.”�ans��src��6肯尼思·沃尔兹《国际政治理论》（1979）�<Kenneth Waltz, “Theory of International Politics” (1979)��id�e8c2da158ff2�body�ِ物价上涨使固定名义金额的购买力下降；当实际利率（名义利率减去通胀）为负时，会侵蚀储蓄的真实价值。َRising prices erode the purchasing power of fixed sums; when the real interest rate (nominal minus inflation) is negative, savings lose value.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�f0c422183a8d�body���《世界人权宣言》由联合国大会于 1948 年 12 月 10 日通过，是世界上首份系统阐述基本人权的文件。它本身是宣示性文件而非强制条约，但后续两项公约使其许多内容成为有约束力的国际法。�"The Universal Declaration of Human Rights was adopted by the UN General Assembly on December 10, 1948, the first comprehensive statement of fundamental human rights. It is a declaratory document rather than a binding treaty, though later covenants made much of it binding international law.�ans��src��.联合国大会第217A(III)号决议（1948）�1UN General Assembly Resolution 217 A (III) (1948)��id�f0f4631d6aad�body�٭用户在社交平台的生产（发帖、标注、训练AI）创造价值却通常无报酬，被称为数字劳工；它揭示平台价值创造与报酬之间的错位。٦Users’ content, tagging, and AI-training on platforms create value without pay—“digital labor”—revealing a mismatch between value creation and compensation.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�f125a5850517�body��)国际法院（ICJ，设于海牙）处理国家之间的法律争端，由联合国大会和安理会选举法官；国际刑事法院（ICC，亦在海牙）则审判个人犯下的种族灭绝、战争罪等，依据 1998 年《罗马规约》设立。两者职能与管辖对象截然不同。�eThe International Court of Justice (ICJ, in The Hague) settles legal disputes between states, with judges elected by the UN General Assembly and Security Council; the International Criminal Court (ICC, also in The Hague) prosecutes individuals for genocide, war crimes, etc., established by the 1998 Rome Statute. They differ in function and subject matter.�ans��src��C联合国国际法院（ICJ）规约；《罗马规约》（1998）�'Statute of the ICJ; Rome Statute (1998)��id�f1fb43ce631b�body��津巴多在 1971 年将志愿者随机分配为“狱警”与“囚犯”，实验本计划两周却因角色代入引发虐待行为而在第 6 天终止，显示情境与角色能强烈塑造行为。该实验后来因伦理问题和实验者干预而受质疑。�(In 1971 Zimbardo randomly assigned volunteers as “guards” or “prisoners”; planned for two weeks, it was halted on day 6 as role-playing produced abusive behavior, showing situations and roles strongly shape conduct. The study was later criticized for ethics and experimenter interference.�ans��src��J菲利普·津巴多《路西法效应》（2007）；1971 年实验报告�APhilip Zimbardo, “The Lucifer Effect” (2007); 1971 experiment��id�soc_25_011�body��x温和的通胀是经济的常态:货币总量增加、工资物价螺旋上升,钱慢慢变得不那么值钱。适度通胀激励人们消费投资,但恶性通胀(如历史上某些国家物价一年翻百倍)会摧毁经济秩序。你的压岁钱如果一直存着不动,购买力其实在被通胀悄悄稀释——这也是理财教育的第一课:让钱保值增值。�}Mild inflation is economic normal: money supply grows, wages and prices spiral gently, cash slowly buys less. Moderate inflation encourages spending and investing, but hyperinflation (prices multiplying hundredfold yearly in some histories) wrecks order. New Year money parked idle quietly loses purchasing power — lesson one of financial literacy: make money hold or grow value.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�soc_25_012�body��W因为平台的推荐算法奖励点击:标题越耸动,打开率越高,广告收入越多。创作者被逼着在真实与流量之间做选择,劣币驱逐良币。破解之道在两端:平台把完读率、举报率纳入排序而非只看点击;读者用不点进来投票。当你不再为标题买单,标题党就失去了生存土壤。�iRecommendation algorithms reward clicks: the more sensational the headline, the higher the opens and ad revenue, forcing creators to choose truth versus traffic as bad coins drive out good. Fixes work both ends: platforms ranking by read-through and reports rather than clicks alone, readers voting by not clicking. Starve clickbait of attention and it starves.�ans��src��9Tim Wu,《The Attention Merchants》,Alfred A. Knopf,2016�5T. Wu, The Attention Merchants, Alfred A. Knopf, 2016��id�3b9a1251a1d4�body��x国际人道法是在武装冲突中保护非战斗人员并限制作战手段的法律，例如《日内瓦公约》。�|International humanitarian law protects non-combatants and limits means of war in conflicts, such as the Geneva Conventions.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�44fc73bb92e6�body�ٖ人类大脑天生就有学语言的区域，加上每天听大人说话、被鼓励模仿，小宝宝就像海绵一样很快吸收词语和句式。ٜHuman brains are born with language areas, and by hearing adults talk daily and being encouraged to imitate, babies absorb words and patterns like a sponge.�ans��src��5Lenneberg, E. (1967). 《语言的生物学基础》.�9Lenneberg, E. (1967). Biological Foundations of Language.��id�7efb5e0ba86f�body�٫水稻要集体修渠、育秧、抢收，催生紧密协作的村社与“互助换工”。水的共享也带来共同管理，使社群强调合作而非个人单干。��Rice needs collective canals, seedlings and rushed harvests, spawning tight village cooperation and labor exchange. Shared water meant shared management, so communities prized cooperation over lone effort.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�854e7b3aa872�body���社会学家凡勃伦称其为“炫耀性消费”：昂贵物品向他人发出“我有资源”的信号，帮助获得尊重、伴侣或机会。消费因此不只是实用，也是地位沟通。��Sociologist Veblen called it 'conspicuous consumption': costly goods signal 'I have resources' to others, aiding respect, mates or opportunities. Consumption thus communicates status, not just utility.�ans��src��3Veblen, T. (1899), 《有闲阶级论》, Macmillan�=Veblen, T. (1899), The Theory of the Leisure Class, Macmillan��id�9ca10d7b9e2a�body���郑和船队以展示国威、朝贡贸易和建立友好联系为主，不以占领殖民地或掠夺财富为目标；欧洲航行多与贸易垄断、殖民和资源掠夺相连。目的不同，后续走向也不同。��Zheng He's fleets aimed to display prestige, conduct tributary trade and build friendly ties, not to colonize or plunder; European voyages were tied to trade monopolies, colonies and resource extraction. Different aims led to different outcomes.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c57e38ff2eb4�body��{参照群体是个人用以评价自身态度与行为的群体，未必是其所属群体，例如青少年模仿偶像。ِA reference group is one used to evaluate one's own attitudes and behavior, not necessarily one a person belongs to, like teens emulating idols.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�soc_25_009�body��-这句话是孔子说的:你不喜欢被插队,就不要去插队;不喜欢被嘲笑,就不要嘲笑别人。它是一把万能钥匙,因为每个人都不想受那些委屈。两千五百年前的人类和今天的人类,开心与难过的地方几乎一样,所以这条黄金法则永远不过时。��Confucius said it: if you hate queue-jumping, never jump queues; hate mockery, never mock. It is a master key because nobody enjoys those hurts. Humans twenty-five hundred years ago felt joy and pain just like us, so this golden rule never expires.�ans��src��3《论语》中华书局译注本,中华书局,2012�IThe Analects of Confucius, annotated edition, Zhonghua Book Company, 2012��id�soc_25_010�body��三招查证法:一看来源——正规媒体有记者署名和机构;二找证据——有没有照片、数据和当事人;三比多家——不同的可靠渠道说的是否一致。标题特别吓人、只让你转发的,多半要打个问号。会查证的人,谣言骗不到。�Three checks: source — real media name reporters and organizations; evidence — photos, data, named witnesses; cross-check — do reliable channels agree? Scary headlines begging for shares deserve question marks. Verify like a detective and rumors cannot fool you.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�009e1a855729�body���信息少的一方可主动发出成本高、难伪造的信号来表明真实质量，如求职者用学历、企业用保修承诺；斯宾塞的信号理论说明这类信号能部分恢复市场效率。��The less-informed side can send costly, hard-to-fake signals of true quality—e.g., degrees for job seekers, warranties for firms; Spence's signaling theory shows such signals partly restore market efficiency.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�03b7aaeec56a�body�ٮ诺斯指出制度与技术一旦形成，会因学习效应、协调成本与既得利益而自我强化，使低效制度长期存续（锁定），改变需重大冲击。١North argued institutions and tech self-reinforce via learning, coordination costs, and vested interests, locking in inefficient ones; change needs major shocks.�ans��src��6诺斯《制度、制度变迁与经济绩效》(1990)�RDouglass North, Institutions, Institutional Change and Economic Performance (1990)��id�05cd73b0bdec�body��高速增长时，资本和劳动力会先涌向回报率最高的地区与行业（如沿海城市、制造业），导致区域和收入差距扩大。市场机制本身的再分配较慢，等制度与公共服务跟上之前，“增长代价”就以不平衡的形式显现。�0During fast growth, capital and labor first rush to the regions and sectors with the highest returns—coastal cities, manufacturing—widening regional and income gaps. Market mechanisms redistribute slowly, so until institutions and public services catch up, the 'cost of growth' shows up as imbalance.�ans��src��GWorld Bank（《世界发展报告2009：重塑世界经济地理》）�HWorld Bank (World Development Report 2009: Reshaping Economic Geography)��id�067956225fa3�body��教育公平追求不同背景者享有均等机会，但城乡资源差距、家庭资本与户籍限制构成结构性障碍。早期劣势会通过课外投入与社交网络被放大，形成代际传递。补偿性拨款与公平招生被视为重要对策。�ZEducational equity seeks equal opportunity regardless of background, but urban–rural resource gaps, family capital, and household registration create structural barriers. Early disadvantage is amplified through extracurricular spending and networks, passing across generations. Compensatory funding and fair admissions are seen as key remedies.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0bdf81dbe2a2�body���贫困代际传递通过物质匮乏、教育资源少、健康差与家庭期望低多重机制叠加，使子女难以脱离底层。它形成“贫困陷阱”。打破需早期干预、教育公平与资产建设。�Intergenerational poverty transmission works through stacked mechanisms—material deprivation, poor education, bad health, low expectations—trapping children at the bottom. It forms a “poverty trap.” Breaking it needs early intervention, educational equity, and asset building.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�0d06eab6cde9�body���汇款是一笔稳定的外汇流入，金额常超过当地普通收入，用于日常消费、建房、教育与小微生意。它直接到达家庭而非依赖波动的政府项目，因而能可靠地稳定并激活地方经济。�%Remittances are a steady inflow of foreign currency, often exceeding local incomes, that funds daily consumption, housing, education and small businesses. Because they reach households directly rather than through volatile state projects, they reliably stabilize and stimulate local economies.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�145927d8788c�body���消费者拥有多层身份：为新鲜、认同与社区支持而买本地，又因品种、反季与低价而依赖全球贸易。二者服务于不同需求与尺度，因此互补并存，而非互相排斥。�Consumers hold layered identities: they may buy local for freshness, identity and community support while relying on global trade for variety, off-season goods and lower prices. The two serve different needs and scales, so they coexist as complements rather than opposites.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�1d3e5919133c�body��城市等级体系指区域内城市按人口规模、经济功能和辐射范围呈金字塔分布：少数大城市居顶，众多小城镇居底。中心地理论解释了为何每级城市服务半径与数量有规律。它帮助理解资源与人口的宏观布局。�^The urban hierarchy describes cities in a region arranged like a pyramid by population, economic function, and sphere of influence: a few large cities at the top, many small towns at the bottom. Central-place theory explains why each level's service radius and number follow patterns. It helps understand the macro layout of resources and population.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1d687c653501�body���来世信念把现世的苦难重新定义为暂时的、并将正义留待日后奖赏，从而提高信徒对困境的忍耐，降低为眼前得失立刻抗争的冲动。这能在现实中缓解冲突的紧迫性，降低社会摩擦的治理成本。�A belief in the afterlife reframes present suffering as temporary and reserves justice for later reward, raising believers' tolerance for hardship and reducing the urge to fight for immediate redress. This can ease the urgency of conflict and lower the cost of managing social friction.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�211a21fadc27�body��␀1602年成立的荷兰东印度公司通过公开发行股票募集资本，股东承担有限责任，并由董事会统一管理远洋贸易。它建立了可转让的股权与持续的法人结构，被视为现代股份公司与资本市场的雏形。�7Founded in 1602, the Dutch East India Company raised capital by publicly issuing shares, gave shareholders limited liability, and had a board manage long-distance trade. It created transferable equity and a lasting corporate structure, seen as the prototype of the modern joint-stock company and capital market.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�212e0925aa9b�body���法律能废除种姓的正式歧视，却很难一夜抹去它塑造的婚姻、邻里、职业与社会资本等隐性网络。这些代际延续的社会结构形成巨大惯性，单靠立法难以迅速消除。�Law can abolish caste as formal discrimination, but it cannot instantly erase the informal networks—marriage, neighborhood, occupation, social capital—that caste shaped. These structures persist across generations, creating an inertia that legislation alone cannot quickly undo.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�289b0de59497�body��1865年法国、比利时、意大利等国组成拉丁货币同盟，约定以金法郎为基准、各国硬币可跨境自由流通。但成员国为筹集战争经费不断降低银币成色，加上黄金与白银比价波动，制度逐渐失衡。它最终在1920年代解体。�2In 1865 France, Belgium, Italy and others formed the Latin Monetary Union, agreeing on the gold franc as a standard and free cross-border circulation of coins. But members debased silver coins to fund wars, and fluctuating gold–silver ratios destabilized the system. It ultimately dissolved in the 1920s.�ans��src���Fendel, Maurer,《Does European History Repeat Itself ? : Lessons from the Latin Monetary Union for the European Monetary Union》,Journal of Economic Integration,2015 (DOI: 10.11130/jei.2015.30.1.93)��Fendel, Maurer, 'Does European History Repeat Itself ? : Lessons from the Latin Monetary Union for the European Monetary Union', Journal of Economic Integration, 2015, DOI: 10.11130/jei.2015.30.1.93��id�2986d2b4fb44�body��A推拉理论认为迁出地的不利因素（如贫困、战乱）把人“推”走，而迁入地的机会（如就业、自由）把人“拉”来，中间还受距离与政策的阻碍。它是最经典的迁移解释框架，但难以涵盖主观网络与文化因素。该理论至今仍广泛用于移民研究。�sPush-pull theory holds that unfavorable conditions at the origin (poverty, war) “push” people out while opportunities at the destination (jobs, freedom) “pull” them in, mediated by distance and policy barriers. It is the classic framework for explaining migration, though it underplays subjective networks and culture. It remains widely used in migration studies.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�29ac55f1da93�body��␀汉萨同盟不是国家，而是13到17世纪北欧约200个城市组成的商业与防御联盟。它控制波罗的海贸易、制定共同规则并保护成员商人的利益。随着海运技术和民族国家的兴起，同盟影响力逐渐衰落。�$The Hanseatic League was not a state but a commercial and defensive alliance of about 200 North European cities from the 13th to 17th centuries. It controlled Baltic trade, set common rules, and protected member merchants. Its influence declined as shipping technology and nation-states rose.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2dad360a0b6d�body��'16世纪起，西班牙从美洲开采大量白银并铸造“八里亚尔”银币，因其成色统一、重量标准而在亚欧非广泛被接受，甚至成为明清时期中国的流通外币。它奠定了早期全球化贸易的通用货币地位，直到19世纪被本国货币取代。�ZFrom the 16th century, Spain mined vast silver in the Americas and minted the eight-real coin, which was accepted across Asia, Europe, and Africa because of its uniform fineness and standard weight, even circulating in Ming–Qing China. It became a common currency of early global trade until national currencies replaced it in the 19th century.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2dbd8d9b8b4b�body��文化交流很少是单向的：输出文化的同时，社会也会因接触外界而受到反向影响，而全球媒体平台本身就是双向通道。贸易、旅游与移民网络决定了，只要敞开大门输出，外来文化也必然随之进入。�Cultural exchange is rarely one-way; sending culture out also exposes a society to foreign influence in return, and global media platforms are themselves two-way channels. Trade, tourism and diaspora networks ensure that openness to export culture also lets outside culture in.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�2e6949558654�body��教育回报率通常用多受一年教育带来的收入增幅表示，可用明瑟收入方程等计量方法估计。它帮助个人判断是否值得继续求学，也供政府评估教育投资效益。但回报受性别、地区与专业影响，差异很大。�:The return to education is usually expressed as the income gain from one extra year of schooling, estimated with models like the Mincer earnings equation. It helps individuals decide whether more study pays off and lets governments assess education investment. But returns vary widely by gender, region, and field.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2fb70c96a1af�body���它指经济与社会被分割为现代城市部门与传统乡村部门两套规则与待遇：城市以工业和服务业、较完善福利为主，乡村以农业、保障较弱为主，两者间转换受限。�It describes an economy split into a modern urban sector and a traditional rural sector with different rules and treatment: cities lean on industry/services with stronger welfare, villages on agriculture with weaker protection, and movement between them is constrained.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�328a23c202c3�body���区块链用分布式账本与加密共识替代对中心化中介的信任，使陌生方能在无第三方下完成可信交易。它降低制度性交易成本，却面临能耗、监管与可扩展挑战。智能合约是其典型应用。�8Blockchain replaces trust in centralized intermediaries with a distributed ledger and cryptographic consensus, letting strangers transact reliably without a third party. It lowers institutional transaction costs but faces energy, regulatory, and scalability challenges. Smart contracts are a typical application.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�341f7ddeaec2�body�ٷ劳动力收缩推高单位人力成本、养老负担加重并可能压低住房与消费，但也可能提升人均资本与自动化替代；净效应取决于生产率与政策。ټShrinking labor raises per-worker costs and pension burdens and may lower housing/consumption, yet can raise capital per head and automation; net effect depends on productivity and policy.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�36ac4ffadf03�body���否决玩家理论指凡能单方面阻止政策变更的行动者（如参议院、宪法法院、地方诸侯）构成制度约束。否决玩家越多，政策越难改变、稳定性越高但改革越难。它用于比较各国制度刚性。�$Veto-player theory says any actor able to unilaterally block policy change—a senate, constitutional court, regional baron—constitutes an institutional constraint. More veto players mean harder change: more stability but tougher reform. It compares institutional rigidity across countries.�ans��src��&Lijphart，《协和式民主》(1969)�+Lijphart, 'Consociational Democracy' (1969)��id�381df8454a22�body���常识并非普世直觉，而是特定文化在语言、规范与环境中长期累积、被视为理所当然的知识。所谓“显而易见”反映的其实是本地历史与实践，因此不同社会之间的常识差异巨大。�Common sense is not universal intuition but the accumulated, taken-for-granted knowledge of a specific culture, learned from childhood through language, norms and environment. What feels 'obvious' reflects local history and practice, so it varies widely between societies.�ans��src�ٟNam-lin Hur,《Multiculturalism in Common Sense versus Common Sense in Multiculturalism》,Journal of Education & Culture,2009 (DOI: 10.24159/joec.2009.15.2.7)ٝNam-lin Hur, 'Multiculturalism in Common Sense versus Common Sense in Multiculturalism', Journal of Education & Culture, 2009, DOI: 10.24159/joec.2009.15.2.7��id�3961da2b6001�body���不是。抽样误差是随机抽样的固有波动，可随样本增大而减小；样本偏差来自选样方式系统性偏向某群体，不会随样本变大消失，会导致结论整体偏斜。��No. Sampling error is the natural fluctuation of random sampling, shrinking with size; sample bias comes from systematically favoring some groups in selection and won't vanish with size—it skews conclusions.�ans��src��[UN DESA,《Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses Rev.3》,2017�:UN DESA, Census Principles and Recommendations Rev.3, 2017��id�3aac7bda1431�body���框架效应指同一事实因表述角度（收益 vs 损失、肇事者 vs 受害者）不同，会引出截然不同的判断。媒体通过选词、配图与版面“框定”议题意义。它说明信息不只是内容，更是呈现方式之争。�The framing effect means the same fact, presented differently (gain vs loss, perpetrator vs victim), elicits very different judgments. Media “frame” issues through wording, images, and layout. It shows communication is not just content but a contest of presentation.�ans��src��gRobert Entman,《Framing: Toward Clarification of a Fractured Paradigm》,Journal of Communication,1993�8R. M. Entman, Framing, Journal of Communication 43, 1993��id�4051d18f2495�body���明文规则无法覆盖所有情境，且执行成本很高，于是在规则模糊或不切实际之处，非正式规范便填补空白。当正式制度与实际运作脱节时，潜规则便由权力关系与利益驱动而生。�Formal rules cannot cover every situation and are costly to enforce, so informal norms fill the gaps where written rules are vague or unrealistic. When official institutions diverge from actual practice, hidden rules emerge, driven by power and self-interest.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4223ef39c767�body��鹰鸽博弈中，个体可选“鹰”（强硬争斗）或“鸽”（示弱退让）策略争夺资源：两鹰相遇两败俱伤，鹰对鸽则鹰胜，两鸽相遇各得一半。演化稳定策略往往是混合比例，说明群体中强硬与温和并存才能稳定。�)In the hawk-dove game, individuals choose “hawk” (fight hard) or “dove” (yield) over a resource: two hawks hurt each other, hawk beats dove, two doves split it. The evolutionarily stable strategy is usually a mixed proportion, showing that a mix of tough and mild types stabilizes a group.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�439ceee8c0bb�body���期货是约定未来以固定价格交割标的资产的合约，用于套期保值或投机；期权则赋予买方在未来按约定价买卖的权利而非义务。二者都属衍生品，能管理价格风险也会放大杠杆。�A futures contract obliges delivery of an asset at a fixed future price, used for hedging or speculation; an option gives the buyer the right, not the obligation, to buy or sell at a set price. Both are derivatives that manage price risk yet amplify leverage.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�43a0870b608f�body�٨丝绸之路是古代连接欧亚的陆上与海上商路，不仅贸易丝绸、瓷器、香料，也传播宗教、技术与作物。它是早期全球化的纽带。��The Silk Road was ancient overland and maritime trade routes linking Eurasia, carrying not just silk, porcelain, and spices but also religions, technologies, and crops. It was an early globalization link.�ans��src��]联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《丝绸之路：长安—天山廊道的路网》�\UNESCO World Heritage Centre, Silk Roads: the Routes Network of Chang'an–Tianshan Corridor��id�4516f9c64751�body���寻租指不创造财富、而是通过游说、垄断或特权把他人财富转移给自己的活动，如争取关税保护或特许牌照。它消耗资源却无社会产出，是制度性腐败的温床。减少寻租靠开放竞争与透明规则。�Rent-seeking is pursuing wealth transfer rather than creation—via lobbying, monopoly, or privilege like tariff protection or licenses. It consumes resources without social output and breeds institutional corruption. Curbing it needs open competition and transparent rules.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�459399020213�body���关切包括平台利用数据和网络效应形成进入壁垒、自我优待（偏袒自有业务）、以及“赢家通吃”压制竞争与创新；监管倾向于促进互操作与数据可携带。��Concerns are barriers from data and network effects, self-preferencing (favoring own services), and “winner-takes-all” suppressing competition and innovation; regulation leans toward interoperability and data portability.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�4e3c55313a25�body���许多社会采用“属人法”的分域模式：世俗法管公共与商业事务，宗教法管各社群的婚姻、家庭与继承。这种务实的区隔让多元法律体系并行，不必以某一方完全取代另一方。�!Many societies adopt a 'personal-status' division: secular law governs public and commercial matters while religious law handles marriage, family and inheritance for each community. This pragmatic compartmentalization lets plural legal orders coexist without one fully replacing the other.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4f08820e27ce�body�ٺ它指个人可要求删除不再必要、已过时或损害声誉的个人信息链接，尤其在搜索引擎等场合；它与公众知情权和言论自由之间存在持续张力。��It lets individuals request removal of links to information that is no longer necessary, outdated, or harmful to reputation, especially in search engines; it tensions with the public's right to know and free expression.�ans��src��9欧盟委员会《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR, 2018)�DEuropean Commission, General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR, 2018)��id�5096cb7b5b76�body���高语境文化里，含义很大程度由语境、关系和潜台词承载，而非直白的语言本身。因此沟通更含蓄，依赖彼此默契，常避免正面冲突以维护面子与关系和谐。�In high-context cultures, meaning is carried heavily by context, relationships and unspoken cues rather than by explicit words. Communication therefore tends to be indirect, relies on shared understanding, and avoids open confrontation to preserve face and relational harmony.�ans��src��>Berry,《Cross-Cultural Psychology》(1997) 文化适应模型�,John Berry, Cross-Cultural Psychology (1997)��id�54b4db850cb9�body��习惯法是长期实践中形成、被共同体认可并自发遵守的规范，未必写成条文。在非洲、太平洋等地的土著社区以及国际商事惯例中仍广泛存在，有时与成文法并行。它的正当性来自认同而非国家强制。�`Customary law is norms formed through long practice, recognized and followed spontaneously by a community, not necessarily written. It remains widespread in indigenous communities of Africa and the Pacific and in international commercial usage, sometimes running parallel to statute law. Its legitimacy comes from acceptance rather than state coercion.�ans��src��BWeber,《Economy and Society»,University of California Press,1978�CM. Weber, Economy and Society, University of California Press, 1978��id�553c070ada4b�body���经济学把腐败视为官员用公共权力换取私利的“寻租”，受查处概率、薪酬与垄断权力影响。低薪、强管制与弱法治会抬高其净收益。降低它需提高透明度、薪酬与问责。�Economics views corruption as officials' rent-seeking by trading public power for private gain, shaped by detection probability, pay, and monopoly power. Low pay, heavy regulation, and weak rule of law raise its net payoff. Reducing it needs transparency, pay, and accountability.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�59d7ae3249c1�body���贝克提出风险社会，指现代化制造出核、气候、金融等人为风险，且传统制度难以应对、风险分配不均。财富分配让位于风险分配成为新冲突轴。它呼吁反思性现代化与全球协作。�:Beck's risk society holds that modernization produces manufactured risks—nuclear, climate, financial—that traditional institutions poorly handle and that distribute unevenly. Wealth distribution gives way to risk distribution as a new conflict axis. It calls for reflexive modernization and global cooperation.�ans��src��h乌尔里希·贝克《风险社会：迈向一种新的现代性》(1986, 马克·里特英译本 1992)�SUlrich Beck, Risk Society: Towards a New Modernity (1986; trans. Mark Ritter, 1992)��id�5b7cdb8f7f25�body�ٰ18世纪起机器与蒸汽动力取代手工，生产力暴涨、城市兴起、社会结构重塑。它开启了现代经济增长模式，也带来环境与劳资新问题。��From the 18th century, machines and steam replaced handwork, exploding productivity, raising cities, and reshaping society. It launched modern economic growth but also new environmental and labor problems.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5dd35d027689�body���科斯定理指出：在产权明确且交易成本为零时，无论最初权利归谁，当事人总能通过谈判达到有效率的结果。它强调交易成本与制度才是现实障碍。污染谈判、资源纠纷常以其为分析框架。�AThe Coase theorem states that with clear property rights and zero transaction costs, parties always negotiate to an efficient outcome regardless of who initially holds the right. It stresses that transaction costs and institutions are the real obstacles. Pollution talks and resource disputes often use it as a framework.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5fed2b2f8f25�body��群体思维指高度凝聚的团队为维持一致而压制异议，导致风险评估失真与方案单一，常见于封闭、领导力强的小组。詹尼斯以古巴导弹危机等案例说明其危害。设立“唱反调者”与鼓励外部意见可缓解它。�CGroupthink occurs when a cohesive team suppresses dissent to preserve harmony, distorting risk assessment and narrowing options, common in closed groups with strong leaders. Janis illustrated its harm using cases like the Cuban Missile Crisis. Appointing a “devil's advocate” and inviting outside views can mitigate it.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�60c01ed385d8�body��&信号博弈中，信息不对称时一方用可观察的行为向另一方传递难以直接衡量的特质。斯宾塞提出学历可作为能力的信号：即使所学不直接有用，高能力者更易获得文凭，雇主借此筛选。这解释了为何“文凭通胀”可能出现。�IIn a signaling game, when information is asymmetric, one side uses observable action to convey hard-to-measure traits. Spence argued degrees signal ability: even if coursework is not directly useful, high-ability people more easily earn diplomas, letting employers screen. This explains why “credential inflation” can appear.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�61e0f9f947c7�body�ٽ集聚带来分工、知识外溢与低成本匹配，提升生产率；过度集聚则推高地价、通勤与污染，降低宜居度。城市规模的最优在于两者边际相等处。��Agglomeration brings division of labor, knowledge spillovers, and cheap matching that boost productivity; excess raises land prices, commuting, and pollution, hurting livability. The optimal city size is where their margins equalize.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�633d93dde9cd�body���影子银行指游离于传统银行监管之外的信用中介（如货币基金、信托、回购），履行类似放贷职能却少受资本与流动性约束。它提高融资效率也放大杠杆与传染风险。2008危机暴露其脆弱性。�4Shadow banking is credit intermediation outside traditional bank regulation—money market funds, trusts, repos—performing lending-like functions with lighter capital and liquidity constraints. It boosts financing efficiency yet amplifies leverage and contagion risk. The 2008 crisis exposed its fragility.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�64bcfb17a825�body��诺依曼提出沉默的螺旋：人若感知自己的观点属少数，会因害怕孤立而少发声，使多数意见显得更强、少数更沉默，形成自我强化的循环。它解释了舆论表面一致背后的压抑。社交媒体既可能放大也可能打破它。�+Noelle-Neumann's spiral of silence: if people sense their view is minority, fear of isolation makes them speak less, making the majority seem stronger and the minority quieter in a self-reinforcing loop. It explains suppressed dissent behind apparent consensus. Social media can amplify or break it.�ans��src��xNoelle-Neumann, E. (1974), 《沉默的螺旋：一种舆论理论》, 传播学期刊 (Journal of Communication), 24(2)�mNoelle-Neumann, E. (1974), The Spiral of Silence: A Theory of Public Opinion, Journal of Communication, 24(2)��id�666702e0aaa4�body���孔多塞悖论指在多选项多数决下，集体偏好可能循环（A胜B、B胜C、C胜A），从而不存在稳定“多数意志”。它揭示民主聚合个人偏好未必产出一致结果。排序投票等规则试图缓解。�>The Condorcet paradox shows that under majority rule with three or more options, group preferences can cycle (A beats B, B beats C, C beats A), so no stable “will of the majority” exists. It reveals democracy may not yield consistent outcomes from individual preferences. Ranked-choice voting tries to mitigate it.�ans��src��/Arrow，《社会选择与个人价值》(1951)�3Arrow, 'Social Choice and Individual Values' (1951)��id�68eac86ea1e6�body���分权后地方为吸引资本与人口，会在税收、服务和制度上相互竞争，可能提升效率，也可能压低环保与劳工标准；竞争效果取决于规则与转移支付等上层设计。��After decentralization, localities compete via taxes, services, and institutions to attract capital and people—potentially raising efficiency but also lowering environmental and labor standards; the outcome depends on upper-level rules and transfers.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�68fb63a02b1c�body��古代中国设御史台、都察院等机构，专司监察百官、纠劾贪腐与违失，可直接向皇帝奏报。它在一定程度上约束了地方与官僚权力，但依赖皇权强弱而成效不一。这一制度对后世文官监督影响深远。�7Imperial China set up bodies like the Censorate to supervise officials, impeach corruption and misconduct, and report directly to the emperor. It checked local and bureaucratic power to some extent, but its effectiveness varied with imperial strength. The system deeply influenced later civil-service oversight.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6e4cf5daeab8�body���该假说认为一旦生育率跌破约1.5并持续，低生育的规范、经济约束与人口结构会相互强化，使回升越来越难，需要强力且及早的政策干预才可能逆转。��The hypothesis holds that once fertility falls below about 1.5 and stays there, low-fertility norms, economic constraints, and demographics reinforce each other, making recovery harder—needing strong, early policy action to reverse.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�726381561c73�body���推荐与风控算法若以多数群体数据训练，可能对弱势群体服务更差、信息更窄或授信更少；加上数字技能落差，弱势者更难从数字红利中获益，差距被放大。��Recommendation and scoring algorithms trained on majority data can serve disadvantaged groups worse, narrow their information, or deny them credit; combined with skill gaps, the vulnerable gain less from digital dividends, widening the divide.�ans��src��OBarocas & Selbst,《Big Data's Disparate Impact》(California Law Review, 2016)�ZSolon Barocas & Andrew Selbst, 'Big Data's Disparate Impact' (California Law Review, 2016)��id�73c0cb211968�body�ٽ保留是当事国在加入条约时声明部分条款对自己不适用；它让更多国家能参与，但过多保留会削弱条约一致性，且通常不得违背条约核心目的。��A reservation is a state's declaration that some clauses won't apply to it upon joining; it lets more states participate but excessive reservations weaken consistency and may not contradict the treaty's core object.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�750cd61c446f�body���解释包括传统性别规范把照护归为女性责任、劳动力市场中的性别不平等使女性“时间更便宜”、以及制度（如育假、托幼）配套不足，三者相互强化。ٿExplanations include norms assigning care to women, labor-market inequality making women's time “cheaper,” and weak institutions (parental leave, childcare)—which reinforce one another.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�76c84bee960a�body���哈贝马斯定义公共领域为介于国家与私人之间的开放空间，公民在此自由讨论公共事务、形成舆论以监督权力。咖啡馆、媒体与网络都曾是其载体。商业化与管控可能使其萎缩。�Habermas defines the public sphere as an open space between state and private life where citizens freely discuss public affairs and form opinion to check power. Coffeehouses, media, and the internet have all been its carriers. Commercialization and control can shrink it.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�77c97ffa060c�body��随着城市化、女性教育和就业率提高、养育成本上升，家庭倾向于少生优生，生育率降至更替水平以下，即“第二次人口转变”。个人主义与晚婚也削弱了传统生育动机。这一阶段在许多发达国家已持续数十年。�pWith urbanization, higher female education and employment, and rising child-rearing costs, families prefer fewer, better-cared-for children, pushing fertility below replacement—the “second demographic transition.” Individualism and later marriage also weaken traditional motives to have children. This stage has persisted for decades in many developed countries.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�79a2165c40df�body��2“编户齐民”指国家把百姓按户登记、编入户籍，作为收税和征役的单位。户籍与土地、赋税绑定，迁移要获批，否则就是“逃户”要受罚。这样一来，国家能稳定掌握人口与税源，百姓也被牢牢固定在特定土地上，难以自由流动。��Registered commoners meant the state enrolled households in registers as the units for tax and labor service. Household status was tied to land and tribute, and moving required permission—those who fled were 'runaway households' punished by law. This let the state steadily count people and collect revenue, while binding commoners to specific plots of land and limiting free movement.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�7c8987f3f311�body���在集体中，个人产出难以精确计量，回报又常按共享或身份分配，于是努力与所得并不严格对应。搭便车者能坐享他人劳动，而贡献者得到的回报被稀释——这是典型的集体行动困境。�In groups, individual output is hard to measure and rewards are often shared or assigned by status, so effort is not strictly matched to return. Free-riders can benefit from others' work while contributors see diluted rewards—a classic collective-action problem.�ans��src��*奥尔森《集体行动的逻辑》(1965)�3Mancur Olson, The Logic of Collective Action (1965)��id�839a14003740�body���在反复互动中，今天的合作能在未来得到回报，背叛则会在以后受罚，于是长期合作的总收益超过短期欺骗。未来的“影子”使自利与互利趋于一致。��In repeated interactions, today's cooperation can be rewarded tomorrow and defection punished later, so the long-term payoff of cooperating outweighs short-term cheating. The shadow of the future aligns self-interest with mutual cooperation.�ans��src��8罗伯特·阿克塞尔罗德《合作的进化》(1984)�3Robert Axelrod, The Evolution of Cooperation (1984)��id�8770e4b52f0b�body���小群体中彼此熟识、贡献容易被看见，社会监督与声誉压力更强，且“每人份额”更大，因此成员更有动力参与；奥尔森的“集体行动逻辑”即讨论此点。�In small groups people know each other, contributions are visible, social monitoring and reputation pressures are stronger, and each person's share matters more—so members are more motivated to participate, as discussed in Olson's logic of collective action.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8845134a8648�body���当互动长期重复，一方可用“以牙还牙”等策略惩罚背叛、奖励合作，使长期合作比短期背叛更有利，从而维持合作；但次数有限或匿名时仍易破裂。��When interaction repeats, a player can punish defection and reward cooperation (e.g., tit-for-tat), making long-run cooperation pay more than short-run cheating; cooperation still breaks down with finite rounds or anonymity.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�89f9d42490b6�body�ٴ两名司机相对疾驰，谁先转向谁丢脸，但都不转则同归于尽；它刻画了对抗中“比谁先退让”的风险，常用于分析冲突、罢工与核威慑。��Two drivers race toward each other; whoever swerves loses face, but neither swerving means disaster. It captures the risk of “who blinks first” in conflicts, strikes, and nuclear deterrence.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�90c815bab312�body�ٶ当自变量受混杂或反向因果干扰时，IV提供只经自变量影响结果的外生变量，借由两阶段估计剥离因果成分，但依赖强相关与排他性假设。ٺWhen an endogenous variable is confounded, an IV affects the outcome only via that variable; two-stage estimation recovers causal effects, relying on relevance and exclusion assumptions.�ans��src���乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010) ; 另见: Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010)��Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010) ; see also: 乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010)��id�96b815d77bb2�body�ٱRCT通过随机分配处理组与对照组，使混杂因素平均平衡，从而将组间差异归因于干预。其外部效度（可推广性）常受样本与情境限制。٤RCTs randomly assign treatment and control, balancing confounders on average so group differences attribute to the intervention; external validity is often limited.�ans��src��.World Bank（《实践中的影响评估》）�*World Bank (Impact Evaluation in Practice)��id�a32c4fa0559b�body���杜瓦杰定律指出：单一选区相对多数制倾向形成两党制，而比例代表制倾向多党制。因前者让小党选票“浪费”、选民策略性转向大党。它揭示制度规则塑造政治格局。�Duverger's law states that single-member plurality systems tend toward two parties, while proportional representation tends toward multiparty systems—because the former wastes small-party votes and pushes strategic voting to big parties. It shows rules shape political landscapes.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a876758a338d�body���它描述一种理想状态：每个消费者按其从该公共品中获得的边际收益来分担成本，使总量恰好满足集体偏好；难点在于个人往往隐瞒真实偏好以少付费。��It describes an ideal where each consumer pays according to their marginal benefit from the public good, matching supply to collective preference; the difficulty is that people tend to understate their true willingness to pay.�ans��src��5萨缪尔森《公共支出的纯理论》(1954, AER)�CPaul Samuelson, 'The Pure Theory of Public Expenditure' (1954, AER)��id�a8c983249add�body���传统指标（如问卷、普查）被实时数字痕迹补充甚至替代，使测量更细、更快，但指标由平台定义，可能隐藏价值选择并影响公共决策，需要公开与可审计。��Traditional metrics (surveys, censuses) are supplemented or replaced by real-time digital traces, making measurement finer and faster—but platform-defined indicators can hide value choices and sway policy, needing transparency and audit.�ans��src��R世界银行(World Bank)《World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives》�@World Bank, World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives��id�aa463da2c649�body�٢GPT（如蒸汽机、电力、ICT）具广泛适用性、持续改进与溢出效应，能渗透各行业并重组生产方式，是长波增长的核心引擎。٩GPTs (steam, electricity, ICT) are widely applicable, improve over time, and spill over, permeating sectors and reorganizing production—the core engines of long waves.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�ae68adabf36d�body�٫魏特夫提出大规模灌溉需集中动员与官僚管理，可能催生集权国家（水利社会）；该假说有争议，但凸显基础设施与权力的关联。ٽWittfogel argued large irrigation needed centralized mobilization and bureaucracy, spawning despotic states (“hydraulic” societies); contested but highlights infrastructure-power links.�ans��src��aKarl Wittfogel,《东方专制主义:对极权社会的比较研究》,Yale University Press,1957�|Karl Wittfogel, Oriental Despotism: A Comparative Study of the Total Impact of Water on Society, Yale University Press, 1957��id�b5a69c34119a�body���印度的统一并不依赖单一语言，而是建立在共享的文明与宗教遗产、强大的联邦民主体制、英语作为中立通用语，以及相互交叠的身份之上。这些因素让任何单一语种群体都难以主导或脱离。�India's unity does not rest on a single language but on a shared civilizational and religious heritage, a strong federal democratic framework, English as a neutral lingua franca, and cross-cutting identities. Together these prevent any one linguistic group from dominating or seceding.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b7fa12d8bd65�body�ٟ比较法通过系统对应关系将语言归入谱系（如印欧语系），并逆向重建未被文字记录的“原始母语”，揭示人群迁徙史。ٞThe comparative method groups languages into families (e.g., Indo-European) and reconstructs unrecorded “proto-languages,” illuminating migration history.�ans��src�كDyen,《Reconstruction, The Comparative Method, and the Proto-Language Uniformity Assumption》,Language,1969 (DOI: 10.2307/411435)فDyen, 'Reconstruction, The Comparative Method, and the Proto-Language Uniformity Assumption', Language, 1969, DOI: 10.2307/411435��id�b8fcd356e080�body���委托-代理问题指委托人（如股东）把任务交给代理人（如经理），因目标不一致且信息不对称，代理人可能谋私而损害委托人。公司治理、官场代理皆如此。解决靠激励相容、监督与透明。�=The principal-agent problem arises when a principal (e.g., shareholders) delegates to an agent (e.g., managers) whose goals differ and who has private information, so the agent may act in self-interest. Corporate governance and bureaucracy both face it. Remedies are incentive alignment, monitoring, and transparency.�ans��src��"OECD（《公司治理原则》）�2OECD (G20/OECD Principles of Corporate Governance)��id�bc1dece97390�body���随着生育率下降与寿命延长，劳动年龄人口相对减少、老年人口增多，每位工作者需供养的退休者比例上升，养老金与医疗压力加大，代际转移负担加重。��As fertility falls and lifespans rise, the working-age share shrinks while elders grow, so each worker supports more retirees—raising pension and health costs and the intergenerational transfer burden.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�bc78f0c0be38�body�ٜ社会建构论认为科学事实的确立受社会、文化与制度语境影响，并非纯粹客观发现的展开，引发与科学实在论的争论。ټSocial constructivism holds that established scientific facts are shaped by social, cultural, and institutional contexts, not pure objective discovery—debated against scientific realism.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�bd64d50f4e86�body���未经筛选的全透明会把复杂细节与琐碎瑕疵一并摊开，让人误以为机构比实际更混乱或无能。信任来自连贯的叙事与被感知的能力，而不只是公开信息的数量。�Raw, unfiltered transparency can overwhelm people with complexity and expose every minor flaw, making institutions look more chaotic or incompetent than they are. Trust rests on a coherent narrative and perceived competence, not merely on the volume of information disclosed.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c52965f0222b�body��e郑和下西洋后，明朝朝廷逐渐把重心转回北方陆地边防（对抗蒙古威胁），远洋航行耗资巨大却被视为“厚往薄来”、收益不直接。儒家官僚也主张把资源用于内政与防边，加之实施海禁，官方的远洋活动便戛然而止。这是一个财政与战略优先级的抉择，而非技术不行。��After Zheng He's voyages, the Ming court shifted focus back to the northern land frontier (the Mongol threat), and long-distance sailing was judged too costly for its indirect returns. Confucian officials favored spending on internal governance and border defense, and a maritime ban was imposed, ending official ocean-going activity. It was a fiscal and strategic choice of priorities, not a lack of technology.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d1457ea669a8�body�ٜ央行通过设定基准利率、公开市场操作和监管银行体系来调控货币供应与金融稳定，通常在日常政治上保持相对独立。��A central bank manages the money supply and financial stability via policy rates, open-market operations, and banking supervision, usually with operational independence from day-to-day politics.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d91de620613d�body���格兰诺维特指出，求职信息更多来自“弱关系”（熟人而非密友），因弱关系跨越不同圈子、带来非冗余的新机会。强关系虽亲密却信息重复。这颠覆了“关系越近越有用”的直觉。�(Granovetter showed job information more often comes from weak ties (acquaintances than close friends) because weak ties bridge different circles and bring non-redundant opportunities. Strong ties are intimate but repetitive in information. This overturns the intuition that closer ties help more.�ans��src��TGranovetter, M. (1973), 《弱关系的力量》, 美国社会学杂志 (AJS), 78(6)�WGranovetter, M. (1973), The Strength of Weak Ties, American Journal of Sociology, 78(6)��id�dabfd30f56c4�body���不一定。除政府外，私人协商、产权界定、社会规范、非营利组织等也可能缓解失灵；干预本身也有成本和失效的可能，需比较不同方案的代价与效果。��Not necessarily. Besides government, private bargaining, defined property rights, social norms, and nonprofits can also mitigate failure; intervention has its own costs and can fail, so options should be compared.�ans��src��CN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017�=N. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017��id�dc31dc13d125�body���新晋阶层缺乏传统的身份标识，便通过可见的消费——奢侈品、品牌、排场——来宣示地位。当流动性快、旧有地位信号薄弱时，炫耀性消费就成了快速确认与彰显阶层的最直接方式。�Newly rising groups lack traditional status markers, so they signal their new position through visible consumption—luxury goods, brands, displays. When mobility is fast and old status cues are weak, conspicuous spending becomes the quickest way to claim and confirm rank.�ans��src��3Veblen, T. (1899), 《有闲阶级论》, Macmillan�=Veblen, T. (1899), The Theory of the Leisure Class, Macmillan��id�dd339e16dca9�body�ٮ丰裕的自然资源可能推高汇率、抑制制造业（荷兰病），并诱发寻租与冲突，反而拖累长期增长，需通过制度质量与财富基金对冲。��Abundant resources can appreciate currency and shrink manufacturing (“Dutch disease”) while fueling rent-seeking and conflict, slowing growth unless buffered by institutions and sovereign funds.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e009a007a240�body���当人们普遍相信他人会守约，就无需在监督、签约、法律执行和核验上投入过多。交易成本下降，更多交易得以更快更便宜地完成，从而提升整体经济效率。��When people generally trust others to keep promises, less effort is spent on monitoring, contracting, legal enforcement and verification. Lower transaction costs let more deals happen faster and cheaper, raising overall economic efficiency.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�e09703ad8d54�body��重商主义是16到18世纪欧洲盛行的政策观念，认为国家富强在于积累金银、鼓励出口并限制进口以减少逆差。政府常通过关税、特许公司和殖民地垄断来干预贸易。它推动了早期殖民竞争，也遭到自由贸易思想的批评。�VMercantilism, dominant in 16th–18th century Europe, held that national power lay in accumulating gold and silver by encouraging exports and limiting imports to shrink deficits. Governments intervened through tariffs, chartered companies, and colonial monopolies. It drove early colonial rivalry and was later criticized by free-trade ideas.�ans��src��>亚当·斯密《国富论》（The Wealth of Nations, 1776）�.Adam Smith, “The Wealth of Nations” (1776)��id�e111e1e7181a�body��成熟精英的地位本已稳固且被公认，过分张扬反而显得俗气或招致审视；于是他们用低调信号——内敛的品牌、圈内人才懂的暗语——向能读懂的人彰显格调。低调炫耀既确认了身份，又规避了炫耀带来的社交代价。�7Established elites already hold secure, recognized status, so overt display can look vulgar or draw scrutiny; instead they use subtle signals—understated brands, insider references—to convey distinction to those who can read them. Quiet signaling affirms rank while avoiding the social cost of flaunting it.�ans��src�ٚPierre Bourdieu《区分：判断力的社会批判》（La Distinction），巴黎Minuit出版社，1979年；英译本哈佛大学出版社，1984年。٤Pierre Bourdieu, La Distinction: Critique sociale du jugement, Paris: Les Editions de Minuit, 1979; English translation Distinction, Harvard University Press, 1984.��id�e4e6930a8065�body��D渐进式改革先在小范围试验、积累经验，再逐步推开，能及时发现问题、减少社会震荡。它给既得利益者留了缓冲，避免剧烈反弹，也让制度和人心有时间适应。相反，“一步到位”若缺乏配套制度和承受能力，容易引发失业、通胀和秩序失控。�tGradual reform pilots changes on a small scale, gathers experience, then expands step by step, catching problems early and damping social shock. It gives vested interests a buffer against abrupt backlash and lets institutions and minds adapt. By contrast, 'shock therapy' without supporting institutions and capacity can trigger unemployment, inflation, and loss of order.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�e83e038998b7�body�٢索洛指出“计算机时代随处可见，唯独在生产率统计中例外”。数字红利常因度量滞后、重组成本与扩散时滞而延迟显现。٫Solow noted “you can see the computer age everywhere but in the productivity statistics.” Digital gains lag due to measurement gaps, reorg costs, and diffusion delays.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�eab8cd6fe0e3�body�٧彭慕兰等探讨为何18世纪后西欧（而非中国等）率先实现持续经济增长与工业化，归因于能源、新大陆资源与制度路径的分叉。٪Pomeranz asks why Western Europe (not China) pioneered sustained growth and industrialization after 1800, citing energy, New World resources, and institutional branching.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ead24467a6db�body��代理问题指所有者（委托人）与经营者（代理人）目标不一致，且委托人难以完全监督代理人行为，导致后者可能损公肥私。现代企业用薪酬挂钩、信息披露与董事会监督来缓解。它也是公司治理的核心议题。�&The principal-agent problem arises when owners (principals) and managers (agents) have misaligned goals and principals cannot fully monitor agents, who may then act for self-interest. Firms use pay linkage, disclosure, and board oversight to ease it. It is also central to corporate governance.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�eb17e174fc31�body�١蒸汽船、铁路与金本位大幅降低贸易成本，1870–1914年全球贸易与移民空前增长；一战、保护主义与金本位崩溃使其逆转。٬Steamships, rails, and the gold standard cut trade costs, driving unprecedented 1870–1914 trade and migration; WWI, protectionism, and gold-standard collapse reversed it.�ans��src��JPolanyi, K. (1944), 《大转型：我们时代的政治与经济起源》�\Polanyi, K. (1944), The Great Transformation: The Political and Economic Origins of Our Time��id�f51b2bf27817�body���软法指不具严格法律约束力却有实际引导力的规范，如行业标准、国际宣言、自律守则。它灵活、成本低，靠声誉与共识执行。在全球治理与新兴科技领域尤为常见。�Soft law refers to norms without strict legal binding force yet with real guiding power—industry standards, international declarations, codes of conduct. It is flexible and low-cost, enforced by reputation and consensus. It is common in global governance and emerging tech.�ans��src�ٔGalander, Walgenbach, Rost,《A social norm perspective on corporate governance soft law》,Corporate Governance,2015 (DOI: 10.1108/cg-07-2013-0096)ْGalander, Walgenbach, Rost, 'A social norm perspective on corporate governance soft law', Corporate Governance, 2015, DOI: 10.1108/cg-07-2013-0096��id�f960d82b39a2�body���政策俘获指被监管行业通过游说、旋转门与信息优势，使监管机构转而服务其私利而非公众。它导致监管失效与不公平。强化独立性、公开听证可减缓俘获。�Regulatory capture is when the regulated industry, through lobbying, revolving doors, and information advantage, bends the agency to serve its private interest over the public's. It causes regulatory failure and unfairness. Independence and open hearings mitigate capture.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�005e6cd70838�body��人口转变理论描述社会从传统高出生高死亡，经历死亡率先降、出生率后降，最终走向低出生低死亡的阶段过程。它常与工业化、城市化和医疗卫生改善相联系。该理论帮助解释不同国家的人口增长差异。�TDemographic transition theory describes how societies move from high birth and death rates, through a stage where death rates fall first and birth rates later, to low birth and death rates. It is often linked to industrialization, urbanization, and better healthcare. The theory helps explain cross-country differences in population growth.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�00655ef88f64�body���碳十四测年利用生物死亡后体内碳-14放射性同位素按固定速率衰变的原理，测定有机遗物（骨骼、木炭、种子）的年代，有效范围约五万年以内。ٶCarbon-14 dating measures the decay of the radioactive isotope carbon-14 in once-living material—bone, charcoal, seeds—to date organic remains, reliable up to about 50,000 years.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�011827e64df0�body��j监管俘获指监管机构被其监管对象左右，出台的政策服务于行业利益而非公共利益。机制包括：行业信息不对称（监管者依赖企业提供技术数据）、“旋转门”（人员往来于监管部门与企业）、游说与竞选资金，以及“利益集中、成本分散”的结构——被监管企业数量少、利益集中、有强激励组织起来，而公众获益分散、组织成本高、关注度低。斯提格勒的规制经济理论甚至提出规制本身可能被行业“采购”。防范靠透明度、利益冲突规则、独立预算与公民参与。��Regulatory capture occurs when regulators are steered by those they regulate, serving industry rather than public interests. Mechanisms include information asymmetry (regulators depend on firms for technical data), revolving doors (staff moving between agency and industry), lobbying and campaign finance, and the “concentrated benefits, dispersed costs” structure—regulated firms are few, benefit intensely, and organize cheaply, while the public's gains are diffuse, costly to organize, and low-salience. Stigler's economic theory of regulation even argues regulation itself can be “purchased” by industry. Safeguards include transparency, conflict-of-interest rules, independent budgets, and public participation.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0182206670af�body��U住房价格由区位（土地）价值主导，而黄金地段的土地供给缺乏弹性：城市核心区可开发土地有限，且区划管制、高度限制、审批漫长与基建配套成本共同约束新增供给，使供给曲线接近垂直。需求端，人口流入与收入增长持续推动价格上涨，而供给调整滞后数年，需求冲击便主要转化为价格上升而非数量增加。研究表明供给弹性低的城市（如旧金山）房价涨幅远高于弹性高的城市（如休斯敦），土地供给管制是住房可负担性问题的核心制度变量。��Housing prices are dominated by location—land value—and supply of land in prime locations is inelastic: developable land is scarce and zoning rules, height limits, slow approvals, and infrastructure costs jointly constrain new supply, making the supply curve nearly vertical. On the demand side, population inflow and income growth keep pushing prices up while supply adjusts with years of lag, so demand shocks mostly become price rises rather than more units. Research shows low-elasticity cities like San Francisco see far larger price increases than high-elasticity ones like Houston; land-use regulation is a central institutional variable in affordability.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�02239fd5606f�body��列维-斯特劳斯在 1949 年《亲属关系的基本结构》等著作中主张，人类文化的表层千差万别，但深层受普遍的心智结构（如二元对立）支配，类似语言的结构规则。这种方法把人类学引向与语言学结合的结构主义。�"In works like “The Elementary Structures of Kinship” (1949), Lévi-Strauss argued that surface cultural diversity is governed by universal mental structures—such as binary oppositions—akin to the rules of language. This steered anthropology toward structuralism tied to linguistics.�ans��src��I克洛德·列维-斯特劳斯《亲属关系的基本结构》（1949）�GClaude Lévi-Strauss, “The Elementary Structures of Kinship” (1949)��id�0289da2d69b1�body��a政策扩散指一项政策从一地传播到其他地区的过程，主要机制有四：学习（借鉴他处经验以提高自身效果）、竞争（为吸引资本与人才而追随邻区政策，如减税）、模仿（因合法性与声望效仿“标杆”地区）和强制或外部压力（上级政府或国际组织推动）。扩散不是简单的“抄作业”，采纳与否取决于本地政治、财政与利益格局；扩散可以加速（成功案例被宣传），也可能失败（水土不服）。这一框架被用于解释最低工资、碳税、禁烟令等政策的跨国传播。��Policy diffusion is a policy's spread from one jurisdiction to others, driven by four main mechanisms: learning (borrowing experiences to improve outcomes), competition (following neighbors to attract capital and talent, e.g., tax cuts), imitation (emulating benchmark regions for legitimacy and prestige), and coercion or external pressure (higher-level governments or international organizations). Diffusion is not simple copying—adoption depends on local politics, fiscal capacity, and interest groups; it can accelerate when success stories circulate or fail when transplants do not fit. The framework explains the cross-national spread of minimum wages, carbon taxes, and smoking bans.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�02b3d2d6d12d�body��唐斯在 1957 年《民主的经济理论》中模型化：在单维议题与多数决下，为争取占多数的中间选民，相互竞争的两党会把政见移到选民偏好的中点。该定理预言选举趋同，却也因现实多维议题而受限。�2In 'An Economic Theory of Democracy' (1957), Downs modeled that under a single left-right axis and majority rule, two competing parties move their platforms toward the median voter to win the majority. The theorem predicts electoral convergence, though it is limited by real-world multi-dimensional issues.�ans��src��>Downs, A. (1957), 《民主的经济理论》, 哈珀出版社�?Downs, A. (1957), An Economic Theory of Democracy, Harper & Row��id�037bd37695ee�body�٢三权分立把政府权力分为立法、行政、司法三部分，彼此独立又相互制衡，防止任何一个部门权力过大。美国是典型例子。��Separation of powers divides government into legislative, executive, and judicial branches that are independent yet check one another, preventing any one from becoming too powerful. The United States is a typical example.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�03ac7bd9f2eb�body���人类学家莫斯指出，许多社会的“送礼”并非无偿，而是建立义务性互惠，维系人与人、群体与群体之间的纽带。这种交换塑造了声望、联盟与社会秩序。��Anthropologist Marcel Mauss showed that “gift-giving” in many societies is not free but creates obligatory reciprocity, binding people and groups. Such exchange builds prestige, alliance, and social order.�ans��src��"莫斯《礼物》(The Gift, 1925)�Marcel Mauss, The Gift (1925)��id�04b22dd851b1�body���他们认为种族是借由“种族化”把历史、政治利益编织进身体分类的过程，由国家政策与反抗运动共同塑造。种族因此随权力格局变动而被持续再建构。��They argue race is produced through 'racialization' that encodes historical and political interests into bodily classifications, shaped by state policy and resistance. Race is thus continually remade as power relations shift.�ans��src��Y迈克尔·奥米与霍华德·维南特《种族形成在美国》(1986, 第三版 2014)�YMichael Omi and Howard Winant, Racial Formation in the United States (1986; 3rd ed. 2014)��id�04fac77b6776�body��强力的再分配与均等化会削弱工作、投资与创新的激励，可能拖慢生产效率。反之，单纯追求效率又会让不平等扩大，因此社会不得不在“为增长牺牲多少平等”与“为平等牺牲多少效率”之间反复权衡。�Strong redistribution and equalization can dampen incentives to work, invest and innovate, potentially slowing productive efficiency. Conversely, pure efficiency lets inequality grow, so societies must constantly trade off how much equality to sacrifice for growth, and vice versa.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�055871cfb7d8�body���当原因与结果互相影响或受遗漏变量干扰时，工具变量找一个只通过原因、不直接影响结果的外生因素，借此剥离出干净的因果效应；工具需满足相关且外生，实践中较难满足。��When cause and effect intertwine or are confounded, an instrumental variable uses a factor that affects only the cause and not the outcome directly, isolating clean effects; it must be relevant and exogenous—hard to satisfy in practice.�ans��src���乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010) ; 另见: Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010)��Joshua D. Angrist and Jörn-Steffen Pischke, Mostly Harmless Econometrics (2009) / The Credibility Revolution (2010) ; see also: 乔舒亚·安格里斯特与约恩-斯特芬·皮施克《可信性革命：计量经济学的经验方法》(2010)��id�064323721dd8�body�ٙ国际法是国家之间自愿达成的规则体系，规范战争、贸易、人权等领域，主要靠条约和习惯维系，由各国合作执行。ٲInternational law is the body of rules agreed among states covering war, trade, human rights, and more, maintained mainly through treaties and custom and enforced by cooperation.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0816d87d5432�body�ٖ当生育率下降使少儿抚养比降低、劳动年龄人口占比升高，储蓄与产出暂时上升，但需就业与制度配合才能兑现。ٟFalling fertility lowers the youth dependency ratio and raises the working-age share, temporarily boosting savings and output—if jobs and institutions align.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�08998147e1bb�body��金本位制是指一国货币的价值直接与固定数量的黄金挂钩，并可按固定比率兑换黄金的制度。在19世纪到20世纪初，许多国家采用金本位以保证币值稳定和国际贸易便利。后来因战争与经济危机，各国陆续放弃金本位。�=The gold standard is a system in which a country's currency is directly linked to a fixed quantity of gold and can be exchanged for gold at a set rate. From the 19th century into the early 20th, many countries adopted it to keep currency stable and trade convenient. Most abandoned it during wars and economic crises.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�094b99311628�body�٢不确定时资产价格可能大跌、变现困难，现金流动性最强、能随时支付并抄底。但它也受通胀侵蚀，所以是权衡而非绝对。ټIn uncertainty, asset prices can crash and become hard to sell; cash is the most liquid, ready to pay and to buy the dip. But it is eroded by inflation, so it is a trade-off, not absolute.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�09b22e92dba0�body��户籍将居民绑定于出生地，并据此分配教育、医疗与社保等福利，使进城务工人员虽贡献城市经济却难享同城待遇。改革逐步放宽落户，但附着在户籍上的福利差异仍造成「半城市化」与代际不平等。�-Hukou ties residents to their birthplace and allocates education, health, and social benefits accordingly, so migrant workers contribute to cities yet enjoy fewer local benefits. Reforms have eased settlement, but welfare differentials still produce half-urbanization and intergenerational inequality.�ans��src��5世界银行(World Bank)《Urban China》研究报告�World Bank, Urban China reports��id�09ef49de3e11�body���NDC 由各国自行设定并定期更新减排目标，取代《京都议定书》自上而下的强制配额，故称自下而上。其透明性框架要求各国汇报进展，但缺乏硬性惩罚，依赖相互审评与声誉约束。�AUnder the NDC mechanism each country sets and periodically updates its own mitigation target, replacing the top-down mandatory quotas of the Kyoto Protocol, hence 'bottom-up'. A transparency framework requires progress reporting, but enforcement relies on peer review and reputational pressure rather than hard penalties.�ans��src��(《巴黎协定》(UNFCCC, 2015) 第4条�)Paris Agreement (UNFCCC, 2015), Article 4��id�09f890de2428�body���社会资本指嵌入在社会网络中的资源——信任、互助规范和熟人关系，个人可以借此获得信息、工作机会和帮助。帕特南把“连接型”社会资本（志愿团体带来的跨圈层关系）和“凝聚型”社会资本（亲戚老乡式的紧密圈子）区分开：前者通常带来新机会，后者利于内部支持。社会资本像社区的粘合剂，影响公共参与和治理质量，但也和财富一样分布不均，网络广而强的人优势更大。�VSocial capital means the resources embedded in social networks, such as trust, norms of reciprocity, and acquaintance ties, that people draw on for information, jobs, and help. Putnam distinguishes bridging social capital, cross-group ties from groups like volunteer associations, from bonding social capital, tight circles of kin and hometown; bridging usually opens new opportunities while bonding provides internal support. Social capital works like community glue, shaping participation and governance, yet it's as unevenly distributed as wealth, favoring those with broader, stronger networks.�ans��src��6Robert Putnam,《Bowling Alone》Simon & Schuster,2000�3R. D. Putnam, Bowling Alone, Simon & Schuster, 2000��id�0b7add1db5ff�body���核不扩散指防止核武器及其相关技术扩散到更多国家或组织的国际努力，核心条约是《不扩散核武器条约》（NPT）。它在“防止扩散”与“和平利用核能权利”之间寻求平衡。��Nuclear non-proliferation is the international effort to stop the spread of nuclear weapons and related technology, centered on the Treaty on the Non-Proliferation of Nuclear Weapons (NPT). It balances prevention with the right to peaceful nuclear energy.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0e3cb4256501�body���人口惯性指即使生育率已降到更替水平，由于大量青年人口将陆续进入育龄，总人口仍会持续增长一段时间的现象。它说明人口变化具有滞后性。��Population momentum means that even after fertility falls to replacement level, total population keeps growing for a while because many young people will still enter childbearing age. Demographic change lags behind.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�0e8e8357b30a�body���波特的 segmented assimilation 认为二代移民并非单一同化，而是分化为向上同化、向下同化（落入贫困族群社区）与选择性适应（保留原生文化并向上流动）三条路径，取决于族裔资本与居住隔离。�:Portes' segmented assimilation holds that the second generation does not assimilate uniformly but diverges into upward assimilation, downward assimilation (into poor co-ethnic enclaves) and selective acculturation (retaining origin culture while moving up), depending on ethnic capital and residential segregation.�ans��src��bPortes, A. & Zhou, M. (1993), 《下一代：分段同化及其变体》, 美国社会学会年鉴ـPortes, A. & Zhou, M. (1993), The New Second Generation: Segmented Assimilation and Its Variants, Annals of the American Academy��id�0f1a9cf917a9�body��
存在主义是20世纪兴起的哲学思潮，强调个体在荒诞或无先验意义的世界中必须自行选择并承担责任的自由。萨特、加缪和海德格尔等是其代表性人物。它关注焦虑、本真性与人的处境，而非抽象体系。�QExistentialism is a 20th-century philosophical movement stressing the individual's freedom to choose and bear responsibility in a world seen as absurd or without predetermined meaning. Figures like Sartre, Camus, and Heidegger are representative. It focuses on anxiety, authenticity, and the human condition rather than abstract systems.�ans��src��m马丁·海德格尔《存在与时间》,1927;让-保罗·萨特《存在主义是一种人道主义》,1946�lMartin Heidegger, Being and Time (Sein und Zeit), 1927; Jean-Paul Sartre, Existentialism Is a Humanism, 1946��id�0ff52a579bf0�body���更替水平生育率指每一代母亲恰好生育足够女儿来替代自身的数量；由于部分女童在育龄前死亡，这个数值略高于 2（约 2.1），而非正好 2。长期低于该水平，人口将趋于萎缩。�Replacement-level fertility is the number of daughters a woman must have on average to replace herself; because some girls die before reproductive age, the figure is slightly above 2 (about 2.1) rather than exactly 2. Sustained below this level, a population tends to shrink.�ans��src��F联合国人口司（UN Population Division）《世界人口展望》�8UN Population Division, “World Population Prospects”��id�0ff52c86c30c�body��sRCT通过随机分配“接受政策”与“对照组”，使两组在平均意义上除政策外无系统差异，从而干净识别因果效应，避免选择偏差。班纳吉、迪弗洛与克雷默因把RCT大规模引入扶贫评估而获诺贝尔经济学奖。但RCT有局限：外部效度问题（此地结果未必适用于他处）、样本规模与时间跨度有限、伦理约束（不能随机拒绝帮助），以及把复杂政策简化为“小项目”而忽略系统改革。因此近年强调对RCT结果做机制分析与外部效度检验，并与其他证据（自然实验、结构模型）互补。��RCTs randomly assign treatment and control groups so that, on average, groups differ only by the policy, cleanly identifying causal effects and avoiding selection bias. Banerjee, Duflo, and Kremer won the Nobel Prize partly for scaling RCTs into poverty-alleviation evaluation. But RCTs have limits: external validity (results may not travel), limited sample sizes and time horizons, ethical constraints (can't randomly deny help), and a tendency to compress complex reforms into small projects. Recent practice therefore adds mechanism analysis and external-validity checks, complementing RCTs with natural experiments and structural models.�ans��src��.World Bank（《实践中的影响评估》）�*World Bank (Impact Evaluation in Practice)��id�10214ce8cde2�body��b历史会被重写，一方面因为新档案、考古或研究方法出现，推翻了旧结论；另一方面，历史叙述从来离不开“谁在写、为谁写”。掌握话语权的一方会强调某些事实、淡化另一些，以服务于国家认同或政治需要。所以历史既是过去的事实，也是不断被重新解释的叙事。�vHistory gets rewritten for two reasons. New archives, archaeology, or methods overturn old conclusions; and historical narrative always depends on who writes it and for whom. Those holding the narrative spotlight certain facts and downplay others to serve national identity or political needs. So history is both the record of the past and a continually reinterpreted story.�ans��src��`Schaff,《Why History is Constantly Rewritten》,Diogenes,1960 (DOI: 10.1177/039219216000803004)�^Schaff, 'Why History is Constantly Rewritten', Diogenes, 1960, DOI: 10.1177/039219216000803004��id�10d07e00b370�body��吉登斯认为结构既是行动的中介也是其结果，规则与资源在行动中“二重性”地循环再生产。他借“时空延伸”说明现代制度（如民族国家、货币）能把跨越广阔时空的互动脱域化，重塑信任与风险。�=Giddens argued that structures are both medium and outcome of action, recursively reproduced through rules and resources (the duality of structure). His 'time-space distanciation' explains how modern institutions like the nation-state and money 'disembed' interactions across vast distances, reshaping trust and risk.�ans��src��G安东尼·吉登斯《社会的构成：结构化理论大纲》(1984)�[Anthony Giddens, The Constitution of Society: Outline of the Theory of Structuration (1984)��id�11c46cd5d6f6�body���TPB 认为行为由态度、主观规范与感知行为控制共同决定。绿色消费常因价格高、可得性差等「行为控制」不足而停滞，使高意愿难以转化为实际购买。��TPB holds behaviour is jointly determined by attitude, subjective norms and perceived behavioural control. Green consumption often stalls because weak control (high price, low availability) prevents high intention from becoming actual purchase.�ans��src��MAjzen, I. (1991), 《计划行为理论》, 组织行为与人类决策过程�fAjzen, I. (1991), The Theory of Planned Behavior, Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes��id�123ef18dd572�body���恢复性司法强调让加害者、受害者与社区共同参与，通过道歉、赔偿与和解来修复伤害，而非仅以监禁惩罚。它在青少年犯罪与轻罪中应用较多。��Restorative justice brings offender, victim, and community together to repair harm through apology, reparation, and reconciliation, rather than prison alone. It is common for youth and minor offenses.�ans��src��W联合国《关于在刑事事项中采用恢复性司法方案的基本原则》(2002)�\UN, Basic Principles on the Use of Restorative Justice Programmes in Criminal Matters (2002)��id�127707c318ca�body��克里斯塔勒在 1933 年提出中心地理论，用“六边形市场区”模型解释城镇作为提供商品与服务的“中心地”如何按等级和服务范围在平原上均匀分布。它是人文地理学和城市体系规划的经典理论。�Christaller’s 1933 central place theory uses a hexagonal market-area model to explain how towns, as “central places” providing goods and services, are distributed evenly across a plain in a hierarchy by range and threshold. It is a classic in human geography and urban planning.�ans��src��i瓦尔特·克里斯塔勒《德国南部的中心地》（Die zentralen Orte in Süddeutschland, 1933）�FWalter Christaller, “Die zentralen Orte in Süddeutschland” (1933)��id�131b42c68c19�body���汇率是一国货币兑换另一国货币的价格，可分为固定汇率与浮动汇率制度。它影响进出口商品价格、资本流动与通货膨胀。汇率水平由市场供求、利率差异和预期等多种因素共同决定。�An exchange rate is the price of one currency in terms of another, under fixed or floating exchange rate regimes. It affects import-export prices, capital flows, and inflation. The rate is shaped by market supply and demand, interest-rate differentials, and expectations, among others.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�156901858b05�body�� 公共物品具有非排他性与非竞争性，即难以排除他人使用、且一人使用不减少他人可用量，如国防和灯塔。由于存在“搭便车”问题，市场往往供给不足，需要政府提供。准公共物品则在某一维度上部分具备这些特征。�:Public goods are non-excludable and non-rivalrous, meaning it is hard to exclude users and one person's use does not reduce another's, like national defense or a lighthouse. Because of free-rider problems, markets under-provide them, so government supply is needed. Quasi-public goods partially share these traits.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press